{"abstract":"Denne rapport er udarbejdet efter bestilling fra Styrelsen for Grøn Arealomlægning og Vandmiljø (SGAV), som en del af det faglige grundlag for Vildtforvaltningrådetsindstilling til ministeren for Grøn Trepart med henblik på revision af gældende jagttider inden jagtsæsonen 2026/27. Rapporten giver for de jagtbare arter en opdateret oversigt over den eksisterende viden om biologiske, bestandsmæssige og jagtlige forhold, som er relevante for en faglig vurdering af den gældende jagttid, suppleret med en vurdering af eventuelle forvaltningsmæssige problemstillinger. Desuden giver rapporten en vurdering af mulighederne for en eventuel jagttid for en række p.t. ikke-jagtbare arter. For en række arter, hvor det har været ønsket af Vildtforvaltningsrådet, vurderes endvidere, hvorvidt jagten har indflydelse på bestandens evne til at opnå den naturlige bærekapacitet.","author_count":21,"contributors":["Christensen, Thomas Kjær","Clausen, Preben","Madsen, Jesper","Kanstrup, Niels","Sterup, Jacob","Nielsen, Rasmus Due","Sørensen, Iben Hove","Clausen, Kevin Kuhlmann","Petersen, Ib Krag","Elmeros, Morten","Galatius, Anders","Teilmann, Jonas","Jeppesen, Annika Skarðsá","Mortensen, Rasmus Mohr","Mayer, Martin","Frederiksen, Morten","Bregnballe, Thomas","Thomsen, Heidi Maria","Haugaard, Lars","Heldbjerg, Henning","Therkildsen, Ole Roland"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-805808"],"filters":{"added":"2025-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"com","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"vildtbestande og jagttider i danmark det biologiske grundlag for jagttidsrevisionen 000000002026","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://dce.au.dk/fileadmin/dce.au.dk/Udgivelser/Videnskabelige_rapporter_600-699/SR652.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["Finansiel støtte: Styrelsen for Grøn Arealomlægning og Vandmiljø"],"id":"S01-000.00-805808","ids":["au-097857c7-9bb9-4e86-bc42-1adf002f10a1"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Commissioned","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-CBE91597BA2E04BBCD075615BC0C5674"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://dce.au.dk/fileadmin/dce.au.dk/Udgivelser/Videnskabelige_rapporter_600-699/SR652.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Ecoscience, Department of Ecoscience - Wildlife Ecology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Thomas Kjær","key":"christensenthomaskjærpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"5554437a-52ef-4f5b-a1e8-7f22fbec1bee","name":"Christensen, Thomas Kjær","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Preben","key":"clausenprebenpau","last":"Clausen","locid":"09884c6f-eeec-4774-a4e9-db625c26dd82","name":"Clausen, Preben","orcid":"0000-0001-8986-294X","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper","key":"madsenjesperpau","last":"Madsen","locid":"d68f4bd0-2909-4a5c-b687-e62a33fb5cfb","name":"Madsen, Jesper","orcid":"0000-0003-3246-0215","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Niels","key":"kanstrupnielspau","last":"Kanstrup","locid":"c0a7ebef-aa1c-4db0-946a-63a5390e0806","name":"Kanstrup, Niels","orcid":"0000-0002-7299-9517","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jacob","key":"sterupjacobpau","last":"Sterup","locid":"99ae9098-644b-4750-8d52-e19c60e9339a",