ehoth","last":"Sajadieh","name":"Sajadieh, Ahmad","rank":30,"role":"Other","rolecode":"oth"}],"pub":{"issn":["01091182"],"newspaper":"Jyllands-Posten","pages":"21","publisher":"JP/Politikens Hus AS","publisher_org":"JP/Politikens Hus A/S","status":"p","title":"Jyllands-Posten"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Miscellaneous","All Non-Profit Organisations","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","Central Denmark Region","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-NP","DI-NP-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Miscellaneous","Non-Profit Organisations","North Denmark Region","Other Research","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-ef800eb4-cebf-4c48-b7ed-a36d17b864cc"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Statiner redder liv – men skræmmekampagnerrisikerer at koste dem","type":"Newspaper Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-831615","year":"2025","yearsub":"2025"}
{"abstract":"Objective: In routine care, clinicians may employ 2-[18F]fluoro-2-deoxy-D-glucose (FDG)-PET/CT to validate their initial clinical diagnosis of PMR. Nevertheless, the diagnostic utility of combining FDG-PET/CT findings with clinical presentation has not been explored. Therefore, this study aimed to investigate whether the diagnostic accuracy for PMR could be enhanced by combining FDG-PET/CT findings with the clinical baseline diagnosis or the 2012 ACR/EULAR clinical classification criteria for PMR. Methods: An investigation and a validation cohort were included from two countries, encompassing 66/27 and 36/21 PMR/non-PMR patients, respectively. The cohorts comprised treatment-naïve patients suspected of PMR, who initially received a clinical baseline diagnosis and underwent FDG-PET/CT scans. The FDG-PET/CT Leuven score was applied to classify patients as either PMR or non-PMR and combined with the clinical baseline diagnosis. Final diagnoses were established through clinical follow-up after 12 or six months in the investigation and validation cohorts, respectively. Results: In the investigation cohort, a clinical baseline diagnosis yielded a sensitivity/specificity of 94%/82%, compared with 78%/70% using the ACR/EULAR criteria. Combining the clinical baseline diagnosis with a positive Leuven score showed a sensitivity/specificity of 80%/93%, compared with 80%/82% for an ACR/EULAR-Leuven score. In the validation cohort, the baseline diagnosis revealed a sensitivity/specificity of 100%/91%, compared with 92%/76% using the ACR/EULAR criteria. Combining FDG-PET/CT with the baseline diagnosis demonstrated a sensitivity/specificity of 83%/95% compared with 89%/81% for the ACR/EULAR-Leuven score. Conclusion: Combining FDG-PET/CT findings with the clinical baseline diagnosis or ACR/EULAR clinical classification criteria can improve the diagnostic specificity for PMR.","author_count":15,"contributors":["Nielsen, Andreas Wiggers","van der Geest, Kornelis S M","Hansen, Ib Tønder","Nielsen, Berit Dalsgaard","Kjær, Søren Geill","Blegvad-Nissen, Jesper","Nienhuis, Pieter H","Sandovici, Maria","Rewers, Kate","Møller Sørensen, Christian","Slart, Riemer H J A","Gormsen, Lars Christian","Brouwer, Elisabeth","Hauge, Ellen Margrethe","Keller, Kresten Krarup"],"cuid":["S02-092.31-804018"],"filters":{"added":"2024-09","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Nielsen, Andreas Wiggers"],"country":["Netherlands"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University Medical Center Groningen","University of Groningen","University of Twente"],"keyword":["Classification criteria","Diagnostic imaging","FDG PET CT","PMR"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-SDR"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"improved diagnostic accuracy for polymyalgia rheumatica using fdg pet ct with clinical diagnosis or 000000002012 acr eular classification criteria","src":["au","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/105002011416","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-092.31-804018","identifier":[{"id":"39058504","type":"pmid"},{"id":"105002011416","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-43dce4a4-95e4-4dc0-bb3b-b94663a7c540","sdu-29f54a1a-b871-4883-8c8a-9309d5628fc5"],"keyword":["FDG-PET/CT","PMR","classification criteria","diagnostic imaging"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-B69A217DBA5F00CD5D5F25AD6FC51CDB"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - The Section for Rheumatology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"nl","key":"university of groningen","loc":["Netherlands","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Groningen","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"nl","key":"university medical center groningen","loc":["Netherlands","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University Medical Center Groningen","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"dk","key":"central denmark region","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CDR","l3nl":"Central Denmark Region","l3nn":"Central Denmark Region","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Central Denmark Region","namevar":["Aarhus University Hospital","Regionshospitalet Silkeborg"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CDR","used":1},{"affno":"5","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Clinical Physiology and Nuclear Medicine (Odense)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"6","country":"dk","key":"region of southern denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-SDR","l3nl":"Region of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"Region of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Region of Southern Denmark","namevar":["Odense University Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-SDR","used":1},{"affno":"7","country":"nl","key":"university of twente","loc":["Netherlands","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Twente","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":