{"abstract":"Since the first recommendations for the use of point-of-care ultrasound in emergency departments in Denmark were published in 2014, emergency medicine was established as an independent specialty in 2017, and continuing development and research within the ultrasound field have created a need for updating the existing consensus paper. The purpose of this position paper by the Danish Emergency Medicine Ultrasound Committee is to describe the ultrasound protocols, education, organization, medico-legal issues, and research in point-of-care ultrasound in the emergency medicine spe-cialty in Denmark.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Arvig, Michael Dan","Laursen, Christian B","Weile‎, Jesper Bo","Bentsen, Lasse Paludan","Falster, Casper","K. Brockhattingen, Kristoffer","Nielsen Jeschke, Klaus","Riishede, Minna","Posth, Stefan"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-791922"],"filters":{"added":"2025-02","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Arvig, Michael Dan"],"country":["United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Independent researcher"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"point of care ultrasound in emergency medicine a position paper by the danish emergency medicine ultrasound committee","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.7146/akut.v7i3.145711","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-791922","ids":["sdu-780246ba-cedf-4807-8326-6641b4039944"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-C908A22C91894ED93D08FD8C3017DA2C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"