{"abstract":"This paper explores the phenomenon of intra-industry Business Model (BM) imitation through the concept of BM configurations and sheds light on how it relates to BM innovation. The analysis focuses on similarities and deviations of BM configurations among 80 companies operating in the industry sector related to Phantom Limb Pain (PLP). Leveraging a questionnaire-based mapping tool, the results show that companies operating within the area of PLP treatment apply relatively similar BM configurations. This indicates that companies mostly imitate the successful BMs of their main competitors in the industry as a whole and in their specific sub-groups, thus potentially ignoring the opportunity to also compete on a BM level. The contribution brought by the paper is twofold. First, it adds to the research stream on BM configurations by showing that this concept can be used not only to analyze and foster cross-industry BM imitation, but also to explore and examine intra-industry BM imitation (or differentiation). Second, the article contributes to the research stream on intra-industry BM imitation by going beyond prior anecdotal evidence and empirically testing the existence of the phenomenon of intra-industry BM imitation and hence, the potential innovation space on a BM level.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Montemari, Marco","Taran, Yariv","Schaper, Stefan","Nielsen, Christian","Thomsen, Peter","Sort, Jesper Chrautwald"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-004884"],"filters":{"added":"2022-09","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Montemari, Marco"],"country":["Italy"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Marche Polytechnic University"],"keyword":["Business model configurations","Business model imitation","Business model innovation","Value drivers"],"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"business model innovation or business model imitation that is the question","src":["aau","au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1080/09537325.2022.2034780","version":"Published Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["Research in this article has partly been supported by the EU FP7-HEALTH grant ID: 602547 'Natural sensory feedback for phantom limb modulation and therapy', for more information: https://cordis.europa.eu/project/id/602547"],"id":"S02-100.00-004884","identifier":[{"id":"85124314684","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-64ec8d51-6e9f-4a4b-972a-52229781b28c","au-d048a340-0dc6-4f86-8ca1-4d1449697cac"],"keyword":["Business model imitation","business model configurations","business model innovation","value drivers"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-2C5A0B1921B7D68BE16E7BAAF30119F8"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/514549815/TASM_FINAL_submitted.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1080/09537325.2022.2034780","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Social Science (SOC)"],"yearPub":"2022","yearSub":"2022"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"it","key":"marche polytechnic university","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Marche Polytechnic University","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Aalborg University Business School","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Aalborg University Business School, The IKE Research Group"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Aarhus BSS, Department of Management"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Marco","key":"montemaripau","last":"Montemari","name":"Montemari, Marco","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Yariv","key":"taranpau","last":"Taran","locid":"7f95bb76-6966-470f-9232-a9edd0fa69d2","name":"Taran, Yariv","orcid":"0000-0001-7314-3123","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Stefan","key":"schaperpau","last":"Schaper","locid":"d2dd8c5f-fa8c-4d4e-96dc-5eef23637324","name":"Schaper, Stefan","orcid":"0000-0001-9189-5070","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Christian","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"5ce07766-d99e-45a5-84b3-0267fca84453","name":"Nielsen, Christian","orcid":"0000-0001-5050-5793","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Peter","key":"thomsenpau","last":"Thomsen","locid":"3f3d3605-229f-4f92-bbba-07b1fd16bcaa","name":"Thomsen, Peter","orcid":"0000-0002-4282-939X","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper","key":"sortpau","last":"Sort","locid":"11418beb-d40c-40bf-af69-55b47598cc45","name":"Sort, Jesper Chrautwald","name_org":"Sort, Jesper","orcid":"0000-0003-0468-6209","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1080/09537325.2022.2034780","issn":["09537325","14653990"],"issn_org":["09537325"],"issue":"3","journal":"Technology Analysis & Strategic Management","pages":"393-407","publisher":"Routledge","status":"p","title":"Technology Analysis & Strategic Management","title_org":"Technology Analysis and Strategic Management","volume":"36"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85124314684"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-64ec8d51-6e9f-4a4b-972a-52229781b28c","au-d048a340-0dc6-4f86-8ca1-4d1449697cac"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Business model innovation or Business model imitation – That is the question","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-004884","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"Black soldier fly (BSF; Hermetia illucens) is a promising insect species for food and feed production as its larvae can convert different organic waste to high-value protein. Selective breeding is one way to optimize production, but the potential of breeding is only starting to be explored and not yet utilized for BSF. To assist in monitoring a captive population and implementing a breeding program, genomics tools are imperative. We conducted whole genome sequencing of two captive populations separated by geographical distance - Denmark (DK) and Texas, USA (TX). Various population genetics analyses revealed a moderate genetic differentiation between two populations. Moreover, we observed higher inbreeding in the DK population, and the detection of a subpopulation within DK population aligned well with the recent foundation of the DK population from two captive populations. Additionally, we generated gene ontology annotation and variants annotation for wider potential applications. Our findings establish a robust marker set for research in population genetics, facilitating the monitoring of inbreeding and laying the groundwork for practical breeding programs for BSF.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Cai, Zexi","Hansen, Laura Skrubbeltrang","Laursen, Stine Frey","Nielsen, Hanne Marie","Bahrndorff, Simon","Tomberlin, Jeffery K.","Kristensen, Torsten Nygaard","Sørensen, Jesper Givskov","Sahana, Goutam"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-741286"],"filters":{"added":"2024-08","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Cai, Zexi"],"country":["United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Texas A and M University","Texas A&M University"],"keyword":["Black soldier fly","Breeding","Food and feed","Insects","Sustainability","Whole genome sequencing"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"whole genome sequencing of two captive black soldier fly populations implications for commercial production","src":["aau","au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ygeno.2024.110891","version":"Published Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["This work was funded by Danish Council for Independent Research (DFF-0136-00171B), the Ministry of Foreign Affairs of Denmark and administered by Danida Fellowship Centre, FLYgene project (21-09-AU), and the Novo Nordic Foundation (Grant no. NNF21OC0070910)."],"id":"S02-100.00-741286","identifier":[{"id":"85196734498","type":"scopus"},{"id":"38909907","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["aau-1bb32ae6-55f0-4871-81bb-7add4d71324c","au-2a37e2ef-09af-416d-a1ba-c2df307d6a9f"],"keyword":["Black soldier fly","Breeding","Food and feed","Insects","Sustainability","Whole genome sequencing"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-487801E1E67F681D670AA2B365F2F018"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ygeno.2024.110891","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/723112117/Cai_et_al._2024.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Center for Quantitative Genetics and Genomics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Chemistry and Bioscience","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Chemistry and Bioscience, Environmental Change and Adaptation","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Chemistry and Bioscience, Section for Bioscience and Engineering","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Chemistry and Bioscience, Section of Functional Ecology and Genomics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"us","key":"texas a and m university","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Texas A and M University","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"us","key":"texas a m university","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Texas A&M University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Zexi","key":"caipau","last":"Cai","locid":"8a71bf1c-e484-4cff-9a57-02a1c6d6b061","name":"Cai, Zexi","orcid":"0000-0002-9579-3415","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Laura Skrubbeltrang","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"5fd29cd8-360a-461a-b205-b81e0ac76c23","name":"Hansen, Laura Skrubbeltrang","orcid":"0000-0002-4270-6365","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Stine Frey","key":"laursenpau","last":"Laursen","locid":"1a898d84-89ba-4f9d-b176-c6658e075581","name":"Laursen, Stine Frey","orcid":"0000-0002-7879-8660","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Hanne Marie","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"4557ab69-42a2-40e1-9c55-66bb9f9aad50","name":"Nielsen, Hanne Marie","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Simon","key":"bahrndorffpau","last":"Bahrndorff","locid":"a270f01e-03d6-473b-8cd1-ab444b299416","name":"Bahrndorff, Simon","orcid":"0000-0002-0838-4008","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 4","corresponding":null,"first":"Jeffery K.","key":"tomberlinpau","last":"Tomberlin","name":"Tomberlin, Jeffery K.","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Torsten Nygaard","key":"kristensenpau","last":"Kristensen","locid":"48974411-cbd8-4785-8336-315ac8080f15","name":"Kristensen, Torsten Nygaard","orcid":"0000-0001-6204-8753","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Givskov","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","locid":"ad745dfe-7c3b-4bbc-90df-4217c1b9ca92","name":"Sørensen, Jesper Givskov","orcid":"0000-0002-9149-3626","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Goutam","key":"sahanapau","last":"Sahana","locid":"bb375f9c-4103-4460-80cc-ec53d0cd03d5","name":"Sahana, Goutam","orcid":"0000-0001-7608-7577","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["38909907"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.ygeno.2024.110891","issn":["08887543","10898646"],"issn_org":["08887543"],"issue":"5","journal":"Genomics","paperid":"110891","publisher":"Academic Press Inc.","status":"p","title":"Genomics","volume":"116"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85196734498"],"sdg":["12. Responsible Consumption and Production","2. Zero Hunger","All UN SDG Classification"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-1bb32ae6-55f0-4871-81bb-7add4d71324c","au-2a37e2ef-09af-416d-a1ba-c2df307d6a9f"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Whole-genome sequencing of two captive black soldier fly populations: Implications for commercial production","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-741286","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"Denne rapport opsummerer hovedresultaterne fra forskningsprojektet ”Udviklingsinitiativer for marine virkemidler”, der er besluttet og finansieret af ”Aftale om grøn omstilling af dansk landbrug” fra 2021 og udmøntet via Miljøstyrelsen. Projektet skal danne grundlag for beslutning om, og i givet fald hvordan de marine virkemidler ”reetablering af ålegræs” og ”dyrkning af tang” kan anvendes i vandplanlægningen til at opsamle næringsstoffer og/eller opnå andre positive miljøeffekter, som kan bidrage til hurtigere opnåelse af god økologisk tilstand i danske kystvandområder i overensstemmelse med vandrammedirektivet. Forskningsprojektet og nærværende opsummerende rapport er ledet af DTU Aqua ved projektleder Karen Timmermann og udført i samarbejde med Syddansk Universitet (SDU), Københavns Universitet (KU), Aarhus Universitet (AU) og DHI. Rapporten er en del af rapportserien ”Udviklingsinitiativer for marine virkemidler”, som udover den opsummerende rapport omfatter en række baggrundsrapporter med videnskabelig dokumentation for projektets resultater. Baggrundsrapporterne i serien udgives i løbet af 2024 og udgøres af: • En dybdegående projektsynteserapport. • Vidensyntese om ålegræstransplantering. • Videnssyntese om tangdyrkning. • Rapporten ”Muligheder for at indregne marine virkemidler i den nationale drivhusgasopgørelse”. • Rapporten ”Retlige rammer for marine virkemidler og marin natur”. • Arbejdspakkerapporter med videnskabelig dokumentation for resultaterne fra hver af projektets centrale faglige arbejdspakker omhandlende ”Ålegræstransplantering”, ”Dyrkning af sukkertang” og \"Modellering af virkemiddeleffekter”. Miljøstyrelsen har haft rapportudkast til kommentering undervejs i projektgruppens arbejde, men valg af metoder og konklusioner er alene projektgruppens ansvar.","author_count":44,"contributors":["Timmermann, Karen","Mostovaya, Alina","Barnewitz, Anders","Erichsen, Anders","Petersen, Anders H.","Holbach, Andreas","Bruhn, Annette","Nielsen, Benjamin","Taylor, Daniel","Hansen, Flemming Thorbjørn","Hansen, Frederik H.","Christensen, Freja","Anker, Helle Tegner","Christensen, Jesper","Holding, Johnna","Baaner, Lasse","Hermannsen, Line","Callisen, Lærke W.","Nielsen, Mette Møller","Gommesen, Mia","Lees, Mikkel K.","Flindt, Mogens R.","Holst, Niels","Canal-Vergés, Paula","Schmedes, Peter Søndergaard","Kjær, Rasmus A.","Steinfurth, Rune C. H.","Stæhr, Sanjina Upadhyay","Pedersen, Sidsel Gurholt","Vinbæk, Sidsel Juul","Gyldenkerne, Steen","Andersen, Søren Stig","Boderskov, Teis","Jørgensen, Thor S.","Banke, Timi L.","Andersen, Trine A.","Larsen, Trine C."],"cuid":["S03-085.23-741743"],"filters":{"added":"2024-08","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"country":["United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University College London"],"level":"com","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-U"],"level3":{"GTS":["DI-GTS-ALL","DI-GTS-DHYI"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-GTS-DHYI","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"ålegræstransplantering og tangdyrkning som marine virkemidler potentialer effekter og juridiske aspekter opsummering af hovedresultater fra projektet udviklingsinitiativer for marine virkemidler","src":["au","dtu","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.11581/DTU.00000330","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S03-085.23-741743","ids":["au-2ceb8fdc-2f46-496b-8bbc-7f94a965b69a","dtu-12626b52-0d2c-4d53-a341-d5d143ccfc9c","ku-72d1342f-25d8-451f-a3f8-7574b2ac0fe7"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Commissioned","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-14A5076AC8430F4DF40770992399A821"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https:/