mi L.","orcid":"0009-0001-1642-2297","rank":35,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Trine A.","key":"andersentrineapau","last":"Andersen","name":"Andersen, Trine A.","rank":36,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Trine C.","key":"larsentrinecpau","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, Trine C.","rank":37,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.11581/dtu.000003","isbn":["9788774813934"],"issn":["13958216"],"issue":"457-2024","pages":"38","publisher":"Danmarks Tekniske Universitet","repno":"DTU Aqua-rapport, 457-2024","series":"DTU Aqua-rapport","status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All GTS Institutes","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-GTS-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","GTS Institutes","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-98125997-674b-4af1-91f2-b7f798a4aed8"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Ålegræstransplantering og tangdyrkning som marine virkemidler : Potentialer, effekter og juridiske aspekter: Opsummering af hovedresultater fra projektet","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-750732","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"Left atrial appendage occlusion (LAAO) is rapidly growing as valid stroke prevention therapy in atrial fibrillation. Cardiac imaging plays an instrumental role in preprocedural planning, procedural execution, and postprocedural follow-up. Recently, cardiac computed tomography (CCT) has made significant advancements, resulting in increasing use both preprocedurally and in outpatient follow-up. It provides a noninvasive, high-resolution alternative to the current standard, transesophageal echocardiography, and may display advantages in both the detection and characterization of device-specific complications, such as peridevice leak and device-related thrombosis. The implementation of CCT in the follow-up after LAAO has identified new findings such as hypoattenuated thickening on the atrial device surface and left atrial appendage contrast patency, which are not readily assessable on transesophageal echocardiography. Currently, there is a lack of standardization for acquisition and interpretation of images and consensus on definitions of essential findings on CCT in the postprocedural phase. This paper intends to provide a practical and standardized approach to both acquisition and interpretation of CCT after LAAO based on a comprehensive review of the literature and expert consensus among European and North American interventional and imaging specialists.","author_count":20,"contributors":["Korsholm, Kasper","Iriart, Xavier","Saw, Jacqueline","Wang, Dee Dee","Berti, Sergio","Galea, Roberto","Freixa, Xavier","Arzamendi, Dabit","De Backer, Ole","Kramer, Anders","Cademartiri, Filippo","Cochet, Hubert","Odenstedt, Jacob","Aminian, Adel","Räber, Lorenz","Cruz-Gonzalez, Ignacio","Garot, Philippe","Jensen, Jesper Møller","Alkhouli, Mohamad","Nielsen-Kudsk, Jens Erik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-752651"],"filters":{"added":"2024-09","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Nielsen-Kudsk, Jens Erik"],"country":["Belgium","Canada","France","Italy","Spain","Sweden","Switzerland","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","CHU de Bordeaux","CHU de Charleroi","Gabriele Monasterio Foundation","Henry Ford Health System","Hospital Clínico Universitario de Salamanca","Hospital of Santa Creu i Sant Pau","Mayo Clinic Rochester, MN","Universite Paris-Saclay","University of Barcelona","University of Bern","University of Gothenburg","Vancouver General Hospital"],"keyword":["Cardiac computed tomography","Device related thrombosis","Left atrial appendage closure","peridevice leak"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"position statement on cardiac computed tomography following left atrial appendage occlusion","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"djr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85199873662","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-752651","identifier":[{"id":"39142755","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85199873662","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-1cad29ca-7f44-4f0a-9fad-690737b33a04"],"keyword":["cardiac computed tomography","device-related thrombosis","left atrial appendage closure","peridevice leak"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-73C98B9BE0EC4A61F5904EA169785E4E"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - The Department of Cardiological Medicine B"],"no