{"abstract":"Det er tid til at gentænke vores tilgang til både klima og sundhed – og her spiller forebyggelse, både af sygdom og forværring af sygdom, potentielt set en afgørende rolle.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Skou, Søren Thorgaard","Birkved, Morten","Nielsen, Jesper Lambert","Reventlow, Susanne","Árnadóttir, Ásthildur","Risør, Torsten","Møller, Anne"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-766330"],"filters":{"added":"2024-11","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Skou, Søren Thorgaard"],"level":"pop","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-ZEA"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-ZEA","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"debat vi har ikke råd til kun at fokusere på én krise ad gangen så hvad skal vi gøre","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"doi","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://sundhedsmonitor.dk/debat/art10089008/Vi-har-ikke-r%C3%A5d-til-kun-at-fokusere-p%C3%A5-%C3%A9n-krise-ad-gangen-s%C3%A5-hvad-skal-vi-g%C3%B8re","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-766330","ids":["sdu-e07a6c87-bd11-4b21-bcc5-74cf17697d9e"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-F95DE11BEF17BED9DC57193EA7A130DC"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://sundhedsmonitor.dk/debat/art10089008/Vi-har-ikke-r%C3%A5d-til-kun-at-fokusere-p%C3%A5-%C3%A9n-krise-ad-gangen-s%C3%A5-hvad-skal-vi-g%C3%B8re","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Sport