{"abstract":"BACKGROUND: Hypertension is the leading risk factor for cardiovascular disease worldwide. Patients with blood pressure (BP) response to dietary sodium reduction are referred to as “salt sensitive.” Salt sensitivity (SS) might be due to differences in sodium storage capacity and the erythrocyte SS examines this capacity of the red blood cells. This study aimed to test the effect of a self-performed sodium reduced diet on BP in patients with essential hypertension and examine whether erythrocyte SS predicts SS. METHODS AND RESULTS: Seventy-two patients with hypertension were included and randomized 2:1 to either sodium reduction or a control group for 4 weeks. Blood samples, 24-hour BP measurement, and 24-hour urine collection were performed before and after. The intervention group received advice on how to lower sodium intake. Urinary sodium excretion decreased 66 mmol (95% CI, −96 to −37 mmol) in the intervention group compared with the control group. Systolic 24-hour BP decreased 9 mm Hg after low-sodium diet compared with the control group (95% CI, −13 to −4 mm Hg). Similarly, the difference in reduction in diastolic BP between the groups was 5 mm Hg (95% CI, −8 to −1 mm Hg). We found no correlation between erythrocyte SS at baseline and decrease in 24-hour BP, neither systolic nor diastolic (P=0.66 and P = 0.84). CONCLUSIONS: Self-performed sodium reduction was feasible and led to decrease in 24-hour BP of 9/5 mm Hg compared with a control group. The erythrocyte SS did not correlate to the change in BP after lowering sodium intake.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Duus, Camilla Lundgreen","Nielsen, Steffen Flindt","Hornstrup, Bodil Gade","Mose, Frank Holden","Bech, Jesper N."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-745050"],"filters":{"added":"2024-08","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Hypertension","Salt sensitivity","Sodium","Sodium reduction"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"self performed dietary sodium reduction and blood pressure in patients with essential hypertension a randomized clinical trial","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1161/JAHA.124.034632","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-745050","identifier":[{"id":"85196582319","type":"scopus"},{"id":"38842286","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC11255768","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["au-a90fb673-3e47-4604-a877-2776b163f6bc"],"keyword":["hypertension","salt sensitivity","sodium","sodium reduction"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-94782ACF92C15C7F8ED2C73C90BE38A0"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1161/JAHA.124.034632","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - University Clinic in Nephrology and Hypertension, Holstebro Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Camilla Lundgreen","key":"duuspau","last":"Duus","locid":"dd95ffa8-c453-4af1-8bc5-f08e62c18b6c","name":"Duus, Camilla Lundgreen","orcid":"0009-0007-2241-5791","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Steffen Flindt","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"040ca6cf-cd77-4f21-8512-8cb0130c7f09","name":"Nielsen, Steffen Flindt","orcid":"0009-0002-5410-1088","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Bodil Gade","key":"hornstruppau","last":"Hornstrup","locid":"91da9078-1b41-4345-873c-9c14a21eab4e","name":"Hornstrup, Bodil Gade","orcid":"0000-0002-4042-5068","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Frank Holden","key":"mosepau","last":"Mose","locid":"2743ec13-0199-4678-9480-a5c65172749f","name":"Mose, Frank Holden","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Nørgaard","key":"bechpau","last":"Bech","locid":"ada3ab11-5e6a-4f8c-8c03-c9e09fcb18be","name":"Bech, Jesper N.","name_org":"Bech, Jesper Nørgaard","orcid":"0000-0002-0605-1277","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["38842286"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1161/jaha.124.034632","issn":["20479980"],"issue":"12","journal":"Journal of the American Heart Association","paperid":"e034632","publisher":"American Heart Association Inc.","status":"p","title":"Journal of the American Heart Association","volume":"13"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85196582319"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-a90fb673-3e47-4604-a877-2776b163f6bc"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Self-Performed Dietary Sodium Reduction and Blood Pressure in Patients With Essential Hypertension : A Randomized Clinical Trial","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-745050","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"author_count":7,"contributors":["Hansen, Laura Skrubbeltrang","Laursen, Stine Frey","Bahrndorff, Simon","Sørensen, Jesper Givskov","Sahana, Goutam","Kristensen, Torsten Nygaard","Nielsen, Hanne Marie"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-745794"],"filters":{"added":"2024-08","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Hansen, Laura Skrubbeltrang"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the unpaved road towards efficient selective breeding in insects for food and feed","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dpr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"rem","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.16364","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-745794","ids":["au-fe512bee-c39c-47fc-acc5-bea7153159e3"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-CEA7C61DAA6542AC274636D5BFA9A749"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"rem","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.16364","version":"Pre-print"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Center for Quantitative Genetics and Genomics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University (AAU)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Laura Skrubbeltrang","k