 Ørbæk","key":"andersenhenrikørbækpau","last":"Andersen","name":"Andersen, Henrik Ørbæk","rank":16,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Morten","key":"helvindmortenpau","last":"Helvind","name":"Helvind, Morten","rank":17,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ole","key":"debackerolepau","last":"De Backer","name":"De Backer, Ole","rank":18,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Christian","key":"jønschristianpau","last":"Jøns","name":"Jøns, Christian","rank":19,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Michael Rahbek","key":"schmidtmichaelrahbekpau","last":"Schmidt","name":"Schmidt, Michael Rahbek","rank":20,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Troels Højsgaard","key":"jørgensentroelshøjsgaardpau","last":"Jørgensen","name":"Jørgensen, Troels Højsgaard","rank":21,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lars","key":"sondergaardlarspau","last":"Sondergaard","name":"Sondergaard, Lars","rank":22,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["38127022"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.jcin.2023.10.070","issn":["18767605","19368798"],"issn_org":["19368798"],"issue":"2","journal":"JACC: Cardiovascular Interventions","pages":"217-227","publisher":"Elsevier Inc.","status":"p","title":"JACC: Cardiovascular Interventions","volume":"17"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85181934062"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","Central Denmark Region","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Region Zealand","Region of Southern Denmark","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-7ceaa106-00ba-4e24-8fdc-34c021627557","sdu-12b20f6d-4e7d-4204-96ac-1b562be6ef87"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Pulmonary Valve Replacement in Tetralogy of Fallot : Procedural Volume and Durability of Bioprosthetic Pulmonary Valves","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-724713","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"PURPOSE: 2-[18F]Fluoro-2-deoxy-D-glucose (FDG)-positron emission tomography (PET)/computed tomography (CT) has been suggested as an imaging modality to diagnose polymyalgia rheumatica (PMR). However, the applicability of FDG-PET/CT remains unclear, especially following glucocorticoid administration. This study aimed to investigate the diagnostic accuracy of FDG-PET/CT before and during prednisolone treatment, as well as following short-term prednisolone discontinuation. METHODS: Treatment naïve suspected PMR patients were clinically diagnosed at baseline and subsequently had an FDG-PET/CT performed. Patients diagnosed with PMR were administered prednisolone following the first FDG-PET/CT and had a second FDG-PET/CT performed after 8 weeks of treatment. Subsequently, prednisolone was tapered with short-term discontinuation at week 9 followed by a third FDG-PET/CT at week 10. An FDG-PET/CT classification of PMR/non-PMR was applied, utilizing both the validated Leuven score and a dichotomous PMR score. The final diagnosis was based on clinical follow-up after 1 year. RESULTS: A total of 68 and 27 patients received a final clinical diagnosis of PMR or non-PMR. A baseline FDG-PET/CT classified the patients as having PMR with a sensitivity/specificity of 86%/63% (Leuven score) and 82%/70% (dichotomous score). Comparing the subgroup of non-PMR with inflammatory diseases to the PMR group demonstrated a specificity of 39%/54% (Leuven/dichotomous score). After 8 weeks of prednisolone treatment, the sensitivity of FDG-PET/CT decreased to 36%/41% (Leuven/dichotomous score), while a short-term prednisolone discontinuation increased the sensitivity to 66%/60%. CONCLUSION: FDG-PET/CT has limited diagnostic accuracy for differentiating PMR from other inflammatory diseases. If FDG-PET/CT is intended for diagnostic purposes, prednisolone should be discontinued to enhance diagnostic accuracy. TRIAL REGISTRATION: ClinicalTrials.gov (NCT04519580). Registered 17th of August 2020.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Nielsen, Andreas Wiggers","Hansen, Ib Tønder","Nielsen, Berit Dalsgaard","Kjær, Søren Geill","Blegvad-Nissen, Jesper","Rewers, Kate","Sørensen, Christian Møller","Hauge, Ellen Margrethe","Gormsen, Lars Christian","Keller, Kresten Krarup"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-751779"],"filters":{"added":"2024-05","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"corresponding_author":["Nielsen, Andreas Wiggers"],"keyword":["Aged","Aged 80 and over","Diagnostic imaging","Effect of prednisolone","FDG PET CT","Female","Fluorodeoxyglucose F18","Humans","Male","Middle Aged","Polymyalgia rheumatica","Positron Emission Tomography Computed Tomography","Prednisolone therapeutic use","Prospective Studies","Radiopharmaceuticals","Sensitivity and Specificity","Withholding Treatment"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-SDR"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the effect of prednisolone and a short term prednisolone discontinuation for the diagnostic accuracy of fdg pet ct in polymyalgia rheumatica a prospective study of 000000000101 patients","src":["au","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s00259-024-06697-8","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-751779","identifier":[{"id":"PMC11224098","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"85189141231","type":"scopus"},{"id":"38563881","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-bfcf2b2a-3266-43b7-9a26-249934b95825","sdu-cc121d27-c2e9-4a0f-bc59-32c7cdf95cd3"],"keyword":["Aged","Aged, 80 and over","Diagnostic imaging","Effect of prednisolone","FDG-PET/CT","Female","Fluorodeoxyglucose F18","Humans","Male","Middle Aged","Polymyalgia Rheumatica/diagnostic imaging","Polymyalgia rheumatica","Positron Emission Tomography Computed Tomography","Prednisolone/therapeutic use","Prospective Studies","Radiopharmaceuticals","Sensitivity and Specificity","Withholding Treatment"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-D534C2822F1D954715F1FEA90990AE05"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/434382841/The_effect_of_prednisolone_and_a_short_term_prednisolone_discontinuation_for_the_diagnostic_accuracy_of_FDG_PETCT_in_polymyalgia_rheumatica_a_prospective_study_of_101_patients.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s00259-024-06697-8","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/268445024/s00259-024-06697-8.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Diagnostisk Center, Universitetsklinik for Innovative Patientforløb, Silkeborg","Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - The Section for Rheumatology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"central denmark region","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CDR","l3nl":"Central Denmark Region","l3nn":"Central Denmark Region","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Central Denmark Region","namevar":["Aarhus University Hospital","Regionshospitalet Silkeborg"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CDR","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"Univers