cid":"465b6401-cdf8-4ee2-b613-0b1079b1d58a","name":"Dysager, Lars","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper F","key":"kallehaugepau","last":"Kallehauge","locid":"13fb901a-df95-4c6e-a843-d1ae03a24c68","name":"Kallehauge, Jesper Folsted","name_org":"Kallehauge, Jesper F","orcid":"0000-0003-3705-5390","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["37683054"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1080/0284186x.2023.2254925","issn":["0284186X","11001704"],"issn_org":["0284186X"],"issue":"10","journal":"Acta Oncologica","pages":"1222-1229","publisher":"Medical Journals Sweden AB","status":"p","title":"Acta Oncologica","title_org":"Acta oncologica (Stockholm, Sweden)","volume":"62"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85170559125"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","Central Denmark Region","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Region of Southern Denmark","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-c295a9d9-74b9-49d8-945c-7164acb5815c","sdu-e0d727ec-e9c2-4d25-b7ee-02b58c4c7832"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Dose comparison of robustly optimized intensity modulated proton therapy (IMPT) vs IMRT and VMAT photon plans for testicular seminoma","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-088.46-761834","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"BackgroundOn 1 January 2018 a four-year test scheme concerning use of medicinal cannabis (MC) was enacted. It has recently been extended for four more years by the Danish Parliament permitting all Danish physicians to prescribe MC to their patients. Previous studies have shown that general practitioners (GPs) have varying prescription experience, little knowledge, and mixed attitudes about MC. However, the present evidence is still limited, and no studies exist about Danish GPs' prescription experience, knowledge, and attitudes towards MC. Therefore, our aim was to examine Danish GPs' prescription experience, knowledge, and attitudes towards MC.MethodsA national online survey-based study addressing Danish GPs was performed from September 2018 to July 2019. We performed separate multivariable logistic regression analyses including GPs' prescription experience, knowledge, and attitudes towards MC as outcome variables.ResultsA total of 427 (38.4%) of 1112 GPs completed the questionnaire. Of these, 37 (8.7%) had experience in prescribing MC. The majority had little or no knowledge about MC (80.6%) as well as a negative view on prescription of MC (71.4%) to patients. Factors associated with prescribing MC to patients were: Single-handed practices (OR = 1.6, 95% CI 1.1;1.8) and perception of having quite some knowledge about MC (OR = 4.8, 95% CI 2.2;10.4). Factors associated with having quite some knowledge about MC were: having a positive attitude towards prescribing MC (OR = 5.2, 95% CI 1.9;14.0), being male (OR = 1.7, 95% CI 1.4;1.8), and being at least 60 years of age (OR = 2.8, 95% CI 1.3;6.0). Factors associated with having a positive attitude towards prescribing MC were: having quite some knowledge about MC (OR = 5.2, 95% CI 2.2;12.5) and GPs being male (OR = 1.7, 95% CI 1.1;1.9).ConclusionIn this first study on prescription experience, knowledge, and attitudes about MC among Danish GPs, conducted one year after the Danish test scheme was enacted, we find a very low proportion of prescribers, little knowledge, and an overall negative attitude towards MC. Among the prescribing GPs, four in ten have little to no knowledge and a negative attitude towards MC. We stress that prescribing patterns, knowledge, and attitudes may change throughout the remaining time of the test scheme.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Rosenbaek, F.","Riisgaard, H.","Nielsen, J. B.","Wehberg, S.","Waldorff, Frans Boch","Pedersen, L. B.","Søndergaard, J."],"cuid":["S02-096.10-704559"],"filters":{"added":"2023-04","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"corresponding_author":["Rosenbæk, Frederik"],"keyword":["Attitude","Experience","General practitioner","Health care","Medical cannabis","Physician","Prescription","Questionnaire","Survey"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"gps prescription patterns experience and attitudes towards medicinal cannabis a nationwide survey at the early stage of the danish test scheme","src":["ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1186/s12875-023-01971-4","version":"Published Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["Funding Information: This study is part of a larger project funded by the Health Committee in the Region of Southern Denmark (case number: 17/23397)."],"id":"S02-096.10-704559","identifier":[{"id":"000914783900003","type":"wos"},{"id":"36650442","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC9843989","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"85146409885","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-3321bd1a-3329-4c0c-8919-f936747ca088","sdu-8dae4b72-e890-469e-88e3-9254d885b727"],"keyword":["Attitude","CARE ULTRASOUND","Experience","General practitioner","HEALTH-CARE","Medical cannabis","PHYSICIAN","Prescription","Questionnaire","Survey"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-D45044718FDBEFF17005E87F53C5A3B7"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1186/s12875-023-01971-4","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/222143982/s12875_023_01971_4.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/336521974/Fulltext.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Public Health","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Public Health, Research Unit of General Pratice"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, External Centres, Forskningsenheden for Almen Praksis"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"F.","key":"rosenbækpau","last":"Rosenbæk","locid":"ddb48549-0a16-43ea-ace9-298bbf7a8c49","name":"Rosenbæk, Frederik","name_org":"Rosenbæk, F.","orcid":"0000-0003-0214-1539","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"H.","key":"riisgaardpau","last":"Riisgaard","locid":"7bb4b4dd-cbd6-4c4c-b99e-aa3c6eee7d11","name":"Riisgaard, Helle","name_org":"Riisgaard, H.","orcid":"0000-0002-1985-6808","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"J. B.","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"75938cc2-43d6-4c8d-a506-6b1c0472a382","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Bo","name_org":"Nielsen, J. B.","orcid":"0000-0002-5764-5462","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"S.","key":"wehbergpau","last":"Wehberg","locid":"2a11b516-c573-4a93-88f1-4a86a858b664","name":"Wehberg, Sonja","name_org":"Wehberg, S.","orcid":"0000-0003-1503-2649","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","first":"F. B.","key":"waldorffpau","last":"Waldorff","locid":"895410ef-1771-4e1d-a0a7-94ccef842d76","name":"Waldorff, Frans Boch","name_org":"Waldorff, F. B.","orcid":"0000-0002-7859-633X","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"L. B.","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"b2346680-b60a-41e8-9332-304171fab9be","name":"Pedersen, Line Bjørnskov","name_org":"Pedersen, L. B.","orcid":"0000-0001-6804-2045","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"J.","key":"søndergaardpau","last":"Søndergaard","locid":"4829db0c-8486-4ad1-8e6b-d4f3dc56c386","name":"Søndergaard, Jens","name_org":"Søndergaard, J.","orcid":"0000-0002-1629-1864","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["36650442"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1186/s12875-023-01971-4","issn":["27314553"],"issue":"1","journal":"BMC Primary Care","paperid":"17","publisher":"BioMed Central","status":"p","title":"BMC Primary Care","volume":"24"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85146409885"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-3321bd1a-3329-4c0c-8919-f936747ca088","sdu-8dae4b72-e890-469e-88e3-9254d885b727"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"GPs' prescription patterns, experience, and attitudes towards medicinal cannabis-a nationwide survey at the early stage of the Danish test scheme","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-096.10-704559","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"Background: Roflumilast is a targeted inhibitor of phosphodiesterase (PDE)-4 and has been approved for treatment of severe chronic obstructive pulmonary disease for more than a decade. Generic versions are available in the United States. PDE-4 is involved in the psoriasis pathogenesis, but the efficacy and safety of oral roflumilast in patients with psoriasis have not previously been studied. Methods: A company-independent, multicenter, randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled trial (ClinicalTrials.gov NCT04549870). Patients were randomized 1:1 to receive monotherapy with oral roflumilast 500 μg once daily or placebo. At week 12, placebo patients were switched to open-label roflumilast through week 24. The primary endpoint was a 75% or greater reduction from baseline in the psoriasis area and severity index (PASI75) at week 12. Findings: In all, 46 patients were randomized (roflumilast, n = 23; placebo, n = 23). At week 12, significantly more patients in the active arm achieved PASI75 (8 of 23 patients [35%]) vs. placebo (0 of 23 patients [0%], with a difference vs. placebo of 8 [35%] patients, 95% CI: 3 [13%]—13 [57%] patients) (p = 0.014). At week 24, 15 (65%), 10 (44%), 5 (22%), and 2 (9%) of patients treated with roflumilast from week 0 had PASI50, PASI75, PASI90, and PASI100 responses (key secondary endpoints), respectively. The most prevalent, drug-related adverse events in both treatment groups were transient gastrointestinal symptoms, weight-loss, headache, and insomnia. A total of three patients (roflumilast n = 2; placebo, n = 1) discontinued therapy due to adverse events. Interpretation: Oral roflumilast was efficacious and safe in treating moderate-to-severe plaque psoriasis over 24 weeks. With generic versions available, this drug may represent an inexpensive and convenient alternative to established systemic psoriasis treatments. Funding: Financial support was received from Herlev and Gentofte Hospital, University of Copenhagen, and independent grants from private foundations in Denmark. No pharmaceutical company, including the market authorization holder of roflumilast, was involved in the study at any point.","author_count":14,"contributors":["Gyldenløve, Mette","Meteran, Howraman","Sørensen, Jennifer A.","Fage, Simon","Yao, Yiqiu","Lindhardsen, Jesper","Nissen, Christoffer V.","Todberg, Tanja","Thomsen, Simon F.","Skov, Lone","Zachariae, Claus","Iversen, Lars","Nielsen, Mia Louise","Egeberg, Alexander"],"cuid":["S02-099.86-724871"],"filters":{"added":"2023-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"corresponding_author":["Egeberg, Alexander"],"keyword":["COPD","Chronic obstructive pulmonary disease","PDE4 inhibitor","Phosphodiesterase 4","Psoriasis","Roflumilast","Therapy"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"efficacy and safety of oral roflumilast for moderate to severe psoriasis a randomized controlled trial psorro","src":["au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.lanepe.2023.100639","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-099.86-724871","identifier":[{"id":"37465323","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85153078697","type":"scopus"},{"id":"PMC10350848","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["au-d1ef277d-da01-4d7a-b5a8-03147158046b","ku-6a1c7f58-0a14-4592-b5ef-ebb1f6494065"],"keyword":["COPD","Chronic obstructive pulmonary disease","PDE4-inhibitor","Phosphodiesterase-4","Psoriasis","Roflumilast","Therapy"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-B6CD619BD50123A96FC0DAAA051E2F10"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.lanepe.2023.100639","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/386606077/1_s2.0_S2666776223000583_main.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Dermatovenerology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital - Herlev and Gentofte"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - The Department of Dermatology and Venereology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"dk","key":"central denmark region","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CDR","l3nl":"Central Denmark Region","l3nn":"Central Denmark Region","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Central Denmark Region","namevar":["Aarhus University Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CDR","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","first":"Mette","key":"gyldenløvepau","last":"Gyldenløve","locid":"edeb4ff6-2ac7-4b29-b508-8486b1d50fc2","name":"Gyldenløve, Mette","orcid":"0000-0001-6156-6081","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Howraman","key":"meteranpau","last":"Meteran","name":"Meteran, Howraman","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Jennifer A","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","name":"Sørensen, Jennifer A","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 4","corresponding":null,"first":"Simon","key":"fagepau","last":"Fage","locid":"255b6adb-2e53-4c19-ad4c-3fbc5c2776bd","name":"Fage, Simon","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Yiqiu","key":"yaopau","last":"Yao","name":"Yao, Yiqiu","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Jesper","key":"lindhardsenpau","last":"Lindhardsen","name":"Lindhardsen, Jesper","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Christoffer V.","key":"nissenpau","last":"Nissen","name":"Nissen, Christoffer V.","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Tanja","key":"todbergpau","last":"Todberg","name":"Todberg, Tanja","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Simon F","key":"thomsenpau","last":"Thomsen","name":"Thomsen, Simon F","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","first":"Lone","key":"skovpau","last":"Skov","locid":"3c315ac3-214b-432d-9741-92790d5b5932","name":"Skov, Lone","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","first":"Claus","key":"zachariaepau","last":"Zachariae","locid":"ee5c26db-8a40-4753-b9da-249ffce2b771","name":"Zachariae, Claus","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 4","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lars","key":"iversenpau","last":"Iversen","locid":"0ee9531c-28fa-41bc-8eb4-64d8ae7f0fb1","name":"Iversen, Lars","orcid":"0000-0003-1816-4508","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Mia-Louise","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Mia-Louise","rank":13,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","first":"Alexander","key":"egebergpau","last":"Egeberg","locid":"e4445a48-c228-4507-b47c-a83175478f82","name":"Egeberg, Alexander","rank":14,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["37465323"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.lanepe.2023.100639","issn":["26667762"],"journal":"The Lancet Regional Health - Europe","paperid":"100639","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"The Lancet Regional Health - Europe","volume":"30"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85153078697"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","Central Denmark Region","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-d1ef277d-da01-4d7a-b5a8-03147158046b","ku-6a1c7f58-0a14-4592-b5ef-ebb1f6494065"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Efficacy and safety of oral roflumilast for moderate-to-severe psoriasis—a randomized controlled trial (PSORRO)","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-099.86-724871","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"The adhesion receptor ADGRA3 (GPR125) is a known spermatogonial stem cell marker, but its impact on male reproduction and fertility has not been examined. Using a mouse model lacking Adgra3 (Adgra3(-/-)), we show that 55% of the male mice are infertile from puberty despite having normal spermatogenesis and epididymal sperm count. Instead, male mice lacking Adgra3 exhibited decreased estrogen receptor alpha expression and transient dilation of the epididymis. Combined with an increased estradiol production, this indicates a post-pubertal hormonal imbalance and fluid retention. Dye injection revealed a blockage between the ejaculatory duct and the urethra, which is rare in mice suffering from infertility, thereby mimicking the etiologies of obstructive azoospermia found in human male infertility. To summarize, male reproductive tract development is dependent on ADGRA3 function that in concert with estrogen signaling may influence fluid handling during sperm maturation and storage.","author_count":13,"contributors":["Nybo, Maja Lind","Kvam, Jone M.","Nielsen, John E.","Frederiksen, Hanne","Spiess, Katja","Jensen, Kristian H.Reveles","Gadgaard, Sarina","Walser, Anna L. S.","Thomsen, Jesper S.","Cowin, Pamela","Juul, Anders","Jensen, Martin B.","Rosenkilde, Mette M."],"cuid":["S02-099.88-685970"],"filters":{"added":"2023-03","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Rosenkilde, Mette Marie"],"country":["United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Harvard University","New York University"],"keyword":["Epididymis","Epithelium","Estrogen","Expression","GPR125","Humans","Infertility","Male","Male infertility","Mouse","Penetrance","Rat","Semen","Seminal Vesicles","Wnt signaling","adhesion G protein coupled receptor","beta Catenin","ejaculatory duct","ejaculatory duct obstruction"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"OT":["Bainan Biotech"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"loss of i adgra000000000003 i causes obstructive azoospermia with high penetrance in male mice","src":["au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1096/fj.202200762RR","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-099.88-685970","identifier":[{"id":"000916845500001","type":"wos"},{"id":"85148509191","type":"scopus"},{"id":"36688818","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC10107928","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["au-7a2a2ff7-b405-4a2f-ad6b-0fccce8b47e6","ku-b0e79271-1ac8-4708-82c7-8008b7857855"],"keyword":["Azoospermia/complications","BETA-CATENIN","EFFERENT DUCTULES","EPIDIDYMIS","EPITHELIUM","EXPRESSION","Epididymis/metabolism","GPR125","Humans","Infertility, Male/metabolism","MALE-INFERTILITY","MOUSE","Male","Penetrance","RAT","Semen","UROGENITAL SINUS","Wnt signaling","adhesion G protein-coupled receptor","ejaculatory duct","ejaculatory duct obstruction","estrogen","infertility","seminal vesicles"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-432B744E69A76E92E19D0C6ADAF9BA27"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/335688777/Loss_of_Adgra3.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1096/fj.202200762RR","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/406479156/The_FASEB_Journal_-_2023_-_Nybo_-_Loss_of_Adgra3_causes_obstructive_azoospermia_with_high_penetrance_in_male_mice.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Univ