ctive, clinical, observational study","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-264579","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"We report the numerical and experimental study of probe pulse deformation in a forward-pumped distributed Raman amplifier on a 40-km standard single mode fiber. Distributed Raman amplification can improve the range of OTDR-based sensing systems, but it could result in pulse deformation. A smaller Raman gain coefficient can be used to mitigate pulse deformation. The sensing performance can still be maintained by compensating for the decrease in the Raman gain coefficient by increasing the pump power. The tunability of the Raman gain coefficient and pump power levels are predicted while keeping the probe power below the modulation instability limit.","author_count":11,"contributors":["Wang, Zepeng","Vandborg, Mads Holmark","Joy, Tomin","Mathew, Neethu Mariam","Grüner-Nielsen, Lars","Rishøj, Lars Søgaard","Christensen, Jesper","Jostmeier, Thorben","Marx, Benjamin","Hill, Wieland","Rottwitt, Karsten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-343152"],"filters":{"added":"2023-05","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"country":["United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Luna Innovations Incorporated"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-U"],"level3":{"GTS":["DI-GTS-ALL","DI-GTS-DFM"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-GTS-DFM","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"mitigating probe pulse deformation in raman amplification in otdr fiber sensing systems","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1364/OE.482292","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-343152","identifier":[{"id":"85150728371","type":"scopus"},{"id":"37155780","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["dtu-8132d05f-a7e6-4459-bee9-8d754fe1a6f1"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-325BD3500