{"abstract":"In this paper we present a method for synthesizing safe controllers for continuous-time sampled switched systems, where the analytical solution for the state trajectories is available. The method creates integer-valued lower and upper bounds on the evolution of the system, so that the tool UPPAAL TIGA can be used to synthesize a guaranteed safe controller for the continuous system. We compare our method to the Euler method, which our method is based upon, using two case studies covering cruise control and management of storm water detention ponds. The cruise control example shows that the proposed method can obtain tighter bounds, allowing the controller to be less conservative. The industrial case study on storm water detention ponds shows that we can obtain reasonable bounds in situations where the Euler method fails to obtain them.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Goorden, Martijn","Larsen, Kim Guldstrand","Nielsen, Jesper Ellerbæk","Nielsen, Thomas Dyhre","Qian, Weizhu","Rasmussen, Michael R.","Zhao, Guohan"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-693064"],"event":{"end":"2023-08-18","place":"Bridgetown, bb","start":"2023-08-16","title":"2023 Conference on Control Technology and Applications","year":"2023"},"filters":{"added":"2023-11","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Goorden, Martijn"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"guaranteed safe controller synthesis for switched systems using analytical solutions","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/550208619/2023CCTA.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-693064","identifier":[{"id":"85173855509","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-d728b269-93bf-402a-9aca-87e4c8ba18c7"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-41E50133CAE2F852D4E3006D3866B654"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/550208619/2023CCTA.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science, Distributed, Embedded and Intelligent Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Martijn","key":"goordenmartijnpau","last":"Goorden","locid":"d71e2c9c-86de-43d9-b98b-2d204bd7a9fa","name":"Goorden, Martijn","orcid":"0000-0002-0641-7240","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Kim Guldstrand","key":"larsenkimguldstrandpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"27dbc400-17ea-4672-9343-63093ad486c9","name":"Larsen, Kim Guldstrand","orcid":"0000-0002-5953-3384","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Ellerbæk","key":"nielsenjesperellerbækpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"f850e281-27d9-4783-84c8-3048e7819444","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Ellerbæk","orcid":"0000-0003-4596-0948","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Thomas Dyhre","key":"nielsenthomasdyhrepau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"d815ae40-14ed-44a2-a215-172e83022c8e","name":"Nielsen, Thomas Dyhre","orcid":"0000-0002-4823-6341","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Weizhu","key":"qianweizhupau","last":"Qian","locid":"2b661ea2-ff2f-48e2-8a45-8b42d6b744aa","name":"Qian, Weizhu","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Michael R.","key":"rasmussenmichaelrpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"97f39e8d-f121-4ce8-9157-10ce8955b1d8","name":"Rasmussen, Michael R.","orcid":"0000-0001-5791-3976","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Guohan","key":"zhaoguohanpau","last":"Zhao","locid":"d57232a0-95f5-4f5e-a7b6-5f856aeee18e","name":"Zhao, Guohan","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/ccta54093.2023.10252857","eisbn":["9798350335446"],"isbn":["9798350335453"],"issn":["27680762"],"pages":"784-790","publisher":"IEEE (Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers)","series":"IEEE Conference on Control Technology and Applications (CCTA) - Proceedings","status":"p","title":"2023 IEEE Conference on Control Technology and Applications, CCTA 2023"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85173855509"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-d728b269-93bf-402a-9aca-87e4c8ba18c7"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Guaranteed safe controller synthesis for switched systems using analytical solutions","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-693064","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"We present simple and practical protocols for generating randomness as used by asynchronous total-order broadcast. The protocols are secure in a proof-of-stake setting with dynamically changing stake. They can be plugged into existing protocols for asynchronous total-order broadcast and will turn these into asynchronous total-order broadcast with dynamic stake. Our contribution relies on two important techniques. The paper “Random Oracles in Constantinople: Practical Asynchronous Byzantine Agreement using Cryptography” [Cachin, Kursawe, and Shoup, PODC 2000] has influenced the design of practical total-order broadcast through its use of threshold cryptography. However, it needs a setup protocol to be efficient. In a proof-of-stake setting with dynamic stake this setup would have to be continually recomputed, making the protocol impractical. The work “Asynchronous Byzantine Agreement with Subquadratic Communication” [Blum, Katz, Liu-Zhang, and Loss, TCC 2020] showed how to use an initial setup for broadcast to asymptotically efficiently generate sub-sequent setups. The protocol, however, resorted to fully homomorphic encryption and was therefore not practically efficient. We adopt their approach to the proof-of-stake setting with dynamic stake, apply it to the Constantinople paper, and remove the need for fully homomorphic encryption. This results in simple and practical proof-of-stake protocols.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Alpos, Orestis","Cachin, Christian","Kamp, Simon Holmgaard","Nielsen, Jesper Buus"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-699641"],"event":{"end":"2023-10-25","place":"Princeton, us","start":"2023-10-23","title":"5th Conference on Advances in Financial Technologies, AFT 2023","year":"2023"},"filters":{"added":"2023-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"country":["Switzerland"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Bern"],"keyword":["Proof of Stake"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"practical large scale proof of stake asynchronous total order broadcast","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85175417135","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-699641","identifier":[{"id":"85175417135","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-67af8ac7-c092-45e9-bcb2-f349d003a919"],"keyword":["Atomic Broadcast","Proof of Stake","Random Beacon","Total-Order Broadcast"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-C537073ECA0AD1493EE4318E56DF83AC"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"ch","key":"university of bern","loc":["Switzerland","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Bern","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Department of Computer Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Orestis","key":"alpospau","last":"Alpos","name":"Alpos, Orestis","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Christian","key":"cachinpau","last":"Cachin","name":"Cachin, Christian","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Simon Holmgaard","key":"kamppau","last":"Kamp","locid":"605890de-dee5-4779-bc6c-6b76966639ba","name":"Kamp, Simon Holmgaard","orcid":"0000-0003-3356-1827","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Buus","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"f428c4b3-80b3-403a-ada6-9ecb0fad97b2","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Buus","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Joseph","key":"bonneaupedh","last":"Bonneau","name":"Bonneau, Joseph","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"S. Matthew","key":"weinbergpedh","last":"Weinberg","name":"Weinberg, S. Matthew","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.4230/lipics.aft.2023.31","eisbn":["9783959773034"],"issn":["18688969"],"publisher":"Dagstuhl Publishing","series":"Leibniz International Proceedings in Informatics, LIPIcs","status":"p","title":"5th Conference on Advances in Financial Technologies, AFT 2023"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85175417135"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-67af8ac7-c092-45e9-bcb2-f349d003a919"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Practical Large-Scale Proof-Of-Stake Asynchronous Total-Order Broadcast","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-699641","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"We review parametric decay instabilities (PDIs) expected in connection with electron cyclotron resonance heating (ECRH) of magnetically confined fusion plasmas, with a specific focus on conditions relevant for the ITER tokamak. PDIs involving upper hybrid (UH) waves are likely to occur in O-mode ECRH scenarios at ITER if electron density profiles allowing trapping of UH waves near the ECRH frequency are present. Such PDIs may occur near the plasma center in ITER full-field scenarios heated by 170 GHz O-mode ECRH and on the high-field side of half-field ITER plasmas heated by 110 GHz or 104 GHz O-mode ECRH. Additionally, 110 GHz O-mode ECRH of half-field ITER scenarios may have low ECRH absorption, due to the electron cyclotron resonance being located on the high-field side of the main plasma. This potentially allows PDIs driven by a significant amount of ECRH radiation reaching the UH resonance in X-mode to occur, as X-mode radiation can be generated by reflection of unabsorbed O-mode radiation from the high-field side wall. The occurrence of PDIs during ECRH may damage microwave diagnostics, such as the electron cyclotron emission and low-field side reflectometer systems at ITER, as well as complicate the calculation of heating and current drive characteristics. However, if PDIs are induced in a controlled manner, they may provide novel diagnostic tools and allow the generation of a moderate fast ion population in plasmas heated only by ECRH.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Hansen, S. K.","Nielsen, Stefan Kragh","Stober, J.","Rasmussen, Jesper","Salewski, Mirko","Willensdorfer, M.","Hoelzl, M.","Stejner Pedersen, Morten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-701222"],"event":{"end":"2022-06-24","place":"Saint-Paul-lez-Durance, fr","start":"2022-06-20","title":"21st Joint Workshop on Electron Cyclotron Emission and Electron Cyclotron Resonance Heating","year":"2022"},"filters":{"added":"2023-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Europe, EU","OECD"],"corpau":["the ASDEX Upgrade Team"],"corresponding_author":["Hansen, S. K."],"country":["Germany","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Massachusetts Institute of Technology","Max Planck Institute for Plasma Physics"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"parametric decay instabilities during electron cyclotron resonance heating of fusion plasmas problems and possibilities","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1051/epjconf/202327701002","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-701222","identifier":[{"id":"001006603800002","type":"wos"}],"ids":["dtu-fbf62d3e-77a3-4098-85fa-bf47f52af966"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-9D13E464E58776794D77EC7CB1BAFCA5"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1051/epjconf/202327701002","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/339911672/epjconf_ec212023_01002.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"us","key":"massachusetts institute of technology","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Massachusetts Institute of Technology","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Physics","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Physics, Pla