rd, but I'd rather wait : Active boarding delay choice behaviour analysis using smart card data in metro systems","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-700919","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
