{"abstract":"Hyperspectral imaging is central for remote sensing, and much research has been done on analysis methods for land surveillance using space- and air-borne imaging systems. Proximal hyperspectral imaging is also widely used in plant and agriculture science. It allows the remote capturing of leaf reflectance information in order to determine and classify plant health and disease. With the high information density in hyperspectral images, it becomes increasingly important to apply sophisticated feature extraction in order to reduce image dimensionality while retaining useful information. Autoencoders are one of the primary methods for deep learning-based feature extraction in hyperspectral images. We investigate different setups of autoencoders to encode the spatial and spectral dimensions in different orders and ways. To our surprise, the best turns out to be a 3D CNN, where the spectral dimension is treated in the same way as the spatial dimensions.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Laprade, William Michael","Westergaard, Jesper Cairo","Nielsen, Jon","Nielsen, Mads","Dahl, Anders Bjorholm"],"cuid":["S02-082.20-672952"],"event":{"end":"2023-04-21","place":"Lapland, fi","start":"2023-04-18","title":"23nd Scandinavian Conference on Image Analysis, SCIA 2023","year":"2023"},"filters":{"added":"2023-08","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"corresponding_author":["Laprade, William Michael"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"an analysis of spatial spectral dependence in hyperspectral autoencoders","src":["dtu","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://rdcu.be/d72bC","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-082.20-672952","identifier":[{"id":"85161414740","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-834a554d-8033-4164-bf49-ee1003328f98","ku-824a155a-bee7-4e86-89ae-7b90a10e5def"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-D4EFA90F9C0BED587F496BA625405B10"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://rdcu.be/d72bC","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science, Visual Computing"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Plant and Environmental Sciences, Plant Facilities and Workshops"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"William Michael","key":"lapradewilliammichaelpau","last":"Laprade","locid":"cc8a91b0-b4a3-42c8-adab-4fefa2e5aac7","name":"Laprade, William Michael","orcid":"0000-0002-4342-1046","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Jesper Cairo","key":"westergaardjespercairopau","last":"Westergaard","locid":"0339bb64-0b52-471e-a25e-a4ac15680af3","name":"Westergaard, Jesper Cairo","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Jon","key":"nielsenjonpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"1d45561f-3e81-41e1-8310-03bdb7abbad0","name":"Nielsen, Jon","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Mads","key":"nielsenmadspau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"52f8d6fb-fd83-4d11-ad65-3e183ca401f2","name":"Nielsen, Mads","orcid":"0000-0003-1535-068X","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anders Bjorholm","key":"dahlandersbjorholmpau","last":"Dahl","locid":"c2bad3c8-b172-481b-bb99-d3c2bc4004ef","name":"Dahl, Anders Bjorholm","orcid":"0000-0002-0068-8170","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Rikke","key":"gaderikkepedh","last":"Gade","name":"Gade, Rikke","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Michael","key":"felsbergmichaelpedh","last":"Felsberg","name":"Felsberg, Michael","rank":7,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Joni-Kristian","key":"kämäräinenjonikristianpedh","last":"Kämäräinen","name":"Kämäräinen, Joni-Kristian","rank":8,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/978-3-031-31438-4_13","eisbn":["9783031314384"],"isbn":["9783031314377"],"issn":["03029743"],"pages":"191-202","publisher":"Springer","series":"Lecture Notes in Computer Science","status":"p","title":"Image Analysis - 23rd Scandinavian Conference, SCIA 2023, Proceedings"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85161414740"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-834a554d-8033-4164-bf49-ee1003328f98","ku-824a155a-bee7-4e86-89ae-7b90a10e5def"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"An Analysis of Spatial-Spectral Dependence in Hyperspectral Autoencoders","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-082.20-672952","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"Background: Air pollution is a well-recognized risk factor for cardiovascular disease. However, the mechanistic pathways underlying the association are not completely understood. Hence, further studies are required to shed light on potential mechanisms, through which air pollution may affect the development from subclinical to clinical cardiovascular disease. Objectives: To investigate associations between short-term exposure to air pollution and high-density lipoprotein (HDL), non-high density lipoprotein (non-HDL), systolic and diastolic blood pressure. Methods: The study was conducted among 32,851 Danes from the Diet, Cancer and Health – Next Generations cohort, who had a blood sample taken and blood pressure measured. We measured HDL and non-HDL in the blood samples. We modelled exposure to fine particulate matter (PM 2.5), ultrafine particles (UFP), elemental carbon (EC) and nitrogen dioxide (NO 2) in time-windows from 24 h up to 90 days before blood sampling. Pollutants were modelled as total air pollution from all sources, and apportioned into contributions from non-traffic and traffic sources. We analyzed data using linear and logistic regression, with adjustment for socio-economic and lifestyle factors. Results: Air pollution exposure over 24 h to 30 days was generally adversely associated with lipid profile and blood pressure, e.g. for 30-day UFP-exposure, adjusted β-estimates were: −0.025 (−0.043; −0.006) for HDL, 0.086 (0.042; 0.130) for non-HDL, 2.45 (1.70; 3.11) for systolic and 1.56 (1.07; 20.4) for diastolic blood pressure, per 10,000 particles/cm 3. The strongest associations were found for the non-traffic components of air pollution, and among those who were overweight/obese. Discussion: In this large study of air pollution and lipid levels and blood pressure, we found that 24-h to 30-day PM 2.5, UFP, EC and NO 2 concentrations were generally adversely associated with lipid profile and blood pressure, two important cardiovascular risk factors. The study suggests potential pathways, through which air pollution could affect the development of cardiovascular disease.","author_count":14,"contributors":["Roswall, Nina","Poulsen, Aslak Harbo","Arthur Hvidtfeldt, Ulla","Hendriksen, Peter Fjeldstad","Boll, Katja","Halkjær, Jytte","Ketzel, Matthias","Brandt, Jørgen","Frohn, Lise Marie","Christensen, Jesper Heile","Im, Ulas","Sørensen, Mette","Raaschou-Nielsen, Ole"],"cuid":["S02-098.97-018762"],"filters":{"added":"2023-03","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Roswall, Nina"],"country":["United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Surrey"],"keyword":["Blood Pressure","Elemental carbon","Lipid profile","Nitrogen dioxide","PM2 5","Ultra fine particles"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-NP","DI-U"],"level3":{"NP":["DI-NP-ALL","DI-NP-CAN"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-NP-CAN","DI-U-AU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"exposure to ambient air pollution and lipid levels and blood pressure in an adult danish cohort","src":["au","ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85145857351","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-098.97-018762","identifier":[{"id":"36584852","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85145857351","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-536b4675-1c85-422b-b9be-c6bd262456b3","ruc-d0c026fb-0ced-4748-b5e6-3f4acaf77917"],"keyword":["Blood pressure","Elemental carbon","Lipid profile","Nitrogen dioxide","PM2.5","Ultra-fine particles"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-711E26B4DA56AC2E9E2D124D76C7232A"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"dcrc danish cancer society research center","l2":"DI-NP","l2n":"Non-Profit Organisations","l3":"DI-NP-CAN","l3nn":"DCRC Danish Cancer Society Research Center","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DCRC Danish Cancer Society Research Center","namevar":["Danish Cancer Society"],"nora_code":"DI-NP-CAN","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Environmental Science, Department of Environmental Science - Atmospheric Emissions & Modelling"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"gb","key":"university of surrey","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Surrey","used":1},{"affno":"4","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of Science and Environment"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Nina","key":"roswallpau","last":"Roswall","name":"Roswall, Nina","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Aslak Harbo","key":"poulsenpau","last":"Poulsen","name":"Poulsen, Aslak Harbo","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ulla","key":"arthurhvidtfeldtpau","last":"Arthur Hvidtfeldt","name":"Arthur Hvidtfeldt, Ulla","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Ulla Arthur","key":"hvidtfeldtpau","last":"Hvidtfeldt","name":"Hvidtfeldt, Ulla Arthur","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Peter Fjeldstad","key":"hendriksenpau","last":"Hendriksen","name":"Hendriksen, Peter Fjeldstad","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Katja","key":"bollpau","last":"B