86","name":"Søgaard, Ole Schmeltz","name_org":"Søgaard, Ole S.","orcid":"0000-0001-9107-2023","rank":33,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["37696935"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1038/s41591-023-02547-6","issn":["10788956","1546170X"],"issn_org":["10788956"],"issue":"10","journal":"Nature Medicine","pages":"2547-2558","publisher":"Nature Research","status":"p","title":"Nature Medicine","volume":"29"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85170556818"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","Central Denmark Region","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","North Denmark Region","Region of Southern Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-6ad91524-b672-49bf-9014-dbbc60094ffe","au-36275b18-109b-4217-a6fc-b06a25bf11c8","ku-9b764ba8-c4b8-4bab-8b84-751fea0ffc89","sdu-60122784-2e20-4387-bc8e-643b608821f5"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","AU Aarhus University","KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Impact of a TLR9 agonist and broadly neutralizing antibodies on HIV-1 persistence : the randomized phase 2a TITAN trial","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S04-100.00-715684","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"Objective: To study time-related changes in the prevalence and patient characteristics of acromegaly, as well as to assess the impact of changes in treatment on disease control. Methods: A total of 107 patients with acromegaly were identified by healthcare registries and subsequently validated by patient chart review over a three-decade period (1992–2021). A systematic literature review focusing on the incidence and prevalence of acromegaly was performed identifying 31 studies. Results: The prevalence of acromegaly significantly increased throughout the study period (R 2 = 0.94, p <.001) and was 122 cases/10 6 persons in 2021 whereas the annual incidence remained constant at 4.6 cases/10 6 persons. The age at the first sign of acromegaly and the age at diagnosis significantly increased during the study period, whereas growth hormone and insulin-like growth factor I decreased. Incidentalomas constituted 32% of all cases diagnosed with acromegaly in the last decade. Primary surgery was used in 93% of all cases, and repeated surgery decreased from 24% to 10% during the three decades. The use of first-generation somatostatin analogues (21%–48%) and second-line medical treatment (4%–20%) increased with a concomitant improvement of biochemical disease control (58%–91%). Conclusion: The prevalence of acromegaly is higher than previously reported and the clinical presentation has shifted towards a milder phenotype. Modern treatment of acromegaly enables individualized treatment and disease control in the majority of patients.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Aagaard, Charlotte","Skjærvedal Christophersen, Amanda","Finnerup, Susanne","Rosendal, Christian Alexander Helleshøj","Gulisano, Helga Angela","Ettrup, Kåre Schmidt","Vestergaard, Peter","Karmisholt, Jesper Scott","Nielsen, Eigil Husted","Dal, Jakob"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-081446"],"filters":{"added":"2022-11","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Dal, Jakob"],"keyword":["Acromegaly","Growth hormone","Pituitary adenoma"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the prevalence of acromegaly is higher than previously reported changes over a three decade period","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1111/cen.14828","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-081446","identifier":[{"id":"85139382670","type":"scopus"},{"id":"36163677","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["aau-6bf8f0b5-823d-4f3c-a7ad-b13211f75505"],"keyword":["acromegaly","growth hormone","pituitary adenoma","pituitary endocrinology"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-A97039535A68733CCA5EE19673868AFC"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1111/cen.14828","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/505817744/Aagaard_et_al._2022_._The_prevalence_of_acromegaly_is_higher_than_previously_reported_Changes_over_a_three_decade_period.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2022","yearSub":"2022"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Klinik Medicin og Akut","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, The Department of Endocrinology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Charlotte","key":"aagaardpau","last":"Aagaard","locid":"3517e19a-9be7-40cd-8e9e-f67846c01ebc","name":"Aagaard, Charlotte","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Amanda S,","key":"christophersenpau","last":"Christophersen","locid":"3e0bdb61-a496-474b-bce5-1497f4bfcfdb","name":"Skjærvedal Christophersen, Amanda","name_org":"Christophersen, Amanda S,","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Susanne","key":"finneruppau","last":"Finnerup","locid":"b273a243-cf90-4dad-adad-e12fcb29893a","name":"Finnerup, Susanne","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Christian","key":"rosendalpau","last":"Rosendal","locid":"eef249b8-63dd-4949-b661-485ae602bc4f","name":"Rosendal, Christian Alexander Helleshøj","name_org":"Rosendal, Christian","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Helga A.","key":"gulisanopau","last":"Gulisano","locid":"ae8bea20-91de-46dd-a5cf-a3f0e1579aec","name":"Gulisano, Helga Angela","name_org":"Gulisano, Helga A.","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Kåre S.","key":"ettruppau","last":"Ettrup","locid":"2bdb42e7-d104-4bd2-9d0d-718e033a883d","name":"Ettrup, Kåre Schmidt","name_org":"Ettrup, Kåre S.","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Peter","key":"vestergaardpau","last":"Vestergaard","locid":"ad223cc8-3f85-4cdf-9da5-5ec44f6a1714","name":"Vestergaard, Peter","orcid":"0000-0002-9046-2967","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper","key":"karmisholtpau","last":"Karmisholt","locid":"410922f0-294c-4d56-b758-b30fffef3a49","name":"Karmisholt, Jesper Scott","name_org":"Karmisholt, Jesper","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Eigil Husted","key":"niel