journal":"Cells","paperid":"2005","publisher":"Multidisciplinary Digital Publishing Institute (MDPI)","status":"p","title":"Cells","volume":"11"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85132421701"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Miscellaneous","All Private Research","All Universities","All University Colleges","Central Denmark Region","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","Hospitals","Miscellaneous","Other Companies","Other Research","Private Research","Region Zealand","Region of Southern Denmark","UCL University College","Universities","University Colleges","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark","VIA University College","allarity therapeutics europe (biz)"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-43da996e-31c8-474b-8a27-516dbd7b49b0","ku-13a5aece-4a24-4e9a-9565-a0682b9e1086","sdu-a3ab033d-b495-4a9d-9d66-101c68f77322","ucl-7c9e8d65-039f-49a4-9a35-60dd51339f37","via-27e77f56-d226-4f1e-90f6-90f6d6b275b0"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark","UCL University College","VIA University College"],"title":"A Signature of Exaggerated Adipose Tissue Dysfunction in Type 2 Diabetes Is Linked to Low Plasma Adiponectin and Increased Transcriptional Activation of Proteasomal Degradation in Muscle","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S05-098.34-017599","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"In this paper, we investigate the use of shape-change for interaction with sound zones. A core challenge to designing interaction with sound zone systems is to support users' understanding of the unique spatial properties of sound zones. Shape-changing interfaces present new opportunities for addressing this. We present a structured investigation into this. We leveraged the knowledge of 12 sound experts to define a set of basic shapes and movements. Then, we constructed a prototype and conducted an elicitation study with 17 novice users, investigating the experience of these shapes and movements. Our findings show that physical visualizations of sound zones can be useful in supporting users' experience of sound zones. We present a framework of 4 basic pattern categories that prompt different sound zone experiences and outline further research directions for shape-change in supporting sound zone interaction.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Johansen, Stine Schmieg","Merritt, Timothy","Jacobsen, Rune Møberg","Nielsen, Peter Axel","Kjeldskov, Jesper"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-088567"],"event":{"end":"2022-05-05","place":"New Orleans, us","start":"2022-04-29","title":"CHI Conference on Human Factors in Computing","year":"2022"},"filters":{"added":"2022-04","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Interaction design","Shape changing interfaces","Sound zones","Soundscape"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"investigating potentials of shape changing displays for sound zones","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85130581446&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-088567","identifier":[{"id":"85130581446","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-8469a446-3078-484d-843c-f1be79a3cfb4"],"keyword":["Interaction design","Shape-changing interfaces","Sound zones","soundscape"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-B3CDBF9D440135EE9710EE3813F34A2E"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology, Human Machine Interaction","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science, Human-Centered Computing"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Stine Schmieg","key":"johansenpau","last":"Johansen","locid":"04546f61-a1e4-4f11-90db-a305c42e53b4","name":"Johansen, Stine Schmieg","orcid":"0000-0002-8451-5444","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Timothy Robert","key":"merrittpau","last":"Merritt","locid":"d1475687-8432-4254-9818-206c8e01e116","name":"Merritt, Timothy","name_org":"Merritt, Timothy Robert","orcid":"0000-0002-7851-7339","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Rune Møberg","key":"jacobsenpau","last":"Jacobsen","locid":"5fe14bb0-bc5c-4b8b-bb8a-71b675619992","name":"Jacobsen, Rune Møberg","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Peter Axel","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"d5302c36-a512-42d6-8ab5-32d3f7da115e","name":"Nielsen, Peter Axel","orcid":"0000-0002-0282-7445","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1"