{"abstract":"Using a stochastic model, we simulate the spontaneously initiated Brillouin scattering in a single-mode optical fiber. In comparing our model with measurements, we find that the model successfully reproduces both the characteristics of the stochastic time traces and the resulting spectra.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Vandborg, Mads Holmark","Mathew, Neethu Mariam","Bjerge Christensen, Jesper","Rishøj, Lars Søgaard","Grüner-Nielsen, Lars","Rottwitt, Karsten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-352741"],"event":{"end":"2022-09-22","place":"Basel, ch","start":"2022-09-18","title":"2022 European Conference on Optical Communication","year":"2022"},"filters":{"added":"2023-02","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Vandborg, Mads Holmark"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-U"],"level3":{"GTS":["DI-GTS-ALL","DI-GTS-DFM"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-GTS-DFM","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"simulations and measurements of spontaneously initiated brillouin scattering in optical fibers","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-352741","ids":["dtu-a16bcf6c-4653-4ccf-8fd5-4855a3a74cc8"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-05D06922F55F4CB72DF5A79E020FB277"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Electrical and Photonics Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Electrical and Photonics Engineering, Fiber Optics, Devices and Non-linear Effects"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"dfm danish national metrology institute","l2":"DI-GTS","l2n":"GTS Institutes","l3":"DI-GTS-DFM","l3nn":"DFM Danish National Metrology Institute","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DFM Danish National Metrology Institute","namevar":["DFM - Dansk Fundamental Metrologi A/S"],"nora_code":"DI-GTS-DFM","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Mads","key":"holmarkvandborgpau","last":"Holmark Vandborg","locid":"46883988-1b9e-487e-9c18-3604cf49e349","name":"Vandborg, Mads Holmark","name_org":"Holmark Vandborg, Mads","orcid":"0000-0003-2513-2424","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Neethu Mariam","key":"mathewpau","last":"Mathew","locid":"a54eb883-5d36-4ea3-924e-3f8b6fe76deb","name":"Mathew, Neethu Mariam","orcid":"0000-0002-1180-5811","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesper","key":"bjergechristensenpau","last":"Bjerge Christensen","name":"Bjerge Christensen, Jesper","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lars Sogaard","key":"rishojpau","last":"Rishoj","locid":"d4d25864-403d-4f3c-99b3-0b3193883b1f","name":"Rishøj, Lars Søgaard","name_org":"Rishoj, Lars Sogaard","orcid":"0000-0003-0810-3859","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lars","key":"grunernielsenpau","last":"Gruner-Nielsen","locid":"d446bb16-12b9-4482-8c11-d4892cdb57e5","name":"Grüner-Nielsen, Lars","name_org":"Gruner-Nielsen, Lars","orcid":"0000-0001-7974-8385","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Karsten","key":"rottwittpau","last":"Rottwitt","locid":"08d1b850-4e34-46e1-9f77-ee3f84163a4c","name":"Rottwitt, Karsten","orcid":"0000-0001-6738-5847","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"eisbn":["9781957171159"],"isbn":["9781665475570"],"publisher":"Optica Publishing Group","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of the European Conference on Optical Communication (ECOC) 2022"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85146399667"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All GTS Institutes","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-GTS-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","GTS Institutes","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-a16bcf6c-4653-4ccf-8fd5-4855a3a74cc8"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Simulations and Measurements of Spontaneously Initiated Brillouin Scattering in Optical Fibers","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-352741","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"We present a unified modeling framework for Time-Based Maintenance (TBM) and ConditionBased Maintenance (CBM) for optimization of replacements in multi-component systems. The considered system has a K-out-of-N reliability structure, and components deteriorate according to a multivariate gamma process with L´evy copula dependence. The TBM and CBM models are formulated as Markov Decision Processes (MDPs), and optimal policies are found using dynamic programming. Solving the CBM model requires that the continuous deterioration process is discretized. We therefore investigate the discretization level required for obtaining a near-optimal policy. Our results indicate that a coarser discretization level than previously suggested in the literature is adequate, indicating that dynamic programming is a feasible approach for optimization in multi-component systems. We further demonstrate this through empirical results for the size limit of the MDP models when solved with an optimized implementation of modified policy iteration. The TBM model can generally be solved with more components than the CBM model, since the former has a sparser state transition structure. In the special case of independent component deterioration, transition probabilities can be calculated efficiently at runtime. This reduces the memory requirements substantially. For this case, we also achieved a tenfold speedup when using ten processors in a parallel implementation of algorithm. Altogether, our results show that the computational requirements for systems with independent component deterioration increase at a slower rate than for systems with stochastic dependence.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Andersen, Jesper Fink","Andersen, Anders Reenberg","Kulahci, Murat","Nielsen, Bo Friis"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-356543"],"filters":{"added":"2022-03","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Andersen, Jesper Fink"],"keyword":["Dynamic programming","Maintenance","Markov decision process","Multi component system","Numerical study"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a numerical study of markov decision process algorithms for multi component replacement problems","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/254953424/Multi_Component_MDP_paper_1st_revision.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-356543","identifier":[{"id":"85111547260","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-ade73d04-a893-482c-bd52-fa1eee4c47bc"],"keyword":["Dynamic Programming","Maintenance","Markov decision process","Multi-component system","Numerical study"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-AE22F2512CBD7CDCD6530922C25BB0A8"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/254953424/Multi_Component_MDP_paper_1st_revision.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2022","yearSub":"2022"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science, Statistics and Data Analysis"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesper Fink","key":"andersenjesperfinkpau","last":"Andersen","locid":"b866063c-6bb9-4a46-8b75-8f0542