{"abstract":"In recent years, digital transformation has emerged as a strategic way to improve communication within organizations and enhance collaboration with key external stakeholders, such as customers, suppliers, distributors, and government representatives (Meroño‐Cerdan et al., 2007). The adoption of digital business is perceived as a way to achieve sustainable competitive advantage in an increasingly globalized economy (Zhu et al., 2020). In this paper, our focus is on how digitalization transforms the operations of small- and medium-sized firms in its broadest sense.","author_count":15,"contributors":["Servais, Per","Rasmussen, Erik Stavnsager"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-607195"],"event":{"end":"2022-05-20","place":"Kolding, dk","start":"2022-05-18","title":"21st Nordic Conference on Small Business Research","year":"2022"},"filters":{"added":"2023-05","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Servais, Per"],"country":["Sweden"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Linnaeus University"],"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"digital transformation of the sme","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.ncsbconference.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/21st-Nordic-Conference-on-Small-Business-Research-Conference-Proceedings.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-607195","ids":["sdu-76ab919e-a58a-456e-bff8-e9256029ca88"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-ABCCFEE46A4AF5F1E63DF0296078FAA0"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.ncsbconference.org/.","version":"Authors Final Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://ww