Eine randomisierte kontrollierte Studie, ID# 48804. [Long term weight loss in a primary care-anchored human eHealth lifestyle coaching program in Denmark: A randomized controlled trial]","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-625107","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"Research funders and policymakers increasingly focus on societal benefits of their investments in research. Research institutions thus face increasing pressure to demonstrate their societal impact to prove their legitimacy and worth. To this end, research institutions need reliable, quantitative methods to measure societal impact. This article describes the development and test of an instrument to quantitatively measure societal impact of applied research at research institution and program levels. It demonstrates the successful validation of the instrument in the multi-disciplinary field of occupational health and safety. The instrument, the Societal Impact Instrument: Occupational Health and Safety Research (SII:OHSR), produces an aggregate measure of societal impact for the research institution as a whole and subscales for each research program. The SII:OHSR instrument is built on a process model of knowledge translation and exchange. It has been developed in the context of multi-disciplinary occupational health and safety research. The instrument is constructed as a generalized and context-independent tool that can be relocated to other research domains and languages. To the best of our knowledge, it is the first singular instrument that quantitatively measures societal impact. It is therefore highly pertinent for the research evaluation field.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Sørensen, Ole Henning","Bjørner, Jakob Bue","Holtermann, Andreas","Dyreborg, J","Sørli, Jorid Birkelund","Kristiansen, Jesper","Nielsen, Steffen Bohni"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-779926"],"filters":{"added":"2025-01","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Forskning til praksis","Metoder"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-WORK"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-WORK"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"measuring societal impact of research developing and validating an impact instrument for occupational health and safety","src":["nfa"],"src-code":["DI-GV-WORK"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1093/reseval/rvab036","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-779926","identifier":[{"id":"85144111511","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["nfa-0c37c36a-f66f-4009-8efb-fc71b8188622"],"keyword":["Forskning til praksis","Metoder"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-610217A435A8519BF98BD58973B54F2F"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1093/reseval/rvab036","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"nfa national research centre for the working environment","l2":"DI-GV","l2n":"Governmental Institutions","l3":"DI-GV-WORK","l3nn":"NFA National Research Centre for the Working Environment","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"NFA National Research Centre for the Working Environment","namevar":["The National Research Centre for the Working Environment","The National Research Centre for the Working Environment, Directors, Musculoskeletal Disorders and Physical Workload"],"nora_code":"DI-GV-WORK","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ole Henning","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","locid":"74946982-c6a7-4888-9b7d-a6abc9241a21","name":"Sørensen, Ole Henning","orcid":"0000-0002-1782-1660","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jakob","key":"bjørnerpau","last":"Bjørner","locid":"97ba3fb5-9a2a-40c7-ac5c-0947fffbcd35","name":"Bjørner, Jakob Bue","name_org":"Bjørner, Jakob","orcid":"0000-0001-7033-8224","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Andreas","key":"holtermannpau","last":"Holtermann","locid":"fd559bce-74b0-4973-a2d9-dd622af8b0c8","name":"Holtermann, Andreas","orcid":"0000-0003-4825-5697","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Johnny","key":"dyreborgpau","last":"Dyreborg","locid":"d5a5dec6-836b-49e6-9044-bd0786cea744","name":"Dyreborg, J","name_org":"Dyreborg, Johnny","orcid":"0000-0002-5452-5596","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jorid Birkelund","key":"sørlipau","last":"Sørli","locid":"0c82c65e-a08d-46fc-baf7-721806799318","name":"Sørli, Jorid Birkelund","orcid":"0000-0001-5453-433X","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesper","key":"kristiansenpau","last":"Kristiansen","locid":"2b90a97c-15d6-468c-a8d6-1362e731d2bc","name":"Kristiansen, Jesper","orcid":"0000-0002-1637-8900","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Steffen Bohni","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"bd795654-eb22-482b-bbd6-15a5e70023fc","name":"Nielsen, Steffen Bohni","orcid":"0000-0003-1077-5398","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1093/reseval/rvab036","issn":["09582029","14715449"],"issn_org":["09582029"],"issue":"1","journal":"Research Evaluation","pages":"118-131","publisher":"Oxford University Press","status":"p","title":"Research Evaluation","volume":"31"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85144111511"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Governmental Institutions","DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-GV-ALL","Governmental Institutions"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["nfa-0c37c36a-f66f-4009-8efb-fc71b8188622"],"src":["NFA National Research Centre for the Working Environment"],"title":"Measuring societal impact of research—Developing and validating an impact instrument for occupational health and safety","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-779926","year":"2022","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"Denne rapport beskriver status for viden om ni potentielle marine virkemidler og tiltag, der kan anvendes til at forbedre miljø- og naturforholdene i Lillebælt. De ni potentielle virkemidler inkluderer: Etablering af ålegræs, etablering af stenrev, etablering af biogene rev, anvendelse af biohuts, dyrkning af muslinger og tang i vandsøjlen, opfiskning af krabber og søstjerner, områder beskyttet mod trawlfiskeri (MPAs) og anvendelse af naturbaserede løsninger til klima-sikring af kysterne. Virkemiddelbeskrivelserne har fokus på de forventede økosystemtjenester relateret til biodiversitet, natur og miljø, men andre økosystemtjenester associeret med virkemidlerne beskrives også. Anvendeligheden og effekterne af de forskellige virkemidler og tiltag til miljø- og naturgenopretning afhænger i høj grad af lokale fysiske og miljømæssige forhold, og derfor vil der være stor forskel på, hvor virkemidlerne kan placeres. Såfremt der findes viden om kriterierne for anvendelse, så indgår det i virkemiddelbeskrivelsen. Vidensgrundlaget for de beskrevne virkemidler er meget varierende og status for eksisterende vidensgrundlag er, ligesom områder hvor der mangler viden, inkluderet i beskrivelserne.","author_count":14,"contributors":["Timmermann, Karen","Bruhn, Annette","Taylor, Daniel","Petersen, Jens Kjerulf","Christensen, Jesper","Svendsen, Jon Christian","Dahl, Karsten","Flindt, Mogens","Svane, Niels","Canal-Vergés, Paula","Nielsen, Pernille","Steinfurth, Rune","Banke, Timi","Lange, Troels"],"cuid":["S02-089.29-025868"],"filters":{"added":"2022-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"virkemidler og tiltag til forbedring af miljø og naturforholdene i lillebælt","src":["au","dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/283567543/405_2022_Virkemidler_og_tiltag_til_forbedring_af_miljoe_og_naturforholdene_i_Lillebaelt.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-089.29-025868","ids":["au-b53401d3-ef73-4fa6-99d7-5d93502287a6","dtu-17facf7b-0217-4f02-bdb3-b9962d072984"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-2-1B268CA1C9E7C76FEF62F2F11A2403CD"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/283567543/405_2022_Virkemidler_og_tiltag_til_forbedring_af_miljoe_og_naturforholdene_i_Lillebaelt.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://dce.au.dk/fileadmin/dce.au.dk/Udgivelser/Eksterne_udgivelser/405-2022_Virkemidler-og-tiltag-til-forbedring-af-miljoe-og-naturforholdene-i-Lillebaelt.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, National Institute of Aquatic Resources","Technical University of Denmark, National Institute of Aquatic Resources, Section for Coastal Ecology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Ecoscience, Department of Ecoscience - Marine Ecology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"