{"abstract":"This letter presents an analysis of channel characteristics for an outdoor scenario at the frequency band of 28-30 GHz. A geometry-based clustering algorithm is proposed to group the measured multipath components (MPCs) from the interaction points on the surrounding walls or objects according to ray-tracing three-dimensional (3-D) simulations, giving results that are more physically interpretable than the traditional clustering algorithms. The cluster-level characteristics at 15 positions along a predefined route covering both line-of-sight (LoS) and non-LoS (NLoS) scenarios are investigated. Moreover, power contributions of MPCs with multiple bounces (up to seven bounces in NLoS scenario) from the interaction objects are also investigated.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Zhang, Guojin","Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","Cai, Xuesong","Pedersen, Gert Frølund","Fan, Wei"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-062382"],"filters":{"added":"2022-03","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Sweden"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Lund University"],"keyword":["Antenna measurements","Azimuth","Buildings","Clustering algorithms","Clustering methods","Delays","Dispersion","Frequency measurement","Millimeter wave","Millimeter wave mm wave","Radio Propagation","interaction objects","outdoor measurement"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"geometry based clustering characteristics for outdoor measurements at 000000000028 000000000030 ghz","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/472047991/FINAL_VERSION.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-062382","identifier":[{"id":"85131840690","type":"scopus"}