{"abstract":"\"Sol går op sol går ned\" af den danske komponist Pelle Gudmundsen-Holmgreen (1932-2016) blev opført på Det kongelige Teater i januar 2015. Operaen (eller non-operaen som komponisten selv har kaldt den) tog udgangspunkt i den gamle (og af bibelvidenskaben forlængst forladte) opfattelse (afspejlet i en bibel fra 1700-tallet, som komponisten som ung havde fået som gave), at kong Salomo skrev både Prædikerens Bog og Højsangen. Operaen fremstiller samtidigt den unge, livsglade Salomo og den gamle desillusionerede konge på scenen igennem hele operaen. I artiklen diskuteres både operaens forhold til de bibelske tekster og de benspænd for enhver entydig forståelse, som komponisten har foretaget igennem de forskellige medier og undermedier, der anvendes.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Petersen, Nils Holger"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-397007"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Bibelbrug","Det Humanistiske Fakultet","Det Teologiske Fakultet","Musikteater","Pelle Gudmundsen Holmgreen"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"højsangen og prædikerens bog i sol går op sol går ned 000000002015 en intermedial analyse af pelle gudmundsen holmgreens opera","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-397007","ids":["ku-05f0f6dc-3b49-4b54-88a7-cdbe7b3ca318"],"keyword":["Bibelbrug","Det Humanistiske Fakultet","Det Teologiske Fakultet","Musikteater","Pelle Gudmundsen-Holmgreen"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-6F3F2D6F61FB571C2044F8FD2E226E9A"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Theology, Sections on Theology - Technical area, Section of Church History"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Nils Holger","key":"petersenpau","last":"Petersen","locid":"6bb7ac90-2d34-4b0a-937c-52a1158ba9a2","name":"Petersen, Nils Holger","orcid":"0000-0002-8568-6595","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Gitte","key":"buchhansenpedh","last":"Buch-Hansen","name":"Buch-Hansen, Gitte","rank":2,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Jesper Tang","key":"nielsenpedh","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Tang","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9788741000251"],"pages":"221-245","place":"København","publisher":"Eksistensen Akademisk","status":"p","title":"Bibelske konfigurationer i kunst og kultur"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-05f0f6dc-3b49-4b54-88a7-cdbe7b3ca318"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Højsangen og Prædikerens Bog i \"Sol går op sol går ned\" (2015) : En intermedial analyse af Pelle Gudmundsen-Holmgreens opera","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-397007","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"Background: A well-known complication of having hip alloplasty surgery is dislocation of the prothesis. This affects 2%-4% of the patients, and 75% of the dislocations occur within the first year after surgery. The aim of our study was to gain knowledge about the clinical considerations underlying the choice of anaesthesia for, and treatment of, patients with dislocated hips by specialists in anaesthesiology and orthopaedic surgery. Methods: We used semi-structured group interviews of specialists in anaesthesiology and orthopaedic surgery. An interview guide was developed and pilot tested before the group interviews. In total, 25 specialists participated, recruited from two university hospitals in Denmark. Data saturation was reached after seven group interviews. Inductive content analysis was used in the data analysis. Results: We identified four overall themes, describing essential considerations made by the specialists: “Adhering to the principle of minimal intervention”, “Ensuring patient safety through optimal working conditions”, “Organisational considerations” and “Pain induced gastric retention”. Conclusion: Our study illustrates different clinical considerations made by specialists in anaesthesiology and orthopaedic surgery in relation to the treatment of patients with dislocated hips. Our results hope to promote mutual understanding in joint clinical decision-making in relation to patients with dislocated hips as well as to inspire less-experienced anaesthesiologists and orthopaedic surgeons. Additionally, our results suggest a set of “rules of thumb” for how jointly to decide on the repositioning site of the patient during the procedure.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Gydesen, Christoffer R.","Møller, Ann Merete","Wildgaard, Kim","Nielsen, Jesper K.","Lunn, Troels Haxholdt","Beck, Torben","Thomsen, Thordis"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-419049"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Group interviews","Hip Dislocation","Qualitative study"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"clinical considerations for reposition of a dislocated hip a qualitative study","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-419049","identifier":[{"id":"85101640264","type":"scopus"},{"id":"33583023","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-2af805e8-2181-4938-ad92-73b069e22523"],"keyword":["anaesthesiologic treatment","group interviews","hip dislocation","pain-induced gastric retention","qualitative study"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-6F6B7CAF0B9B2C3F26BF065018E54E67"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital - Bispebjerg and Frederiksberg"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Christoffer R.","key":"gydesenpau","last":"Gydesen","name":"Gydesen, Christoffer R.","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Ann M.","key":"møllerpau","last":"Møller","locid":"75bf0134-ea9c-4496-908d-56c8e51aed96","name":"Møller, Ann Merete","name_