j.ebiom.2021.103230","issn":["23523964"],"journal":"EBioMedicine","paperid":"103230","publisher":"Elsevier BV","publisher_org":"Elsevier B.V.","status":"p","title":"EBioMedicine","volume":"64"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85100079172"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-f1006a10-9425-4765-b70f-8cf80aca747d"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"SARS-CoV-2 persistence is associated with antigen-specific CD8 T-cell responses","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-266851","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"Accurate position measurements are extremely valuable in the shipping industry for various reasons such as safety (collision avoidance), fuel saving (weather identification), punctuality (route prediction), etc. Although GNSS (Global Navigation Satellite System) receivers installed on-board the ships are proven to be highly accurate, the data collection process may occasionally be problematic, mainly due to the complexity of the measurements and the decimal precision that is required. Data was collected from 3 years of operations of 228 Maersk Line container vessels and an analysis reveals that there is a substantial amount (≈20%) of historical position measurements sent to shore that does not reflect reality. With this study, the authors initially identify the source of the faulty logged position measurements, then they categorize them into segments and finally they apply an interpolation methodology in order to validate and correct them by using AIS (Automatic Identification System) data.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Ikonomakis, Angelos","Dietz, Jesper","Kähler Holst, Klaus","Nielsen, Ulrik Dam","Galeazzi, Roberto"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-334297"],"event":{"end":"2021-09-01","place":"Pontignano, it","start":"2021-08-30","title":"6th Hull Performance &amp; Insight Conference","year":"2021"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-MAE"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-MAE","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"historical position measurement validation and correction using ais data an account from a larger shipping company","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/255814196/HP18_Maersk.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-334297","ids":["dtu-63ca20ae-abad-4f5a-8f55-2a56b132b441"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-13EA376B7D0B565E96F08C45074559FE"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/255814196/HP18_Maersk.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"a p moller maersk","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-MAE","l3nl":"A.P. Møller – Mærsk","l3nn":"A.P. Moller - Maersk","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"A.P. Moller - Maersk","namevar":["Maersk R&D"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-MAE","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Mechanical Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Mechanical Engineering, Fluid Mechanics, Coastal and Maritime Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Angelos","key":"ikonomakispau","last":"Ikonomakis","name":"Ikonomakis, Angelos","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesper","key":"dietzpau","last":"Dietz","name":"Dietz, Jesper","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Klaus","key":"kählerholstpau","last":"Kähler Holst","name":"Kähler Holst, Klaus","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Ulrik Dam","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"106115f2-5a14-4e9b-ba17-0199c93439b5","name":"Nielsen, Ulrik Dam","orcid":"0000-0001-7470-2003","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Roberto","key":"galeazzipau","last":"Galeazzi","locid":"b66b869e-5eed-4d