","key":"jacobsenhenrikpau","last":"Jacobsen","locid":"9c8ea0df-9b73-4fce-b62c-a8bc649226f7","name":"Jacobsen, Henrik","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jørgen","key":"johansenjørgenpau","last":"Johansen","locid":"7b9ef019-61d4-4b88-8109-5745bf524ada","name":"Johansen, Jørgen","orcid":"0000-0003-3911-3929","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","first":"Claus","key":"kristensenclausapau","last":"Andrup Kristensen","locid":"8ccf9f7b-e5d4-482e-9609-c14c61bfec15","name":"Kristensen, Claus A.","name_org":"Andrup Kristensen, Claus","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"6","corresponding":null,"first":"Claus","key":"andrupkristensenclauspau","last":"Andrup Kristensen","name":"Andrup Kristensen, Claus","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5 6","first":"Elo","key":"andersenelopau","last":"Andersen","locid":"7dc4dce0-0ce5-4269-a51c-90c9f9516d5c","name":"Andersen, Elo","rank":13,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"7 8","corresponding":null,"first":"Maria","key":"andersenmariapau","last":"Andersen","locid":"6da3e480-13a0-4b96-9c64-d739bd7ba6fe","name":"Andersen, Maria","rank":14,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Kristine","key":"bjørndalkristinepau","last":"Bjørndal","locid":"3f3f0a57-b46d-4012-8152-eabdc6fbc914","name":"Bjørndal, Kristine","orcid":"0000-0003-3840-7861","rank":15,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["34542209"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1002/hed.26875","issn":["10433074","10970347"],"issn_org":["10433074"],"issue":"11","journal":"Head & Neck","pages":"3699-3700","publisher":"John Wiley & Sons Inc.","status":"p","title":"Head & Neck","title_org":"Head and Neck","volume":"43"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85115117607"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","Central Denmark Region","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","North Denmark Region","Region of Southern Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-072a245c-770f-4965-8d58-b07d59bb6134","au-be334c56-74aa-44dc-9450-206454779411","ku-2fa1caf6-f87b-499c-8fa4-921149824f2b","sdu-27a463f3-4080-43b5-b1c9-8718d1147613"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","AU Aarhus University","KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Reply to Letter to the Editor regarding “In reference to Surgical treatment of the neck in patients with salivary gland carcinoma”","type":"Journal Comment","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S04-098.45-000374","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"OBJECTIVE: Data on sex differences in acromegaly at the time of diagnosis vary considerably between studies. DESIGN: A nationwide cohort study including all incident cases of acromegaly (1978-2010, n = 596) and a meta-analysis on sex differences in active acromegaly (40 studies) were performed. METHOD: Sex-dependent differences in prevalence, age at diagnosis, diagnostic delay, pituitary adenoma size, insulin-like growth factor 1 (IGF-I) and growth hormone (GH) concentrations were estimated. RESULTS: The cohort study identified a balanced gender distribution (49.6% females) and a comparable age (years) at diagnosis (48.2 CI95% 46.5-49.8 (males) vs. 47.2 CI95% 45.5-48.9 (females), p = 0.4). The incidence rate significantly increased during the study period (R2 = 0.42, p < 0.01) and the gender ratio (F/M) changed from female predominance to an even ratio (SR: 1.4 vs. 0.9, p = 0.03). IGF-ISDS was significantly lower in females compared to males, whereas neither nadir GH nor pituitary adenoma size differed between males and females. In the meta-analysis, the weighted percentage female was 53.3% (CI95% 51.5-55.2) with considerable heterogeneity (I2 = 85%) among the studies. The mean age difference at diagnosis between genders was 3.1 years (CI95% 1.9-4.4), and the diagnostic delay was longer in females by 0.9 years (CI95% -0.4 to 2.1). Serum IGF-I levels were significantly lower in female patients, whereas nadir GH, and pituitary adenoma size were comparable. CONCLUSION: There are only a minor sex differences in the epidemiology of acromegaly at the time of diagnosis except that female patients are slightly older and exhibit lower IGF-I concentrations and a longer diagnostic delay.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Dal, Jakob","Skov, Benedikte G","Andersen, Marianne","Feldt-Rasmussen, Ulla","Feltoft, Claus L","Karmisholt, Jesper Scott","Nielsen, Eigil Husted","Dekkers, Olaf M","Jørgensen, Jens Otto L"],"cuid":["S04-100.00-000954"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":4,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Dal, Jakob"],"country":["Netherlands"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Leiden University"],"keyword":["Acromegaly","Age","Diagnostic delay","GH","Gender","IGF I","Sex"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-STENO"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-STENO","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"sex differences in acromegaly at diagnosis a nationwide cohort study and meta analysis of the literature","src":["aau","au","ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/318802243/Sex_differences_in_acromegaly_at_diagnosi_acc_manus.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["Unrestricted research grant from Pfizer. JD: unrestricted research grants and lecture fee from Pfizer, JOJ: Grants and lecture fees from Pfizer, IPSEN and Novartis, CF: Lecture fee from Bristol Myers Squibb."],"id":"S04-100.00-000954","identifier":[{"id":"33306249","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85098090510","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-1228465c-6bb5-4160-98b1-6e553d4bde31","au-0e8242f7-7e10-40d3-aca7-9dde56a002a3","ku-e4d48fa2-55f4-4110-b47a-b65a2b8057e2","sdu-71190fe0-8dd2-4c36-8842-df2f77649359"],"keyword":["GH","IGF-I","acromegaly","age","diagnostic delay","gender","sex"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-7-BF16E5967FD271394FBA3CDCE66F2F1F"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https: