{"abstract":"I dag (2019) består de danske regnmålernetværk af omkring 275 regnmålerstationer fordelt på 174 af spildevandskomiteens (SVK) Rimco-regnmålere og 101 af DMIs Pluvio- og Synopmålestationer. SVK-regnmålerne er primært placeret i og omkring de større byer, hvorimod DMIs regnmålere er placeret mere jævnt fordelt over landet.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Røn, Sofie","Nielsen, Mads B","Andersen, Christoffer Bang","Nielsen, Jesper Ellerbæk","Thorndahl, Søren Liedtke"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-115470"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Crowdsourcing"],"level":"pop","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Horsens Kommune"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"crowdsourcing af regndata fra privatejede netatmo regnmålere","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/443234261/2021_02_EVA_blad_Crowdsourcing_af_regndata_fra_privatejede_Netatmo_regnm_lere.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-115470","ids":["aau-e0fe633c-9537-41de-b8c1-7b1f99e4aec6"],"keyword":["Crowdsourcing","Netatmo-regnmålere","Regndata"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-DA775BF80E9B8CA3C52A5311CF3731D4"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/443234261/2021_02_EVA_blad_Crowdsourcing_af_regndata_fra_privatejede_Netatmo_regnm_lere.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"http://www.evanet.dk/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/2021_02_EVA_blad.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Horsens Kommune"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of the Built Environment","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of the Built Environment, Division of Civil and Environmental Engineering","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of the Built Environment, Urban Water Research Group"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Sofie","key":"rønsofiepau","last":"Røn","name":"Røn, Sofie","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Mads B","key":"nielsenmadsbpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Mads B","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Christoffer Bang","key":"andersenchristofferbangpau","last":"Andersen","locid":"a7f8fecb-ba31-4cb5-a1c6-232bbcf803e4","name":"Andersen, Christoffer Bang","orcid":"0000-0002-1624-5796","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Ellerbæk","key":"nielsenjesperellerbækpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"f850e281-27d9-4783-84c8-3048e7819444","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Ellerbæk","orcid":"0000-0003-4596-0948","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Søren Liedtke","key":"thorndahlsørenliedtkepau","last":"Thorndahl","locid":"5faa528b-e2f0-41fd-8128-9d76ed5993f0","name":"Thorndahl, Søren Liedtke","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["19013663"],"issue":"34","journal":"EVA : Erfaringsudveksling i vandmiljøteknikken","pages":"30-36","status":"p","title":"EVA : Erfaringsudveksling i vandmiljøteknikken","volume":"2"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-e0fe633c-9537-41de-b8c1-7b1f99e4aec6"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Crowdsourcing af regndata fra privatejede Netatmo-regnmålere","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-115470","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"The creation of sound zones with frequency-domain variable span trade-off filters (VAST) is investigated herein. Both narrowband and broadband discrete Fourier transform (DFT)-domain VAST approaches are proposed, and we discuss their relationship to the existing time-domain VAST approach. The core idea in VAST is to apply a generalized eigenvalue decomposition to the spatial statistics to control the trade-off between acoustic contrast and signal distortion. Moreover, a method for determining the optimal Lagrange multiplier that controls this trade-off is also considered in terms of physical, meaningful parameters. Through analysis and experiments, a performance comparison using measured room impulse responses is conducted not only between the two proposed methods but also between the two proposed methods and the existing time-domain approach. The results confirm that the broadband approach is able to transfer the acoustic contrast from one frequency bin to another, which is not the case for the narrowband approach. Furthermore, the results also show that the proposed DFT-domain VAST approach can be considered to be a special case of the time-domain VAST approach.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Lee, Taewoong","Shi, Liming","Nielsen, Jesper Kjær","Christensen, Mads Græsbøll"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-115950"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Optimization","Personal sound","Sound zones"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"fast generation of sound zones using variable span trade off filters in the dft domain","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/391870653/Lee_etal_DK_2020_TASLP_dft_accepted.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-115950","identifier":[{"id":"85097933734","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-e2a7cc69-2857-46ea-89b7-9f2b6abf71ad"],"keyword":["Optimization","Personal sound","Sound Zones","variable span trade-off filters"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-38EF4D3F5FF6C8AA17B45F4CE5D473E1"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/391870653/Lee_etal_DK_2020_TASLP_dft_accepted.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology, Audio Analysis Lab (CREATE)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology, Section for Media Technology - Campus Aalborg"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Taewoong","key":"leepau","last":"Lee","locid":"d1eeade6-8e75-427d-9c1f-1a4ac5464576","name":"Lee, Taewoong","orcid":"0000-0002-6669-0820","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Liming","key":"shipau","last":"Shi","locid":"e44b1378-1291-46be-b76a-fd0e196e2d46","name":"Shi, Liming","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesper Kjær","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"3d21c73c-3aa1-4590-870f-8be578634702","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Kjær","orcid":"0000-0002-2586-7925","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mads Græsbøll","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"cf9e922d-e5f8-4964-9b84-581667f97b0b","name":"Christensen, Mads Græsbøll","orcid":"0000-0003-3586-7969","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/taslp.2020.3042701","issn":["23299290"],"journal":"IEEE/ACM Transactions on Audio, Speech, and Language Processing","pages":"363-378","paperid":"9281345","publisher":"IEEE Advancing Technology for Humanity","status":"p","title":"IEEE/ACM Transactions on Audio, Speech, and Language Processing","volume":"29"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85097933734"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-e2a7cc69-2857-46ea-89b7-9f2b6abf71ad"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Fast Generation of Sound Zones Using Variable Span Trade-Off Filters in the DFT-Domain","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-115950","year":"2021","yearsub":"2020"}
{"author_count":3,"contributors":["Franch, Jesper","Nielsen, Anders","Larsen, Ryan Godsk"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-119441"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"bliver ol s maraton afgjort af hvem der har de bedste løbesko","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://videnskab.dk/forskerzonen/teknologi-innovation/bliver-ols-maraton-afgjort-af-hvem-der-har-de-bedste-loebesko","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-119441","ids":["aau-eeb357ed-decb-4b15-b5e8-e1dfcea8576b"],"lang":"English","level":"Popular","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-44A1EF0931AA6E08039354BC47FD6C06"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Health Science and Technology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Health Science and Technology, Sport Sciences - Performance and Technology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper","key":"franchpau","last":"Franch","locid":"9f5ebab9-2344-4c4d-aae9-7dc7d0dfa5fd","name":"Franch, Jesper","orcid":"0000-0002-8668-2385","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"56136ff8-3354-4fe5-9d96-ab0a3b6e4c6b","name":"Nielsen, Anders","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Ryan Godsk","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"86d31e60-1de1-4284-a688-596cc17dca1c","name":"Larsen, Ryan Godsk","orcid":"0000-0002-4622-1453","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["1903301X"],"journal":"Videnskab.dk","status":"p","title":"Videnskab.dk","title_org":"Videnskab.dk [online]"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-eeb357ed-decb-4b15-b5e8-e1dfcea8576b"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Bliver OL’s maraton afgjort af, hvem der har de bedste løbesko?","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-119441","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"In this work, a stochastic 3-D user shadowing model is presented, which can be used in the frequency range from 28 to 34 GHz. To characterize the user shadowing pattern, new metrics of shadowed cumulative distribution function (SCDF) and user shadowed intensity ratio (USIR) are proposed. The user shadowing model is based on measurements with 18 subjects of different heights and genders. For simplicity, the user shadowing pattern is divided into four regions based on the mean shadowing pattern obtained from the measurements. Each of the spatial regions is modeled as a stochastic process, which follows the Gaussian distribution. It has been shown that any horizontally polarized mobile antenna is compatible with the presented model. The proposed user shadowing pattern model can be directly used for fifth-generation (5G) mm-wave ray tracing or link simulations.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Liu, Peiye","Syrytsin, Igor A.","Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","Pedersen, Gert Frølund","Zhang, Shuai"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-121919"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Zhang, Shuai"],"keyword":["5G","Blockage","Mobile terminal antenna","fifth generation 5G","human shadowing","mm Wave","user effect"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"characterization and modeling of the user blockage for 000000000005g handset antennas","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/387097799/manuscript.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-121919","identifier":[{"id":"85096852364","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-f7532051-ad6d-4c76-b95f-922f86e9ed64"],"keyword":["5G","Mobile terminal antenna","blockage","fifth generation (5G)","human shadowing","mm-wave","user effect"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-5364B7F3ADC4D8E0F2021D0B4D3D8A58"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/387097799/manuscript.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Antennas","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Antennas, Propagation and Millimetre-Wave Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Peiye","key":"liupau","last":"Liu","locid":"4367f3da-350d-4d04-8da4-99dd79478afd","name":"Liu, Peiye","orcid":"0000-0002-6002-2899","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Igor Aleksandrovich","key":"syrytsinpau","last":"Syrytsin","locid":"b916ec46-2fe9-45d6-8d3b-fbcfb438fac5","name":"Syrytsin, Igor A.","name_org":"Syrytsin, Igor Aleksandrovich","orcid":"0000-0003-2157-1868","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Ødum","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"12489268-4402-4c17-8487-76a4323ee983","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","orcid":"0000-0002-8505-853X","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Gert Frølund","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"a49c73ee-aed0-448c-8a92-792c9ee12a9e","name":"Pedersen, Gert Frølund","orcid":"0000-0002-6570-7387","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Shuai","key":"zhangpau","last":"Zhang","locid":"c97f8895-893d-4895-bc19-d7bf7d5fe6d9","name":"Zhang, Shuai","orcid":"0000-0002-9003-2879","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/tim.2020.3039644","issn":["00189456"],"journal":"IEEE Transactions on Instrumentation and Measurement","pages":"1-11","paperid":"9265270","publisher":"IEEE (Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers)","status":"p","title":"IEEE Transactions on Instrumentation and Measurement","title_org":"I E E E Transactions on Instrumentation and Measurement","volume":"70"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85096852364"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-f7532051-ad6d-4c76-b95f-922f86e9ed64"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Characterization and Modeling of the User Blockage for 5G Handset Antennas","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-121919","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"I denne rapport fremlægges resultaterne af overvågningen af fugle i NOVANA for årene 2018-2019. Den nationale overvågning har omfattet ynglefugle samt rastende og overvintrende fugle omfattet af Fuglebeskyttelsesdirektivet. I overvågningen har indgået et specielt program for Vadehavet i henhold til det Trilaterale Vadehavssamarbejde, et særligt program for de Vestjyske fjorde, et særligt program for Tøndermarsken og Vejlerne samt et særligt program for overvågning af skarv.","author_count":11,"contributors":["Holm, Thomas Eske","Nielsen, Rasmus Due","Clausen, Preben","Bregnballe, Thomas","Clausen, Kevin Kuhlmann","Petersen, Ib Krag","Sterup, Jacob","Balsby, Thorsten Johannes Skovbjerg","Pedersen, Claus Lunde","Mikkelsen, Peter","Bladt, Jesper"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-227067"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"com","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"fugle 000000002018 000000002019 novana","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://dce2.au.dk/pub/SR420.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-227067","ids":["au-ab6124f2-f2b8-4eaf-bff0-98c817934eab"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Commissioned","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-4647360261FE8026C7A6FD5A91E25D4C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://dce2.au.dk/pub/SR420.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/208939084/SR420.pdf","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","nameva