{"abstract":"In the project, the emission impacts for particulate matter (TSP, PM10 and PM2.5) and black carbon (BC) of three scenarios for residential wood combustion have been estimated and the impacts of the concentrations of BC have been modelled over Denmark and the Arctic using the Danish Eulerian Hemispheric Model (DEHM). Additionally, the modelled concentrations have been compared to the measurement results. The overall greenhouse gas effect of residential wood burning in Denmark has been estimated considering the pollutants where the IPCC Fifth Assessment Report provides global warming potentials (CH4, N2O, NOx, VOC and BC). The basic scenario have been compared to three scenarios which includes banning older wood stoves in areas with district heating, installing particle filters on stoves and boilers not being ecolabelled and requiring older stoves to be scrapped or replaced when a property is sold.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Plejdrup, Marlene Schmidt","Nielsen, Ole-Kenneth","Christensen, Jesper Heile"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-259905"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Air pollution","Arctic","Black carbon","Emissions"],"level":"com","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"emission scenarios and air quality modelling for residential wood combustion impact analysis of measures for small wood burning appliances in denmark and effect on transport of black carbon to the arctic","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://dce2.au.dk/pub/SR426.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-259905","ids":["au-e4aec63d-c3ca-41d1-8ca5-f3674cb83b84"],"keyword":["Air quality modelling","Arctic","Black carbon","Emissions","Residential wood burning","air pollution"],"lang":"English","level":"Commissioned","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-D51F4A29A93722AB441711256C2DE02B"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://dce2.au.dk/pub/SR426.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Environmental Science, Department of Environmental Science - Atmospheric Emissions"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Marlene Schmidt","key":"plejdruppau","last":"Plejdrup","locid":"9dede80b-ff3e-4171-9504-bf8547fec74d","name":"Plejdrup, Marlene Schmidt","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ole-Kenneth","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"17ec76bb-7916-4024-867b-3aca60ca0c40","name":"Nielsen, Ole-Kenneth","orcid":"0000-0003-4350-0956","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Heile","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"5d084fe1-5909-4b7f-ac1a-907f4a30089e","name":"Christensen, Jesper Heile","orcid":"0000-0002-6741-5839","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9788771565621"],"issue":"426","pages":"54","publisher":"Aarhus University, DCE - Danish Centre for Environment and Energy","repno":"Scientific Report from DCE - Danish Centre for Environment and Energy, No. 426","series":"Scientific Report from DCE - Danish Centre for Environment and Energy","status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-e4aec63d-c3ca-41d1-8ca5-f3674cb83b84"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Emission scenarios and air quality modelling for residential wood combustion : Impact analysis of measures for small wood burning appliances in Denmark and effect on transport of black carbon to the Arctic","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-259905","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"In Supplementary Table 1 of this Article, there were typos in the dating estimates of two samples, VK201 and VK203. In the ‘Age’ and ‘Finer_ age’ columns both samples were listed as ‘Viking’ and ‘10th century CE’, respectively, whereas they should be listed as ‘Iron Age’, with finer estimates of ‘5–6th century CE’ (VK201) and ‘1–7th century CE’ (VK203). The Supplementary Information of the original Article has been corrected online.","author_count":90,"contributors":["Margaryan, Ashot","Lawson, Daniel J.","Sikora, Martin","Racimo, Fernando","Rasmussen, Simon","Moltke, Ida","Cassidy, Lara M.","Jørsboe, Emil","Ingason, Andrés","Pedersen, Mikkel W.","Korneliussen, Thorfinn","Wilhelmson, Helene","Buś, Magdalena M.","de Barros Damgaard, Peter","Martiniano, Rui","Renaud, Gabriel","Bhérer, Claude","Moreno-Mayar, J. Víctor","Fotakis, Anna K.","Allen, Marie","Allmäe, Raili","Molak, Martyna","Cappellini, Enrico","Scorrano, Gabriele","McColl, Hugh","Buzhilova, Alexandra","Fox, Allison","Albrechtsen, Anders","Schütz, Berit","Skar, Birgitte","Arcini, Caroline","Falys, Ceri","Jonson, Charlotte Hedenstierna","Błaszczyk, Dariusz","Pezhemsky, Denis","Turner-Walker, Gordon","Gestsdóttir, Hildur","Lundstrøm, Inge","Gustin, Ingrid","Mainland, Ingrid","Potekhina, Inna","Muntoni, Italo M.","Cheng, Jade","Stenderup, Jesper","Ma, Jilong","Gibson, Julie","Peets, Jüri","Gustafsson, Jörgen","Iversen, Katrine Højholt","Simpson, Linzi","Strand, Lisa","Loe, Louise","Sikora, Maeve","Florek, Marek","Vretemark, Maria","Redknap, Mark","Bajka, Monika","Pushkina, Tamara","Søvsø, Morten","Grigoreva, Natalia","Christensen, Tom","Kastholm, Ole","Uldum, Otto","Favia, Pasquale","Holck, Per","Sten, Sabine","Arge, Símun V.","Ellingvåg, Sturla","Moiseyev, Vayacheslav","Bogdanowicz, Wiesław","Magnusson, Yvonne","Orlando, Ludovic","Pentz, Peter","Jessen, Mads Dengsø","Pedersen, Anne","Collard, Mark","Bradley, Daniel G.","Jørkov, Marie Louise","Arneborg, Jette","Lynnerup, Niels","Price, Neil","Gilbert, M. Thomas P.","Allentoft, Morten E.","Bill, Jan","Sindbæk, Søren M.","Hedeager, Lotte","Kristiansen, Kristian","Nielsen, Rasmus","Werge, Thomas","Willerslev, Eske"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-353443"],"filters":{"added":"2022-03","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"51-200 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Asia, East","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Nielsen, Rasmus","Willerslev, Eske"],"country":["Canada","Estonia","Faroe Islands","France","Iceland","Ireland","Isle of Man","Italy","Norway","Poland","Russia","Sweden","Taiwan","Ukraine","United Kingdom","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Amgueddfa Cymru–National Museum Wales","Belle Arti e Paesaggio per le Province di Barletta","Institute of Archaeology","Jönköping County Museum","Lomonosov Moscow State University","Lund University","Malmö museum","Manx National Heritage","Maria Curie-Skłodowska University in Lublin","McGill University","National Academy of Sciences of Ukraine","National Museum of Ireland","National Museum of the Faroe Islands","National Yunlin University of Science and Technology","Norwegian University of Science and Technology","Oxford Archaeology","Polish Academy of Sciences","Russian Academy of Sciences","Simon Fraser University","Tallinn University","Thames Valley Archaeological Services","Trinity College Dublin","Trzy Epoki Archaeological Service","University of Bristol","University of California at Berkeley","University of Cambridge","University of Foggia","University of Gothenburg","University of Oslo","University of Warsaw","University of the Highlands and Islands","Université Paul Sabatier Toulouse III","Upplandsmuseet","Uppsala University","Västergötlands Museum"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-KUM"],"OT":["Museum of Southwest Jutland"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU",