-021f32e21e22"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Pulling mechanisms and pushing strategies : How to improve Ecosystem Advice Fisheries Management advice within the European Union’s Common Fisheries Policy","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-098.60-009053","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"Filamentous cable bacteria display long-range electron transport, generating electrical currents over centimeter distances through a highly ordered network of fibers embedded in their cell envelope. The conductivity of these periplasmic wires is exceptionally high for a biological material, but their chemical structure and underlying electron transport mechanism remain unresolved. Here, we combine high-resolution microscopy, spectroscopy, and chemical imaging on individual cable bacterium filaments to demonstrate that the periplasmic wires consist of a conductive protein core surrounded by an insulating protein shell layer. The core proteins contain a sulfur-ligated nickel cofactor, and conductivity decreases when nickel is oxidized or selectively removed. The involvement of nickel as the active metal in biological conduction is remarkable, and suggests a hitherto unknown form of electron transport that enables efficient conduction in centimeter-long protein structures.","author_count":34,"contributors":["Boschker, Henricus T.S.","Cook, Perran L. M.","Polerecky, Lubos","Thiruvallur Eachambadi, Raghavendran","Lozano, Helena","Hidalgo-Martinez, Silvia","Khalenkow, Dmitry","Spampinato, Valentina","Claes, Nathalie","Kundu, Paromita","Wang, Da","Bals, Sara","Sand, Karina","Cavezza, Francesca","Hauffman, Tom","Bjerg, Jesper Jensen","Skirtach, Andre G.","Kochan, Kamila","McKee, Merrilyn","Wood, Bayden","Bedolla, Diana","Gianoncelli, Alessandra","Geerlings, Nicole M. J.","Van Gerven, Nani","Remaut, Han","Geelhoed, Jeanine S","Millan-Solsona, Ruben","Fumagalli, Laura","Nielsen, Lars Peter","Franquet, Alexis","Manca, Jean V.","Gomila, Gabriel","Meysman, Filip Jean Remi"],"cuid":["S02-099.60-015074"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD","Oceania"],"country":["Australia","Belgium","Germany","Netherlands"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Delft University of Technology","Max Planck Institute for Marine Microbiology","Monash University","Netherlands Institute of Ecology","Royal Netherlands Institute for Sea Research - NIOZ","University of Antwerp","Utrecht University","Vrije Universiteit Brussel"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"efficient long range conduction in cable bacteria through nickel protein wires","src":["au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-021-24312-4","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-099.60-015074","identifier":[{"id":"34183682","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC8238962","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"85109790725","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-220484f8-b3ea-4dc1-97c2-4e9695c6c06b","ku-2884c603-d9d2-4c3e-bd10-dbaaee5afe01"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-54CB02B304665CF16BDBA7E9B5C68ABB"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-021-24312-4","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/274479711/s41467_021_24312_4.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"nl","key":"netherlands institute of ecology","loc":["Netherlands","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Netherlands Institute of Ecology","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"nl","key":"utrecht university","loc":["Netherlands","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Utrecht University","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"be","key":"university of antwerp","loc":["Belgium","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Antwerp","used":1},{"affno":"4","