U University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"The Danish Head and Neck Cancer Group (DAHANCA) 2020 radiotherapy guidelines","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S04-095.52-006064","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"Two types of clinically important nucleic acid biomarkers, microRNA (miRNA) and circulating tumor DNA (ctDNA) were detected and quantified from human serum using an amplification-free fluorescence hybridization assay. Specifically, miRNAs hsa-miR-223-3p and hsa-miR-486-5p with relevance for rheumatoid arthritis and cancer related mutations BRAF and KRAS of ctDNA were directly measured. The required oligonucleotide probes for the assay were rationally designed and synthesized through a novel \"clickable\"approach which is time and cost-effective. With no need for isolating nucleic acid components from serum, the fluoresence-based assay took only 1 hour. Detection and absolute quantification of targets was successfully achieved despite their notoriously low abundance, with a precision down to individual nucleotides. Obtained miRNA and ctDNA amounts showed overall a good correlation with current techniques. With appropriate probes, our novel assay and signal boosting approach could become a useful tool for point-of-care measuring other low abundance nucleic acid biomarkers.","author_count":12,"contributors":["Uhd, Jesper","Miotke, Laura","Ji, Hanlee P.","Dunaeva, Marina","Pruijn, Ger J.M.","Jørgensen, Christian Damsgaard","Kristoffersen, Emil Laust","Birkedal, Victoria","Yde, Christina Westmose","Nielsen, Finn Cilius","Hansen, Jonas","Astakhova, Kira"],"cuid":["S04-099.92-020440"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":4,"continent":["America, North","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Astakhova, Kira"],"country":["Netherlands","Russia","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Radboud University Medical Center","Radboud University Nijmegen","Sechenov First Moscow State Medical University","Sechenov University","Stanford University","Stanford University Medical Center","Stanford University School of Medicine"],"level":"sci","mra":["med","sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-OTH","DI-HO-SDR"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-OTH","DI-HO-SDR","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"ultra fast detection and quantification of nucleic acids by amplification free fluorescence assay","src":["au","dtu","ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85089815572","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S04-099.92-020440","identifier":[{"id":"32648858","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85089815572","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-6ab20724-6462-4300-b0d3-a2f8ed32d066","dtu-e134d800-7a20-4f21-a615-a27ce6b4e5c6","ku-af006e13-4205-434c-ab1d-667c054232ef","sdu-c00b7fb4-863f-425e-a901-a54542318e5c"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science","Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-7-D4BD3791FD0728FB761BF58C2E412FB3"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Chemistry"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"us","key":"stanford university","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Stanford University","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"us","key":"stanford university school of medicine","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Stanford University School of Medicine","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"us","key":"stanford unive