{"abstract":"I denne artikel undersøges, hvorledes passagerventetider afhænger af køreplanstype samt frekvens. Baseret på et stort antal observationer fra Rejsekortet fandt vi, at mange passagerer aktivt planlægger deres ankomst til stationen for derved at nedbringe deres ventetid - selv ved meget høj frekvens såsom 5-minutters drift. Resultaterne understreger vigtigheden i at offentliggøre nøjagtige og opdaterede køreplaner til passagererne, idet de derved kan spare tid ved at planlægge ankomsten.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Ingvardson, Jesper Bláfoss","Nielsen, Otto Anker"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-319782"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"frekvensbaserede køreplaner øger passagerventetiden","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/234548581/9580.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-319782","ids":["dtu-33146820-7ddc-46c5-9411-a365227ed858"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-60E13CDE7AB5EC5AEEBFA0A0E75D33B4"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/234548581/9580.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Technology, Management and Economics","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Technology, Management and Economics, Transport","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Technology, Management and Economics, Transport, Network and Route Choice"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Bláfoss","key":"ingvardsonpau","last":"Ingvardson","locid":"910e3f5c-3100-4005-82a4-8d3253d4d89b","name":"Ingvardson, Jesper Bláfoss","orcid":"0000-0002-0609-5165","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Otto Anker","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"0b46cbc2-23db-4c0b-bc64-91094ef11adb","name":"Nielsen, Otto Anker","orcid":"0000-0001-7901-7021","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["19037384"],"journal":"Trafik & Veje","pages":"30-33","publisher":"Dansk Vejtidsskrift ApS","status":"p","title":"Trafik & Veje","volume":"9"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-33146820-7ddc-46c5-9411-a365227ed858"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Frekvensbaserede køreplaner øger passagerventetiden","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-319782","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"Phonon interactions in solid-state photonics systems cause intrinsic quantum decoherence and often present the limiting factor in emerging quantum technology. Due to recent developments in nanophotonics, exciton-cavity structures with very strong light-matter coupling rates can be fabricated. We show that in such structures, a regime emerges where the decoherence is completely suppressed due to decoupling of the dominant phonon process. Using a numerically exact tensor network approach, we perform calculations in this nonperturbative, non-Markovian dynamical regime. Here, we identify a strategy for reaching near-unity photon indistinguishability and also discover an interesting phonon dressing of the exciton-cavity polaritons in the high-Q regime, leading to multiple phonon sidebands when the light-matter interaction is sufficiently strong.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Denning, Emil Vosmar","Bundgaard-Nielsen, Matias","Mørk, Jesper"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-341292"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Denning, Emil Vosmar"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"optical signatures of electron phonon decoupling due to strong light matter interactions","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/240479024/PhysRevB.102.235303.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-341292","identifier":[{"id":"85099131115","type":"scopus"},{"id":"000602843200005","type":"wos"}],"ids":["dtu-7b1365a8-19b8-4979-93b2-183d58bbcd8d"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-408BC7BEC878578E0A3654EA8556B5DD"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/241950624/Erratum.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/240479024/PhysRevB.102.235303.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Centers, NanoPhoton – Center for Nanophotonics","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Photonics Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Photonics Engineering, Quantum and Laser Photonics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Emil Vosmar","key":"denningpau","last":"Denning","locid":"22939a2d-b8f5-4324-99f9-d1debfe5ce2d","name":"Denning, Emil Vosmar","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Matias","key":"bundgaardnielsenpau","last":"Bundgaard-Nielsen","name":"Bundgaard-Nielsen, Matias","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesper","key":"mørkpau","last":"Mørk","locid":"6621c7d8-77e3-4e53-a34d-b330e59262c6","name":"Mørk, Jesper","orcid":"0000-0001-8498-661X","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1103/physrevb.102.235303","issn":["1550235X","24699950"],"issn_org":["10980121"],"issue":"23","journal":"Physical Review B","paperid":"235303","publisher":"American Physical Society","status":"p","title":"Physical Review B","volume":"102"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85099131115"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-7b1365a8-19b8-4979-93b2-183d58bbcd8d"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Optical signatures of electron-phonon decoupling due to strong light-matter interactions","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-341292","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"The installation of an organic Rankine cycle unit on the exhaust line of a marine engine imposes an increase in the backpressure on the engine, resulting in a decrease of the engine performance and a variation of the available waste heat. In this paper, a method is presented for the optimal design of organic Rankine cycle power systems for waste heat recovery in marine applications. The method is based on the use of performance maps for the engine and numerical models for the organic Rankine cycle unit and the waste heat recovery boiler, thereby enabling consideration of the effect of the increased backpressure on the performance of both the main engine and the organic Rankine cycle unit. The method is evaluated on a hypothetical containership fuelled by liquefied natural gas. The results of the study indicate that the overall system fuel consumption can be reduced by 0.52 g/kWh to 1.45 g/kWh by allowing higher backpressure levels on the engine. In addition, the results of the study indicate that for a fixed power output of the organic Rankine cycle unit, a reduction of the space requirement for the waste heat recovery boiler by up to 35% can be attained when increasing the maximum allowed engine backpressure from 3 kPa to 6 kPa.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Baldasso, Enrico","Mondejar, Maria E.","Andreasen, Jesper Graa","Rønnenfelt, Kari Anne Tveitaskog","Nielsen, Bent Ørndrup","Haglind, Fredrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-360539"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Baldasso, Enrico"],"country":["Germany"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","MAN Energy Solutions SE"],"keyword":["Organic Rankine cycle","Shipping","Volume estimation","Waste heat recovery"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"design of organic rankine cycle power systems for maritime applications accounting for engine backpressure effects","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/215035731/backpressure_paper_rev2_final.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-360539","identifier":[{"id":"85086104170","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-bb3dd0c7-41c1-4671-a2c2-0ae5d55688eb"],"keyword":["Backpressure","Organic Rankine cycle","Shipping","Volume estimation","Waste heat recovery"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-65F245CA9B1AFDC1D5C5458CF34A0516"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/215035731/backpressure_paper_rev2_final.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Mechanical Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Mechanical Engineering, Thermal Energy"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"de","key":"man energy solutions se","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"MAN Energy Solutions SE","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Enrico","key":"baldassopau","last":"Baldasso","locid":"61e20649-75ee-4908-bfc7-dc54bdda4ad1","name":"Baldasso, Enrico","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Maria E.","key":"mondejar