{"abstract":"This work investigates the channel activity in the European license free 863–870 MHz band via measurements in 7 widely different urban and sub-urban areas. The data is analyzed in 8 different sub-bands. The measured 1 ms sweeps are used to characterize the random activity, where the estimated complementary cumulative distribution functions (CCDFs) are found to be highly dependent on both location and sub-band. In addition, the probability of observing an unused channel for varying lengths of time is estimated.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","Fresia, Maria","Pedersen, Gert Frølund"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-070218"],"event":{"acronym":"EuCAP","end":"2020-03-20","place":"Copenhagen, dk","start":"2020-03-15","title":"14th European Conference on Antennas and Propagation","year":"2020"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"country":["United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Intel"],"keyword":["Radio Propagation"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"measured activity in 000000000860 mhz channels","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85088655220&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-070218","identifier":[{"id":"85088655220","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-45a029d6-9198-4115-ab07-1f927f9fdde4"],"keyword":["Radio Propagation","interference measuresurements"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-E08E5A539460DF9853097ABD332D869A"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Antennas, Propagation and Millimetre-Wave Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"us","key":"intel","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Intel","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Ødum","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"12489268-4402-4c17-8487-76a4323ee983","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","orcid":"0000-0002-8505-853X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Maria","key":"fresiapau","last":"Fresia","name":"Fresia, Maria","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Gert Frølund","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"a49c73ee-aed0-448c-8a92-792c9ee12a9e","name":"Pedersen, Gert Frølund","orcid":"0000-0002-6570-7387","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.23919/eucap48036.2020.9135525","eisbn":["9788831299008"],"isbn":["9781728137124"],"publisher":"IEEE (Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers)","series":"Porceedings of the IEEE European Conference on Antennas and Propagation","status":"p","title":"2020 14th European Conference on Antennas and Propagation (EuCAP)"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85088655220"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-45a029d6-9198-4115-ab07-1f927f9fdde4"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Measured Activity in 860 MHz Channels","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-070218",