{"author_count":2,"contributors":["Andrioti, Despena","Nielsen, Jesper Bo"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-636424"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Andrioti, Despena"],"level":"com","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"memorandum of agreement with the faculty of international maritime studies kasetsart university thailand initiated the bilateral cooperation and drafted the agreement between the centre of maritime health and society institute of public health sdu and the faculty of international maritime studies kasetsart university thailand acadre 000000000020 000000006721","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"doo","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-636424","ids":["sdu-dcbc57aa-fd54-4209-9886-7de63cfc9691"],"lang":"English","level":"Commissioned","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-28B14F63A3EDB515395317EC8818FC89"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Public Health, Research Unit for Maritime Health and Technology (MHT)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Despena","key":"andriotibygvraapau","last":"Andrioti Bygvraa","locid":"a94ed7d8-f06a-45aa-a33c-633a075590c9","name":"Andrioti, Despena","name_org":"Andrioti Bygvraa, Despena","orcid":"0000-0002-9355-3004","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Bo","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"75938cc2-43d6-4c8d-a506-6b1c0472a382","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Bo","orcid":"0000-0002-5764-5462","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-dcbc57aa-fd54-4209-9886-7de63cfc9691"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Memorandum of Agreement with the Faculty of International Maritime Studies, Kasetsart University Thailand : Initiated the bilateral cooperation and drafted the agreement between the Centre of Maritime Health and Society, Institute of Public Health, SDU and the Faculty of International Maritime Studies, Kasetsart University Thailand, acadre: 20/6721.","type":"Other-Unknown","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-636424","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"Agner Møller tog i 20erne i hollandsk tjeneste i Hollandsk Ostindien, som så mange andre danske læger. Han var en kritisk observatør af hollandsk kolonialisme og indsamlede betydningsfulde genstande til Nationalmuseets Etnografiske Samling. Samlingen af etnografika fra øen Nias, er en af verdens største og bedst registrerede.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Kurt Nielsen, Jesper"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-749718"],"filters":{"added":"2024-08","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Imperialisme","Indonesien","Kolonialisme","NIAS"],"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-KUM"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-KUM"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"manden der ikke ville være høflig historien om den danske koloni læge agner møller","src":["kum"],"src-code":["DI-GV-KUM"],"type":"db","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-749718","ids":["kum-97eedb27-22ab-4f1d-99c3-447aac16f019"],"keyword":["Agner Møller","Hollandsk Ostindien","Imperialisme","Indonesien","Kolonialisme","Nias"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-BABA21CC141C4D2D2069359D728A7EA0"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"kum ministry of culture archives museums and royal library denmark","l2":"DI-GV","l2n":"Governmental Institutions","l3":"DI-GV-KUM","l3nn":"KUM Ministry of Culture - Archives, Museums, and Royal Library Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KUM Ministry of Culture - Archives, Museums, and Royal Library Denmark","namevar":["Ministry of Culture Denmark, The National Museum of Denmark"],"nora_code":"DI-GV-KUM","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesper","key":"kurtnielsenpau","last":"Kurt Nielsen","locid":"77adafc2-64b0-41b8-9853-e677e84ee34e","name":"Kurt Nielsen, Jesper","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"edition":"1","isbn":["9788702263411"],"pages":"331","place":"København","publisher":"Gyldendal","status":"p","volume":"1"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Governmental Institutions","DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-GV-ALL","Governmental Institutions"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["kum-97eedb27-22ab-4f1d-99c3-447aac16f019"],"src":["KUM Ministry of Culture - Archives, Museums, and Royal Library Denmark"],"title":"Manden Der Ikke Ville Være Høflig : Historien om den danske koloni læge Agner Møller","type":"Book","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-749718","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"Background: Particulate matter (PM) air pollution is a complex mixture and the various PM constituents likely affect health differently. The literature on the relationships among specific PM constituents and the risk of cancer is sparse. In this study, we aimed to evaluate the association of PM 2.5 and its constituents with the incidence of non-Hodgkin lymphoma (NHL) and the two main NHL subtypes. Methods: We undertook a nationwide register-based case-control study including 20,847 cases registered in the Danish Cancer Registry with NHL between 1989 and 2014. Among the entire Danish population, we selected 41,749 age and sex-matched controls randomly from the Civil Registration System. We assessed modelled outdoor PM concentrations at addresses of cases and controls with a state-of-the-art multi scale air pollution modelling system and used conditional logistic regression to estimate odds ratios (ORs) adjusted for individual and neighborhood level socio-demographic variables. Results: The 10-year time-weighted average concentrations of PM 2.5, primary carbonaceous particles (BC/OC), secondary inorganic aerosols (SIA), secondary organic aerosols (SOA) and sea salt were 17.4, 2.3, 7.8, 0.3, and 4.1 μg/m 3, respectively among controls. The results showed higher risk for NHL in association with exposure to BC/OC (OR = 1.03; 95% CI: 1.00, 1.07, per interquartile range (IQR)) and SOA (OR = 1.54; 95% CI: 1.13, 2.09, per IQR). The results indicated a higher risk for follicular lymphoma in association with several PM components. Including PM 2.5 (OR = 1.16; 95% CI: 0.98–1.38), BC/OC (OR = 1.05; 95% CI: 0.97–1.14), SIA (OR = 1.44; 95% CI: 0.80–1.08), SOA (OR = 4.52; 95% CI: 0.86–23.83) per IQR. Conclusion: This is the first study on PM constituents and the risk of NHL. The results indicated an association with primary carbonaceous and secondary organic PM. The results need replication in other settings before any firm conclusion can be reached.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Taj, Tahir","Poulsen, Aslak Harbo","Ketzel, Matthias","Geels, Camilla","Brandt, Jørgen","Christensen, Jesper Heile","Puett, Robin","Hvidtfeldt, Ulla Arthur","Sørensen, Mette","Raaschou-Nielsen, Ole"],"cuid":["S02-099.67-793316"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["America, North","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"country":["United Kingdom","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University System of Maryland","University of Maryland","University of Surrey"],"keyword":["Case control study","Particulate matter","non Hodgkin lymphoma"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-NP","DI-U"],"level3":{"NP":["DI-NP-ALL","DI-NP-CAN"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-NP-CAN","DI-U-AU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"long term exposure to pm sub 000000000002 000000000005 sub and its constituents and risk of non hodgkin lymphoma in denmark a population based case control study","src":["au","ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85086369006","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-099.67-793316","identifier":[{"id":"32535359","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85086369006","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-7817d207-5d0d-43c0-b267-3db685121dea","ruc-75e1e379-1e4d-4b72-ac2a-ee279a831d05"],"keyword":["Case–control study","Non-hodgkin lymphoma","Particulate matter"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-BCD7F208A96220FA24FA6F33C07D181D"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"dcrc danish cancer society research center","l2":"DI-NP","l2n":"Non-Profit Organisations","l3":"DI-NP-CAN","l3nn":"DCRC Danish Cancer Society Research Center","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DCRC Danish Cancer Society Research Center","namevar":["Danish Cancer Society"],"nora_code":"DI-NP-CAN","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Environmental Science, Department of Environmental Science - Atmospheric Emissions & Modelling"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"gb","key":"university of surrey","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Surrey","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"us","key":"university system of maryland","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"University System of Maryland","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"us","key":"university of maryland","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"University of Maryland","used":1},{"affno":"6","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of Science and Environment"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Tahir","key":"tajpau","last":"Taj","name":"Taj, Tahir","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Aslak Harbo","key":"poulsenpau","last":"Poulsen","name":"Poulsen, Aslak Harbo","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Matthias","key":"ketzelpau","last":"Ketzel","locid":"798900d2-1d54-4c53-a4ca-671c12aa3015","name":"Ketzel, Matthias","orcid":"0000-0001-9519-1935","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Ca