"Svendsen, Jesper Hastrup","name_org":"Svendsen, Jesper H","orcid":"0000-0001-8466-8515","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5 4","first":"Lars","key":"køberpau","last":"Køber","locid":"e3f0c57c-605a-431a-9c63-2213c46621e6","name":"Køber, Lars","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Peter","key":"søgaardpau","last":"Søgaard","locid":"30606c01-a86b-4eee-90ef-b4268fedaee9","name":"Søgaard, Peter","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Svend E","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"41577b23-e500-42e1-b7cc-c6600c672fbd","name":"Jensen, Svend Eggert","name_org":"Jensen, Svend E","rank":13,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Christian","key":"torppedersenpau","last":"Torp-Pedersen","locid":"5417d806-0578-4505-b3fe-68ae0359913e","name":"Torp-Pedersen, Christian","rank":14,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Steen M","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"9215b2eb-a8ac-4397-bf06-5696e108f951","name":"Hansen, Steen Møller","name_org":"Hansen, Steen M","orcid":"0000-0002-9421-774X","rank":15,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["31647913"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.amjmed.2019.08.056","issn":["00029343","02105713"],"issn_org":["00029343"],"issue":"5","journal":"American Journal of Medicine","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"American Journal of Medicine","title_org":"The American Journal of Medicine","volume":"133"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85076865324"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-dcd3c159-a2ea-4677-a12d-30c876477bd9","ku-b40e58f2-afd5-4492-91e0-54449f75b191"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Long-Term Prognostic Value of Less Stringent Electrocardiographic Q Waves and Fourth Universal Definition of Myocardial Infarction Q Waves","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-010515","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"In clinical practice and for scientific purposes, cardiologists and primary care physicians perform risk assessment in patients with cardiac diseases or conditions with high risk of developing such. The European Heart Rhythm Association (EHRA), Heart Rhythm Society (HRS), Asia Pacific Heart Rhythm Society (APHRS), and the Latin American Heart Rhythm Society (LAHRS) set down this expert consensus statement task force to summarize the consensus regarding risk assessment in cardiac arrhythmias. Objectives were to raise awareness of using the right risk assessment tool for a given outcome in a given population, and to provide physicians with practical proposals that may lead to rational and evidence-based risk assessment and improvement of patient care in this regard. A large variety of methods are used for risk assessment and choosing the best methods and tools hereof in a given situation is not simple. Even though parameters and test results found associated with increased risk of one outcome (e.g. death) may also be associated with higher risk of other adverse outcomes, specific risk assessment strategies should be used only for the purposes for which they are validated. The work of this task force is summarized in a row of consensus statement tables.","author_count":54,"contributors":["Nielsen, Jens Cosedis","Lin, Yenn Jiang","de Oliveira Figueiredo, Marcio Jansen","Shamloo, Alireza Sepehri","Alfie, Alberto","Boveda, Serge","Dagres, Nikolaos","Di Toro, Dario","Eckhardt, Lee L.","Ellenbogen, Kenneth","Hardy, Carina","Ikeda, Takanori","Jaswal, Aparna","Kaufman, Elizabeth","Krahn, Andrew","Kusano, Kengo","Kutyifa, Valentina","Lim, Han S.","Lip, Gregory Y.H.","Nava-Townsend, Santiago","Pak, Hui Nam","Diez, Gerardo Rodríguez","Sauer, William","Saxena, Anil","Svendsen, Jesper Hastrup","Vanegas, Diego","Vaseghi, Marmar","Wilde, Arthur","Jared Bunch, T.","Buxton, Alfred E.","Calvimontes, Gonzalo","Chao, Tze Fan","Eckardt, Lars","Estner, Heidi","Gillis, Anne M.","Isa, Rodrigo","Kautzner, Josef","Maury, Philippe","Moss, Joshua D.","Nam, Gi Byung","Olshansky, Brian","Pava Molano, Luis Fernando","Pimentel, Mauricio","Prabhu, Mukund","Tzou, Wendy S.","Sommer, Philipp","Swampillai, Janice","Vidal, Alejandro","Deneke, Thomas","Hindricks, Gerhard","Leclercq, Christophe"],"cuid":["S03-092.80-003758"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"51-200 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"continent":["America, Central","America, North","America, South","Asia, East","Asia, South","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","OECD","Oceania"],"corpau":["ESC Scientific Document Group"],"corresponding_author":["Nielsen, Jens Cosedis"],"country":["Argentina","Australia","Brazil","Canada","Chile","Colombia","Czechia","France","Germany","Guatemala","Hungary","India","Japan","Mexico","Netherlands","South Korea","Spain","Taiwan","United Kingdom","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Case Western Reserve University","Clinique Pasteur Toulouse","Fortis Healthcare","Grupo Agbar","Harvard University","Hospital General de Agudos Dr. Cosme Argerich","Hospital Militar Central","Institute for Clinical and Experimental Medicine","Instituto Nacional de Cardiologia Ignacio Chavez","Instituto do Coração do Hospital das Clínicas","Intermountain Medical Center","LMU Klinikum / University Hospital Munich","Leipzig University","Liverpool Heart and Chest Hospital NHS Foundation Trust","McGill University","National Cerebral and Cardiovascular Center","Private practice - Germany (medical)","Semmelweis University","Sree Chitra Tirunal Institute for Medical Sciences and Technology","Toho University","Universidad Nacional de Colombia","Universidad Rafael Landívar","Universidad de Chile","Universidade Estadual de Campinas","Universidade Federal de Sao Paulo","University Hospital of Toulouse","University of Amsterdam","University of British Columbia","University of Calgary","University of California at Berkeley","University of 