","issn":["19490976","19490984"],"issn_org":["19490976"],"issue":"1","journal":"Gut Microbes","pages":"1-14","status":"p","title":"Gut Microbes","volume":"12"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85097120980"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-2ac5c877-3cb2-4f52-8a6f-c2eaac73aaf8"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Personalized B cell response to the Lactobacillus rhamnosus GG probiotic in healthy human subjects : a randomized trial","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-418933","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
