{"abstract":"Background: Anoxic brain injury is the primary cause of death after resuscitation from out-of-hospital cardiac arrest (OHCA) and prognostication is challenging. The aim of this study was to evaluate the potential of two fragments of tau as serum biomarkers for neurological outcome. Methods: Single-center sub-study of 171 patients included in the Target Temperature Management (TTM) Trial randomly assigned to TTM at 33 °C or TTM at 36 °C for 24 h after OHCA. Fragments (tau-A and tau-C) of the neuronal protein tau were measured in serum 24, 48 and 72 h after OHCA. The primary endpoint was neurological outcome. Results: Median (quartile 1 - quartile 3) tau-A (ng/ml) values were 58 (43-71) versus 51 (43-67), 72 (57-84) versus 71 (59-82) and 76 (61-92) versus 75 (64-89) for good versus unfavourable outcome at 24, 48 and 72 h, respectively (pgroup = 0.95). Median tau C (ng/ml) values were 38 (29-50) versus 36 (29-49), 49 (38-58) versus 48 (33-59) and 48 (39-59) versus 48 (36-62) (pgroup = 0.95). Tau-A and tau-C did not predict neurological outcome (area under the receiver-operating curve at 48 h; tau-A: 0.51 and tau-C: 0.51). Conclusions: Serum levels of tau fragments were unable to predict neurological outcome after OHCA.","author_count":13,"contributors":["Grand, Johannes","Kjaergaard, Jesper","Nielsen, Niklas","Friberg, Hans","Cronberg, Tobias","Bro-Jeppesen, John","Karsdal, Morten A","Nielsen, Henning B","Frydland, Martin","Henriksen, Kim","Mattsson, Niklas","Zetterberg, Henrik","Hassager, Christian"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-423465"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Aged","Biomarkers blood","Body Temperature","Cardiopulmonary Resuscitation methods","Female","Humans","Male","Middle Aged","Out of Hospital Cardiac Arrest blood","Peptide Fragments blood","Prognosis","Prospective Studies","ROC Curve","Survival Analysis","Treatment Outcome","tau Proteins blood"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"serum tau fragments as predictors of death or poor neurological outcome after out of hospital cardiac arrest","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/255506644/Serum_tau_fragments_as_predictors_of_death_or_poor_neurological_outcome_after_out_of_hospital_cardiac_arrest_AAM_1.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-423465","identifier":[{"id":"85066632306","type":"scopus"},{"id":"31017476","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-3274641b-3aa9-492d-ae54-19d183a7d80f"],"keyword":["Aged","Biomarkers/blood","Body Temperature","Cardiopulmonary Resuscitation/methods","Female","Humans","Hypoxia, Brain/blood","Male","Middle Aged","Out-of-Hospital Cardiac Arrest/blood","Peptide Fragments/blood","Prognosis","Prospective Studies","ROC Curve","Survival Analysis","Treatment Outcome","tau Proteins/blood"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-4BFC74342DBDE8BF0BD4209E0F6BA999"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/255506644/Serum_tau_fragments_as_predictors_of_death_or_poor_neurological_outcome_after_out_of_hospital_cardiac_arrest_AAM_1.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2019","yearSub":"2019"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Internal medicine: Cardiology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Johannes","key":"grandjohannespau","last":"Grand","name":"Grand, Johannes","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Jesper","key":"kjaergaardjesperpau","last":"Kjaergaard","name":"Kjaergaard, Jesper","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Niklas","key":"nielsenniklaspau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Niklas","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Hans","key":"friberghanspau","last":"Friberg","name":"Friberg, Hans","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Tobias","key":"cronbergtobiaspau","last":"Cronberg","name":"Cronberg, Tobias","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"John","key":"brojeppesenjohnpau","last":"Bro-Jeppesen","name":"Bro-Jeppesen, John","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Morten A","key":"karsdalmortenapau","last":"Karsdal","name":"Karsdal, Morten A","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Henning B","key":"nielsenhenningbpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Henning B","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Martin","key":"frydlandmartinpau","last":"Frydland","name":"Frydland, Martin","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Kim","key":"henriksenkimpau","last":"Henriksen","name":"Henriksen, Kim","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Niklas","key":"mattssonniklaspau","last":"Mattsson","name":"Mattsson, Niklas","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Henrik","key":"zetterberghenrikpau","last":"Zetterberg","name":"Zetterberg, Henrik","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Christian","key":"hassagerchristianpau","last":"Hassager","locid":"49196e5d-0f61-44b2-a6b9-cd6c5f8f3bc2","name":"Hassager, Christian","orcid":"0000-0002-1199-0981","rank":13,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["31017476"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1080/1354750x.2019.1609580","issn":["1354750X","13665804"],"issn_org":["1354750X"],"issue":"6","jou