{"abstract":"This paper discusses the design, analysis and experimental demonstration of a planar transformer for a compact 5 kW isolated dc-dc converter. In the proposed converter, a 200 kHz planar transformer is used with a turnâ™s ratio of 8:1. Analytical evaluation of planar transformer alone becomes more complicated and time consuming. In order to evaluate the performance of such transformer designs, a finite element simulation software is often required. In this paper, COMSOL Multiphysics simulation along with experimental verification are been presented to illustrate the performance of the proposed planar transformer.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Ramachandran, Rakesh","Nymand, Morten","Nielsen, Jesper"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-618764"],"event":{"end":"2019-10-17","place":"Hanoi, vn","start":"2019-10-14","title":"2019 IEEE Vehicle Power and Propulsion Conference, VPPC 2019","year":"2019"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Finite element analysis","High efficiency","Planar transformer"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"design and fe analysis of a planar transformer for a compact 000000000005 kw isolated dc dc converter","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85078730905","version":"Other Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["ACKNOWLEDGMENT The project is supported by the Innovation Fund Denmark under the project Advanced Power Electronic Technology and Tools (APETT)."],"id":"S01-000.00-618764","identifier":[{"id":"85078730905","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["sdu-9f0fa2aa-cb46-4317-be9e-b242e27215da"],"keyword":["Finite Element Analysis","High efficiency","Planar transformer"],"lang":"