{"abstract":"In the version of this article initially published, in the graph keys in Fig. 1i, the colors indicating ‘Ob’ and ‘Ad’ were red and blue, respectively, but should have been blue and red, respectively; the shapes indicating ‘MUS’ and ‘BM’ were a triangle and a square, respectively, but should have been a square and a triangle, respectively. The errors have been corrected in the HTML and PDF versions of the article.","author_count":17,"contributors":["Rauch, Alexander","Haakonsson, Anders Kristian","Madsen, Jesper Grud Skat","Hyldahl, Mette","Forss, Isabel","Madsen, Martin Rønn","Van Hauwaert, Elvira Laila","Wiwie, Christian","Jespersen, Naja Z.","Tencerova, Michaela","Nielsen, Ronni","Larsen, Bjørk Ditlev","Röttger, Richard","Baumbach, Jan","Scheele, Camilla","Kassem, Moustapha","Mandrup, Susanne"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-621995"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Mandrup, Susanne"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"author correction osteogenesis depends on commissioning of a network of stem cell transcription factors that act as repressors of adipogenesis nature genetics 000000002019 000000000051 000000000004 000000000716 000000000727 000000000010 000000001038 s000000041588 000000000019 000000000359 000000000001","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"djc","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85063579223","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-621995","identifier":[{"id":"85063579223","type":"scopus"},{"id":"30911162","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["sdu-aa57800a-9b2d-4a27-8098-4256bcd26570"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["M