{"abstract":"I kapitlet sætter vi lys på de unges overgange, tilblivelsesprocesser og ori­enteringer inden for såvel uddannelse som elitesport, herunder om idrætseleverne i fremtiden vil prioritere sport, uddannelse eller dual career højest.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Nielsen, Jens Christian","Skrubbeltrang, Lotte Stausgaard","Olesen, Jesper Stilling"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-001303"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Dual career","Grundskole","Talentudvikling","Uddannelseskultur","Uddannelsespolitik","Uddannelsesvalg","Vejledning"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum","med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"idrætselevers tilblivelse og transition","src":["aau","au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://unipress.dk/udgivelser/t/talentudvikling-og-elitesport-i-skolen/","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-001303","ids":["aau-19458ff0-bd5c-4e16-a4e5-64c2fd4693eb","au-635cc536-1682-454f-b68a-1982a621efb5"],"keyword":["Grundskole","Uddannelseskultur","Uddannelsespolitik","Vejledning","dual career","idrætselevers karriereovervejelser","overgange elitespoirt og uddannelse","talentudvikling","uddannelsesvalg"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities","Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-2-E4B177616168E2AA6372ED25674BAE14"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, Danish School of Education, Danish School of Education - Educational Psychology, Emdrup"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","u