{"abstract":"I dette kapitel fokuserer vi på idrætseleverne og deres tilblivelsesprocesser, som de ser ud ved afslutningen af 9. klasse, med særlig fokus på, hvordan uddannelse og elitesport indgår i idrætselevernes orienteringer og fremtidsplaner.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Nielsen, Jens Christian","Skrubbeltrang, Lotte Stausgaard","Olesen, Jesper Stilling"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-003310"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Dual career","Elitesport","Grundskole","Overgang fra skole til ungdomsuddannelse","Talent","Talentudvikling","Ungdomsuddannelse"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum","med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"overgangen til ungdomsuddannelse","src":["aau","au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://unipress.dk/udgivelser/t/talentudvikling-og-elitesport-i-skolen/","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-003310","ids":["aau-433f942c-cb2a-46b1-87a8-57b18896a9d2","au-bfa7fcc5-f627-447d-919f-e7979e85e44b"],"keyword":["Grundskole","Overgang fra skole til ungdomsuddannelse","Talent","Talentudvikling","becomming","dual career","elitesport","ungdomsuddannelse"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities","Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-2-CA0E097BD2F6D08757DBC97FFE27A2DF"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, Danish School of Education, Danish School of Education - Educational Psychology, Emdrup"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalbo