{"author_count":5,"contributors":["Sørensen, Jesper"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-193311"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"ekstase og kedsomhed ritualer i menneskets evolution","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-193311","ids":["au-70148803-f554-4348-a6f1-fcc17d078d5b"],"keyword":["ritual, evolution, kognition"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-67D94A3B242F7DFFC3AC6D6FAA5488C4"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, School of Culture and Society, School of Culture and Society - Department of the Study of Religion"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","locid":"6eb687a7-1af7-48c0-bad1-cc9cc0ba3054","name":"Sørensen, Jesper","orcid":"0000-0003-2344-6534","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Trine Kellberg","key":"nielsenpedh","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Trine Kellberg","rank":2,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Casper","key":"andersenpedh","last":"Andersen","name":"Andersen, Casper","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Alexandra R.","key":"kratschmerpedh","last":"Kratschmer","name":"Kratschmer, Alexandra R.","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Mathias","key":"clasenpedh","last":"Clasen","name":"Clasen, Mathias","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"isbn":["978 87 7184 553 12"],"pages":"103-116","place":"Aarhus","publisher":"Aarhus Universitetsforlag","status":"p","subtitle":"Et biokulturelt perspektiv","title":"Menneske, kultur, evolution"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-70148803-f554-4348-a6f1-fcc17d078d5b"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Ekstase og kedsomhed : ritualer i menneskets evolution","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-193311","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"To analyse the potential future ecological state of estuaries located in the temperate climate (here exemplified with the Odense Fjord estuary, Denmark), we combined end-of-the-century climate change projections from four different climate models, four contrasting land use scenarios (“Agriculture for nature” “Extensive agriculture” “High-tech agriculture” and “Market driven agriculture”) and two different eco-hydrological models. By decomposing the variance of the model-simulated output from all scenario and model combinations, we identified the key sources of uncertainties of these future projections. There was generally a decline in the ecological state of the estuary in scenarios with a warmer climate. Strikingly, even the most nature-friendly land use scenario, where a proportion of the intensive agricultural area was converted to forest, may not be enough to counteract the negative effects of a future warmer climate on the ecological state of the estuary. The different land use scenarios were the most significant sources of uncertainty in the projections of future ecological state, followed, in order, by eco-hydrological models and climate models, albeit all three sources caused high variability in the simulated outputs. Therefore, when projecting the future state of aquatic ecosystems in a global warming context, one should at the very least consider to evaluate an ensemble of land use scenarios (nutrient loads) but ideally also include multiple eco-hydrological models and climate change projections. Our study may set precedence for future attempts to predict and quantify uncertainties of model and model input ensembles, as this will likely be key elements in future tools for decision-making processes.","author_count":12,"contributors":["Trolle, Dennis","Nielsen, Anders","Andersen, Hans Estrup","Thodsen, Hans","Olesen, Jørgen E","Børgesen, Christen Duus","Refsgaard, Jens Christian","Sonnenborg, Torben O.","Karlsson, Ida B.","Christensen, Jesper Philip Aagaard","Markager, Stiig","Jeppesen, Erik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-194520"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Nordic"],"country":["Greenland"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Geological Survey of Denmark and Greenland"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"effects of changes in land use and climate on aquatic ecosystems coupling of models and decomposition of uncertainties","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.scitotenv.2018.12.055","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-194520","identifier":[{"id":"85058546476","type":"scopus"},{"id":"30677929","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-7228182f-794b-44a7-8403-5759f5afde23"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-F530F9398F20468CF0304FA6D6BD4F48"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.scitotenv.2018.12.055","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/194201390/1_s2.0_S0048969718348952_main.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2019","yearSub":"2019"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Ecoscience, Department of Ecoscience - Lake Ecology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"gl","key":"geological survey of denmark and greenland","loc":["Greenland","Nordic"],"name":"Geological Survey of Denmark and Greenland","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Dennis","key":"trollepau","last":"Trolle","locid":"c79b9936-b2ff-450b-a5eb-18da45490a51","name":"Trolle, Dennis","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"37195921-910a-4f27-89cd-924affe13591","name":"Nielsen, Anders","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Hans Estrup","key":"andersenpau","last":"Andersen","locid":"368cd58b-96d4-4648-bc00-a9ef227b7d97","name":"Andersen, Hans Estrup","orcid":"0000-0003-2465-583X","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Hans","key":"thodsenpau","last":"Thodsen","locid":"32bff5cf-3478-427f-a25a-edc45f21b300","name":"Thodsen, Hans","orcid":"0000-0002-6542-4934","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jørgen Eivind","key":"olesenpau","last":"Olesen","locid":"d3bcf85c-a32d-4169-8f78-b2bf7fe78102","name":"Olesen, Jørgen E","name_org":"Olesen, Jørgen Eivind","orcid":"0000-0002-6639-1273","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Christen Duus","key":"børgesenpau","last":"Børgesen","locid":"7ef4f29b-fec5-47d1-9733-390ead4e917d","name":"Børgesen, Christen Duus","orcid":"0000-0001-8362-6460","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Jens Christian","key":"refsgaardpau","last":"Refsgaard","name":"Refsgaard, Jens Christian","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Torben O.","key":"sonnenborgpau","last":"Sonnenborg","name":"Sonnenborg, Torben O.","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Ida B.","key":"karlssonpau","last":"Karlsson","name":"Karlsson, Ida B.","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Philip Aagaard","key":"christensenpau","last