{"abstract":"I kapitlet sammenfattes bogens afsøgning af, hvordan idrætsklasserne gennem kombi­nation af eliteidræt og skole er kommet til at udgøre en ny standard for tidlig talentudvikling, hvor idrætselever bliver forberedt på en potentiel dual career. Det afsøger, hvordan det sættes i scene og praktiseres i idrætsklasserne, samt hvilke konsekvenser det har for idrætseleverne som skoleelever og idrætsudøvere.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Stilling Olesen, Jesper","Nielsen, Jens Christian"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-218662"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Dual career","Grundskole","Idrætsklasser","Talent","Talentudvikling","elitesport og folkeskole"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"den nye vej mod eliten","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-218662","ids":["au-9cde6684-a33c-4d12-8ca0-53522fd83cf7"],"keyword":["Grundskole","Talent","dual career","elitesport og folkeskole","idrætsklasser","talentudvikling"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-0926084B2323A37592E5E72AB2034202"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, Danish School of Education, Danish School of Education - Educational Anthropology, Emdrup"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper","key":"stillingolesenpau","last":"Stilling Olesen","locid":"bb840c08-e692-4000-8a96-d541f03bb9f4","name":"Stilling Olesen, Jesper","orcid":"0000-0001-7536-4544","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jens Christian","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"f8fee80e-c33e-467c-9afd-8462e0bf571e","name":"Nielsen, Jens Christian","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Jens Christian","key":"nielsenpedh","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Jens Christian","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Jesper Stilling","key":"olesenpedh","last":"Olesen","name":"Olesen, Jesper Stilling","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"isbn":["978 87 7184 144 2"],"issn":["19042698"],"issue":"18","pages":"229-246","place":"Aarhus","publisher":"Aarhus Universitetsforlag","series":"Asterisk","status":"p","title":"Talentudvikling og elitesport i skolen"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-9cde6684-a33c-4d12-8ca0-53522fd83cf7"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Den nye vej mod eliten","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-218662","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"I dette kapitel ser vi nærmere på unge idrætsudøvere, der tilsynela­dende er særligt succesfulde i deres talentudvikling, og som anses for store talenter inden for deres respektive idrætsgrene. Selvom deres talent nærmest kan forekomme som voksende ud af en naturlig udvikling, er vi interesseret i at undersøge, hvilket netværk af aktører der med­virker til at producere og opretholde disse udøveres talentfuldhed og deres evne til at gøre talent med succes.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Nielsen, Jens Christian","Stilling Olesen, Jesper"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-221661"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Talentgørelse"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"de synlige talenter","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-221661","ids":["au-a2045875-8731-4d8f-98f1-90e60acfa624"],"keyword":["Mialet","distribueret-centreret sub­jekt","distribution af ressource i talentudvikling","talentgørelse"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-AD6118BA072222B809C4865E1CBCC0E9"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, Danish School of Education, Danish School of Education - Educational Psychology, Emdrup"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jens Christian","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"f8fee80e-c33e-467c-9afd-8462e0bf571e","name":"Nielsen, Jens Christian","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first