 Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Nordic Bioscience","Other Companies","Private Research","Universities","University of Copenhagen","proscion"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-1c6a4e61-aac9-4ab5-b381-786dd77efaaa"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Cancer risk in relation to body fat distribution, evaluated by DXA-scans, in postmenopausal women – the Prospective Epidemiological Risk Factor (PERF) study","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-410378","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"Inflammatory signaling is restricted through degradation and the translational repression of cytokine mRNAs. A key factor in this regulation is tristetraprolin (TTP), an RNA-binding protein (RBP) that recruits RNA-destabilizing factors and the translation inhibitory complex 4EHP-GIGYF1/2 to AU-rich element (ARE)-containing mRNAs. Here, we show that the RBP ZNF598 contributes to the same regulatory module in a TTP-like manner. Similar to TTP, ZNF598 harbors three proline-rich motifs that bind the GYF domain of GIGYF1. RNA sequencing experiments showed that ZNF598 is required for the regulation of known TTP targets, including IL-8 and CSF2 mRNA. Furthermore, we demonstrate that ZNF598 binds to IL-8 mRNA, but not TNF mRNA. Collectively, our findings highlight that ZNF598 functions as an RBP that buffers the level of a range of mRNAs. We propose that ZNF598 is a TTP-like factor that can contribute to the regulation of the inflammatory potential of cytokine-producing cells.","author_count":11,"contributors":["Tollenaere, Maxim A X","Tiedje, Christopher","Rasmussen, Simon Horskjær","Nielsen, Julie C","Vind, Anna Constance","Blasius, Melanie","Batth, Tanveer S","Mailand, Niels","Olsen, Jesper V.","Gaestel, Matthias","Bekker-Jensen, Simon"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-416037"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Germany"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Hannover Medical School"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"gigyf000000000001 000000000002 driven cooperation between znf000000000598 and ttp in posttranscriptional regulation of inflammatory signaling","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.celrep.2019.03.006","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-416037","identifier":[{"id":"85062939661","type":"scopus"},{"id":"30917308","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-25d0b71e-69bd-46f9-8e40-897fea362dcc"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-6F1B85A0A8734C39EE164B48B076FADC"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/229013033/1_s2.0_S2211124719303134_main.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.celrep.2019.03.006","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2019","yearSub":"2019"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Cellular and Molecular Medicine, Molecular Aging Program"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"de","key":"hannover medical school","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Hannover Medical School","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Maxim A X","key":"tollenaerepau","last":"Tollenaere","locid":"ba650f40-cf41-4c3e-95e1-55fde12efbe5","name":"Tollenaere, Maxim A X","orcid":"0000-0002-2653-0777","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Christopher","key":"tiedjepau","last":"Tiedje","locid":"9cec9c20-f420-413b-8042-fa8f94f70ff1","name":"Tiedje, Christopher","orcid":"0000-0002-3013-6967","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Simon","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"94a11552-488e-4c24-8ae4-a3af28299a71","name":"Rasmussen, Simon Horskjær","name_org":"Rasmussen, Simon","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Julie C","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"63e6e2ae