wed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85067117894"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","Central Denmark Region","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Miscellaneous","North Denmark Region","Other Hospitals","Other Research","Region Zealand","Region of Southern Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark","frederiksberg heart clinic, frederiksberg, denmark."],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-688da9f8-e190-4525-981b-7ca5006c6407","au-06109428-0aec-4b73-abbb-dec672c515e7","ku-c318ed9e-8316-49c1-9773-96f2fc20e385","sdu-0bfb96a1-6376-43b7-b3e3-3ce9ba702293"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","AU Aarhus University","KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"The impact of implantable cardioverter-defibrillator implantation on health-related quality of life in the DANISH trial","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S04-100.00-005067","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"The understanding of speech from a particular speaker in the presence of other interfering speakers can be severely degraded for a hearing impaired person. Beamforming techniques have been proven to be effective to improve the speech understanding in such scenarios. However, the number of microphones in a hearing aid (HA) is limited due to the space and power constraints present in the HA. In this paper, we propose to use an external device e.g., a microphone array, that can communicate with the HA to overcome this limitation. We propose a method to control this external device based on the look direction of the HA user. We show, by means of simulations, the robustness of the proposed method at very low SNRs in a reverberant scenario. Moreover, we have also conducted experiments that show the benefit of using this framework for binaural and monaural enhancement.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Kavalekalam, Mathew Shaji","Nielsen, Jesper Kjær","Christensen, Mads Græsbøll","Boldt, Jesper"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-114830"],"event":{"acronym":"ICASSP","end":"2019-05-17","place":"Brighton, United Kingdom,","start":"2019-05-12","title":"ICASSP 2019 - 2019 IEEE International Conference on Acoustics, Speech and Signal Processing (ICASSP)","year":"2019"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Autoregressive models","Beamforming","Speech enhancement"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"hearing aid controlled beamformer for binaural speech enhancement using a model based approach","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/323026459/Template.pdf","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-114830","identifier":[{"id":"85068979461","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-dec8a541-d20d-4bdf-b3c1-780def7d1ab6"],"keyword":["Speech enhancement","autoregressive models","beamforming"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-4B8F5A5C934DA600AC8C1C607DC9CA48"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/323026459/Template.pdf","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/323026461/Template.pdf","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2019","yearSub":"2019"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology, Audio Analysis Lab (CREATE)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"other companies","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-OTH","l3nl":"Other Companies","l3nn":"Other Companies","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Companies","namevar":["GN Hearing A/S"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-OTH","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mathew Shaji","key":"kavalekalampau","last":"Kavalekalam","locid":"6082dcd3-6e02-459e-8b51-2ac06555e654","name":"Kavalekalam, Mathew Shaji","orcid":"0000-0003-3124-3008","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesper Kjær","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"3d21c73c-3aa1-4590-870f-8be578634702","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Kjær","orcid":"0000-0002-2586-7925","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mads Græsbøll","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"cf9e922d-e5f8-4964-9b84-581667f97b0b","name":"Christensen, Mads Græsbøll","orcid":"0000-0003-3586-7969","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesper","key":"boldtpau","last":"Boldt","name":"Boldt, Jesper","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/icassp.2019.8683662","eisbn":["9781479981311"],"issn":["15206149"],"pages":"321-325","publisher":"IEEE (Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers)","series":"IEEE International Conference on Acoustics, Speech and Signal Processing. Proceedings","status":"p","title":"2019 IEEE International Conference on Acoustics, Speech and Signal Processing (ICASSP)"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85068979461"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Private Research","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Other Companies","Private Research","Universities","gn hearing a/s"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-dec8a541-d20d-4bdf-b3c1-780def7d1ab6"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Hearing aid-controlled beamformer for binaural speech enhancement using a model-based approach","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-114830","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"Sound zone systems have actively been developed for more than two decades. Building on this, we explore four different interaction design approaches for domestic sound zone systems: Tangible representation, light projection, familiar objects, and handhelds. These four approaches were conceived through a scenario-based workshop with HCI and IS experts responding to the functional challenges, opportunities, and requirements of interactive sound zones. The work presented in this paper contributes to development of interaction design for sound zone systems which is an essential parallel to the technical development.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Johansen, Stine Schmieg","Nielsen, Peter Axel","Kjeldskov, Jesper"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-117782"],"event":{"acronym":"Audiomostly","end":"2019-09-20","place":"Nottingham, gb","start":"2019-09-18","title":"Audio Mostly","year":"2019"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Interaction design","Sketching","Sound zones"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"interaction design for domestic sound zones","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://delivery.acm.org/10.1145/3360000/3356630/p248-Lundgaard.pdf?ip=130.225.198.202&id=3356630&acc=ACTIVE%20SERVICE&key=36332CD97FA87885%2E1DDFD8390336D738%2E249F1060D00930D5%2E4D4702B0C3E38B35&__acm__=1576139867_8bdf979b0d864158a95a8c8a4055caf9","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-117782","identifier":[{"id":"85076733793","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-e8fbcdbf-1adc-43ad-a91e-378d6ce5ba5a"],"keyword":["Interaction Design","Sketching","Sound Zones"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-