"Astrid","key":"mandersgrootpau","last":"Manders-Groot","name":"Manders-Groot, Astrid","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Ole","key":"raaschounielsenpau","last":"Raaschou-Nielsen","name":"Raaschou-Nielsen, Ole","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Non-Profit Organisations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-NP","DI-NP-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Non-Profit Organisations","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-1d53ad96-7869-4406-b2fd-dd860e6dfdcf"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Modelling ultrafine particle concentrations : implementation of the M7 aerosol module in the Danish Eulerian Hemispheric Model (DEHM)","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-146115","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"Talentudvikling i Danmark forandrer sig altså i disse år. Den sæt­ter tidligere ind, og den foregår i samspil med folkeskolen på den præmis, at talentudvikling skal foregå på en samfundsmæssig for­svarlig måde ved at blive kombineret med uddannelse. I bogen har vi derfor fokus på idrætseleven som en ny kategori i grænselandet mellem eliteidræt og skole. Vi undersøger, hvordan kategorien er opstået, og hvad de unge atleter/elever, der optages i en idrætsklasse, skal gøre for at kvalificere sig til den hybride betegnelse idrætselev, og hvilke forventninger og forpligtelser der bliver rejst til idrætsele­verne gennem samarbejde mellem en række forskellige aktører, som fx skole, klub, kommune og elitekoordinator.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Nielsen, Jens Christian","Stilling Olesen, Jesper"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-151366"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Elitesport","Folkeskole","Idrætsklasser","Talentudvikling"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"talentudvikling under forandring","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-151366","ids":["au-2655e820-2ed3-4217-aa9c-1e6a485c8cc4"],"keyword":["Forandringer forholdet mellem elitesport og uddannelse","Talentudvikling","elitesport","folkeskole","idrætsklasser"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-B7B79015DA94CB49F852DB6DF1C2E782"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, Danish School of Education, Danish School of Education - Educational Psychology, Emdrup"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jens Christian","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"f8fee80e-c33e-467c-9afd-8462e0bf571e","name":"Nielsen, Jens Christian","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper","key":"stillingolesenpau","last":"Stilling Olesen","locid":"bb840c08-e692-4000-8a96-d541f03bb9f4","name":"Stilling Olesen, Jesper","orcid":"0000-0001-7536-4544","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Jesper Stilling","key":"olesenpedh","last":"Olesen","name":"Olesen, Jesper Stilling","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Jens Christian","key":"nielsenpedh","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Jens Christian","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"isbn":["978 87 7184 144 2"],"issn":["19042698"],"issue":"18","pages":"9-16","place":"Aarhus","publisher":"Aarhus Universitetsforlag","series":"Asterisk","status":"p","title":"Talentudvikling og elitesport i skolen"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-2655e820-2ed3-4217-aa9c-1e6a485c8cc4"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Talentudvikling under forandring","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-151366","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"Objective: Age is the most important risk factor for osteoarthritis (OA). It is suggested that changes in subchondral bone and calcified cartilage may occur in early OA. Therefore, the aim was to investigate age-related changes in the femoral head composition. We hypothesise that the thickness of the subchondral bone plate decreases with age, while the thickness of the calcified cartilage increases with age as seen in early-stage OA. Methods: Femoral heads from 29 women (20–74 years) and 32 men (23–78 years), who had died suddenly and unexpectedly, were obtained at autopsy. Individuals with bone or joint diseases or macroscopic abnormal cartilage were excluded. Using design-based stereology, femoral head volume as well as thickness and volume of the calcified cartilage and subchondral bone plate were estimated and correlated to sex and age. Results: The thickness and volume of the subchondral bone plate were not correlated with age. Calcified cartilage thickness and volume correlated positively with age in women, while the femoral head volume was correlated positively with age in men. Conclusion: In human femoral heads obtained from a cross-sectional population without macroscopic OA changes, the thickness of the subchondral bone plate did not change with age, which differs from the thinning seen in early OA. Surprisingly, the age-related changes of the volume and thickness of the calcified cartilage and of the volume of the femoral head were different for women and men. This indicate that cartilage and bone metabolism is sex-specific, which may influence ageing of the hip joint.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Nielsen, Andreas Wiggers","Klose-Jensen, Rasmus","Hartlev, Louise Brøndt","Boel, Lene Warner Thorup","Thomsen, Jesper Skovhus","Keller, Kresten Krarup","Hauge, Ellen Margrethe"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-227068"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Nielsen