{"abstract":"Purpose: After resuscitation from out-of-hospital cardiac arrest (OHCA), renal injury and hemodynamic instability are common. We aimed to assess the association between low cardiac output during targeted temperature management (TTM) and acute kidney injury (AKI) after OHCA. Materials and methods: Single-center substudy of 171 patients included in the prospective, randomized TTM-trial. Hemodynamic evaluation was performed with serial measurements by pulmonary artery catheter. AKI was the primary endpoint and was defined according to the KDIGO-criteria. Results: Of 152 patients with available hemodynamic data, 49 (32%) had AKI and 21 (14%) had AKI with need for renal replacement therapy (RRT) in the first three days. During targeted temperature management, patients with AKI had higher heart rate (11 beats/min, pgroup < 0.0001), higher mean arterial pressure (MAP) (4 mmHg, pgroup = 0.001) and higher lactate (1 mmol/L, pgroup < 0.0001) compared to patients without AKI. However, there was no difference in cardiac index (pgroup = 0.25). In a multivariate logistic regression model, adjusting for potential confounders, MAP (p = .03), heart rate (p = .01) and lactate (p = .006), but not cardiac output, were independently associated with AKI. Conclusions: Blood pressure, heart rate and lactate, but not cardiac output, during 24 h of TTM were associated with AKI in comatose OHCA-patients.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Grand, Johannes","Bro-Jeppesen, John","Hassager, Christian","Rundgren, M.","Winther-Jensen, Matilde","Thomsen, Jakob Hartvig","Nielsen, Niklas","Wanscher, Michael","Kjærgaard, Jesper"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-523704"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Sweden"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Department of Anesthesia and Intensive Care","Lund University"],"keyword":["Acute kidney injury","Cardiac Output","Cardiac arrest","Dialysis","Hemodynamic","Post cardiac arrest syndrome"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"cardiac output during targeted temperature management and renal function after out of hospital cardiac arrest","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85069645527&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-523704","identifier":[{"id":"31362189","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85069645527","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-da1f99f5-fa1d-4244-8b10-350bbc82dd6a"],"keyword":["Acute kidney injury","Cardiac arrest","Cardiac output","Dialysis","Hemodynamic","Post cardiac arrest syndrome"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-03FD584BCD76A4541872528C09209DB4"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2019","yearSub":"2019"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital - Rigshospitalet"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Internal medicine: Cardiology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"se","key":"lund university","loc":["Sweden","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Lund University","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"se","key":"department of anesthesia and intensive care","loc":["Sweden","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Department of Anesthesia and Intensive Care","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Johannes","key":"grandpau","last":"Grand","name":"Grand, Johannes","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"John","key":"brojeppesenpau","last":"Bro-Jeppesen","name":"Bro-Jeppesen, John","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Christian","key":"hassagerpau","last":"Hassager","locid":"49196e5d-0f61-44b2-a6b9-cd6c5f8f3bc2","name":"Hassager, Christian","orcid":"0000-0002-1199-0981","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","first":"M.","key":"rundgrenpau","last":"Rundgren","name":"Rundgren, M.","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Matilde","key":"wintherjensenpau","last":"Winther-Jensen","name":"Winther-Jensen, Matilde","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Jakob Hartvig","key":"thomsenpau","last":"Thomsen","name":"Thomsen, Jakob Hartvig","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","first":"Niklas","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Niklas","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Michael","key":"wanscherpau","last":"Wanscher","name":"Wanscher, Michael","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Jesper","key":"kjærgaardpau","last":"Kjærgaard","name":"Kjærgaard, Jesper","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["31362189"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.jcrc.2019.07.013","issn":["08839441","15578615"],"issn_org":["08839441"],"journal":"Journal of Critical Care","pages":"65-73","status":"p","title":"Journal of Critical Care","volume":"54"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85069645527"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-da1f99f5-fa1d-4244-8b10-350bbc82dd6a"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Cardiac output during targeted temperature management and renal function after out-of-hospital cardiac arrest","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-523704","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"BACKGROUND: Of the 108 Schizophrenia (SZ) risk-loci discovered through genome-wide association studies (GWAS), 96 are not altering the sequence of any protein. Evidence linking non-coding risk-SNPs and genes may be established using expression quantitative trait loci (eQTL). However, other approaches such allelic expression quantitative trait loci (aeQTL) also may be of use. METHODS: We applied both the eQTL and aeQTL analysis to a biobank of deeply sequenced RNA from 680 dorso-lateral pre-frontal cortex (DLPFC) samples. For each of 340 genes proximal to the SZ risk-SNPs, we asked how much SNP-genotype affected total expression (eQTL), as well as how much the expression ratio between the two alleles differed from 1:1 as a consequence of the risk-SNP genotype (aeQTL). RESULTS: We analyzed overlap with comparable eQTL-findings: 16 of the 30 risk-SNPs known to have gene-level eQTL also had gene-level aeQTL effects. 6 of 21 risk-SNPs with known splice-eQTL had exon-aeQTL effects. 12 novel potential risk genes were identified with the aeQTL approach, while 55 tested SNP-pairs were found as eQTL but not aeQTL. Of the tested 108 loci we could find at least one gene to be associated with 21 of the risk-SNPs using gene-level aeQTL, and with an additional 18 risk-SNPs using exon-level aeQTL. CONCLUSION: Our results suggest that the aeQTL strategy complements the eQTL approach to susceptibility gene identification.","author_count":14,"contributors":["Gådin, Jesper R","Buil, Alfonso","Colantuoni, Carlo","Jaffe, Andrew E","Nielsen, Jacob","Shin, Joo-Heon","Hyde, Thomas M","Kleinman, Joel E","Plath, Niels","Eriksson, Per","Brunak, Søren","Didriksen, Michael","Weinberger, Daniel R","Folkersen, Lasse"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-524946"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corpau":["BrainSeq Consortium"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"comparison of quantitative trait loci methods total expression and allelic imbalance method in brain rna seq","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0217765","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-524946","identifier":[{"id":"31206532","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC6576752","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"85067275727","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-dc2d27bb-8dbc-46e3-95c0-54eb9b4288c9"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-4582EDDB3A21FDA1A1D039AB7BF85202"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0217765","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/224026237/journal.pone.0217765.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2019","yearSub":"2019"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Novo Nordisk Foundation Center for Protein Research, CPR publication list","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Novo Nordisk Foundation Center for Protein Research, Disease Systems Biology Program"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":2,"key":"brainseq consortium","name":"BrainSeq Consortium","role":"oau"}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Jesper R","key":"gådinpau","last":"Gådin","name":"Gådin, Jesper R","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Alfonso","key":"builpau","last":"Buil","name":"Buil, Alfonso","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Carlo","key":"colantuonipau","last":"Colantuoni","name":"Colantuoni, Carlo","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Andrew E","key":"jaffepau","last":"Jaffe","name":"Jaffe, Andrew E","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Jacob","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Jacob","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Joo-Heon","key":"shinpau","last":"Shin","name":"Shin, Joo-Heon","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Thomas M","key":"hydepau","last":"Hyde","name":"Hyde, Thomas M","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Joel E","key":"kleinmanpau","last":"Kleinman","name":"Kleinman, Joel E","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Niels","key":"plathpau","last":"Plath","name":"Plath, Niels","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Per","key":"erikssonpau","last":"Eriksson","name":"Eriksson, Per","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Søren","key":"brunakpau","last":"Brunak","locid":"9398f2a1-bef5-4491-9b57-083e6758eac2","name":"Brunak, Søren","orcid":"0000-0003-0316-5866","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Michael","key":"didriksenpau","last":"Didriksen","name":"Didriksen, Michael","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Daniel R","key":"weinbergerpau","last":"Weinberger","name":"Weinberger, Daniel R","rank":13,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Lasse","key":"folkersenpau","last":"Folkersen","name":"Folkersen, Lasse","rank":14,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["31206532"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1371/journal.pone.0217765","issn":["19326203"],"issue":"6","journal":"PLOS ONE","paperid":"e0217765","status":"p","title":"PLOS ONE","title_org":"PLoS ONE","volume":"14"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85067275727"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-dc2d27bb-8dbc-46e3-95c0-54eb9b4288c9"]