ng Concerns in Telecare : Three Concepts to Guide the Design of Patient-Centred E-Health","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-394879","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
