ate Research","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark","clinical microbiomics","clinical microbiomics a/s","clinical-microbiomics a/s (biz)"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-768564b7-f553-46bd-b641-c18491719897","ku-32f6a287-6b33-4713-9058-05a50fee0140","sdu-5267237b-720c-48b2-9173-3bf41ccd6eb3"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark","KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"A low-gluten diet induces changes in the intestinal microbiome of healthy Danish adults","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S03-099.74-035308","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"Pitch estimation is an important task in speech and audio analysis. In this paper, we present a multi-pitch estimation algorithm based on block sparse Bayesian learning and intra-block clustering for speech analysis. A statistical hierarchical model is formulated based on a pitch dictionary with a fixed maximum number of harmonics for all the candidate pitches. Block sparse Bayesian learning is proposed for estimating the complex amplitudes. To deal with the problem of unknown harmonic orders and subharmonic errors, intra-block clustering structured sparsity prior is also introduced. The statis- tical update formulas are obtained by the variational Bayesian in- ference. Compared with the conventional group LASSO-type algo- rithms for multi-pitch estimation, experimental results indicate ro- bustness against noise and improved estimation accuracy of the pro- posed method.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Shi, Liming","Jensen, Jesper Rindom","Nielsen, Jesper Kjær","Christensen, Mads Græsbøll"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-062910"],"event":{"acronym":"ICASSP","end":"2018-04-20","place":"Calgary, ca","start":"2018-04-15","title":"2018 IEEE International Conference on Acoustics, Speech and Signal Processing (ICASSP)","year":"2018"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"multipitch estimation using block sparse bayesian learning and intra block clustering","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-062910","identifier":[{"id":"85054236899","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-2c5fc3ea-7c9b-40c3-97a4-9d6f91ded0e6"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-8766D1B24638A7EB3E49AE695D0CDA53"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology, Audio Analysis Lab (CREATE)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology, Section for Media Technology - Campus Aalborg"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Liming","key":"shipau","last":"Shi","locid":"e44b1378-1291-46be-b76a-fd0e196e2d46","name":"Shi, Liming","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Rindom","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"af897213-5e0d-41e9-8e3c-a89d3ca4a5b1","name":"Jensen, Jesper Rindom","orcid":"0000-0001-6023-8270","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Kjær","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"3d21c73c-3aa1-4590-870f-8be578634702","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Kjær","orcid":"0000-0002-2586-7925","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mads Græsbøll","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"cf9e922d-e5f8-4964-9b84-581667f97b0b","name":"Christensen, Mads Græsbøll","orcid":"0000-0003-3586-7969","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/icassp.2018.8462300","eisbn":["9781538646588"],"isbn":["9781538646571","9781538646595"],"issn":["15206149"],"pages":"666-670","place":"Calgary, Canada","publisher":"IEEE (Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers)","series":"IEEE International Conference on Acoustics, Speech and Signal Processing. Proceedings","status":"p","title":"2018 IEEE International Conference on Acoustics, Speech and Signal Processing (ICASSP)"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85054236899"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-2c5fc3ea-7c9b-40c3-97a4-9d6f91ded0e6"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Multipitch Estimation Using Block Sparse Bayesian Learning and Intra-block Clustering","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-062910","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"Efter mange års tab af industriarbejdspladser giver Industri 4.0, herunder digitalisering, automation og robotter, nyt håb for produktionsindustrien på dansk grund. Men de nye muligheder kræver en omfattende omstilling af det danske uddannelsessystem, hvis de skal udmønte sig i arbejdspladser. Efter mange års tab af industriarbejdspladser giver Industri 4.0, herunder digitalisering, automation og robotter, nyt håb for produktionsindustrien på dansk grund. Men de nye muligheder kræver en omfattende omstilling af det danske uddannelsessystem, hvis de skal udmønte sig i arbejdspladser. Det fremgår af rapporten ”Uddannelser til fremtidens vidensbaserede produktion, som fremsætter en række anbefalinger til, hvad forskellige aktører bør tage fat på for at sætte gang i omstillingen. Teknologiudviklingen udfordrer de nuværende arbejdsgange og processer i virksomhederne. I fremtiden vil der være brug for medarbejdere, som på baggrund af en dyb faglighed kan samarbejde på tværs af uddannelsesniveau og faglighed. Det gælder, uanset om man er faglært eller civilingeniør. ATV-rapporten anbefaler uddannelsessamarbejder på tværs af virksomheder, universiteter og de teknisk-faglige uddannelser. Det vil kræve en kulturændring på uddannelserne og i virksomhederne, og ATV-rapporten peger på fire barrierer, som skal overvindes: Rammevilkår: Omfang og krav i uddannelsesbekendtgørelser og studieordninger bør reduceres for at skabe større fleksibilitet. Kulturelle forskelle: Det er vigtigt at indtænke de forskellige indgangsvinkler, undervisere og studerende har på forskellige uddannelsesretninger. Ledelsens opbakning og prioritering: Der skal afsættes tid og ressourcer for at udvikle og gennemføre relevante uddannelsessamarbejder. Praktiske forhold: Kommunikation, geografi og logistik kan spænde ben for ellers gode initiativer.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Grenaa, Jesper","Nielsen, Eskild Holm","Wæhrens, Brian Vejrum","Rasmussen, Christian"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-081905"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["ATV, Akademiet for de Tekniske Videnskaber"],"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-GFS"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-GFS","DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"uddannelser til fremtidens vidensbaserede produktion","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/287583410/Rapport_ATV_Uddannelser_til_fremtidens_vidensbaseredeproduktion_september_2018_opslag.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-081905","ids":["aau-6d8bb737-e022-41a8-8db9-f1ddf5456dec"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-E0D09298253CCF90F698CCD1A7FFAD98"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/287583410/Rapport_ATV_Uddannelser_til_fremtidens_vidensbaseredeproduktion_september_2018_opslag.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["ATV, Akademiet for de Tekniske Videnskaber"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"grundfos","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-GFS","l3nl":"Grundfos","l3nn":"Grundfos","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Grundfos","namevar":["Grundfos DK AS"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-GFS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesper","key":"grenaapau","last":"Grenaa","name":"Grenaa, Jesper","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Eskild Holm","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"8b57ba21-67e6-45a2-b61d-18cb7d753bd6","name":"Nielsen, Eskild Holm","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Brian Vejrum","key":"wæhrenspau","last":"Wæhrens","locid":"b4ed4be4-3e26-4121-904a-bacd1ef30da1","name":"Wæhrens, Brian Vejrum","orcid":"0000-0001-6140-5587","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Christian","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","name":"Rasmussen, Christian","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"32","publisher":"Akademiet for de Tekniske Videnskaber","status":"p"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Private Research","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Grundfos","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Private Research","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-6d8bb737-e022-41a8-8db9-f1ddf5456dec"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Uddannelser til fremtidens vidensbaserede produktion","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-081905","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"Purpose: The purpose of this paper is to investigate how entrepreneurs market their business opportunities towards business angels in the investment process. This is achieved by introducing the business model canvas as a mitigating framework to help entrepreneurs in communicating and structuring the information desired by business angels. Design/methodology/approach: This paper mobilises a case study approach by following a series of investment processes and investment meetings between entrepreneurs and business angels through 27 semi-structured interviews as well as participant observation and qualitative participant feedback from 13 investment processes. Findings: The findings illustrate how introducing a framework like the business model canvas helps alleviate the informational and communication challenges between entrepreneurs and business angels. However, some problems occurred when the entrepreneurs and the business angels did not fully agree on the value proposition of the investment opportunity. Research limitations/implications: The findings show that entrepreneurs who market their business cases to investors obtain better feedback and a higher chance of funding using the business model canvas. Implications of this paper also relate to the preparation of the entrepreneurs and that matchmakers between entrepreneurs and investors can use the business model canvas to facilitate such processes. Originality/value: This paper contributes to both the theory of the investment process as well as the application of the business model canvas.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Sort, Jesper Chrautwald","Nielsen, Christian"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-085510"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Business model canvas","Business pitch","Entrepreneurs"],"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"using the business model canvas to improve investment processes","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/311111263/Accepted_author_manuscript_Jesper_Sort.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-085510","identifier":[{"id":"85044300422","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-7a0ec756-9d04-419b-b462-8cd9d0f119f4"],"keyword":["Business angels","Business model canvas","Business pitch","Entrepreneurs","Investment process"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-0C5AD338AE7FC4DA95254BDFAC7C0EDC"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/311111263/Accepted_author_manuscript_Jesper_Sort.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Social Science (SOC)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Aalborg University Business School, Business Design Center","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences, Department of Business and Management","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences, Department of Business and Management, Management Accounting and Control, MAC"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Chrautwald","key":"sortpau","last":"Sort","locid":"11418beb-d40c-40bf-af69-55b47598cc45","name":"Sort, Jesper Chrautwald","orcid":"0000-0003-0468-6209","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Christian","key"