{"abstract":"Controlling the sound field in a room with loud- speakers, requires information about how each loudspeaker radiates sound to the regions of interest. This information can be estimated by in-situ measurements of the transfer functions. However, noise in the estimates can severely deteriorate how well the sound field is controlled. Accurate transfer functions are especially important for sound zones, which rely on destructive interference between multiple loudspeakers. In the presented study, transfer function measurements from eight 10” woofers were repeated 30 times in a room. Pressure matching was used to create sound zones between 20-300 Hz. The performance is evaluated for individual and averaged transfer function measure- ments. Additionally, the effect of Tikhonov regularization based on the estimated noise in the transfer functions is examined.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Møller, Martin Bo","Nielsen, Jesper Kjær","Fernandez Grande, Efren","Olesen, Søren Krarup"],"cuid":["S02-084.48-003569"],"event":{"end":"2018-07-11","place":"Sheffield, gb","start":"2018-07-08","title":"2018 IEEE 10th Sensor Array and Multichannel Signal Processing Workshop (SAM)","year":"2018"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Sound field control","Sound zones"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-BOO"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-BOO","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"on the influence of transfer function noise on low frequency pressure matching for sound zones","src":["aau","dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/153994743/2018_05_19_SAM_paper_Final_Submission_Martin_Jesper_Efren_Soeren.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S02-084.48-003569","identifier":[{"id":"85053612526","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-495e834d-5b27-4fc1-a321-a79f8df8a985","dtu-9caadeff-5ca1-4a4b-9411-1814e43dfb28"],"keyword":["Sound Field Control","Sound Zones"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-F97F9806D6F124F32BAFE1E4690C2F3A"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/295532291/2018_05_19_SAM_paper_Final_Submission_Martin_Jesper_Efren_Soeren.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/153994743/2018_05_19_SAM_paper_Final_Submission_Martin_Jesper_Efren_Soeren.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"bang olufsen","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-BOO","l3nl":"Bang & Olufsen","l3nn":"Bang & Olufsen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Bang & Olufsen","namevar":["Bang & Olufsen A/S"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-BOO","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology, Audio Analysis Lab (CREATE)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology, Section for Media Technology - Campus Aalborg"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Electrical Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Electrical Engineering, Acoustic Technology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Martin Bo","key":"møllerpau","last":"Møller","name":"Møller, Martin Bo","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Martin","key":"bomollerpau","last":"Bo Moller","name":"Bo Moller, Martin","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesper Kjær","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"3d21c73c-3aa1-4590-870f-8be578634702","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Kjær","orcid":"0000-0002-2586-7925","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Efren","key":"fernandezgrandepau","last":"Fernandez Grande","locid":"f3251df1-9730-455a-9a5d-97e2a6128e79","name":"Fernandez Grande, Efren","orcid":"0000-0002-8900-183X","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Søren Krarup","key":"olesenpau","last":"Olesen","locid":"215999a6-bbe8-4d92-acb8-0b35df2e6492","name":"Olesen, Søren Krarup","orcid":"0000-0002-7950-0926","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/sam.2018.8448689","eisbn":["9781538647523"],"isbn":["9781538647523"],"issn":["15512282"],"pages":"331-335","publisher":"IEEE (Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers)","series":"IEEE Workshop on Sensor Array and Multichannel Signal Processing","status":"p","title":"2018 IEEE 10th Sensor Array and Multichannel Signal Processing Workshop, SAM 2018","volume":"2018-July"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85053612526"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Private Research","A