rhus University","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Local bone loss in patients with anti-citrullinated peptide antibody and arthralgia, evaluated with high-resolution peripheral quantitative computed tomography","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-015935","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"OBJECTIVE: We investigated the health-related effect of systematic medication review performed by a clinical pharmacist and a clinical pharmacologist on nonelective elderly orthopedic patients. METHODS: This is a nonblinded randomized controlled study of 108 patients 65 years or older treated with at least 4 drugs. For the intervention, the clinical pharmacist reviewed the participants' medication after completion of the usual medication routine. Information was collected from medical charts, interviews with participants, and database registrations of drug purchase. Results were conferred with the clinical pharmacologist, and recommendations were delivered directly to the ward physicians. The control was usual medication routine, that is, physicians prescribing admitting orders. The primary outcome was time to the first unplanned contact to a physician after discharge (i.e., general practitioner, emergency department visit, or readmission) during 3-month follow-up. Secondary outcomes included other health-related outcomes, for example, length of in-hospital stay, mortality, and quality of life. RESULTS: Time to the first unplanned contact to a physician was 14.9 days (95% confidence interval, 8.9-21.0) in the intervention group compared with 27.3 days (95% confidence interval, 18.9-35.7) in the controls (P = 0.05). Overall, no statistically significant differences were seen in the secondary outcomes apart from \"number of\" and \"time to first\" emergency department visits, which were in favor of the intervention group. A marked hesitation of the ward physicians to comply with recommendations was noted (18%). CONCLUSIONS: The study showed that the patients receiving usual care had a significantly longer time to the first unplanned contact to a physician after discharge; however, the fact that less than 1 of 5 recommendations was adopted by the physicians raises concerns as to whether this finding could be attributable to the intervention.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Lisby, Marianne","Bonnerup, Dorthe Krogsgaard","Brock, Birgitte","Gregersen, Pernille Axelsen","Jensen, Jørn","Larsen, Maren-Lis","Rungby, Jørgen","Sonne, Jesper","Mainz, Jan","Nielsen, Lars Peter"],"cuid":["S03-096.30-004889"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"keyword":["Clinical pharmacist","Health related outcomes","Medication review","Randomized controlled study"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"medication review and patient outcomes in an orthopedic department a randomized controlled study","src":["aau","au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://journals.lww.com/journalpatientsafety/Abstract/publishahead/Medication_Review_and_Patient_Outcomes_in_an.99694.aspx","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S03-096.30-004889","identifier":[{"id":"85048013776","type":"scopus"},{"id":"25742062","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["aau-650da506-5fd4-4d79-aa00-a722aa0d02fd","au-0add0178-1abe-4a1e-bb92-beecf7a17b58","ku-4debf979-0b56-45ae-b9a0-fb815020187c"],"keyword":["clinical pharmacist","clinical pharmacologist","health-related outcomes","medication review","randomized controlled study"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-3-7-5D33FD4C36136C0A036EC87BBC5F3413"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Research Center for Emergency Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Psychiatry"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Marianne","key":"lisbypau","last":"Lisby","locid":"004570c3-e576-458e-84ff-466464d151c3","name":"Lisby, Marianne","orcid":"0000-0002-9434-0967","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Dorthe Krogsgaard","key":"bonneruppau","last":"Bonnerup","locid":"03f369c9-930a-45d3-ae10-de344ec2c252","name":"Bonnerup, Dorthe Krogsgaard","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Birgitte","key":"brockpau","last":"Brock","locid":"4d67596e-ceda-46f3-9fb4-5c0185e90911","name":"Brock, Birgitte","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Pernille Axelsen","key":"gregersenpau","last":"Gregersen","locid":"73286701-35d3-47c5-a23f-66cca4aaceef","name":"Gregersen, Pernille A","name_org":"Gregersen, Pernille Axelsen","orcid":"0000-0003-3424-0590","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Jørn","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","name":"Jensen, Jørn","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Maren-Lis","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, Maren-Lis","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Joergen","key":"rungbypau","last":"Rungby","locid":"cdb1562f-9a3a-492f-a02b-10df1c6adfcf","name":"Rungby, Jørgen","name_org":"Rungby, Joergen","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Jesper","key":"sonnepau","last":"Sonne","locid":"ec3eb8f8-e255-430e-a97a-984085abf098","name":"Sonne, Jesper","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jan","key":"mainzpau","last":"Mainz","locid":"fadbea42-81be-48a2-afb2-c868f9dfa4f5","name":"Mainz, Jan","orcid":"0000-0003-0242-9233","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lars Peter","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"0b084919-d92a-46d0-a432-e3f631b4da16","name":"Nielsen, Lars Peter","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["25742062"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1097/pts.0000000000000173","issn":["15498417","15498425"],"issn_org":["15498417"],"issue":"2","journal":"Journal of Patient Safety","pages":"74-81","publisher":"Lippincott Williams and Wilkins Ltd.","status":"p","title":"Journal of Patient Safety","volume":"14"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85048013776"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-650da506-5fd4-4d79-aa00-a722aa0d02fd","au-0add0178-1abe-4a1e-bb92-beecf7a17b58","ku-4debf979-0b56-45ae-b9a0-fb815020187c"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","AU Aarhus University","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Medication Review and Patient Outcomes in an Orthopedic Department : A Randomized Controlled Study","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S03-096.30-004889","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"Generalized sampling is a mathematical technique for obtaining approximations of signals with respect to different representations in a numerically stable manner. This can for example be relevant in processing MRI images, where hardware often enforces initial frequency measurements, but where a wavelet basis may be better suited for representing the image. Recently the theory of generalized sampling was extended to work with arbitrary patterns in R d. In this article we investigate how the choice of the probability distribution generating random sampling schemes in R 2 affects the numerical stability of generalized sampling.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Jacobsen, Christian Robert Dahl","Møller, Jesper","Nielsen, Morten","Rasmussen, Morten Grud"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-055251"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"investigations of the effects of random sampling schemes on the stability of generalized sampling","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-055251","identifier":[{"id":"85031109217","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-11d150d1-8bd0-454c-a99f-48b412937442"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-8C95602B70C603933D93DBE68D0081F3"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Mathematical Sciences","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Mathematical Sciences, Applied Mathematical Analysis"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Christian Robert Dahl","key":"jacobsenpau","last":"Jacobsen","locid":"dc147d98-2452-4521-8d04-3efc3192ce60","name":"Jacobsen, Christian Robert Dahl","orcid":"0000-0003-4281-2624","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper","key":"møllerpau","last":"Møller","locid":"f4a41894-3666-409d-9242-1e37dc10e906","name":"Møller, Jesper","orcid":"0000-0002-0008-6890","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Morten","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"a2d4eb0d-db4a-4f25-924a-4a830da62f9f","name":"Nielsen, Morten","orcid":"0000-0002-9078-0594","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Morten Grud","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"4831f00e-40eb-436b-a17d-8f993e2d4cf5","name":"Rasmussen, Morten Grud","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.acha.2017.09.004","issn":["10635203","1096603X"],"issn_org":["10635203"],"issue":"2","journal":"Applied and Computational Harmonic Analysis","pages":"453-461","publisher":"Academic Press","status":"p","title":"Applied and Computational Harmonic Analysis","volume":"45"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85031109217"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-11d150d1-8bd0-454c-a99f-48b412937442"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Investigations of the effects of random sampling schemes on the stability of generalized sampling","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-055251","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"OBJECTIVE: To ascertain whether persons treated with statins experience a decreased risk of community-acquired Staphylococcus aureus bacteremia (CA-SAB) as compared with nonusers. PATIENTS AND METHODS: Using population-based medical registries, we conducted a case-control study including all adults with first-time CA-SAB and population controls matched on age, sex, and residence in Northern Denmark from January 1, 2000, through December 31, 2011. Statin users were categorized as current users (new or long-term use), former users, and nonusers. We used conditional logistic regression to compute odds ratios (ORs) for CA-SAB according to statin exposure, overall and stratified by intensity (<20, 20-39, ≥40 mg/d) and duration of use (<365, 365-1094, ≥1095 days). RESULTS: We identified 2638 patients with first-time CA-SAB and 26,379 matched population controls. Compared with nonusers, current statin users experienced markedly decreased risk of CA-SAB (adjusted OR, 0.73; 95% CI, 0.63-0.84). The adjusted OR was 0.96 (95% CI, 0.60-1.51) for new users, 0.71 (95% CI, 0.62-0.82) for long-term users, and 1.12 (95% CI, 0.94-1.32) for former users as compared with nonusers. The CA-SAB risk decreased with increasing intensity of statin use; thus, compared with nonusers, the adjusted OR was 0.84 (95% CI, 0.68-1.04) for current users with daily dosages of less than 20 mg/d, 0.71 (95% CI, 0.58-0.87) for 20 to 39 mg/d, and 0.63 (95% CI, 0.49-0.81) for 40 mg/d or more. Conversely, we observed no differences in the risk of CA-SAB with successive increases in the duration of statin use. CONCLUSION: Statin use was associated with a decreased risk of CA-SAB, particularly in long-term users.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Smit, Jesper","Schønheyder, Henrik Carl","Nielsen, Henrik","Søgaard, Mette","López-Cortés, Luis Eduardo","Rodríguez-Bãno, Jesús","Thomsen, Reimar W","Frøslev, Trine"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-067168"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Journal Article"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unidad Clínica de Enfermedades Infecciosas, Microbiología y Medicina Preventiva, Instituto de Biomedicina de Sevilla (IBiS), Hospitales Universitarios Virgen Macarena y Virgen del Rocío/CSIC/Universidad de Sevilla, Sevilla, Spain."],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"in reply statin use associated with a decreased risk of community acquired staphylococcus aureus bacteremia","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"djc","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85044158503&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-067168","identifier":[{"id":"85044158503","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-3b1437ea-9110-4ab1-a04c-49ee635549bf"],"keyword":["Journal Article"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-5B505717D8238EF475CC93162A659048"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Department of Clinical Microbiology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Department of Infectious Diseases","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Klinik Diagnostik","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Klinik Medicin og Akut"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Unidad Clínica de Enfermedades Infecciosas, Microbiología y Medicina Preventiva, Instituto de Biomedicina de Sevilla (IBiS), Hospitales Universitarios Virgen Macarena y Virgen del Rocío/CSIC/Universidad de Sevilla, Sevilla, Spain."],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesper","key":"smitpau","last":"Smit","locid":"29aa2e66-1f20-4693-9114-5f988949c879","name":"Smit, Jesper","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik C","key":"schønheyderpau","last":"Schønheyder","locid":"d35b264a-6efc-467d-ac9d-e558542ef8a8","name":"Schønheyder, Henrik Carl","name_org":"Schønheyder, Henrik C","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"f0dd5aa7-1ea7-4567-9595-b60afb486088","name":"Nielsen, Henrik","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Mette","key":"søgaardpau","last":"Søgaard","locid":"5ce4f246-03bc-4e72-b36a-eb5f76e5e5cb","name":"Søgaard, Mette","orcid":"0000-0002-2830-4968","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Luis Eduardo","key":"lópezcortéspau","last":"López-Cortés","name":"López-Cortés, Luis Eduardo","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesús","key":"rodríguezbãnopau","last":"Rodríguez-Bãno","name":"Rodríguez-Bãno, Jesús","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Reimar W","key":"thomsenpau","last":"Thomsen","name":"Thomsen, Reimar W","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Trine","key":"frøslevpau","last":"Frøslev","name":"Frøslev, Trine","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.mayocp.2017.12.023","issn":["00256196","19425546"],"issn_org":["00256196"],"issue":"4","journal":"Mayo Clinic Proceedings","pages":"542","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"Mayo Clinic Proceedings","volume":"93"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85044158503"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-3b1437ea-9110-4ab1-a04c-49ee635549bf"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"In Reply—Statin Use Associated With a Decreased Risk of Community-Acquired Staphylococcus aureus Bacteremia","type":"Journal Comment","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-067168","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"The International Council for the Exploration of the Sea (ICES) occupies a central role in the advice system to support the implementation of an ecosystem approach to fisheries management (EAFM) in the European Union (EU). Despite improvements, its capacity to deliver ecosystem advice seems to be far from a fully functional operational framework. To what extent availability of appropriate scientific advice is a barrier for a more widespread use of an EAFM in Europe remains an open question. Building on the findings of a large research project, this article explores what advice ICES can provide. The article concludes that: (i) ICES has taken a leading role in generating an EAFM framework in which management decisions can operate; (ii) the advice “suppliers” and the advice “users” agree on the feasibility of using existing knowledge to “do EAFM now”; (iii) ICES can address a range of shortcomings, but some of the present bottlenecks demand concerted action between the advisory system and the political realm. The implementation of an EAFM requires consistency between science and management. ICES appears as well-suited to facilitate the dialogue on applying an EAFM in the EU, but it is unrealistic to expect ICES to produce all the answers.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Ballesteros, Marta","Chapela, Rosa","Ramirez-Monsalve, Paulina","Raakjær, Jesper","Hegland, Troels Jacob","Nielsen, Kåre Nolde","Laksá, Unn","Degnbol, Poul"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-070859"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"do not shoot the messenger ices advice for an ecosystem approach to fisheries management in the european union","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-070859","identifier":[{"id":"000429491500007","type":"wos"},{"id":"85045139599","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-47c9b786-3c51-4b81-afc3-4b1ade02170e"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-1EF61DB0D2B053FE205B50054899FB4D"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2017","yearSub":"2017"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Sustainability and Planning","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Sustainability and Planning, Innovative Fisheries Management, IFM"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Marta","key":"ballesterospau","last":"Ballesteros","name":"Ballesteros, Marta","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Rosa","key":"chapelapau","last":"Chapela","name":"Chapela, Rosa","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Paulina","key":"ramirezmonsalvepau","last":"Ramirez-Monsalve","locid":"d9a6ba87-fab6-4b68-b514-8563df8519ab","name":"Ramirez-Monsalve, Paulina","orcid":"0000-0001-5853-1830","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper","key":"raakjærpau","last":"Raakjær","locid":"313ef87d-616c-4cbb-ba8c-834d681406e1","name":"Raakjær, Jesper","orcid":"0000-0001-8543-2280","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Troels Jacob","key":"heglandpau","last":"Hegland","locid":"3930b6ec-7161-4fb4-b91f-5b1d42730307","name":"Hegland, Troels Jacob","orcid":"0000-0001-7363-4475","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Kåre Nolde","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Kåre Nolde","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Unn","key":"laksápau","last":"Laksá","name":"Laksá, Unn","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Poul","key":"degnbolpau","last":"Degnbol","locid":"cb2d8666-5297-4f85-9718-8970306b20fe","name":"Degnbol, Poul","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1093/icesjms/fsx181","issn":["10543139","10959289"],"issn_org":["10543139"],"issue":"fsx181","journal":"ICES Journal of Marine Science","publisher":"Oxford University Press","status":"p","title":"ICES Journal of Marine Science","volume":"2017"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85045139599"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-47c9b786-3c51-4b81-afc3-4b1ade02170e"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Do not shoot the messenger : ICES advice for an ecosystem approach to fisheries management in the European Union","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-070859","year":"2018","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"The productivity in the Danish construction industry is significantly less compared to other sectors in Denmark. It has only doubled over the last 50 years, and based on this fact, this paper as a starting point look into the productivity of the building and construction industry to investigate trend similarities with other countries. Hereafter a literature study elaborates the challenges within the building and construction industry to understand the conditions that strain the industry in improving productivity. Mass customization as a strategy has increased productivity and competitiveness in other industries in Denmark, and despite that mass customization has not been explored much in the research field of the building and construction industry, so implementing this strategy might affect the building and construction industry in a positive way. Therefore, this paper also study some indicators that justify mass customization as a strategy applicable within the building and construction industry, as well as some assumptions and requirements of applying mass customization.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Jensen, Kim Nørgaard","Nielsen, Kjeld","Brunø, Thomas Ditlev","Larsen, Jesper Kranker"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-085694"],"event":{"end":"2017-11-21","start":"2017-11-20","title":"9th World Mass Customization &amp; Personalization Conference (MCPC 2017)","year":"2017"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"productivity challenges and applying mass customization in the building and construction industry","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-085694","identifier":[{"id":"85125267225","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-7ab159e2-eb14-48d7-87da-012e43e1ec21"],"keyword":["Mass customization Construction industry Productivity"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-560A94FFA2D3E10C6153E67B52603CED"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Materials and Production","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Materials and Production, Production","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Materials and Production, Sustainable Manufacturing Systems research group"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Kim Nørgaard","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"48067000-c081-404b-9162-02ecf0a3a8bb","name":"Jensen, Kim Nørgaard","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Kjeld","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"ffae8343-8516-499e-89a3-2f0d6179a5fc","name":"Nielsen, Kjeld","orcid":"0000-0002-3720-167X","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Thomas Ditlev","key":"brunøpau","last":"Brunø","locid":"b75a6b6d-0181-4141-b951-6f7f70bae83f","name":"Brunø, Thomas Ditlev","orcid":"0000-0002-9847-6562","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Kranker","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"cfa28d79-69f2-47dc-b958-6017a1128eee","name":"Larsen, Jesper Kranker","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/978-3-319-77556-2_34","edition":"1","eisbn":["9783319775562"],"isbn":["9783319775555"],"issn":["21987246"],"pages":"551-565","publisher":"Springer Publishing Company","series":"Springer Proceedings in Business and Economics","status":"p","subtitle":"Proceedings of the 9th World Mass Customization &amp; Personalization Conference (MCPC 2017), Aachen, Germany, November 20th-21st, 2017","title":"Customization 4.0"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85125267225"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-7ab159e2-eb14-48d7-87da-012e43e1ec21"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Productivity, Challenges, and Applying Mass Customization in the Building and Construction Industry","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-085694","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"Recently, so-called smart speakers have been introduced and they in- clude a microphone array. One potential application of such a smart speaker is to use it for calibrating a larger audio system which the speaker is a part of. In this paper, we propose a method to perform this calibration using one or several smart speakers. Specifically, a map is estimated of the sensors and sound sources. As opposed to existing methods, the proposed method can create this map for both synchronised and unsynchronised sound sources by taking the different localisation errors into account. We show that this gives more accurate estimates than assuming identical estimation errors, and that existing methods are outperformed in terms of estimation accuracy for various noise levels and reverberation times.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Nielsen, Jesper Kjær"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-097720"],"event":{"acronym":"ICASSP","end":"2018-04-20","place":"Calgary, ca","start":"2018-04-15","title":"2018 IEEE International Conference on Acoustics, Speech and Signal Processing (ICASSP)","year":"2018"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Array processing"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"loudspeaker and listening position estimation using smart speakers","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/273873672/master.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-097720","identifier":[{"id":"85054274015","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-a45ba5d1-2f41-4274-bd2e-017f661f6561"],"keyword":["Array processing","Procrustes analysis","Source and sensor calibration"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-847E5744870D3FDAD7DC60FF38D86FBE"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/273873672/master.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/305320081/icaspp2018.zip","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology, Audio Analysis Lab (CREATE)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology, Section for Media Technology - Campus Aalborg"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Kjær","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"3d21c73c-3aa1-4590-870f-8be578634702","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Kjær","orcid":"0000-0002-2586-7925","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/icassp.2018.8462302","eisbn":["9781538646588"],"isbn":["9781538646571"],"issn":["15206149"],"pages":"81-85","place":"Calgary, Canada","publisher":"IEEE Press","series":"IEEE International Conference on Acoustics, Speech and Signal Processing. Proceedings","status":"p","title":"2018 IEEE International Conference on Acoustics, Speech and Signal Processing (ICASSP)"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85054274015"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-a45ba5d1-2f41-4274-bd2e-017f661f6561"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Loudspeaker and Listening Position Estimation using Smart Speakers","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-097720","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"Three main characteristics of massive multiple-input-multiple-output (MIMO) are studied. The widespread use of these characteristics and their lack of validation motivates this paper based in measurements. First, we study the channel hardening when the number of antennas in the base station (BS) increases. Second, we focus on the channel vector orthogonality between two users. Third, we investigate the rank of the spatial covariance matrix. The data used for this paper have been obtained in two measurement campaigns with all real antennas (i.e., neither virtual arrays nor virtual users). The first one has 64 BS elements arranged in 3 configurations, and it serves 8 users with 2 antennas each. The second campaign has 128 BS elements, serving 2 users with 2 antennas each. Both campaigns include line-of-sight and nonline-of-sight scenarios, designed according to the future 5G deployment scenarios. We show the rate of channel hardening when the number of BS elements increases. We evaluate the sum rate of two users at specific distances between them. We observe the large angular spread occupied by the user.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Martinez, Alex Oliveras","Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","De Carvalho, Elisabeth","Popovski, Petar"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-107181"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Channel measurements","Linear antenna arrays","Multiuser MIMO","massive multiple input multiple output MIMO"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"an experimental study of massive mimo properties in 000000000005g scenarios","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/293051374/An_Experimental_Study_of_Massive_MIMO.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-107181","identifier":[{"id":"85054624825","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-c4ec0b79-1754-4378-86ae-7f15b0d480d1"],"keyword":["Channel measurements","linear antenna arrays","massive multiple-input-multiple-output (MIMO)","multiuser MIMO"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-B48DAAB73A108281505D70D88E42875E"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/293051374/An_Experimental_Study_of_Massive_MIMO.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Connectivity (section)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Alex Oliveras","key":"martinezpau","last":"Martinez","locid":"12d64adc-fd5d-44ee-99c6-b8253e019d43","name":"Martinez, Alex Oliveras","orcid":"0000-0003-2002-570X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Ødum","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"12489268-4402-4c17-8487-76a4323ee983","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","orcid":"0000-0002-8505-853X","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Elisabeth De","key":"carvalhopau","last":"Carvalho","locid":"cd08d3bf-1c27-487e-90dc-9aafd1088da2","name":"De Carvalho, Elisabeth","name_org":"Carvalho, Elisabeth De","orcid":"0000-0002-5478-5531","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Petar","key":"popovskipau","last":"Popovski","locid":"393886d2-0dbf-4356-84fe-3a1138a9c51f","name":"Popovski, Petar","orcid":"0000-0001-6195-4797","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/tap.2018.2871881","issn":["0018926X"],"issue":"12","journal":"IEEE Transactions on Antennas and Propagation","pages":"7206-7215","paperid":"8471108","publisher":"IEEE (Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers)","status":"p","title":"IEEE Transactions on Antennas and Propagation","title_org":"I E E E Transactions on Antennas and Propagation","volume":"66"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85054624825"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-c4ec0b79-1754-4378-86ae-7f15b0d480d1"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"An Experimental Study of Massive MIMO Properties in 5G Scenarios","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-107181","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"This paper deals with the estimation of the short-term predictor (STP) parameters of speech and noise in a binaural framework. A binaural model based approach is proposed for estimating the power spectral density (PSD) of speech and noise at the individual ears for an arbitrary position of the speech source. The estimated PSDs can be subsequently used for enhancement in a binaural framework. The experimental results show that taking into account the position of the speech source using the proposed method leads to improved modelling and enhancement of the noisy speech.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Kavalekalam, Mathew Shaji","Nielsen, Jesper Kjær","Christensen, Mads Græsbøll","Boldt, Jesper Bünsow"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-116391"],"event":{"end":"2018-09-07","place":"Rome, it","start":"2018-09-03","title":"26th European Signal Processing Conference (EUSIPCO 2018)","year":"2018"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"model based estimation of stp parameters for binaural speech enhancement","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/301380818/eusipco_2018_paper_1.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-116391","identifier":[{"id":"85059818930","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-e43aeb17-33be-4039-98d5-7161da200543"],"keyword":["autoregressive modelling, binaural speech enhancement"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-7B7146B97EB4152810B246D06947B8CC"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/301380818/eusipco_2018_paper_1.pd