arch?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-117801","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"This work investigates different correlation based models useful for evaluation of outage capacity (OC) of mobile multiple-input multiple-output (MIMO) handsets. The work is based on a large measurement campaign in a micro-cellular setup involving two dual-band base stations, 10 different handsets in an indoor environment for different use cases and test users. Several models are evaluated statistically, comparing the OC values estimated from the model and measurement data, respectively, for about 2,700 measurement routes. The models are based on either estimates of the full correlation matrices or simplifications. Among other results, it is shown that the OC can be predicted accurately (median error typically within 2.6%) with a model assuming knowledge only of the Tx-correlation coefficient and the mean power gain.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","Yanakiev, Boyan","Barrio, Samantha Caporal Del","Pedersen, Gert Frølund"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-120845"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"country":["United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Intel"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"channel models for capacity evaluation of mimo handsets in data mode","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Andet","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/237977851/JOedumNielsen_IET_MAP_CapacityModel.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-120845","identifier":[{"id":"000394464300001","type":"wos"},{"id":"85010223809","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-f37766a2-330c-4f59-bf30-d95762d36269"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-C61B7E63CA19971300F3821E4930A06C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Andet","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/237977851/JOedumNielsen_IET_MAP_CapacityModel.pdf","version":"Pre-print"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2017","yearSub":"2017"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Antennas, propagation and radio networking"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"us","key":"intel","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Intel","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Ødum","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"12489268-4402-4c17-8487-76a4323ee983","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","orcid":"0000-0002-8505-853X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Boyan","key":"yanakievpau","last":"Yanakiev","name":"Yanakiev, Boyan","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Samantha Caporal Del","key":"barriopau","last":"Barrio","locid":"cd9159b3-d654-407c-9dd9-dc628d8b3065","name":"Barrio, Samantha Caporal Del","orcid":"0000-0002-1096-0924","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Gert Frølund","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"a49c73ee-aed0-448c-8a92-792c9ee12a9e","name":"Pedersen, Gert Frølund","orcid":"0000-0002-6570-7387","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1049/iet-map.2015.0769","issn":["17518725","17518733"],"issn_org":["17518725"],"issue":"1","journal":"IET Microwaves, Antennas & Propagation","pages":"1-9","publisher":"John Wiley & Sons Inc.","status":"p","title":"IET Microwaves, Antennas & Propagation","title_org":"I E T Microwaves Antennas & Propagation","volume":"11"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85010223809"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-f37766a2-330c-4f59-bf30-d95762d36269"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Channel Models for Capacity Evaluation of MIMO Handsets in Data Mode","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-120845","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"The annual concentrations of NO2, PM2.5 and PM10 in 2012 have for the first time been modelled for all 2.4 million addresses in Denmark based on a multi-scale air quality modelling approach. All addresses include residential, industrial, institutional, shop, school, restaurant addresses etc. The approach is based on a suite of chemistry-transport models all developed at Aarhus University and includes regional modelling, urban background modelling and street modelling. Information about traffic volumes is based on a newly developed national Danish Transport Model, and national travel speed data have been obtained from a recent dataset based on GPS readings of vehicles. Air quality model results are validated by comparisons with measurements obtained from the fixed site monitoring stations under the Danish Air Quality Monitoring Programme. The validation showed that calculated street concentrations of NO2 for the five available street monitoring stations are within −27% to +12%. The model results were also verified with comparisons with previous model results for NO2 at 98 selected streets in Copenhagen and 31 streets in Aalborg. The verification showed good correlation in Copenhagen (r2 = 0.70) and fairly good agreement in Aalborg (r2 = 0.60). The target groups for the air quality mapping of all Danish addresses are the general public for information and awareness about air quality, and local and national authorities whom may use the information as a screening tool for air quality assessment. The air quality map has been provided on a WebGIS platform on the internet in September 2016 (http://luftenpaadinvej.au.dk). The air quality map is named AirStreet for Air Quality at Your Street.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Jensen, Steen Solvang","Ketzel, Matthias","Becker, Thomas","Christensen, Jesper","Brandt, Jørgen","Plejdrup, Marlene Schmidt","Winther, Morten","Nielsen, Ole-Kenneth","Hertel, Ole","Ellermann, Thomas"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-238883"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Jensen, Steen Solvang"],"keyword":["Air quality","MAP","MODEL","Nesting","Traffic","Validation"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"high resolution multi scale air quality modelling for all streets in denmark","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.trd.2017.02.019","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-238883","identifier":[{"id":"85016145314","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-bffa89bc-7a7c-46b4-ac24-45063453c52a"],"keyword":["Air quality","Map","Model","Nesting","Traffic","Validation"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-7740D3DF206939685B51819599CBA563"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.trd.2017.02.019","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/120341658/1_s2.0_S1361920916304072_main.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2017","yearSub":"2017"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Environmental Science, Department of Environmental Science - Environmental social science, Silkeborg"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Steen Solvang","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen"