{"abstract":"On the FTU tokamak, the collective Thomson scattering (CTS) diagnostic was renewed for investigating the possible excitation of parametric decay instabilities (PDI) by electron cyclotron (EC) or CTS probe beams in presence of magnetic islands and measure their effects on the EC power absorption.The experiments were performed launching a gyroton probe beam (140 GHz, 400 kW) and observing the scattered radiation in symmetric and asymmetric directions (with respect to the equatorial plane) in different conditions of plasma density and magnetic field (with or without the EC resonance in the plasma), and with magnetic islands generated by Neon injection. The acquisition with a fast digitizer allowed observing spectral features with very high time and frequency resolution. Shots were performed at 7.2 T, with the fundamental EC resonance out of the plasma region, at 4.7 T, with the resonance on the high field side of the plasma column, and at 3.6 T, in this last case with the plasma between the first and the second EC harmonics both lying outside the plasma volume. Several types of spectral features characterized by their frequency and their fast time evolution were identified in the observed signal after a proper treatment. The paper reports the observations in the different experimental cases and the correlation of the features with the existence of MHD modes as witnessed by magnetic probes signals and with macroscopic plasma parameters.","author_count":27,"contributors":["Bruschi, A.","Alessi, E.","Bin, W.","D'Arcangelo, O.","Baiocchi, B.","Belli, F.","Calabro, G.","Casiraghi, I.","Cocilovo, V.","Figini, L.","Galperti, C.","Garavaglia, S.","Granucci, G.","Grosso, G.","Korsholm, Søren Bang","Lontano, M.","Lubyako, L.","Mazzotta, C.","Mellera, V.","Del Moro, A.","Nielsen, Stefan Kragh","Orsitto, F.","Ramogida, G.","Rasmussen, Jesper","Ricci, D.","Stejner Pedersen, Morten","Tartari, U."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-336079"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"country":["Italy","Russia","Switzerland"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Italian National Agency for New Technologies, Energy and Sustainable Economic Development","National Research Council of Italy","RAS - Institute of Applied Physics","Swiss Federal Institute of Technology Lausanne","Università degli Studi di Milano-Bicocca","Università degli Studi di Napoli Federico II"],"keyword":["Collective Thomson scattering","Parametric decay instabilities"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"observation of short time scale spectral emissions at millimeter wavelengths with the new cts diagnostic on the ftu tokamak paper","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/151718528/preprint0275.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-336079","identifier":[{"id":"85020849759","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-69931109-a594-45d3-8e2f-08fa6b161e02"],"keyword":["Collective Thomson scattering","Electron cyclotron heating","Magnetic islands","Parametric decay instabilities"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-DFC8B01F09501D02D7860D4A933B89E1"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/151718528/preprint0275.pdf","version":"Pre-print"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2017","yearSub":"2017"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"it","key":"national research council of italy","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"National Research Council of Italy","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"it","key":"italian national agency for new technologies energy and sustainable economic development","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Italian National Agency for New Technologies, Energy and Sustainable Economic Development","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"it","key":"università degli studi di milano bicocca","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Università degli Studi di Milano-Bicocca","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"ch","key":"swiss federal institute of technology lausanne","loc":["Switzerland","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"Swiss Federal Institute of Technology Lausanne","used":1},{"affno":"5","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Physics","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Physics, Plasma Physics and Fusion Energy"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"6","country":"ru","key":"ras institute of applied physics","loc":["Russia","Europe, Non-EU"],"name":"RAS - Institute of Applied Physics","used":1},{"affno":"7","country":"it","key":"università degli studi di napoli federico ii","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Università degli Studi di Napoli Federico II","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"A.","key":"bruschipau","last":"Bruschi","name":"Bruschi, A.","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"E.","key":"alessipau","last":"Alessi","name":"Alessi, E.","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"W.","key":"binpau","last":"Bin","name":"Bin, W.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"O.","key":"darcangelopau","last":"D'Arcangelo","name":"D'Arcangelo, O.","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"B.","key":"baiocchipau","last":"Baiocchi","name":"Baiocchi, B