of short time-scale spectral emissions at millimeter wavelengths with the new CTS diagnostic on the FTU tokamak : Paper","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-336079","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"We demonstrate measurements of spectra of O-mode electron cyclotron resonance heating (ECRH) waves scattered collectively from microscopic plasma fluctuations in ASDEX Upgrade discharges with an ITER-like ECRH scenario. The measured spectra are shown to allow determination of the main ion temperature and plasma rotation velocity. This demonstrates that ECRH systems can be exploited for diagnostic purposes alongside their primary heating purpose in a reactor relevant scenario.","author_count":11,"contributors":["Stejner Pedersen, Morten","Rasmussen, Jesper","Nielsen, Stefan Kragh","Jacobsen, Asger Schou","Korsholm, Søren Bang","Leipold, Frank","McDermott, R. M.","Salewski, Mirko","Schubert, M.","Stober, J.","Wagner, D. H."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-336150"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Germany"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Max Planck Institute for Plasma Physics"],"keyword":["Collective Thomson scattering","Electron cyclotron resonance heating"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"main ion temperature and plasma rotation measurements based on scattering of electron cyclotron heating waves in asdex upgrade paper","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/151765082/WPMST1PR16_16174_submitted.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-336150","identifier":[{"id":"85020375639","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-69c59385-1886-461f-87d2-5416263058cd"],"keyword":["Collective Thomson scattering","electron cyclotron resonance heating","main-ion temperature","plasma rotation"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Gl