{"abstract":"Fingerplanen for Hovedstadsområdet fastlægger den overordnede ramme for områdets regionale udvikling og fysiske planlægning. Formålet med fingerplanen er at sikre, at den kommunale planlægning i Hovedstadsområdet sker på grundlag af vurderinger af udviklingen og i henhold til fingerbystrukturen. Et af principperne i fingerbystrukturen er stationsnærhedsprincippet, som har til formål at fremme brugen af kollektiv transport og reducere bilkørsel i håndfladen og byfingrene. Denne rapport sigter på at gøre en første vurdering af, om der er grundlag for at få ændret stationsnærhedsprincippet til at omfatte stoppesteder/stationer for en højklasset Bus Rapid Transit, dvs. BRT-betjening. BRT er et interessant alternativ til metro og letbaner, idet der kan opnås sammenlignelige ”level of service”-niveauer på basis af en mindre investering. Erfaringer har vist, at frekvens og rejsetid samt faciliteter som cykelparkering, overdækning mv. har betydning for en stations/et stoppesteds markedsandele i forhold til øvrige transportformer. Nærheden til en station/stoppested og designet af stationen/stoppestedet har betydning for de rejsendes transportmønstre og bilejerskab (Dyrberg & Christensen, 2015; Anderson, 2013; Halldórsdóttir, 2015).","author_count":6,"contributors":["Andersen, Jonas Lohmann Elkjær","Anderson, Marie Karen","Christiansen, Hjalmar","Ingvardson, Jesper Bláfoss","Sylvan, Henrik","Nielsen, Otto Anker"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-335876"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"mulige effekter ved bus rapid transit brt","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/163156929/Mulige_effekter_ved_Bus_Rapid_Transit_BRT_DTU_2017.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-335876","ids":["dtu-68da4c4e-2cc3-4ea1-af93-6df1ac614117"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-D5DD575F01A3181C37E9A8429D43AE4F"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/163156929/Mulige_effekter_ved_Bus_Rapid_Transit_BRT_DTU_2017.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Management Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Management Engineering, Transport DTU"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jonas Lohmann Elkjær","key":"andersenpau","last":"Andersen","locid":"0f1c058d-30ea-40ca-8bed-319bf28bdcee","name":"Andersen, Jonas Lohmann Elkjær","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Marie Karen","key":"andersonpau","last":"Anderson","locid":"21e06505-39b3-4255-8d17-9b4265910919","name":"Anderson, Marie Karen","orcid":"0000-0003-0164-4011","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Hjalmar","key":"christiansenpau","last":"Christiansen","locid":"25814ea5-7365-4509-88af-911bcdbdb933","name":"Christiansen, Hjalmar","orcid":"0000-0002-3493-1618","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesper Bláfoss","key":"ingvardsonpau","last":"Ingvardson","locid":"910e3f5c-3100-4005-82a4-8d3253d4d89b","name":"Ingvardson, Jesper Bláfoss","orcid":"0000-0002-0609-5165","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik","key":"sylvanpau","last":"Sylvan","locid":"ebe8119c-6410-4b96-a75e-6484898e7382","name":"Sylvan, Henrik","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Otto Anker","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"0b46cbc2-23db-4c0b-bc64-91094ef11adb","name":"Nielsen, Otto Anker","orcid":"0000-0001-7901-7021","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"24","status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-68da4c4e-2cc3-4ea1-af93-6df1ac614117"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Mulige effekter ved Bus Rapid Transit (BRT)","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-335876","year":"2017","yearsub":"2018"}
