itle":"Ikke-regulerede flammehæmmere i indeklimaet - nye eksponerings- og sundhedsrisici?","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-780206","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"Introduction Fibrinogen C domain-containing 1 (FIBCD1) is a homotetrameric type II transmembrane protein, expressed at epithelial surfaces. FIBCD1 has a wide ligand spectrum, including chitin found in various pathogens such as helminths and fungi. Current understanding points towards a role as a pattern recognition receptor in the innate immune response. Aim In the present study, we investigate the localization of FIBCD1 in 49 different healthy human tissues by immunohistochemistry. Further, we investigate the in vitro effects of excretory-secretory (ES) antigens from pig whipworm (Trichuris suis) on FIBCD1-transfected colon epithelial cells, and identify protein fractions in the ES-antigen that binds to FIBCD1. Results Immunohistochemical staining shows that FIBCD1 is present at mucosal surfaces throughout the human body, with high intensity in the airways and gastrointestinal and urogenital tract. Transfection of the human colon epithelial cell line HCT116 with FIBCD1 did not result in any major genotypic differences upon stimulation with ES antigens, as determined by quantitative PCR of various pro- and anti-inflammatory genes. FIBCD1 recognizes and binds to whipworm eggshell and ES antigens. Analysis of the T. suis ES-antigen by size chromatography reveals predominant sizes of proteins ranging from 10 kDa to 200 kDa. Conclusion FIBCD1 is present at mucosal surfaces throughout the human body, which may underline its function as a pattern recognition receptor in the innate immune system. FIBCD1 binds to ES antigens. Stimulation with ES antigens does not appear to be influenced by FIBCD1 transfection in vitro. FIBCD1 may play a role in whipworm infections in vivo.","author_count":13,"contributors":["von Huth, Sebastian","Skallerup, Sofie","Buragaite, Benita","Schlosser, Anders","Moeller, Jesper B.","Hammond, Mark","Nielsen, Ole","Marcussen, Niels","Svensson Frej, Marcus","Williams, Andrew R.","Thamsborg, Stig M.","Sorensen, Grith L.","Holmskov, Uffe"],"cuid":["S02-080.68-038188"],"event":{"end":"2017-10-20","place":"Stockholm, se","start":"2017-10-17","title":"44th Scandinavian Society for Immunology Meeting","year":"2017"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"sci","mra":["med","sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-SDR"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-SDR","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"investigations of fibcd000000000001 immunohistochemical localization and immunomodulatory role upon helminth antigen stimulation in colon epithelium","src":["dtu","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/138479507/2017_Scandinavian_Journal_of_Immunology_1_255.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-080.68-038188","identifier":[{"id":"000411865200022","type":"wos"}],"ids":["dtu-fca545dd-0bc2-4db0-828e-d23d2175c5b8","ku-9ad369a2-322b-49ee-88db-7691cda815c7"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science","Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-2-202F7B4BD315BAE1A436C762234C23AB"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/138479507/2017_Scandinavian_Journal_of_Immunology_1_255.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["University of Southern Denmark"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"region of southern denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-SDR","l3nl":"Region of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"Region of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Region of Southern Denmark","namevar":["Odense University Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-SDR","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, National Veterinary Institute","Technical University of Denmark, National Veterinary Institute, Division of Immunology & Vaccinology, Mucosal Immunology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"4","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Veterinary and Animal Sciences, Parasitology and Aquatic Pathobiology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Sebastian","key":"vonhuthpau","last":"von Huth","name":"von Huth, Sebastian","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Sofie","key":"skalleruppau","last":"Skallerup","name":"Skallerup, Sofie","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Benita","key":"buragaitepau","last":"Buragaite","name":"Buragaite, Benita","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders","key":"schlosserpau","last":"Schlosser","name":"Schlosser, Anders","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesper B.","key":"moellerpau","last":"Moeller","name":"Moeller, Jesper B.","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Mark","key":"hammondpau","last":"Hammond","name":"Hammond, Mark","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Ole","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Ole","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Niels","key":"marcussenpau","last":"Marcussen","name":"Marcussen, Niels","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Marcus","key":"svenssonfrejpau","last":"Svensson Frej","locid":"ee1471ea-b6af-485b-b981-ad4f0ba10b79","name":"Svensson Frej, Marcus","orcid":"0000-0002-3934-464X","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","first":"Andrew R.","key":"williamspau","last":"Williams","locid":"393f749c-84d9-4245-84f2-1fee6f8d3ead","name":"Williams, Andrew R.","orcid":"0000-0002-8231-282X","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","first":"Stig M.","key":"thamsborgpau","last":"Thamsborg","locid":"e1ff513c-cc7f-43e8-ac3d-742aee7fe1da","name":"Thamsborg, Stig Milan","name_org":"Thamsborg, Stig M.","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Grith L.","key":"sorensenpau","last":"Sorensen","name":"Sorensen, Grith L.","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Uffe","key":"holmskovpau","last":"Holmskov","name":"Holmskov, Uffe","rank":13,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1111/sji.12587","issn":["03009475","03016323"],"issn_org":["03009475"],"issue":"4","journal":"Scandinavian Journal of Immunology","pages":"255-255","paperid":"A-31195","status":"p","title":"Scandinavian Journal of Immunology","volume":"86"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","sdg":["3. Good Health and Well-being","All UN SDG Classification"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Region of Southern Denmark","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-fca545dd-0bc2-4db0-828e-d23d2175c5b8","ku-9ad369a2-322b-49ee-88db-7691cda815c7"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Investigations of FIBCD1: Immunohistochemical localization and immunomodulatory role upon helminth antigen stimulation in colon epithelium","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-080.68-038188","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"The objective of this study was to evaluate the use of alfaxalone in a small passerine species. A dose-response trial was conducted whereby 10, 30, and 50 mg/kg alfaxalone was administered subcutaneously (SC) to 10 Bengalese finches ( Lonchura domestica) in a randomized complete crossover study design. Subsequently, a similar protocol was used to compare 30 mg/kg alfaxalone alone or combined with either 0.7 mg/kg midazolam or 1 mg/kg butorphanol SC. Induction and recovery times were recorded and depth of anesthesia monitored at 5-min intervals throughout each procedure. Functional oxygen saturation and pulse rates were measured with a pulse oximeter at 15 min after administration of the anesthetic agent(s). Dose-dependent decreases in induction time and prolongation of anesthetic duration were seen with increasing alfaxalone dosage. Alfaxalone combined with midazolam resulted in faster inductions, and the addition of both midazolam and butorphanol resulted in longer durations of anesthesia than alfaxalone alone. The addition of midazolam significantly decreased the pulse rate at 15 min compared with alfaxalone alone. Alfaxalone was found to be an effective agent for inducing anesthesia when administered subcutaneously, and no complications were observed. Increasing the dose, and combining with a benzodiazepine or opioid increased the duration of anesthesia with minimal or no effects on respiratory or pulse rates, within the dose range investigated.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Perrin, Kathryn L.","Nielsen, Jesper Brinkmann","Thomsen, Anders Fick","Mads, Bertelsen"],"cuid":["S02-092.39-014267"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Avian anesthesia","Butorphanol","Midazolam","Passerine","Pulse oximetry","Society finch"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Copenhagen Zoo"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"alfaxalone anesthesia in the bengalese finch lonchura domestica","src":["au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85040226926","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-092.39-014267","identifier":[{"id":"85040226926","type":"scopus"},{"id":"29297827","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-175abccc-d952-44ca-9b37-c80e13e02937","ku-1ac80a27-3992-44cc-bcad-292d32fa8bcc"],"keyword":["Avian anesthesia","Butorphanol","Midazolam","Passerine","Pulse oximetry","Society finch"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-C0DF50F498C7C9F63A19600815523C33"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2017","yearSub":"2017"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Veterinary Clinical Sciences, Internal Medicine, Clinical Oncology and Veterinary Clinical Pathology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Copenhagen Zoo"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - De Kirurgiske Forskningslaboratorier, SKS"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","first":"Kathryn L.","key":"perrinpau","last":"Perrin","locid":"c1102000-7e33-46c0-a8ec-54ffb62f6ca7","name":"Perrin, Kathryn L.","orcid":"0000-0002-3887-6302","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesper Brinkmann","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Brinkmann","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anders Fick","key":"thomsenpau","last":"Thomsen","locid":"0fcedb6f-587a-4962-8f83-628d2a2e317b","name":"Thomsen, Anders Fick","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Mads F.","key":"bertelsenpau","last":"Bertelsen","locid":"37d31086-f61f-47da-814e-5351f7b1af6d","name":"Bertelsen, Mads Frost","name_org":"Bertelsen, Mads F.","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Bertelsen","key":"madspau","last":"Mads","name":"Mads, Bertelsen","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["29297827"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1638/2016-0300r.1","issn":["10427260","19372825"],"issn_org":["10427260"],"issue":"4","journal":"Journal of Zoo and Wildlife Medicine","pages":"1146-1153","publisher":"American Association of Zoo Veterinarians","status":"p","title":"Journal of Zoo and Wildlife Medicine","volume":"48"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85040226926"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-175abccc-d952-44ca-9b37-c80e13e02937","ku-1ac80a27-3992-44cc-bcad-292d32fa8bcc"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"ALFAXALONE ANESTHESIA IN THE BENGALESE FINCH (LONCHURA DOMESTICA)","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-092.39-014267","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"Background The aim of this study was to analyse the additional treatment costs of acute patients admitted to a Danish hospital who suffered an adverse event (AE) during in-hospital treatment. Methods A matched case-control design was utilised. Using a combination of trigger words and patient record reviews 91 patients exposed to AEs were identified. Controls were identified among patients admitted to the same department during the same 20-month period. The matching was based on age, gender, and main diagnosis. Cost data was extracted from the Danish National Cost Database for four different periods after beginning of the admission. Results Patients exposed to an AE were associated with higher mean cost of EUR 9505 during their index admission (p = 0.014). For the period of 6 months from the beginning of the admission minus the admission itself they were associated with higher mean cost of EUR 4968 (p = 0.016). For the period from the 7th month until the end of the 12th month there was no statistically significant difference (p = 0.104). For the total period of 12 month, patients exposed to an AE were associated with statistically significant higher mean cost of EUR 13,930 (p = 0.001). Conclusions AEs are associated with significant hospital costs. Our findings suggest that a follow-up period of 6 months is necessary when investigating the costs associated with AEs among acute patients. Further research of specific types of AEs and the costs of preventing these types of AEs would improve the understanding of the relationship between adverse events and costs.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Kjellberg, Jakob","Wolf, Rasmus Trap","Kruse, Marie","Rasmussen, Susanne Reindahl","Vestergaard, Jesper","Nielsen, Kent J.","Rasmussen, Kurt"],"cuid":["S02-092.64-021077"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Journal Article"],"level":"sci","mra":["med","soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-VIVE"],"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-VIVE","DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"costs associated with adverse events among acute patients","src":["au","vive"],"src-code":["DI-GV-VIVE","DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1186/s12913-017-2605-5","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-092.64-021077","identifier":[{"id":"PMC5598051","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"28903748","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85029358243","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-72f86ede-7e9e-4ee3-8dbd-e3240a636df0","vive-d61388fb-56bb-4abd-821c-78d6fcbe5dba"],"keyword":["Journal Article"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science","Social Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-9B6DD8CD6D6262AF9DCE1485FBE970F3"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1186/s12913-017-2605-5","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2017","yearSub":"2017"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"vive the danish center for social science research","l2":"DI-GV","l2n":"Governmental Institutions","l3":"DI-GV-VIVE","l3nn":"VIVE The Danish Center for Social Science Research","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"VIVE The Danish Center for Social Science Research","namevar":["VIVE - The Danish Center for Social Science Research, VIVE Governance and Management"],"nora_code":"DI-GV-VIVE","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Unspecified organisation"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Department of Occupational and Environmental Medicine, RHG"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jakob","key":"kjellbergjakobpau","last":"Kjellberg","locid":"aeaf985c-6162-47fa-a509-3f31a2829d5d","name":"Kjellberg, Jakob","orcid":"0000-0003-4336-2397","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Rasmus Trap","key":"wolfrasmustrappau","last":"Wolf","name":"Wolf, Rasmus Trap","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Marie","key":"krusemariepau","last":"Kruse","name":"Kruse, Marie","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Susanne Reindahl","key":"rasmussensusannereindahlpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"391fb0ef-d902-4578-ac6e-6402441423a6","name":"Rasmussen, Susanne Reindahl","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper","key":"vestergaardjespermedompau","last":"Vestergaard","locid":"f2a2e103-1293-4370-b308-c4427f184a75","name":"Vestergaard, Jesper Medom","name_org":"Vestergaard, Jesper","orcid":"0000-0002-7435-6566","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesper","key":"vestergaardjesperpau","last":"Vestergaard","name":"Vestergaard, Jesper","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Kent J","key":"nielsenkentjacobpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"b11fecf5-8895-4034-a7b1-d5eb0399ea93","name":"Nielsen, Kent Jacob","name_org":"Nielsen, Kent J","orcid":"0000-0002-4643-5697","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Kent J.","key":"nielsenkentjpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Kent J.","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Kurt","key":