{"abstract":"A phytochemical investigation of Seidlitzia rosmarinus collected along the shoreline of the Gulf of Aqaba in the remote southern desert region of the Sinai peninsula has revealed the presence of the registered drug metformin (4). However, analysis of the 14C content revealed the drug to be an anthropogenic contaminant. Consequently, natural product researchers should be aware that compounds isolated from plants might originate from environmental contamination rather than biosynthesis. The new natural product N-(4-hydroxyphenylethyl)-α-chloroferuloylamide was isolated as a mixture of the E and Z isomers along with a number of other well-established secondary metabolites.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Hassan, Ahmed R.","El-Kousy, Salah M.","El-Toumy, Sayed A.","Frydenyang, Karla","Truong Thanh Tung, no-firstname","Olsen, Jesper","Nielsen, John","Christensen, Soren Bragger"],"cuid":["S02-095.73-013087"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Africa"],"corresponding_author":["Nielsen, John"],"country":["Egypt"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Menoufia University","National Research Center (Egypt)"],"keyword":["AGENTS","Derivatives","Flavonoids","Journal Article","Natural products","Plants","Tramadol"],"level":"sci","mra":["med","sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"metformin an anthropogenic contaminant of seidlitzia rosmarinus collected in a desert region near the gulf of aqaba sinai peninsula","src":["au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85032579307","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-095.73-013087","identifier":[{"id":"85032579307","type":"scopus"},{"id":"000414234400031","type":"wos"},{"id":"28930456","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-06bb14dd-b333-4603-848b-55b5c20aef66","ku-27d567c6-c641-43fb-bb3f-5f16bfa89255"],"keyword":["AGENTS","DERIVATIVES","DRUG METFORMIN","FLAVONOIDS","Journal Article","NATURAL-PRODUCTS","OCCURRING ORGANOHALOGEN COMPOUNDS","PLANTS","TRAMADOL"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science","Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-6C651322DBFE5D97CC4F3E750248D256"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2017","yearSub":"2017"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Unspecified organisation"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"eg","key":"national research center","loc":["Egypt","Africa"],"name":"National Research Center (Egypt)","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"eg","key":"menoufia university","loc":["Egypt","Africa"],"name":"Menoufia University","used":1},{"affno":"4","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Drug Design and Pharmacology, Biostructural Research"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"5","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Department of Physics and Astronomy"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ahmed R.","key":"hassanpau","last":"Hassan","name":"Hassan, Ahmed R.","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 1","corresponding":null,"first":"Salah M.","key":"elkousypau","last":"El-Kousy","name":"El-Kousy, Salah M.","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 1","corresponding":null,"first":"Sayed A.","key":"eltoumypau","last":"El-Toumy","name":"El-Toumy, Sayed A.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","first":"Karla","key":"frydenvangpau","last":"Frydenvang","locid":"dcc9f4f8-1800-40ac-a7e9-5d2eda9ce65b","name":"Frydenvang, Karla","orcid":"0000-0002-5823-3478","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","first":"Truong Thanh","key":"tungpau","last":"Tung","locid":"61a6697c-016d-4fc9-9303-f58fd43b5478","name":"Thanh Tung, Truong","name_org":"Tung, Truong Thanh","orcid":"0000-0002-5263-203X","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper","key":"olsenpau","last":"Olsen","locid":"2e527ce1-e5f9-44c3-8896-acd476b303ea","name":"Olsen, Jesper","orcid":"0000-0002-4445-5520","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","first":"John","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"b927452e-5c62-49fb-93f6-76877c08e407","name":"Nielsen, John","orcid":"0000-0002-2854-8188","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","first":"Søren Brøgger","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"7fa2901b-af37-44dc-bc6d-c1a674738eb7","name":"Christensen, Søren Brøgger","orcid":"0000-0002-5773-6874","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["28930456"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1021/acs.jnatprod.7b00106","issn":["01633864","15206025"],"issn_org":["01633864"],"issue":"10","journal":"Journal of Natural Products","pages":"2830-2834","publisher":"American Chemical Society","status":"p","title":"Journal of Natural Products","volume":"80"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85032579307"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-06bb14dd-b333-4603-848b-55b5c20aef66","ku-27d567c6-c641-43fb-bb3f-5f16bfa89255"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Metformin, an Anthropogenic Contaminant of Seidlitzia rosmarinus Collected in a Desert Region near the Gulf of Aqaba, Sinai Peninsula","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-095.73-013087","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"Phosphorus recycling from secondary materials like sewage sludge ashes offers an alternative to mining of phosphates from primary resources and a mean to counteract the current phosphorous rock depletion concern. A separation of P from the bulk ash is normally required, due to its low plant availability and the presence of heavy metals. Previously, more than 80% of P was recovered from incineration sewage sludge ashes using a two-compartment electrodialytic cell. In contrast, the recovery was below 30% for ashes from low-temperature gasification using the same setup. The low recovery was due to a high presence of Al- and Fe(III)-P bindings. In the present study, an electrodialytic process combining sequentially a pair of two-compartment cells allowed a recovery of up to 70% of phosphorus from these ashes. The use of a second cell, where the ash was suspended in an alkaline solution, allowed the P solubilisation from aluminium and ferric phosphates. In addition, P was separated from most metals as they became insoluble under the prevailing chemical environment. The obtained ratio of Al, Fe, Mg and most heavy metals to P was comparable to wet process phosphoric acid. Therefore, this sequential process was found to be suitable to recycle P and potentially use it in the production of common fertilizers like diammonium phosphate. ","author_count":5,"contributors":["Parés Viader, Raimon","Jensen, Pernille Erland","Ottosen, Lisbeth M.","Ahrenfeldt, Jesper","Hauggaard-Nielsen, Henrik"],"cuid":["S02-096.61-034376"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Electrodialysis","Heavy metals","Iron phosphates","Low temperature gasification","Phosphorus","Sewage sludge ash"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum","sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"sequential electrodialytic recovery of phosphorus from low temperature gasification ashes of chemically precipitated sewage sludge","src":["dtu","ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/130111874/Sequential_electrodialytic_recovery_of_phosphorus_from_low_temperature_gasification_ashes_of_chemically_precipitated_sewage_sludge.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S02-096.61-034376","identifier":[{"id":"85007402870","type":"scopus"},{"id":"27912988","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["dtu-4fd81171-7436-4c46-a920-4c3e516f296c","ruc-78307e69-7fd3-4944-9c31-756b0728fe6c"],"keyword":["Electrodialysis","Heavy metals","Iron phosphates","Low-temperature gasification","Phosphorus","Sewage sludge ash"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities","Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-F2AB3B27E1CF8D80E549536CCC376B9B"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/59945971/Sequential_electrodialytic_recovery_of_phosphorus_from_low_temperature_gasification_ashes_of_chemically_precipitated_sewage_sludge.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/130111874/Sequential_electrodialytic_recovery_of_phosphorus_from_low_temperature_gasification_ashes_of_chemically_precipitated_sewage_sludge.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Humanities (HUM)","Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2017","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Techn