{"abstract":"Novel cross-sectorial and transdisciplinary work on climate impacts has led to a shared, local knowledge and visions’ platform for adaptation and planning. A regional center for coastal water sector related research and innovation on climate change adaptation is becoming reality: the ‘Climatorium’.","author_count":23,"contributors":["Sørensen, Carlo Sass","N. Holmegaard, Lars","Damgaard, Thomas","Vrist, Christian","Molgaard, Mads R.","S. Schow, Charlotte","Hviid, Bo","Jensen, Albert","Sørensen, Thomas","Broge, Niels","F. Levinsen, Joanna","Sørensen, Per","Thomsen, Mie","H. Jensen, Jesper","Frambøl, Charlotte","Mogree, Pieter","Harbo, Kirsten","Andersen, Flemming","M. Katborg, Kim","Nielsen, Jan","B. Andersen, Thomas","Knudsen, Per","Vognsen, Karsten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-354332"],"event":{"end":"2017-10-12","place":"Aarhus, dk","start":"2017-10-10","title":"15th Nordic Wastewater Conference","year":"2017"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-NP","DI-OT","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"NP":["DI-NP-ALL","DI-NP-RAM"],"OT":["Lemvig municipality"],"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-NP-RAM","DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"transcending sectors pooling visions and surging ahead","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/140545042/Sorensen_Holmegaard_et_al_NORDIWA2017_abstract.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-354332","ids":["dtu-a6b0de25-3e2b-428e-9ce2-9eaf8f2353dc"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-41A06E8E361D1911DE0EAED1C86EFFC4"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/140545042/S