{"abstract":"Den danske Nigerekspedition under geografen Ole Olufsens ledelse, førte i samtiden til indsamlinger af genstande og præparater til Botanisk Museum, Zoologisk Museum samt Nationalmuseets Etnografiske Samling. Derudover onserverede de tre ekspeditionsdeltagere både fransk og britiske kolonial udførelse. Sidstnævnte betyder at ekspeditionen dokumenterer og nuancerer europæisk kolonialisme i 1927-28.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Kurt Nielsen, Jesper"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-755093"],"filters":{"added":"2024-09","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Ekspedition","Imperialisme","Kolonialisme"],"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-KUM"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-KUM"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"olufsens sidste rejse den danske nigerekspedition 000000001927 000000000028","src":["kum"],"src-code":["DI-GV-KUM"],"type":"db","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-755093","ids":["kum-457abe6c-465c-468a-854c-a27c28b29e8b"],"keyword":["Ekspedition","Imperialisme","Kolonialisme","Olaf Asmussen Hagerup","Ole Olufsen"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-50D3F12CD86148EA1DAFB8A82037C945"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"kum ministry of culture archives museums and royal library denmark","l2":"DI-GV","l2n":"Governmental Institutions","l3":"DI-GV-KUM","l3nn":"KUM Ministry of Culture - Archives, Museums, and Royal Library Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KUM Ministry of Culture - Archives, Museums, and Royal Library Denmark","namevar":["Ministry of Culture Denmark, The National Museum of Denmark"],"nora_code":"DI-GV-KUM","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesper","key":"kurtnielsenpau","last":"Kurt Nielsen","locid":"77adafc2-64b0-41b8-9853-e677e84ee34e","name":"Kurt Nielsen, Jesper","rank":1,"rolecode":"pa