{"abstract":"Discovering activities in the city around you can be difficult with traditional search engines unless you know what you are looking for. Searching for inspiration on things to do requires a more open-ended and explorative approach. We introduce transitory search as a dynamic way of uncovering information about activities in the city around you that allows the user to start from a vague idea of what they are interested in, and iteratively modify their search using slider continuums to discover best-fit results. We present the design of a smartphone app exemplifying the idea of transitory search and give results from a lab evaluation and a 4-week field deployment involving 15 people in two different cities. Our findings indicate that transitory search on a mobile device both supports discovering activities in the city and more interestingly helps users reflect on and shape their preferences in situ. We also found that ambiguous slider continuums work well as people happily form and refine individual interpretations of them.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Paay, Jeni","Kjeldskov, Jesper","Skov, Mikael B.","Nielsen, Per M.","Pearce, Jon"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-114862"],"event":{"acronym":"MobileHCI","end":"2016-09-09","place":"Florence, it","start":"2016-09-06","title":"18th International Conference on Human-Computer Interaction with Mobile Devices and Services, MobileHCI 2016","year":"2016"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["OECD","Oceania"],"country":["Australia"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Melbourne"],"keyword":["Explorative search"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"discovering activities in your city using transitory search","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=84991352091&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-114862","identifier":[{"id":"84991352091","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-dee0dec2-9ad8-4d4e-b0a5-70e678ad1319"],"keyword":["Event finding","Explorative search","Sliders","Transitory search"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-C72901E64A407A253CF1E2610EE06BDD"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science, Research Centre for Socio-Interactive Design"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"au","key":"university of melbourne","loc":["Australia","Oceania","OECD"],"name":"University of Melbourne","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jeni","key":"paaypau","last":"Paay","locid":"e75f8ac5-e726-4091-8c0c-0e0884bd139f","name":"Paay, Jeni","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper","key":"kjeldskovpau","last":"Kjeldskov","locid":"90f5514b-34fa-4d01-98dd-ed6166dd1489","name":"Kjeldskov, Jesper","orcid":"0000-0001-7990-4229","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mikael B.","key":"skovpau","last":"Skov","locid":"c82c4a8d-1612-4218-b5ab-35e729748eb8","name":"Skov, Mikael B.","orcid":"0000-0003-4488-5683","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Per M.","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"c1