{"abstract":"Cable bacteria are filamentous bacteria that electrically couple sulfide oxidation and oxygen reduction at centimeter distances, and observations in sediment environments have suggested that they are motile. By time-lapse microscopy, we found that cable bacteria used gliding motility on surfaces with a highly variable speed of 0.5±0.3 μms -1 (mean±standard deviation) and time between reversals of 155±108 s. They frequently moved forward in loops, and formation of twisted loops revealed helical rotation of the filaments. Cable bacteria responded to chemical gradients in their environment, and around the oxic-anoxic interface, they curled and piled up, with straight parts connecting back to the source of sulfide. Thus, it appears that motility serves the cable bacteria in establishing and keeping optimal connections between their distant electron donor and acceptors in a dynamic sediment environment.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Bjerg, Jesper Jensen","Damgaard, Lars Riis","Holm, Simon Agner","Schramm, Andreas","Nielsen, Lars Peter"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-160970"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Cable bacteria","Motility"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"motility of electric cable bacteria","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4907201/pdf/zam3816.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-160970","identifier":[{"id":"PMC4907201","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"27084019","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84976428031","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-375eaa5b-fabd-4673-83d4-b978770cab7d"],"keyword":["Cable bacteria","MOTILITY"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-D7882A808A06A924F784113CCFE5D826"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4907201/pdf/zam3816.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Department of Biology, Department of Biology - Microbiology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Tataru","key":"bjergpau","last":"Bjerg","locid":"682ae3d8-d830-4101-b5a3-494ea2e4e0be","name":"Bjerg, Jesper Jensen","name_org":"Bjerg, Jesper Tataru","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lars Riis","key":"damgaardpau","last":"Damgaard","locid":"c5cdd5ec-4f55-40bd-a82c-beb4648cdedd","name":"Damgaard, Lars Riis","orcid":"0000-0003-1036-269X","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Simon Agner","key":"holmpau","last":"Holm","name":"Holm, Simon Agner","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Andreas","key":"schrammpau","last":"Schramm","locid":"25080de3-b60e-46b4-a606-d99f1ec089e5","name":"Schramm, Andreas","orcid":"0000-0002-7614-9616","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lars Peter","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"7b1f70e1-663b-4a12-b10c-a12dfc320c81","name":"Nielsen, Lars Peter","orcid":"0000-0002-7269-4860","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["27084019"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1128/aem.01038-16","issn":["00992240","10985336"],"issn_org":["00992240"],"issue":"13","journal":"Applied and Environmental Microbiology","pages":"3816-3821","publisher":"American Society for Microbiology","status":"p","title":"Applied and Environmental Microbiology","volume":"82"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84976428031"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-375eaa5b-fabd-4673-83d4-b978770cab7d"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Motility of electric cable bacteria","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-160970","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"author_count":3,"contributors":["Jakobsen, Thomas Pelle","Nielsen, Jesper Buus","Orlandi, Claudio"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-162882"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-U"],"level3":{"GTS":["DI-GTS-ALL","DI-GTS-ALX"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-GTS-ALX","DI-U-AU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a framework for outsourcing of secure computation","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"doi","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://eprint.iacr.org/2016/037","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-162882","ids":["au-3ad4c27d-77cc-4687-a4c3-35a41be701b7"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-77557F13369B138BF719291C87510395"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://eprint.iacr.org/2016/037","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"alexandra institute","l2":"DI-GTS","l2n":"GTS Institutes","l3":"DI-GTS-ALX","l3nn":"Alexandra Institute","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Alexandra Institute","namevar":["Alexandra Instituttet A/S"],"nora_code":"DI-GTS-ALX","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Department of Computer Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas P.","key":"jakobsenpau","last":"Jakobsen","locid":"03cea827-2da0-4861-92c1-4162551c38c3","name":"Jakobsen, Thomas Pelle","name_org":"Jakobsen, Thomas P.","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Buus","key":"nielsenpau","last":