{"abstract":"PURPOSE: To describe the onset, duration, intensity, and nursing shift variation of agitated behavior in patients with acquired brain injury (ABI) at a rehabilitation hospital. DESIGN: Prospective descriptive study. METHODS: A total of 11 patients with agitated behavior were included. Agitated behavior was registered with the Agitated Behavior Scale (ABS). The nurse or therapist allocated the individual patient assessed ABS during each shift. Intensity of agitated behavior was tested using exact test. A within-subject shift effect was analyzed with repeated-measure ANOVA. FINDINGS: The onset of agitated behavior was at a median of 14 (1-28) days from admission. Seven patients remained agitated beyond 3 weeks from onset. Severe intensity of agitation was observed in 86 of 453 nursing shifts. Differences in agitated behavior between day, evening, and night shifts were found, F(2.20) = 7.90, p = .008, with tendencies of increased agitated behavior in day and evening shifts compared to night shifts. CONCLUSION: Agitated behavior had a late onset, was severe, and long-lasting in the present sample of patients. CLINICAL RELEVANCE: The study increases awareness on the potential challenge of agitated behavior in patients with ABI.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Aadal, Lena","Mortensen, Jesper","Nielsen, Jørgen Feldbæk"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-203744"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"monitoring agitated behavior after acquired brain injury onset duration intensity and nursing shift variation","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85028234240","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-203744","identifier":[{"id":"85028234240","type":"scopus"},{"id":"26542895","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-8235f886-b20a-4c60-95b6-e5118eadee9c"],"keyword":["Brain injury; cognitive; rehabilitation; quantitative research"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-66401FC72C5F6B61BC408D265855AA06"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Hammel Neurocenter, Universitetsklinik for Neurorehabilitering"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lena","key":"aadalpau","last":"Aadal","locid":"a3a1966b-710e-489c-a729-810645c717b5","name":"Aadal, Lena","orcid":"0000-0001-7365-3916","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper","key":"mortensenpau","last":"Mortensen","locid":"2b929317-14ec-499f-b8bd-f392162e2e65","name":"Mortensen, Jesper","orcid":"0000-0001-7285-3422","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jørgen Feldbaek","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"3fb25b9f-381b-44a6-a8dd-26eacf839d37","name":"Nielsen, Jørgen Feldbæk","name_org":"Nielsen, Jørgen Feldbaek","orcid":"0000-0001-5339-171X","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["26542895"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1002/rnj.251","issn":["02784807","20487940"],"issn_org":["02784807"],"journal":"Rehabilitation Nursing","pages":"1-9","publisher":"Lippincott Williams and Wilkins Ltd.","status":"p","title":"Rehabilitation Nursing","title_org":"Rehabilitation nursing : the official journal of the Association of Rehabilitation Nurses"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85028234240"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-8235f886-b20a-4c60-95b6-e5118eadee9c"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Monitoring Agitated Behavior After acquired Brain Injury : Onset, Duration, Intensity, and Nursing Shift Variation","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-203744","year":"2016","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"Side-channel attacks allow the adversary to gain partial knowledge of the secret key when cryptographic protocols are implemented in real-world hardware. The goal of leakage resilient cryptography is to design cryptosystems that withstand such attacks. In the auxiliary input model, an adversary is allowed to see a computationally hard-to-invert function of the secret key. The auxiliary input model weakens the bounded leakage assumption commonly made in leakage resilient cryptography as the hard-to-invert function may information-theoretically reveal the entire secret key. In this work, we propose the first constructions of digital signature schemes that are secure in the auxiliary input model. Our main contribution is a digital signature scheme that is secure against chosen message attacks when given any exponentially hard-to-invert function of the secret key. As a second contribution, we construct a signature scheme that achieves security for random messages assuming that the adversary is given a polynomial-time hard-to-invert function (where both the challenge as well as the signatures seen prior to that are computed on random messages). Here, polynomial hardness is required even when given the entire public key. We further show that such signature schemes readily give us auxiliary input secure identification schemes.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Faust, Sebastian","Hazay, Carmit","Nielsen, Jesper Buus","Nordholt, Peter Sebastian","Zottarel, Angela"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-255530"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, Middle East","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Faust, Sebastian"],"country":["Israel","Switzerland"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Bar-Ilan University","Laboratory of Integrative and Systems Physiology, School of Life Sciences, École Polytechnique Fédérale, 1015 Lausanne, Switzerland."],"keyword":["Attacks","Encryption"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-U"],"level3":{"GTS":["DI-GTS-ALL","DI-GTS-ALX"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-GTS-ALX","DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"signature schemes secure against hard to invert leakage","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84959132521","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-255530","identifier":[{"id":"84959132521","type":"scopus"},{"id":"000371077900005","type":"wos"}],"ids":["au-dd1a7486-7d46-4e94-96b9-51d640df3df9"],"keyword":["ATTACKS","ENCRYPTION"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-5F295F64D27F062F33D3DEBF38927D0A"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"ch","key":"laboratory of integrative and systems physiology school of life sciences école polytechnique fédérale 1015 lausanne switzerland","loc":["Switzerland","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"Laboratory of Integrative and Systems Physiology, School of Life Sciences, École Polytechnique Fédérale, 1015 Lausanne, Switzerland.","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"il","key":"bar ilan university","loc":["Israel","Asia, Middle East","OECD"],"name":"Bar-Ilan University","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Department of Computer Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"4","key":"alexandra institute","l2":"DI-GTS","l2n":"GTS Institutes","l3":"DI-GTS-ALX","l3nn":"Alexandra Institute","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Alexandra Institute","namevar":["Alexandra Instituttet A/S"],"nora_code":"DI-GTS-ALX","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Sebastian","key":"faustpau","last":"Faust","name":"Faust, Sebastian","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Carmit","key":"hazaypau","last":"Hazay","name":"Hazay, Carmit","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Buus","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"f428c4b3-80b3-403a-ada6-9ecb0fad97b2","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Buus","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Peter Sebastian","key":"nordholtpau","last":"Nordholt","locid":"45ed0f2e-3f58-4839-b089-4ba3cd802323","name":"Nordholt, Peter Sebastian","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Angela","key":"zottarelpau","last":"Zottarel","locid":"394061f9-826e-4304-9343-85b519672c62","name":"Zottarel, Angela","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/s00145-015-9197-1","issn":["09332790","14321378"],"issn_org":["09332790"],"issue":"2","journal":"Journal of Cryptology","pages":"422-455","publisher":"Springer","status":"p","title":"Journal of Cryptology","volume":"29"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84959132521"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All GTS Institutes","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-GTS-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","GTS Institutes","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-dd1a7486-7d46-4e94-96b9-51d640df3df9"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Signature Schemes Secure Against Hard-to-Invert Leakage","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-255530","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"Ninety-one HIV-infected individuals (61 men and 30 women) were randomized to vaccination either with quadrivalent (Gardasil™) or bivalent (Cervarix™) HPV vaccine. Neutralizing and specific HPV-binding serum antibodies were measured at baseline and 12 months after the first vaccine dose. Presence of neutralizing and binding antibodies had good agreement (average Kappa for HPV types 6, 11, 16, 18, 31, 33 and 45 was 0.65). At baseline, 88% of subjects had antibodies against at least one genital HPV. Following vaccination with Cervarix™, all subjects became seropositive for HPV16 and 18. After Gardasil™ vaccination, 96% of subjects seroconverted for HPV16 and 73% for HPV18. Levels of HPV16-specific antibodies were <1 international unit (IU) in 87% of study subjects before vaccination but >10IU in 85% of study subjects after vaccination. Antibodies against non-vaccine HPV types appeared after Gardasil™ vaccination for >50% of vaccinated females for HPV 31, 35 and 73 and for >50% of Cervarix™-vaccinated females for HPV 31, 33, 35, 45, 56 and 58. Cross-reactivity with non-genital HPV types was also detected. In conclusion, HIV-infected subjects responded to HPV vaccination with induction of neutralizing antibodies against both vaccine and non-vaccine types.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Faust, Helena","Nielsen, Lars Toft","Sehr, Peter","Müller, Martin","Bonde, Jesper","Forslund, Ola","Østergaard, Lars Jørgen","Tolstrup, Martin","Dillner, Joakim"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-260739"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Cervarix","Gardasil™","HIV","HPV","Seroconversion"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"human papillomavirus neutralizing and cross reactive antibodies induced in hiv positive subjects after vaccination with quadrivalent and bivalent hpv vaccines","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84960463991","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-260739","identifier":[{"id":"84960463991","type":"scopus"},{"id":"26896686","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-e620d315-7cde-4a8e-b77b-c18bf304b5ed"],"keyword":["Cervarix™","Gardasil™","HIV","HPV","Pseudovirions","Seroconversion"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-3AEF2972B26FFF52FD69A597DA6E96F0"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Department of Infectious Diseases"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Helena","key":"faustpau","last":"Faust","name":"Faust, Helena","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lars Toft","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"57593d7e-a6df-4659-a4c9-08c8c7e155aa","name":"Nielsen, Lars Toft","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Peter","key":"sehrpau","last":"Sehr","name":"Sehr, Peter","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Martin","key":"müllerpau","last":"Müller","name":"Müller, Martin","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesper","key":"bondepau","last":"Bonde","locid":"4b12f240-d09e-4563-8035-d3cbbe4601bf","name":"Bonde, Jesper","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Ola","key":"forslundpau","last":"Forslund","name":"Forslund, Ola","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lars Jørgen","key":"østergaardpau","last":"Østergaard","locid":"fb8358a6-187a-4d5f-8187-06051ed74173","name":"Østergaard, Lars Jørgen","orcid":"0000-0003-2459-0511","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Martin","key":"tolstruppau","last":"Tolstrup","locid":"36e9f1d5-608c-46b7-8d41-2505c02086fc","name":"Tolstrup, Martin","orcid":"0000-0001-7020-5173","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Joakim","key":"dillnerpau","last":"Dillner","name":"Dillner, Joakim","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["26896686"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.vaccine.2016.02.019","issn":["0264410X","13552732"],"issn_org":["0264410X"],"issue":"13","journal":"Vaccine","pages":"1559-1565","publisher":"Elsevier Ltd","status":"p","title":"Vaccine","volume":"34"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84960463991"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-e620d315-7cde-4a8e-b77b-c18bf304b5ed"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Human Papillomavirus neutralizing and cross-reactive antibodies induced in HIV-positive subjects after vaccination with quadrivalent and bivalent HPV vaccines","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-260739","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"Incineration of sewage sludge is a common practice in many western countries. Gasification is an attractive option because of its high energy efficiency and flexibility in the usage of the produced gas. However, they both unavoidably produce sewage sludge ash (SSA), a material which is rich in phosphorus (P), but that it is commonly landfilled or used in construction materials. With current uncertainty in phosphate rock (PR) supply, P recovery from SSA has become interesting. In the present work, ashes from incineration and gasification of the same sewage sludge were compared in terms of P extractability using electrodialytic (ED) methods. The results show that comparable recovery rates of P were achieved with a single ED step for incineration SSA and a sequential combination of two ED steps for gasification SSA, which was due to a higher influence of Fe and/or Al in P solubility for the latter. A product with lower level of metallic impurities and comparable to wet process phosphoric acid (WPA) was eventually obtained from gasification SSA. Thus, gasification becomes an interesting alternative to incineration also in terms of P separation.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Parés Viader, Raimon","Jensen, Pernille Erland","Ottosen, Lisbeth M.","Thomsen, Tobias Pape","Ahrenfeldt, Jesper","Hauggaard-Nielsen, Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-325980"],"event":{"end":"2016-06-09","place":"Malmö, se","start":"2016-06-07","title":"2nd IWA Conference on Holistic Sludge Management","year":"2016"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Electrodialysis","Heavy metals","Incineration","Low temperature gasification","Phosphorus","Sewage sludge ash"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"comparison of phosphorus recovery from incineration and gasification sewage sludge ash","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-325980","ids":["dtu-47ff5733-0ccc-4d10-a26d-911f5b6335c1"],"keyword":["Electrodialysis","Heavy metals","Incineration","Low-temperature gasification","Phosphorus","Sewage sludge ash"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-DBEB3AC2B947963AEAB94C0EDDB9ED18"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Civil Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Civil Engineering, ARTEK, Section for Arctic Engineering and Sustainable Solutions"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Raimon","key":"parésviaderpau","last":"Parés Viader","locid":"d5b464c6-90ab-4f44-8f76-3d0295518738","name":"Parés Viader, Raimon","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Pernille Erland","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"c21f7bd4-85f5-420a-b31b-51a5c58bc254","name":"Jensen, Pernille Erland","orcid":"0000-0003-4718-1630","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lisbeth M.","key":"ottosenpau","last":"Ottosen","locid":"653cfe69-d98d-42ec-b241-5409bbfc951c","name":"Ottosen, Lisbeth M.","orcid":"0000-0001-7756-382X","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Tobias Pape","key":"thomsenpau","last":"Thomsen","locid":"f75a7756-932a-4066-8a74-8955f3f30f55","name":"Thomsen, Tobias Pape","orcid":"0000-0003-3597-7199","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper","key":"ahrenfeldtpau","last":"Ahrenfeldt","locid":"9fef4394-4b16-4061-8cc6-0da0fe3996b3","name":"Ahrenfeldt, Jesper","orcid":"0000-0002-3999-5864","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik","key":"hauggaardnielsenpau","last":"Hauggaard-Nielsen","locid":"ccc14efd-163a-46ec-865c-cdfd086c15fe","name":"Hauggaard-Nielsen, Henrik","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","sdg":["7. Affordable and Clean Energy","All UN SDG Classification"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-47ff5733-0ccc-4d10-a26d-911f5b6335c1"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Comparison of phosphorus recovery from incineration and gasification sewage sludge ash","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-325980","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"Microwave diagnostics will play an increasingly important role in burning plasma fusion energy experiments like ITER and beyond. The Collective Thomson Scattering (CTS) diagnostic to be installed at ITER is an example of such a diagnostic with great potential in present and future experiments. The ITER CTS diagnostic will inject a 1 MW 60 GHz gyrotron beam into the ITER plasma and observe the scattering off fluctuations in the plasma — to monitor the dynamics of the fast ions generated in the fusion reactions.","author_count":17,"contributors":["Korsholm, Søren Bang","Leipold, Frank","Goncalves, B.","Gutierrez Espinoza, Heidi Estibaliz","Jensen, T.","Jessen, Martin","Klinkby, Esben Bryndt","Larsen, Axel Wright","Naulin, Volker","Nielsen, Stefan Kragh","Nonbøl, Erik","Oosterbeek, H.","Rasmussen, Jesper","Salewski, Mirko","Sanchez, P.","Stejner Pedersen, Morten","Taormina, Arianna"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-331258"],"event":{"end":"2016-09-30","place":"Copenhagen, dk","start":"2016-09-25","title":"41st International Conference on Infrared, Millimeter and Terahertz Waves","year":"2016"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Netherlands","Portugal","Spain"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Eindhoven University of Technology","Fusion For Energy","University of Lisbon"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"high power microwave diagnostic for the fusion energy experiment iter","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/139684209/IRMMW_synopsis_Korsholm_ITER_CTS_PID4361567.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-331258","identifier":[{"id":"85006147279","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-59c1f7e0-55d7-446c-872c-474ca3561252"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-FC2D35266CA290ECD13F6620E0D7EEC7"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/139684209/IRMMW_synopsis_Korsholm_ITER_CTS_PID4361567.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Physics","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Physics, Plasma Physics and Fusion Energy"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"pt","key":"university of lisbon","loc":["Portugal","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Lisbon","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"nl","key":"eindhoven university of technology","loc":["Netherlands","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Eindhoven University of Technology","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"es","key":"fusion for energy","loc":["Spain","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Fusion For Energy","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Søren Bang","key":"korsholmpau","last":"Korsholm","locid":"cc3d86b6-81c5-4e9b-99dd-3933c1d56f7d","name":"Korsholm, Søren Bang","orcid":"0000-0001-7160-8361","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Frank","key":"leipoldpau","last":"Leipold","locid":"fb1ca27f-36e0-43a2-8779-3d8135a2a8dc","name":"Leipold, Frank","orcid":"0000-0003-3107-6713","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"B.","key":"goncalvespau","last":"Goncalves","name":"Goncalves, B.","rank":3,"rol