{"abstract":"Fundamental frequency estimation is a very important task in many applications involving periodic signals. For computational reasons, fast autocorrelation-based estimation methods are often used despite parametric estimation methods having superior estimation accuracy. However, these parametric methods are much more costly to run. In this paper, we propose an algorithm which significantly reduces the computational cost of an accurate maximum likelihood-based estimator for real-valued data. The computational cost is reduced by exploiting the matrix structure of the problem and by using a recursive solver. Via benchmarks, we demonstrate that the computation time is reduced by approximately two orders of magnitude. The proposed fast algorithm is available for download online.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Nielsen, Jesper Kjær","Jensen, Tobias Lindstrøm","Jensen, Jesper Rindom","Christensen, Mads Græsbøll","Jensen, Søren Holdt"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-099968"],"event":{"acronym":"ICASSP","end":"2016-03-25","place":"Shanghai, cn","start":"2016-03-20","title":"The 41st IEEE International Conference on Acoustics, Speech and Signal Processing","year":"2016"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Fast algorithm","Fundamental frequency estimation"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"fast and statistically efficient fundamental frequency estimation","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/240352216/master.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-099968","identifier":[{"id":"84973279747","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-ac00834b-60db-4f84-9ba7-1606fea36a6c"],"keyword":["Toeplitz-plus-Hankel solver","fast algorithm","fundamental frequency estimation"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-9BD29B342F9E688A3D864B41EF547FAA"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/240352216/master.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology, Section for Media Technology - Campus Aalborg"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Kjær","key":"nielsenjesperkjærpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"3d21c73c-3aa1-4590-870f-8be578634702","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Kjær","orcid":"0000-0002-2586-7925","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Tobias Lindstrøm","key":"jensentobiaslindstrømpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"a2e382fc-c4c6-4ff2-b7d2-8b012eb5160e","name":"Jensen, Tobias Lindstrøm","orcid":"0000-0003-4262-0577","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Rindom","key":"jensenjesperrindompau","last":"Jensen","locid":"af897213-5e0d-41e9-8e3c-a89d3ca4a5b1","name":"Jensen, Jesper Rindom","orcid":"0000-0001-6023-8270","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Mads Græsbøll","key":"christensenmadsgræsbøllpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"cf9e922d-e5f8-4964-9b84-581667f97b0b","name":"Christensen, Mads Græsbøll","orcid":"0000-0003-3586-7969","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Søren Holdt","key":"jensensørenholdtpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"bfd2a53b-f2bd-4563-8968-9a911996215f","name":"Jensen, Søren Holdt","orcid":"0000-0002-1050-470X","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/icassp.2016.7471642","eisbn":["9781479999880"],"issn":["15206149"],"pages":"86-90","publisher":"IEEE (Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers)","series":"IEEE International Conference on Acoustics, Speech and Signal Processing. Proceedings","status":"p","title":"Acoustics, Speech and Signal Processing (ICASSP), 2016 IEEE International Conference on"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84973279747"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-ac00834b-60db-4f84-9ba7-1606fea36a6c"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Fast and Statistically Efficient Fundamental Frequency Estimation","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-099968","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"Formålet med dette notat er at afklare, hvor gode sammenlignelige nedbørsobservationer målt med disdrometer og SVK vippekars-regnmålere kan forventes at være. De to typer af nedbørsmålere anvender signifikant forskelligt måleprincip, hvorfor forskelle kan forventes mellem de to typer af observationer. Data anvendt i analysen stammer fra to lokaliteter i Danmark; Frejlev ved Aalborg og Vejle renseanlæg. Fælles for disse lokaliteter er, at der her er placeret et OTT Parsivel laser disdrometer (Löffler-Mang og Joss (2000), OTT Messtechnik (2009)) i umiddelbar nærhed af en SVK RIMCO vippekar regnmåler (SVK, 1999). Sammenligningen er foretaget for hele år 2015 i Frejlev. Men da disdrometeret i Vejle først blev installeret i starten af februar 2015, er januar måned ikke medtaget for denne lokalitet.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Nielsen, Jesper Ellerbæk","Thorndahl, Søren Liedtke","Rasmussen, Michael R."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-104669"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Nedbør","Observationer","Vejle"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"sammenligning af disdrometerobservationer og spildevandskomiteens regnmålersystem","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/226021686/Sammenligning_af_disdrometerobservationer_og_Spildevandskomiteens_regnm_lersystem.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-104669","ids":["aau-bc686e5f-e63c-4bab-bc11-f10946ef83d1"],"keyword":["Disdrometer","Frejlev","Nedbør","Nedbørsobservationer","Observationer","SVK vippekars-regnmålere","Vejle"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-50A327BD5BAB6808BA90A2C7C194957F"]