{"abstract":"Purpose: The purpose of this study was to investigate the pathophysiologic heterogeneity of Fuchs endothelial corneal dystrophy (FECD). Methods: We conducted a systematic immunofluorescence study on 39 Descemet membrane samples from FECD patients and compared these with 10 Descemet membrane samples from patients with pseudophakic bullous keratopathy (PBK) and 7 normal corneas. Samples were analyzed with immunofluorescence using antibodies to the a1-chain [collagen VIII a1-chain (COL8A1)] and a2-chain (COL8A2). Intensity of staining was assessed using a subjective grading scale from 0 to 3. The presence of specific staining patterns was noted. Results: The overall distribution of COL8A1 staining intensity between groups was significantly different (P = 0.002). There was marked/intense staining in 85% (33/39) of the FECD samples, 40% (4/10) of the PBK samples (P = 0.034), and 29% (2/7) of normal samples (P = 0.004). The overall distribution of COL8A2 staining intensity was not significantly different between groups (P = 0.39). There was marked/intense staining in 33% (13/39) of the FECD samples, 10% (1/10) of PBK samples, and 14% (1/7) of the normal samples. There was substantial variation in staining intensity in the FECD group, a phenomenon that was especially pronounced for the COL8A2 antibody. Conclusions: We found increased staining for COL8A1, but not COL8A2 in FECD samples. Further, there was striking variation of staining intensity in FECD patients, indicating pathophysiological heterogeneity.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Nielsen, Esben","Nielsen, Kim","Ivarsen, Anders","Greenhill, Nicholas S","Davis, Paul F","Hjortdal, Jesper"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-246839"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Collagen VIII","Cornea","Endothelium","Fuchs endothelial corneal dystrophy","Pathology"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"fuchs endothelial corneal dystrophy a systematic immunofluorescence study of collagen type viii suggests heterogeneous pathophysiology","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84963533319","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-246839","identifier":[{"id":"84963533319","type":"scopus"},{"id":"27078008","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-cd937c80-7c87-4d6c-9fa8-279cb6bcfc67"],"keyword":["Collagen VIII","Cornea","Endothelium","Fuchs endothelial corneal dystrophy","Pathology"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-7C6A85D657CF79294C90F64345AF1DC8"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Department of Ophthalmology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Esben","key":"nielsenesbenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"242d1c56-f540-479d-87ad-68df850f2587","name":"Nielsen, Esben","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Kim","key":"nielsenkimpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"fd36656a-1aa7-48bb-9135-b85808617582","name":"Nielsen, Kim","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anders","key":"ivarsenanderspau","last":"Ivarsen","locid":"072c0ad1-1c62-4539-8b63-868ff8422866","name":"Ivarsen, Anders","orcid":"0000-0003-1466-4804","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Nicholas S","key":"greenhillnicholasspau","last":"Greenhill","name":"Greenhill, Nicholas S","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Paul F","key":"davispaulfpau","last":"Davis","name":"Davis, Paul F","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper","key":"hjortdaljesperpau","last":"Hjortdal","locid":"b69f284e-e209-49a7-9d0d-9eeff6a8feb3","name":"Hjortdal, Jesper","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["27078008"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1097/ico.0000000000000848","issn":["02773740","15364798"],"issn_org":["02773740"],"issue":"6","journal":"Cornea","pages":"872-7","publisher":"Lippincott Williams and Wilkins","status":"p","title":"Cornea","volume":"35"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84963533319"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-cd937c80-7c87-4d6c-9fa8-279cb6bcfc67"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Fuchs Endothelial Corneal Dystrophy : A Systematic Immunofluorescence Study of Collagen Type VIII Suggests Heterogeneous Pathophysiology","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-246839","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"We study data structure problems related to document indexing and pattern matching queries and our main contribution is to show that the pointer machine model of computation can be extremely useful in proving high and unconditional lower bounds that cannot be obtained in any other known model of computation with the current techniques. Often our lower bounds match the known space-query time trade-off curve and in fact for all the problems considered, there is a very good and reasonable match between our lower bounds and the known upper bounds, at least for some choice of input parameters. The problems that we consider are set intersection queries (both the reporting variant and the semi-group counting variant), indexing a set of documents for two-pattern queries, or forbiddenpattern queries, or queries with wild-cards, and indexing an input set of gapped-patterns (or two-patterns) to find those matching a document given at the query time.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Afshani, Peyman","Nielsen, Jesper Asbjørn Sindahl"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-262529"],"event":{"acronym":"ICALP","end":"2016-07-15","place":"Rome, it","start":"2016-07-12","title":"ICALP 2016","year":"2016"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Data structure lower bounds","Pattern matching","Pointer machine","Set Intersection"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"data structure lower bounds for document indexing problems","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.4230/LIPIcs.ICALP.2016.93","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-262529","identifier":[{"id":"85012933623","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-e96a50db-0658-481b-9d9f-75c704dbadd6"],"keyword":["Data Structure Lower Bounds","Pattern Matching","Pointer Machine","Set Intersection"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-1FE540CF966FAA12644129E06268833D"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/110153409/paper.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.4230/LIPIcs.ICALP.2016.93","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Department of Computer Science","Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Department of Computer Science, Department of Computer Science - Center for Massive Data Algoritmics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Peyman","key":"afshanipau","last":"Afshani","locid":"83ec0afd-4428-4aaa-b748-9f10e55c98af","name":"Afshani, Peyman","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesper Asbjørn Sindahl","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"b70668c1-8833-4c48-be91-7e3552de7773","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Asbjørn Sindahl","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Ioannis","key":"chatzigiannakispedh","last":"Chatzigiannakis","name":"Chatzigiannakis, Ioannis","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Michael","key":"mitzenmacherpedh","last":"Mitzenmacher","name":"Mitzenmacher, Michael","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Yuval","key":"rabanipedh","last":"Rabani","name":"Rabani, Yuval","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Davide","key":"sangiorgipedh","last":"Sangiorgi","name":"Sangiorgi, Davide","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.4230/lipics.icalp.2016.93","eisbn":["9783959770132"],"isbn":["9783959770132"],"issn":["18688969"],"publisher":"Dagstuhl Publishing","series":"Leibniz International Proceedings in Informatics","status":"p","title":"43rd International Colloquium on Automata, Languages, and Programming (ICALP 2016)","volume":"55"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85012933623"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-e96a50db-0658-481b-9d9f-75c704dbadd6"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Data Structure Lower Bounds for Document Indexing Problems","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-262529","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"Non-linear wave-wave interactions in fusion plasmas, such as the parametric decay instability (PDI) of gyrotron radiation, can potentially hamper the use of microwave diagnostics. Here we report on anomalous scattering in the ASDEX Upgrade tokamak during electron cyclotron resonance heating experiments. The observations can be linked to parametric decay of the gyrotron radiation at the second harmonic upper hybrid resonance layer.","author_count":12,"contributors":["Nielsen, Stefan Kragh","Jacobsen, Asger Schou","Hansen, Søren Kjer","Korsholm, Søren Bang","Leipold, Frank","Rasmussen, Jesper","Salewski, Mirko","Stejner Pedersen, Morten","Denk, S.","Stober, J.","Schubert, M.","Wagner, D."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-320189"],"event":{"end":"2016-09-30","place":"Copenhagen, dk","start":"2016-09-25","title":"41st International Conference on Infrared, Millimeter and Terahertz Waves","year":"2016"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Germany"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Max Planck Institute for Plasma Physics"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"three wave interaction during electron cyclotron resonance heating and current drive","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85006096949","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-320189","identifier":[{"id":"85006096949","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-346c1295-8491-407a-9556-04dd7a0ffc73"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-563452FDB9EC857BA5425B2FA2F70261"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Physics","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Physics, Plasma Physics and Fusion Energy"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"de","key":"max planck institute for plasma physics","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Max Planck Institute for Plasma Physics","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Stefan Kragh","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"185da313-7f9e-45e7-9ee7-83306c90e806","name":"Nielsen, Stefan Kragh","orcid":"0000-0003-4175-3829","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Asger Schou","key":"jacobsenpau","last":"Jacobsen","locid":"2cf25f5f-7ac3-4206-b331-68303e95a7f8","name":"Jacobsen, Asger Schou","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Kjer","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","name":"Hansen, Søren Kjer","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Søren Bang","key":"korsholmpau","last":"Korsholm","locid":"cc3d86b6-81c5-4e9b-99dd-3933c1d56f7d","name":"Korsholm, Søren Bang","orcid":"0000-0001-7160-8361","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Frank","key":"leipoldpau","last":"Leipold","locid":"fb1ca27f-36e0-43a2-8779-3d8135a2a8dc","name":"Leipold, Frank","orcid":"0000-0003-3107-6713","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"64e646b9-b8d3-4a78-ad01-598d07290029","name":"Rasmussen, Jesper","orcid":"0000-0002-3947-1518","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","