{"abstract":"De fleste bilister kender til, at hastigheden sænkes, når det regner, eller når der er sne på vejen. Med data for Køge Bugt motorvejen er det undersøgt, hvor meget det typisk drejer sig om. Det viser sig at ligge under 10% og er ofte væsentlig mindre. Der er overraskende lavt set i internationalt perspektiv, men kan skyldes at rigtigt dårligt vejr er et relativt sjældent fænomen i Danmark. Dog kan klimaforandringerne måske ændre vejrets betydning for hastighederne fremover. DMI forventer, at det fremtidige klima i Danmark bliver varmere med tørrere somre og vådere vintre. Men selvom sommernedbøren forventes at blive mindre, forventes nedbøren at falde mere intenst og dermed give flere dage med kraftig regn.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Jensen, Thomas","Nielsen, Jesper Ellerbæk"],"cuid":["S02-086.67-007891"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Hastighed","Regn"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"vejret og hastigheden på motorvej","src":["aau","dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://issuu.com/trafikogveje/docs/togv_maj_2016_zkxw_for_abonnenter","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-086.67-007891","ids":["aau-a35098c1-82a1-4282-a2eb-5199cfa24bc4","dtu-016fdc37-2be3-4de3-a22d-2a95b75a7bee"],"keyword":["Hastighed","Køge Bugt motorvejen","Regn","Regnvejr","Vejret"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-2-A3B98DAA22335F210C1A1C003DDC8472"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://issuu.com/trafikogveje/docs/togv_maj_2016_zkxw_for_abonnenter","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Management Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Transport","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Transport, Transport policy and behaviour"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Civil Engineering","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Civil Engineering, Division of Water and Environment (CIVIL)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of the Built Environment, Division of Civil and Environmental Engineering","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of the Built Environment, Urban Water Research Group"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Thomas Christian","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"508d2414-4535-4780-a206-70fc21d83e55","name":"Jensen, Thomas Christian","orcid":"0000-0002-1942-2014","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Ellerbæk","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"f850e281-27d9-4783-84c8-3048e7819444","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Ellerbæk","orcid":"0000-0003-4596-0948","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["19037384"],"issue":"5","journal":"Trafik & Veje","pages":"43-45","publisher":"Dansk Vejtidsskrift ApS","status":"p","title":"Trafik & Veje"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-a35098c1-82a1-4282-a2eb-5199cfa24bc4","dtu-016fdc37-2be3-4de3-a22d-2a95b75a7bee"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Vejret og hastigheden på motorvej","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-086.67-007891","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"A 2015 consensus paper proposed a unified definition of the early repolarization (ER) pattern based upon quantification of end-QRS notches and slurs in the ECG. In this study we investigated the relationship between end-QRS concave 'bite' segments in the vectorcardiogram (VCG) and the consensus ER pattern. We reviewed digital 12-lead ECG recordings from 1561 subjects in whom out-of-hospital cardiac arrest was later witnessed. ECGs were made available by the Copenhagen General Practitioners' Laboratory. The consensus criteria were used to quantify notches and slurs. ER manifestations were divided into 3 types: A) notches only B) notch and slur C) slurs only. An automatic algorithm developed by the authors were used to quantify bites in 3D. 85 of the 1561 subjects (5.4%) fulfilled the ECG consensus criteria for ER. End-QRS bites were present in 100 % of cases for types A and B and in 92 % of the cases for type C. Subjects with ER type A had the highest median bite amplitude with 79 μV, followed by 60 μV for type B and 36 μV for type C. Our investigation of end-QRS morphology in ER suggest the existence of a continuous transition from slurring to notching governed by the size of 3D VCG bites.","author_count":19,"contributors":["Sørensen, Peter Lyngø","Sørensen, Kasper","Melgaard, Jacob","Struijk, Johannes","Hansen, Steen Møller","Kanters, Jørgen K.","Nielsen, Jonas B.","Svendsen, Jesper H.","Haunsø, Stig","Køber, Lars","Holst, Anders G.","Pietersen, Adrian","Torp-Pedersen, Christian","Lippert, Freddy K.","Graff, Claus"],"cuid":["S02-087.59-008333"],"event":{"end":"2016-09-14","place":"Vancouver, ca","start":"2016-09-11","title":"43rd Computing in Cardiology Conference, CinC 2016","year":"2016"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a vectorcardiographic evaluation of the consensus criteria for early repolarization","src":["aau","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.22489/CinC.2016.061-436","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-087.59-008333","identifier":[{"id":"85016119562","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-ad16aeee-7fcf-4405-a7b8-904aa9b6015b","ku-8205619d-3426-4b66-a766-6f07942bbd0d"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-2A486CFA9C30F143D60F8BBCD8FBC771"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.cinc.org/archives/2016/pdf/061-436.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.22489/CinC.2016.061-436","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/7868714/","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Health Science and Technology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Health Science and Technology, Medical Informatics Group (CT)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet,