{"abstract":"We demonstrate the combination of fast-ion D-alpha spectroscopy (FIDA) and collective Thomson scattering (CTS) measurements to determine a common best estimate of the fastion velocity distribution function by velocity-space tomography. We further demonstrate a benchmark of FIDA tomography and CTS measurements without using a numerical simulation as common reference. Combined velocity-space tomographies from FIDA and CTS measurements confirm that sawtooth crashes reduce the fast-ion phase-space densities in the plasma center and affect ions with pitches close to one more strongly than those with pitches close to zero.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Jacobsen, Asger Schou","Salewski, Mirko","Geiger, B.","Korsholm, Søren Bang","Leipold, Frank","Nielsen, Stefan Kragh","Rasmussen, Jesper","Stejner Pedersen, Morten","Weiland, M."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-316284"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Germany"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Max Planck Institute for Plasma Physics"],"keyword":["Collective Thomson scattering","Fast ion D alpha spectroscopy","Sawtooth crash","Tokamak","Velocity space tomography"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"benchmark and combined velocity space tomography of fast ion d alpha spectroscopy and collective thomson scattering measurements","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84962209551","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-316284","identifier":[{"id":"84962209551","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-276cd985-b7f7-4ac1-9082-1b965049e55b"],"keyword":["Collective Thomson scattering","Fast-ion D-alpha spectroscopy","Sawtooth crash","Tokamak","Velocity-space tomography"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-7B4513E45DE7EA13563F9BA4C6F18D17"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Physics","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Physics, Plasma Physics and Fusion Energy"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"de","key":"max planck institute for plasma physics","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Max Planck Institute for Plasma Physics","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Asger Schou","key":"jacobsenpau","last":"Jacobsen","locid":"2cf25f5f-7ac3-4206-b331-68303e95a7f8","name":"Jacobsen, Asger Schou","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mirko","key":"salewskipau","last":"Salewski","locid":"38100e3a-6385-47d3-aa2d-6fc5608a8649","name":"Salewski, Mirko","orcid":"0000-0002-3699-679X","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"B.","key":"geigerpau","last":"Geiger","name":"Geiger, B.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Søren Bang","key":"korsholmpau","last":"Korsholm","locid":"cc3d86b6-81c5-4e9b-99dd-3933c1d56f7d","name":"Korsholm, Søren Bang","orcid":"0000-0001-7160-8361","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Frank","key":"leipoldpau","last":"Leipold","locid":"fb1ca27f-36e0-43a2-8779-3d8135a2a8dc","name":"Leipold, Frank","orcid":"0000-0003-3107-6713","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Stefan Kragh","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"185da313-7f9e-45e7-9ee7-83306c90e806","name":"Nielsen, Stefan Kragh","orcid":"0000-0003-4175-3829","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"64e646b9-b8d3-4a78-ad01-598d07290029","name":"Rasmussen, Jesper","orcid":"0000-0002-3947-1518","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Morten Stejner","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"5e16534e-b167-4a1f-a316-ea12e478d879","name":"Stejner Pedersen, Morten","name_org":"Pedersen, Morten Stejner","orcid":"0000-0003-1300-8135","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"M.","key":"weilandpau","last":"Weiland","name":"Weiland, M.","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1088/0741-3335/58/4/042002","issn":["07413335","13616587"],"issn_org":["07413335"],"issue":"4","journal":"Plasma Physics and Controlled Fusion","paperid":"042002","publisher":"IOP Publishing","status":"p","title":"Plasma Physics and Controlled Fusion","volume":"58"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84962209551"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-276cd985-b7f7-4ac1-9082-1b965049e55b"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Benchmark and combined velocity-space tomography of fast-ion D-alpha spectroscopy and collective Thomson scattering measurements","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-316284","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"Scattered millimeter waves entering from the collective Thomson scattering diagnostic at ASDEX Upgrade fusion device are generally elliptically polarized. In order to convert the millimeter waves to linearly polarized waves (required for the detector), birefringent window assemblies (sapphire) have been developed to replace grooved metal mirrors. This allows a significantly more compact receiver design which is less susceptible to misalignment. The setup has been tested and implemented at ASDEX Upgrade.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Leipold, Frank","Hansen, S. K.","Jacobsen, Asger Schou","Jensen, T.","Jessen, Martin","Korsholm, Søren Bang","Nielsen, Stefan Kragh","Rasmussen, Jesper","Salewski, Mirko","Stejner Pedersen, Morten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-352259"],"event":{"end":"2016-09-30","place":"Copenhagen, dk","start":"2016-09-25","title":"41st International Conference on Infrared, Millimeter and Terahertz Waves","year":"2016"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"millimeter wave receiver design for plasma diagnostics","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85006132035","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-352259","identifier":[{"id":"85006132035","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-9fd244ed-c59f-4463-81ac-abb9362582a4"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-9D63C6290FF3D701FF1663D45362736F"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-D