urelle og Regionale Studier, Københavns Universitet","series":"Tværkultur","status":"p","subtitle":"Årbog for ToRS 2015","title":"Alkohol"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-c5e90ac0-beed-4ba1-a240-fb8dd8f5a6ce"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Fest som samfundets lim : alkohol og dans i oldtidens nære Orient","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-511573","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"INTRODUCTION: The optimal temperature during targeted temperature management (TTM) for comatose patients resuscitated from out-of-hospital cardiac arrest is unknown. It has been hypothesized that patients with long no-flow times, for example those without bystander CPR would have the most to gain from temperature management at lower temperatures. METHODS: We analysed data from an international clinical trial randomizing cardiac arrest patients to targeted temperature management at 33°C and 36°C for an interaction between no-flow time and intervention group, with neurological function at six months after cardiac arrest as the primary outcome. A cerebral performance category (CPC) score of 1 or 2 was considered a good outcome. RESULTS: No-flow time (min) was associated with poor neurological outcome (OR 1.13, 95% confidence interval 1.06-1.20, p<0.001). There was no statistically significant interaction between no flow-time and intervention group (p=0.11), which may imply that the non-superior effect of 33°C was consistent for all no-flow times. Bystander CPR was not independently associated with neurological function. CONCLUSIONS: TTM at 33°C compared to 36°C was not associated with an increased probability of a good neurological function for patients with longer no-flow times.","author_count":19,"contributors":["Dankiewicz, Josef","Friberg, Hans","Bělohlávek, Jan","Walden, Andrew","Hassager, Christian","Cronberg, Tobias","Erlinge, David","Gasche, Yvan","Hovdenes, Jan","Horn, Janneke","Kjaergaard, Jesper","Kuiper, Michael","Pellis, Thomas","Stammet, Pascal","Wanscher, Michael","Wetterslev, Jørn","Wise, Matthew","Åneman, Anders","Nielsen, Niklas"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-528843"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Journal Article","Research Support Non U S Gov t"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"time to start of cardiopulmonary resuscitation and the effect of target temperature management at 000000000033 c and 000000000036 c","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-528843","identifier":[{"id":"84954338677","type":"scopus"},{"id":"26705972","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-e2ac14ca-1f72-4ecc-ac51-eb3c62731ce5"],"keyword":["Journal Article","Research Support, Non-U.S. Gov't"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-F5C58C574BD00528CD1C092AC42C5FC2"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Josef","key":"dankiewiczpau","last":"Dankiewicz","name":"Dankiewicz, Josef","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Hans","key":"fribergpau","last":"Friberg","name":"Friberg, Hans","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Jan","key":"bělohlávekpau","last":"Bělohlávek","name":"Bělohlávek, Jan","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Andrew","key":"waldenpau","last":"Walden","name":"Walden, Andrew","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Christian","key":"hassagerpau","last":"Hassager","locid":"49196e5d-0f61-44b2-a6b9-cd6c5f8f3bc2","name":"Hassager, Christian","orcid":"0000-0002-1199-0981","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Tobias","key":"cronbergpau","last":"Cronberg","name":"Cronberg, Tobias","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","firs