{"abstract":"I workshoppen arbejder deltagerne konkret med muligheder og udfordringer forbundet med at opstille læringsprogressioner ud fra fx de nye forenklede Fælles Mål eller læreplaner. Desuden diskuterer vi, hvordan man kan benytte læringsprogressioner og tegn på læring i forbindelse med formativ evaluering. Forskning viser, at arbejdet med læringsprogressioner kan være vanskeligt for mange lærere, både i folkeskolen og gymnasiet. Workshoppen vil være en blanding af oplæg, arbejde med lærernes egne erfaringer og eksempler fra ASSIST-ME-projektet.Workshop Big Bang 2016, Aarhus, Danmark.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Bruun, Jesper","Nielsen, Sanne Schnell","Tidemand, Sofie","Jensen, Sofie Birch"],"cuid":["S02-093.55-039124"],"event":{"end":"2016-03-11","place":"Aarhus, dk","start":"2016-03-10","title":"Big bang: National konference for undervisning i naturfag","year":"2016"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-UC"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"],"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-KP"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU","DI-UC-KP"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"få redskaber til at anvende læringsprogression","src":["kp","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU","DI-UC-KP"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S02-093.55-039124","ids":["kp-89da9ca9-f8bf-4771-90ea-f1aa57e45744","ku-7f32b2ee-e5d6-4684-bf02-43cd1f7ce144"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-2-295D15642FB0570ACC10DE0EE2CA49B8"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Science Education","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Science Education, Assessment, Teaching and Learning in Science Education"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"kp university college copenhagen","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-KP","l3nl":"KP","l3nn":"KP University College Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KP University College Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Professionshøjskole, Rektors område, Fakultet for læreruddannelse og livslang læring - Dekan, Læreruddannelse 2","Læring, dannelse og trivsel i skolen – Institut for Læreruddannelse ","Læring, dannelse og trivsel i skolen – Institut for Læreruddannelse , Udvikling af fagdidaktik i skolen, STEM-didaktik"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-KP","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Jesper","key":"bruunpau","last":"Bruun","locid":"d2218073-20b7-41ac-aa88-f7c4bc9fff74","name":"Bruun, Jesper","orcid":"0000-0003-4739-7351","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","first":"Sanne Schnell","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"e2e58218-933a-44d8-af1f-cbcda52d8d1b","name":"Nielsen, Sanne Schnell","orcid":"0000-0002-9981-8288","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Sofie","key":"tidemandpau","last":"Tidemand","locid":"812b5799-cf5c-42bc-a691-33c894445f06","name":"Tidemand, Sofie","orcid":"0000-0003-0471-9277","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Sofie Birch","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"086f7708-fa5e-4001-a0f3-6732cb727436","name":"Jensen, Sofie Birch","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","KP","Universities","University Colleges","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["kp-89da9ca9-f8bf-4771-90ea-f1aa57e45744","ku-7f32b2ee-e5d6-4684-bf02-43cd1f7ce144"],"src":["KP University College Copenhagen","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Få redskaber til at anvende læringsprogression","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-093.55-039124","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"BACKGROUND: Previous studies suggest that doctors' personal lifestyle, risk taking personality and beliefs about risk reducing therapies may affect their clinical decision-making. Whether such factors are further associated with patients' adherence with medication is largely unknown. OBJECTIVE: To estimate associations between GPs' attitudes towards risk, statin therapy and management of non-adherence and their patients' adherence, and to identify subgroups of GPs with poor patient adherence. METHODS: All Danish GPs were invited to participate in an online survey. We asked whether they regarded statin treatment as important, how they managed non-adherence and whether non-adherence annoyed them. The Jackson Personality Inventory-revised was used to measure risk attitude. The GPs' responses were linked to register data on their patients' redeemed statin prescriptions. Mixed effect logistic regression was used to estimate associations between patient adherence and GPs' attitudes. Adherence was estimated by the proportion of days covered in a 1-year period using an 80% cut-off. RESULTS: We received responses from 1398 GPs (42.2%) who initiated statin therapy in 12 192 patients during the study period. In total 6590 (54.1%) of these patients were adherent. Patients who had GPs rarely assessing their treatment adherence were less likely to be adherent than those who had GPs assessing their patients' treatment adherence now and then, odds ratio (OR) 0.86 [confidence interval (CI) 0.77-0.96]. No other associations were found between patients' adherence and GPs' attitudes. CONCLUSIONS: Our findings suggest that GPs' attitudes to risk, statin therapy or management of non-adherence are not significantly associated with their patients' adherence.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Barfoed, Benedicte L","Paulsen, Maja S","Christensen, Palle M","Halvorsen, Peder A","Jarbøl, Dorte E","Larsen, Mogens Lytken","Munch, Maria R","Søndergaard, Jens","Nielsen, Jesper B"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-011349"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Norway"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","UiT The Arctic University of Norway"],"keyword":["Journal Article"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-NDR"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-NDR","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"associations between patients adherence and gps attitudes towards risk statin therapy and management of non adherence a survey and register based study","src":["aau","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1093/fampra/cmw005","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-011349","identifier":[{"id":"000374475200005","type":"wos"},{"id":"84963964077","type":"scopus"},{"id":"26936208","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["aau-edb70ba2-39dc-4a10-8a63-a072f90ec9f0","sdu-d20475ca-4afd-4e58-9399-47d2a57c33f8"],"keyword":["Journal Article"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-F3899CDB0C71752A76C29ADBFDD7F3A9"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1093/fampra/cmw005","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Public Health, Research Unit of General Pratice"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"