{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"P.","key":"sanchezppau","last":"Sanchez","name":"Sanchez, P.","rank":16,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Morten Stejner","key":"stejnerpedersenmortenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"5e16534e-b167-4a1f-a316-ea12e478d879","name":"Stejner Pedersen, Morten","name_org":"Pedersen, Morten Stejner","orcid":"0000-0003-1300-8135","rank":17,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Arianna","key":"taorminaariannapau","last":"Taormina","locid":"3f2308da-3403-41e7-8210-d40228218861","name":"Taormina, Arianna","rank":18,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-61b9511b-92eb-4b2d-98fc-0d56bca84ecd"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"High Power Microwave Diagnostic for the Fusion Energy Experiment ITER","type":"Conference Poster","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-333689","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"Velocity-space tomography of the fast-ion distribution function in a fusion plasma is usually a photon-starved tomography method due to limited optical access and signal-to-noise ratio of fast-ion Dα (FIDA) spectroscopy as well as the strive for high-resolution images. In high-definition tomography, prior information makes up for this lack of data. We restrict the target velocity space through the measured absence of FIDA light, impose phase-space densities to be non-negative, and encode the known geometry of neutral beam injection (NBI) sources. We further use a numerical simulation as prior information to reconstruct where in velocity space the measurements and the simulation disagree. This alternative approach is demonstrated for four-view as well as for two-view FIDA measurements. The high-definition tomography tools allow us to study fast ions in sawtoothing plasmas and the formation of NBI peaks at full, half and one-third energy by time-resolved tomographic movies.","author_count":16,"contributors":["Salewski, Mirko","Geiger, B.","Jacobsen, A.S.","Hansen, Per Christian","Heidbrink, W.W.","Korsholm, Søren Bang","Leipold, Frank","Madsen, Jens","Moseev, Dmitry","Nielsen, Stefan Kragh","Nocente, M.","Odstrčil, T.","Rasmussen, Jesper","Stagner, L.","Stejner Pedersen, Morten","Weiland, M."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-341782"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Germany","Italy","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Max Planck Institute for Plasma Physics","University of California at Irvine","University of Milan - Bicocca"],"keyword":["Fast ion D alpha spectroscopy","Fast ions","Neutral beam injection","Tokamaks","Tomography"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"high definition velocity space tomography of fast ion dynamics","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/125604290/salewski2016b_nf_postprint.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-341782","identifier":[{"id":"84987667727","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-7cb63f28-5cba-4517-a977-16e87946d025"],"keyword":["Fast ions","Fast-ion D-alpha spectroscopy","Neutral beam injection","Sawteeth","Tokamaks","Tomography"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-637901ED528CD50B8C8EFAF4CEC779E2"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/125604290/salewski2016b_nf_postprint.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Physics","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Physics, Plasma Physics and Fusion Energy"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"de","key":"max planck institute for plasma physics","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Max Planck Institute for Plasma Physics","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"us","key":"university of california at irvine","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"University of California at Irvine","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"it","key":"university of milan bicocca","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Milan - Bicocca","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","firs