{"abstract":"\"Hvad laver araberne nu i en bog om alkohol?\" Vil nogle tænke. \"Det er jo forbudt for dem, og de kan ikke engang tolerere, at andre drikker det.\" Men intet forbud uden fascination. Araberne har faktisk et ret intenst og facetteret forhold til alkohol, også i dag. Og historisk gælder det ikke mindre - ja, det var jo ligefrem dem, der opfandt den.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Skovgaard-Petersen, Jakob","Sabih, Joshua"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-450006"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"vin der ikke beruser om arabernes alkoholiske ambivalens","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://e-pages.dk/ku/1205/2","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-450006","ids":["ku-5e8705a1-c217-49b8-861e-e8dd9e1128c9"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-6F9A937FE64963A227DDB6FEB292A17E"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://e-pages.dk/ku/1205/2","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Humanities, Department of Cross-Cultural and Regional Studies"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Jakob","key":"skovgaardpetersenpau","last":"Skovgaard-Petersen","locid":"00603d84-ef33-4f4a-8a50-907552067bd8","name":"Skovgaard-Petersen, Jakob","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Joshua","key":"sabihpau","last":"