{"abstract":"Biokul (biochar) er forgasset biomasse. Tilførsel til dyrket jord tilskrives ofte mange positive effekter og herunder en gødningseffekt. Er det hele historien? Sessionen sammendrager flere års forskningsindsats og besvarer, hvordan biokul eventuelt kan anvendes i en dansk sammenhæng.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Hansen, Veronika","Müller-Stöver, Dorette Sophie","Petersen, Carsten Tilbæk","Hauggaard-Nielsen, Henrik","Ahrenfeldt, Jesper","Jensen, Lars Stoumann"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-560156"],"event":{"end":"2016-01-21","place":"Herning, dk","start":"2016-01-20","title":"Plantekongres 2016","year":"2016"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"session 000000000061 biokuls relevans i dansk sammenhæng biokul og jordens frugtbarhed","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-560156","ids":["ruc-3e175f34-a631-4e6f-a9f1-fe631f0dc01e"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-676C00142B90E18B9DB5AACCA7CEBFBD"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology"]