{"abstract":"The two key purposes of assessment, formative and summative, are often in a contradictory position. The summative assessment of learning will normally prevent the formative assessment for learning to be realised (Butler, 1988), meaning that the learning potential of the assessment will often be minimal. It is therefore a central challenge to find ways to combine the dual use of assessment.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Dolin, Jens","Jensen, Sofie Birch","Bruun, Jesper","Nielsen, Sanne Schnell"],"cuid":["S02-080.65-038761"],"event":{"end":"2016-08-26","place":"Dublin, ie","start":"2016-08-23","title":"ECER 2016","year":"2016"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Research designs theory and method"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-UC"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"],"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-KP"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU","DI-UC-KP"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the design and implementation of an assessment method combining formative and summative assessment","src":["kp","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU","DI-UC-KP"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.eera-ecer.de/ecer-programmes/pdf/print/conference/21/contribution/37777/","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-080.65-038761","ids":["kp-400c3bea-d3fe-424a-acd5-782813a9b28a","ku-97576718-28b1-4a52-924d-ea9d98577166"],"keyword":["research designs, theory and method"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-2-0746921CC53FCAFFB21F6483F69FC168"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Science Education","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Science Education, Assessment, Teaching and Learning in Science Education"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"kp university college copenhagen","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-KP","l3nl":"KP","l3nn":"KP University College Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KP University College Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Professionshøjskole, Rektors område, Fakultet for læreruddannelse og livslang læring - Dekan, Læreruddannelse 2","Læring, dannelse og trivsel i skolen – Institut for Læreruddannelse ","Læring, dannelse og trivsel i skolen – Institut for Læreruddannelse , Udvikling af fagdidaktik i skolen, STEM-didaktik"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-KP","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Jens","key":"dolinpau","last":"Dolin","locid":"76d1971b-6d64-4bce-b4dc-6af9cd79f81f","name":"Dolin, Jens","orcid":"0000-0003-1604-1846","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Sofie Birch","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"086f7708-fa5e-4001-a0f3-6732cb727436","name":"Jensen, Sofie Birch","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Jesper","key":"bruunpau","last":"Bruun","locid":"d2218073-20b7-41ac-aa88-f7c4bc9fff74","name":"Bruun, Jesper","orcid":"0000-0003-4739-7351","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","first":"Sanne Schnell","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"e2e58218-933a-44d8-af1f-cbcda52d8d1b","name":"Nielsen, Sanne Schnell","orcid":"0000-0002-9981-8288","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p","title":"Conference:ECER 2016, Leading Education: The Distinct Contributions of Educational Research and Researchers"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","KP","Universities","University Colleges","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["P