{"abstract":"We describe 2 fatal cases of methicillin-resistant Staphylococcus aureus (MRSA) clonal complex 398 septicemia in persons who had no contact with livestock. Whole-genome sequencing of the isolated MRSA strains strongly suggest that both were of animal origin and that the patients had been infected through 2 independent person-to-person transmission chains.","author_count":11,"contributors":["Nielsen, Rikke Thoft","Kemp, Michael","Holm, Anette","Skov, Marianne Nielsine","Detlefsen, Mette","Hasman, Henrik","Aarestrup, Frank Møller","Kaas, Rolf Sommer","Nielsen, Jesper Boye","Westh, Henrik","Kolmos, Hans Jørn"],"cuid":["S03-099.42-037587"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"keyword":["Aged","Animals","Antimicrobial resistance","Bacteremia","Bacteria","Bacterial Infections","Case Reports","Cross Infection","Denmark","Disease transmission","Epidemiology","Farmers","Fatal Outcome","Female","Genome Bacterial","Hospitals","Humans","Infectious","Infectious diseases","Journal Article","Livestock","Male","Methicillin Resistant Staphylococcus aureus","Microbiology medical","Middle Aged","Molecular epidemiology","Nursing Homes","Phylogeny","Renal Dialysis","Sepsis","Staphylococcal Infections","Staphylococci","spa typing"],"level":"sci","mra":["med","sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-SDR"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-SDR","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"fatal septicemia linked to transmission of mrsa clonal complex 000000000398 in hospital and nursing home denmark","src":["dtu","ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3201/eid2205.151835","versio