{"abstract":"In many spectral estimation and array processing problems, the process of finding estimates of model parameters often involves the optimisation of a cost function containing multiple peaks and dips. Such non-convex problems are hard to solve using traditional optimisation algorithms developed for convex problems, and computationally intensive grid searches are therefore often used instead. In this paper, we establish an analytical connection between the grid size and the parametrisation of the cost function so that the grid size can be selected as coarsely as possible to lower the computation time. Additionally, we show via three common examples how the grid size depends on parameters such as the number of data points or the number of sensors in DOA estimation. We also demonstrate that the computation time can potentially be lowered by several orders of magnitude by combining a coarse grid search with a local refinement step.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Nielsen, Jesper Kjær","Jensen, Tobias Lindstrøm","Jensen, Jesper Rindom","Christensen, Mads Græsbøll","Jensen, Søren Holdt"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-069631"],"event":{"end":"2016-09-02","place":"Budapest, hu","start":"2016-08-29","title":"European Signal Processing Conference","year":"2016"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["DOA estimation","Fundamental frequency estimation","Optimisation","Periodogram"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"grid size selection for nonlinear least squares optimization in spectral estimation and array processing","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/246407615/master.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-069631","identifier":[{"id":"85005982422","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-43a2bda4-8a71-48bd-896e-381fc6d571f9"],"keyword":["DOA estimation","fundamental frequency estimation","optimisation","periodogram"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-1E7A143D1383D82D1D7BFCCA9A162386"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/320308287/20160913_eusipco16.zip","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/246407615/master.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology, Section for Media Technology - Campus Aalborg"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Kjær","key":"nielsenjesperkjærpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"3d21c73c-3aa1-4590-870f-8be578634702","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Kjær","orcid":"0000-0002-2586-7925","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Tobias Lindstrøm","key":"jensentobiaslindstrømpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"a2e382fc-c4c6-4ff2-b7d2-8b012eb5160e","name":"Jensen, Tobias Lindstrøm","orcid":"0000-0003-4262-0577","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Rindom","key":"jensenjesperrindompau","las