{"abstract":"Reverberation is well-known to have a detrimental impact on many localization methods for audio sources. We address this problem by imposing a model for the early reflections as well as a model for the audio source itself. Using these models, we propose two iterative localization methods that estimate the direction-of-arrival (DOA) of both the direct path of the audio source and the early reflections. In these methods, the contribution of the early reflections is essentially subtracted from the signal observations before localization of the direct path component, which may reduce the estimation bias. Our simulation results show that we can estimate the DOA of the desired signal more accurately with this procedure compared to state-of-theart estimator in both synthetic and real data experiments with reverberation.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Jensen, Jesper Rindom","Nielsen, Jesper Kjær","Heusdens, Richard","Christensen, Mads Græsbøll"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-102975"],"event":{"acronym":"ICASSP","end":"2016-03-25","place":"Shanghai, cn","start":"2016-03-20","title":"The 41st IEEE International Conference on Acoustics, Speech and Signal Processing","year":"2016"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Netherlands"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Delft University of Technology"],"keyword":["Audio localization","DOA estimation","Maximum likelihood","Reverberation","nonlinear least squares"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"doa estimation of audio sources in reverberant environments","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/245959697/Jensen_et_al_ICASSP2016_rev3.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-102975","identifier":[{"id":"84973402288","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-b645df0f-3e62-45c6-b9ee-fa369cdc159d"],"keyword":["Audio localization","DOA estimation","maximum likelihood","nonlinear least squares","reverberation"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-1B1AE3597171E5204F3E8E6F0FF9EBF6"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/245959697/Jensen_et_al_ICASSP2016_rev3.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology, Audio Analysis Lab (CREATE)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology, Section for Media Technology - Campus Aalborg"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"nl","key":"delft university of technology","loc":["Netherlands","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Delft University of Technology","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Rindom","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"af897213-5e0d-41e9-8e3c-a89d3ca4a5b1","name":"Jensen, Jesper Rindom","orcid":"0000-0001-6023-8270","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Kjær","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"3d21c73c-3aa1-4590-870f-8be578634702","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Kjær","orcid":"0000-0002-2586-7925","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Richard","key":"heusdenspau","last":"Heusdens","locid":"04d38ca5-50cd-4acc-aa9e-45ae0fa6a38c","name":"Heusdens, Richard","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Mads Græsbøll","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"cf9e922d-e5f8-4964-9b84-581667f97b0b","name":"Christensen, Mads Græsbøll","orcid":"0000-0003-3586-7969","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/icassp.2016.7471660","issn":["15206149","2379190X"],"issn_org":["15206149"],"journal":"IEEE International Conference on Acoustics, Speech and Signal Processing. Proceedings","publisher":"IEEE Signal Processing Society","status":"p","title":"IEEE International Conference on Acoustics, Speech and Signal Processing. Proceedings","title_org":"I E E E International Conference on Acoustics, Speech and Signal Processing. Proceedings"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84973402288"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-b645df0f-3e62-45c6-b9ee-fa369cdc159d"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"DOA Estimation of Audio Sources in Reverberant Environments","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-102975","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"This work presents results based on wideband radio channel measurements at 26 GHz. Three widely different indoor environments were measured; a cluttered laboratory, a corridor with a bend, and a large entrance hall. Power angular spectra were obtained for both vertical polarization (VP) and horizontal polarization (HP) at many different Rx locations, using both VP or HP for the fixed Tx. The results show that a quite rich channel may exist with several propagation paths. Further, coupling between the VP and HP was found in a non line of sight (NLOS) scenario.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","Pedersen, Gert Frølund"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-107764"],"event":{"end":"2016-09-08","place":"Valencia , es","start":"2016-09-04","title":"IEEE 27th Annual IEEE International Symposium on Personal, Indoor and Mobile Radio Communications - (PIMRC)","year":"2016"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"dual polarized indoor propagation at 000000000026 ghz","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-107764","identifier":[{"id":"85010065027","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-c6db3333-1364-4f23-8be3-68c0d180899b"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-D0C40FD82B9A7D77293482AF47819780"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Antennas, propagation and radio networking"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Ødum","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"12489268-4402-4c17-8487-76a4323ee983","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","orcid":"0000-0002-8505-853X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Gert F.","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"a49c73ee-aed0-448c-8a92-792c9ee12a9e","name":"Pedersen, Gert Frølund","name_org":"Pedersen, Gert F.","orcid":"0000-0002-6570-7387","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/pimrc.2016.7794751","eisbn":["9781509032549"],"isbn":["9781509032556"],"issn":["21669570"],"publisher":"IEEE (Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers)","series":"IEEE International Symposium Personal, Indoor and Mobile Radio Communications","status":"p","title":"Personal, Indoor, and Mobile Radio Communications (PIMRC), 2016 IEEE 27th Annual International Symposium on"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85010065027"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-c6db3333-1364-4f23-8be3-68c0d180899b"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Dual-Polarized Indoor Propagation at 26 GHz","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-107764","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"BEWARE opstillingen har til formål at undersøge, om flowmålinger fra en kendt befæstet overflade giver en mere direkte måling af nedbørens afstrømning. Det kan være udfordrende at placere regnmålere i byen, hvorfor det derfor er værd at undersøge om afstrømningsmålinger kan supplere regnmålere. Resultaterne viser, at man får meget sammenlignelige resultater mellem flowmålinger og velplacerede regnmålere. Det kræver imidlertid mange regnmålere på samme sted for at opnå statistisk signifikans på denne konklusion.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Nielsen, Jesper Ellerbæk","Ahm, Malte","Rasmussen, Michael R."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-112563"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Nedbørsmåling","Regnmåler"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"tema 000000000001 beware danmarks største regnmåler","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dra","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.dmi.dk/fileadmin/user_upload/Rapporter/TR/2016/DMI_report_16_3_version2.pdf","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-112563","ids":["aau-d736abee-f712-49e6-84df-9b2d572affea"],"keyword":["BEWARE","Nedbørsmåling","Regnmåler"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-F02C6E5FC2D0D04CC09E3A7CD4552119"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Ci