{"abstract":"Anomalous emissions were found over the last few years in spectra of Collective Thomson Scattering (CTS) diagnostics in tokamak devices such as TEXTOR, ASDEX and FTU, in addition to real CTS signals. The signal frequency, down-shifted with respect to the probing one, suggested a possible origin in Parametric Decay Instability (PDI) processes correlated with the presence of magnetic islands and occurring for pumping wave power levels well below the threshold predicted by conventional models. A threshold below or close to the Electron Cyclotron Resonance Heating (ECRH) power levels could limit, under certain circumstances, the use of the ECRH in fusion devices. An accurate characterization of the conditions for the occurrence of this phenomenon and of its consequences is thus of primary importance. Exploiting the front-steering configuration available with the real-time launcher, the implementation of a new CTS setup now allows studying these anomalous emission phenomena in FTU under conditions of density and wave injection geometry that are more similar to those envisaged for CTS in ITER. The upgrades of the diagnostic are presented as well as a few preliminary spectra detected with the new system during the very first operations in 2014.","author_count":21,"contributors":["Bin, W.","Bruschi, A.","D'Arcangelo, O.","Castaldo, C.","Angeli, M. De","Figini, L.","Galperti, C.","Garavaglia, S.","Granucci, G.","Grosso, G.","Korsholm, Søren Bang","Lontano, M.","Mellera, V.","Minelli, D.","Moro, A.","Nardone, A.","Nielsen, Stefan Kragh","Rasmussen, Jesper","Simonetto, A.","Stejner Pedersen, Morten","Tartari, U."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-336904"],"event":{"end":"2015-04-17","place":"Frascati, it","start":"2015-04-14","title":"1st EPS Conference on Plasma Diagnostics","year":"2015"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"country":["Italy","Switzerland"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","EURATOM-ENEA sulla Fusione","National Research Council of Italy","Swiss Federal Institute of Technology Lausanne"],"keyword":["Microwave antennas","Nuclear instruments and methods for hot plasma diagnostics"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"first operations with the new collective thomson scattering diagnostic on the frascati tokamak upgrade device","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/117515728/document.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-336904","identifier":[{"id":"84947125395","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-6c39628f-73a3-49bf-af4a-89a66af6131d"],"keyword":["Microwave Antennas","Nuclear instruments and methods for hot plasma diagnostics"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-26E7C5BE2A5C689D0DE90C70121FD901"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/117515728/document.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"it","key":"national research council of italy","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"National Research Council of Italy","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"it","key":"euratom enea sulla fusione","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"EURATOM-ENEA sulla Fusione","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"ch","key":"swiss federal institute of technology lausanne","loc":["Switzerland","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"Swiss Federal Institute of Technology Lausanne","used":1},{"affno":"4","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Physics","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Physics, Plasma Physics and Fusion Energy"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"W.","key":"binpau","last":"Bin","name":"Bin, W.","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"A.","key":"bruschipau","last":"Bruschi","name":"Bruschi, A.","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"O.","key":"darcangelopau","last":"D'Arcangelo","name":"D'Arcangelo, O.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"C.","key":"castaldopau","last":"Castaldo","name":"Castaldo, C.","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"M. De","key":"angelipau","last":"Angeli","name":"Angeli, M. De","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"L.","key":"figinipau","last":"Figini","name":"Figini, L.","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"C.","key":"galpertipau","last":"Galperti","name":"Galperti, C.","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"S.","key":"garavagliapau","last":"Garavaglia","name":"Garavaglia, S.","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"G.","key":"granuccipau","last":"Granucci","name":"Granucci, G.","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"G.","key":"grossopau","last":"Grosso","name":"Grosso, G.","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Søren Bang","key":"korsholmpau","last":"Korsholm","locid":"cc3d86b6-81c5-4e9b-99dd-3933c1d56f7d","name":"Korsholm, Søren Bang","orcid":"0000-0001-7160-8361","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"M.","key":"lontanopau","last":"Lontano","name":"Lontano, M.","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"V.","key":"mellerapau","last":"Mellera","name":"Mellera, V.","rank":13,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"D.","key":"minellipau","last":"Minelli","name":"Minelli, D.","rank":14,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"A.","key":"moropau","last":"Moro","name":"Moro, A.","rank":15,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"A.","key":"nardonepau","last":"Nardone","name":"Nardone, A.","rank":16,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Stefan Kragh","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"185da313-7f9e-45e7-9ee7-83306c90e806","name":"Nielsen, Stefan Kragh","orcid":"0000-0003-4175-3829","rank":17,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"64e646b9-b8d3-4a78-ad01-598d07290029","name":"Rasmussen, Jesper","orcid":"0000-0002-3947-1518","rank":18,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"A.","key":"simonettopau","last":"Simonetto","name":"Simonetto, A.","rank":19,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Morten Stejner","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"5e16534e-b167-4a1f-a316-ea12e478d879","name":"Stejner Pedersen, Morten","name_org":"Pedersen, Morten Stejner","orcid":"0000-0003-1300-8135","rank":20,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"U.","key":"tartaripau","last":"Tartari","name":"Tartari, U.","rank":21,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1088/1748-0221/10/10/p10007","issn":["17480221"],"issue":"10","journal":"Journal of Instrumentation","paperid":"P10007","publisher":"IOP Publishing","status":"p","title":"Journal of Instrumentation","volume":"10"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84947125395"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-