{"abstract":"To analyze the heating phase of an induction heated injection molding tool precisely, the temperature-dependent magnetic properties, B–H curves, and the hysteresis loss are necessary for the molding tool materials. Hence, injection molding tool steels, core materials among other materials have, in this paper, been characterized for their temperature-dependent magnetic properties. The properties have been measured using a vibrating sample magnetometer, able to reach to 350 °C. The established material database comprises the B–H loops, from which the mean B–H curve, relative permeability versus magnetic flux density, and hysteresis loss versus magnetic flux density have been extracted and are presented.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Guerrier, Patrick","Nielsen, Kaspar Kirstein","Hattel, Jesper Henri"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-368861"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Hysteresis loss","Induction heating"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"temperature dependence and magnetic properties of injection molding tool materials used in induction heating","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84940186589","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-368861","identifier":[{"id":"84940186589","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-d72c00e7-a951-4338-84a2-8a179fa3b91e"],"keyword":["Hysteresis loss","Induction heating","Injection molding tool materials","Temperature dependence of magnetic properties"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-15FD9B314F31E2FE3750C3C87CE68ED2"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Mechanical Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Mechanical Engineering, Manufacturing Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Patrick","key":"guerrierpau","last":"Guerrier","locid":"269ab07e-04d3-4aa7-8a5d-f84a54653073","name":"Guerrier, Patrick","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Kaspar Kirstein","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"82e21ae8-a61e-40c9-867b-de0b8f7c7c01","name":"Nielsen, Kaspar Kirstein","orcid":"0000-0001-7938-4577","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesper Henri","key":"hattelpau","last":"Hattel","locid":"cc43ac84-8b15-435d-a8b8-343c75c257db","name":"Hattel, Jesper Henri","orcid":"0000-0001-5687-4581","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/tmag.2015.2428215","issn":["00189464","19410069"],"issn_org":["00189464"],"issue":"9","journal":"IEEE Transactions on Magnetics","paperid":"6000507","publisher":"Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers Inc.","status":"p","title":"IEEE Transactions on Magnetics","title_org":"I E E E Transactions on Magnetics","volume":"51"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84940186589"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-d72c00e7-a951-4338-84a2-8a179fa3b91e"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Temperature Dependence and Magnetic Properties of Injection Molding Tool Materials Used in Induction Heating","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-368861","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"author_count":3,"contributors":["Nielsen, Rasmus","Hoff, Ayoe","Andersen, Jesper Levring"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-412921"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"analyseværktøj til forbedrede økonomiske forvaltningsanalyser i dansk fiskeri atøf afprøvning af analyseværktøjets muligheder","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/132474955/IFRO_Rapport_236.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-412921","ids":["ku-20b2e81d-f347-43b1-9ce6-6d3567e5df73"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-228DEEA3E1D1DEFA333B877DC7064EEC"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/132474955/IFRO_Rapport_236.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Food and Resource Economics, Section for Environment and Natural Resources"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Rasmus","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"f6e4af88-d330-4a75-8435-e502a8c24df7","name":"Nielsen, Rasmus","orcid":"0000-0001-7357-6965","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Ayoe","key":"hoffpau","last":"Hoff","locid":"482961a7-8068-4369-8dd5-353f7a3dd10e","name":"Hoff, Ayoe","orcid":"0000-0002-3679-3431","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Jesper Levring","key":"andersenpau","last":"Andersen","locid":"72c137de-8212-41ed-ac15-9d04635c2559","name":"Andersen, Jesper Levring","orcid":"0000-0001-6963-5053","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issue":"236","pages":"28","place":"Frederiksberg","publisher":"Institut for Fødevare- og Ressourceøkonomi, Københavns Universitet","repno":"IFRO Rapport, No. 236","series":"IFRO Rapport","status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-20b2e81d-f347-43b1-9ce6-6d3567e5df73"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Analyseværktøj til forbedrede økonomiske forvaltningsanalyser i dansk fiskeri (ATØF) : afprøvning af analyseværktøjets muligheder","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-412921","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"PURPOSE: Assessment of prognosis after out-of-hospital cardiac arrest (OHCA) is challenging. Cerebral computed tomography (cCT) scans are widely available, but the use in prognostication of comatose OHCA-patients is unclear. We evaluated the prognostic value of cCT in a clinical cohort of OHCA-patients. METHOD: A total of 1120 consecutive OHCA-patients with cardiac aetiology and successful or on-going resuscitation at hospital arrival were included (2002-2011). Utstein-criteria for registration of pre-hospital data and review of patient-charts for post-resuscitation care including cCT results were used. The primary endpoint was 30-day mortality analysed by log-rank and multivariate Cox-regression analyses. RESULTS: A cCT scan was performed in 341(30%) of the clinical OHCA-cohort, and an early CT (<24h) was performed in 188 patients. The early CT was found 'normal' in 163(89%) and with reduced discrimination in 7(4%) of patients, which was independently associated with higher 30-day mortality compared with OHCA-patients with an early cCT (HR(adjusted) = 3.5 (95%CI: 1.0-11.5), p = 0.04). A late CT (≥ 24 h) was performed in 153 patients in a median of 3 days (IQR: 2-5) and was 'normal' in 89(60%), 'cerebral bleeding' in 4(3%), 'new cerebral infarction' in 10(7%), and 'reduced discrimination between white and grey matter and/or oedema' in 45(30%) patients. 'Reduced discrimination and/or oedema' by late cCT was independently associated with higher 30-day mortality compared to patients with a normal late CT (HR(adjusted) = 2.6 (95%CI: 1.4-4.8, p = 0.002). CONCLUSION: Our observations suggest that a cCT may be useful as part of the neurological prognostication in patients with OHCA. 'Reduced discrimination between white and grey matter and/or oedema' on cCT was independently associated with a poor prognosis.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Langkjær, Sandra","Hassager, Christian","Kjaergaard, Jesper","Salam, Idrees","Thomsen, Jakob Hartvig","Lippert, Freddy","Wanscher, Michael","Køber, Lars","Nielsen, Niklas","Søholm, Helle"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-422416"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"prognostic value of reduced discrimination and oedema on cerebral computed tomography in a daily clinical cohort of out of hospital cardiac arrest patients","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-422416","identifier":[{"id":"25882783","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84931564861","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-309e4266-530e-4f3c-a550-618e51dfeef9"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-38A14DE4E0B2A10067F417BBE49A4EF7"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Sandra","key":"langkjærpau","last":"Langkjær","name":"Langkjær, Sandra","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Christian","key":"hassagerpau","last":"Hassager","locid":"49196e5d-0f61-44b2-a6b9-cd6c5f8f3bc2","name":"Hassager, Christian","orcid":"0000-0002-1199-0981","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Jesper","key":"kjaergaardpau","last":"Kjaergaard","locid":"d2d434a4-221d-4c1a-a9c6-466340d150e0","name":"Kjaergaard, Jesper","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Idrees","key":"salampau","last":"Salam","name":"Salam, Idrees","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Jakob Hartvig","key":"thomsenpau","last":"Thomsen","name":"Thomsen, Jakob Hartvig","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Freddy K","key":"lippertpau","last":"Lippert","locid":"48ac5d81-3437-4345-b6c3-394683a09d5d","name":"Lippert, Freddy","name_org":"Lippert, Freddy K","orcid":"0000-0002-2356-8809","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Michael","key":"wanscherpau","last":"Wanscher","name":"Wanscher, Michael","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Lars","key":"køberpau","last":"Køber","locid":"e3f0c57c-605a-431a-9c63-2213c46621e6","name":"Køber, Lars","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Niklas","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Niklas","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Helle","key":"søholmpau","last":"Søholm","name":"Søholm, Helle","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["25882783"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.resuscitation.2015.03.023","issn":["03009572","18731570"],"issn_org":["03009572"],"journal":"Resuscitation","pages":"141-7","status":"p","title":"Resuscitation","volume":"92"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84931564861"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-309e4266-530e-4f3c-a550-618e51dfeef9"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Prognostic value of reduced discrimination and oedema on cerebral computed tomography in a daily clinical cohort of out-of-hospital cardiac arrest patients","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-422416","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"Few published research papers concern the study of communication and language development among children with congenital deafblindness. The aim of this study is to explore and discuss linguistic features of what may be considered as tactile languages. By analysing one pilot video observation of a five year old congenital deafblind child communicating with his mother about a slide experience tactile linguistic features of phonology, morphology, semantics and syntax were explored. The linguistic features of tactile language were found to involve a potential unique and complex structure based on direction, speed and acceleration of movements, pressure, and body position. It is discussed how tactile languages, if they exist, can be studied from its unique bodily-tactile nature and not as a modification of visual sign languages.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Dammeyer, Jesper","Nielsen, Anja","Strøm, Emilie","Hendar, Nils Ola Ebbe","Eiriksdottir, Valgerdur Kristin"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-453430"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Center for Døvblindhed og Høretab, Region Nordjylland"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a case study of tactile language and its possible structure a tentative outline to study tactile language systemns among children with congenital deafblindness","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.4172/2375-4427.1000133","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-453430","ids":["ku-6457a6b9-644e-4cc9-aa03-316da69e2664"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-1885214E227259591F7B77C805666CCE"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.4172/2375-4427.1000133","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Social Science (SOC)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Social Sciences, Department of Psychology, Department of Psychology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Center for Døvblindhed og Høretab, Region Nordjylland"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Jesper Herup","key":"dammeyerpau","last":"Dammeyer","locid":"4e00d381-dd0b-4b42-a335-652388c7f73b","name":"Dammeyer, Jesper","name_org":"Dammeyer, Jesper Herup","orcid":"0000-0001-6753-8516","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Anja","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Anja","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Emilie","key":"strømpau","last":"Strøm","locid":"7d0d77a1-6c50-4712-890b-e219783accaf","name":"Strøm, Emilie","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Nils Ola Ebbe","key":"hendarpau","last":"Hendar","locid":"6c1db8b4-96c2-4706-b449-0f72021eb5d0","name":"Hendar, Nils Ola Ebbe","orcid":"0000-0002-7204-0066","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Valgerdur Kristin","key":"eiriksdottirpau","last":"Eiriksdottir","name":"Eiriksdottir, Valgerdur Kristin","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.4172/2375-4427.1000133","issn":["23754427"],"issue":"2","journal":"Journal of Communication Disorder, Deaf Studies & Hearing Aids","pages":"1-7","status