{"abstract":"Lav-temperatur termisk forgasning muliggør effektiv og bæredygtig kraftvarmeproduktion på basis af halm og andre restfraktioner fra det danske landbrug. Samtidig produceres en koksfraktion med høj gødningsværdi og gode jordforbedringsegenskaber","author_count":4,"contributors":["Ahrenfeldt, Jesper","Thomsen, Tobias Pape","Müller-Stöver, Dorette Sophie","Hauggaard-Nielsen, Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-560229"],"event":{"end":"2015-01-15","place":"dk","start":"2015-01-14","title":"Plantekongres 2015","year":"2015"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"forgasning og fremstilling af halmkoks","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/55620218/Ahrenfeldt_pl_plk_2015_kongresbilag_web.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-560229","ids":["ruc-3f2313aa-dc02-44e7-be5d-96fa84a7731e"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-CD65E137273BE75945E104324D176C37"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/55620218/Ahrenfeldt_pl_plk_2015_kongresbilag_web.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, The Department of Environmental, Social and Spatial Change"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Jesper","key":"ahrenfeldtpau","last":"Ahrenfeldt","name":"Ahrenfeldt, Jesper","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Tobias Pape","key":"thomsenpau","last":"Thomsen","name":"Thomsen, Tobias Pape","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Dorette Sophie","key":"müllerstöverpau","last":"Müller-Stöver","name":"Müller-Stöver, Dorette Sophie","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","first":"Henrik","key":"hauggaardnielsenpau","last":"Hauggaard-Nielsen","locid":"0bc8cc02-9199-4a75-9e51-7dd5ceba9583","name":"Hauggaard-Nielsen, Henrik","orcid":"0000-0001-8929-9691","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Roskilde University","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ruc-3f2313aa-dc02-44e7-be5d-96fa84a7731e"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Forgasning og fremstilling af halmkoks","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-560229","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"The return of residual products from bioenergy generation to soils is a step towards closing nutrient cycles, which is especially important for nutrients produced from non-renewable resources such as phosphorus (P). Low-temperature gasification is an innovative process efficiently generating energy from different biomass fuels, such as agricultural residues and waste streams, and at the same time producing a biochar product potentially valuable for soil amendment. In pot experiments, different residual products originating from low-temperature gasification were tested for their P-fertilizing potential with spring barley as a test crop. Biochar resulting from gasification of pure wheat straw showed the best P fertilizer value, however, because of the low P content, extremely high amounts had to be applied when crop P demand should be met, which came along with an over-fertilization of potassium (K). Gasification of pure sewage sludge with a high Fe and Al content practically eliminated its P fertilizer value, while co-gasification of sludge lower in Fe and Al together with wheat straw resulted in a biochar product with only somewhat reduced P availability and improved P/K ratio for fertilization purposes. Operationally defined P pools in soil obtained by sequential chemical extraction of the biochar-amended soils could be related to the observations made in the pot experiments. The results emphasize the potential of combining different feedstocks for thermal conversion processes when aiming at improving the usability of the residual products","author_count":6,"contributors":["Müller-Stöver, Dorette Sophie","Jensen, Lars Stoumann","Grønlund, Mette","Jakobsen, Iver","Hauggaard-Nielsen, Henrik","Ahrenfeldt, Jesper"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-560287"],"event":{"end":"2015-09-30","place":"Geisenheim, de","start":"2015-09-28","title":"Joint International Biochar Symposium 2015","year":"2015"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"return of phosphorus in agricultural residues and urban sewage sludge to soil using biochar from low temperature gasification as fertilizer product","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Andet","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/56696604/Biochar_COST_hnie2.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-560287","ids":["ruc-3fde6501-b91c-463c-8a21-f011e52fd083"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-D39360EA03E5D12511DEF1084AF5BEC9"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Andet","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/56696604/Biochar_COST_hnie2.pdf","version":"Pre-print"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, The Department of Environmental, Social and Spatial Change"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Dorette Sophie","key":"müllerstöverpau","last":"Müller-Stöver","name":"Müller-Stöver, Dorette Sophie","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Lars Stoumann","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","name":"Jensen, Lars Stoumann","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Mette","key":"grønlundpau","last":"Grønlund","name":"Grønlund, Mette","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Iver","key":"jakobsenpau","last":"Jakobsen","name":"Jakobsen, Iver","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","first":"Henrik","key":"hauggaardnielsenpau","last":"Hauggaard-Nielsen","locid":"0bc8cc02-9199-4a75-9e51-7dd5ceba9583","name":"Hauggaard-Nielsen, Henrik","orcid":"0000-0001-8929-9691","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","first":"Jesper","key":"ahrenfeldtpau","last":"Ahrenfeldt","name":"Ahrenfeldt, Jesper","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Roskilde University","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ruc-3fde6501-b91c-463c-8a21-f011e52fd083"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Return of phosphorus in agricultural residues and urban sewage sludge to soil using biochar from low-temperature gasification as fertilizer product","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-560287","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"Most guidelines for clinical practice, and especially those for the construction of decision support tools, assume that the individual person (the patient) needs to be in possession of information of particular sorts and amount in order to qualify as having made an 'informed decision'. This often implicitly segues into the patient having made a 'good decision'. In person-centred health care, whether, in what form, and with what weight, 'information' is included as a criterion of decision quality is a matter for the person involved, to decide in the light of their own values, preferences, and time and resource constraints.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Kaltoft, Mette Kjer","Nielsen, Jesper Bo","Salkeld, Glenn","Dowie, Jack"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-606220"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Decision quality","Decision support","Informed decision","Multi criteria decision analysis"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"who should decide how much and what information is important in person centred health care","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84943153523","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-606220","identifier":[{"id":"25577192","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84943153523","type":"scopus"},{"id":"PMC4469540","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["sdu-735e92fe-49ec-4549-ab4c-772188d9ae6d"],"keyword":["Decision quality","Decision support","Informed decision","Multi-criteria decision analysis"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-38F0B7962384F3E2073893F22DA7785A"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Medicine (Svendborg)","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Public Health, Research Unit of General Pratice"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Mette Kjer","key":"kaltoftpau","last":"Kaltoft","locid":"6f7d182a-c64a-413a-84e7-40365be224fe","name":"Kaltoft, Mette Kjer","orcid":"0000-0002-7056-8297","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Bo","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"75938cc2-43d6-4c8d-a506-6b1c0472a382","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Bo","orcid":"0000-0002-5764-5462","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Glenn","key":"salkeldpau","last":"Salkeld","name":"Salkeld, Glenn","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Jack","key":"dowiepau","last":"Dowie","locid":"4c165795-2471-415a-9a87-aa348af42431","name":"Dowie, Jack","orcid":"0000-0002-4572-9562","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["25577192"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1177/1355819614567911","issn":["13558196","17581060"],"issn_org":["13558196"],"issue":"3","journal":"Journal of Health Services Research & Policy","pages":"192-195","publisher":"SAGE Publications","status":"p","title":"Journal of Health Services Research & Policy","volume":"20"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84943153523"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-735e92fe-49ec-4549-ab4c-772188d9ae6d"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Who should decide how much and what information is important in person-centred health care?","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-606220","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"Objective. General practitioners' (GPs') perception of risk is a cornerstone of preventive care. The aims of this interview study were to explore GPs' professional and personal attitudes and experiences regarding treatment with lipid-lowering drugs and their views on patient compliance. Methods. The material was drawn from semistructured qualitative interviews. We sampled GPs purposively from ten selected practices, ensuring diversity of demographic, professional, and personal characteristics. The GPs were encouraged to describe examples from their own practices and reflect on them and were informed that the focus was their personal attitudes and experiences. Systematic text condensation was applied for analysis in order to uncover the concepts and themes. Results. The analysis revealed the following 3 main themes: (1) use of cardiovascular guidelines and risk assessment tools, (2) strategies for managing patient compliance, and (3) GPs' own risk management. There were substantial differences in the attitudes concerning all three themes. Conclusions. The substantial differences in the GPs' personal and professional risk perceptions may be a key to understanding why GPs do not always follow cardiovascular guidelines. The impact on daily clinical practice, personal consultation style, and patient behaviour with regard to prevention is worth studying further.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Barfoed, Benedicte Marie Lind","Jarbøl, Dorte Ejg","Paulsen, Maja Skov","Christensen, Palle Mark","Halvorsen, Peder Andreas","Nielsen, Jesper Bo","Søndergaard, Jens"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-619260"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"gps perceptions of cardiovascular risk and views on patient compliance a qualitative interview study","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/129631931/GPs_Perceptions_of_Cardiovascular_Risk_and_Views_on_Patient_Compliance.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-619260","identifier":[{"id":"PMC4606097","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"26495143","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["sdu-a0d27a3d-cb98-4a80-ab0f-a3361af2cc55"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-BF13493A5FA0CE3E161F80FA960FDFAE"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/129631931/GPs_Perceptions_of_Cardiovascular_Risk_and_Views_on_Patient_Compliance.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Public Health, Research Unit of General Pratice"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Benedicte Marie Lind","key":"barfoedpau","last":"Barfoed","locid":"d4fff58a-9ee4-49aa-ba67-bd49cb73f420","name":"Barfoed, Benedicte Marie Lind","orcid":"0000-0002-2319-3963","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Dorte Ejg","key":"jarbølpau","last":"Jarbøl","locid":"42ad7b79-3390-486b-840a-94cadacfeaef","name":"Jarbøl, Dorte Ejg","orcid":"0000-0002-3241-4190","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Maja Skov","key":"paulsenpau","last":"Paulsen","locid":"7288551b-43b2-4400-bdc3-b78ad9c0ccc3","name":"Paulsen, Maja Skov","orcid":"0000-0003-0360-0039","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Palle Mark","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"e266e55b-be6c-4c91-ad39-392abfc547f6","name":"Christensen, Palle Mark","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Peder Andreas","key":"halvorsenpau","last":"Halvorsen","name":"Halvorsen, Peder Andreas","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Bo","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"75938cc2-43d6-4c8d-a506-6b1c0472a382","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Bo","orcid":"0000-0002-5764-5462","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jens","key":"søndergaardpau","last":"Søndergaard","locid":"4829db0c-8486-4ad1-8e6b-d4f3dc56c386","name":"Søndergaard, Jens","orcid":"0000-0002-1629-1864","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["26495143"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1155/2015/214146","issn":["20902042","20902050"],"issn_org":["20902042"],"journal":"International Journal of Family Medicine","paperid":"214146","publisher":"Wiley","status":"p","title":"International Journal of Family Medicine","volume":"2015"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-a0d27a3d-cb98-4a80-ab0f-a3361af2cc55"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"GPs' Perceptions of Cardiovascular Risk and Views on Patient Compliance : A Qualitative Interview Study","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-619260","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"In this protocol for a pilot study we seek to establish the feasibility of using a web-based survey to simultaneously supply healthcare organisations and agencies with feedback on a key aspect of the care experience they provide and increase the generic health decision literacy of the individuals responding. The focus is on the person's involvement in decision making, an aspect of care which is seriously under-represented in current surveys if one adopts the perspective of person-centred care. By engaging with an instrument to assess decision quality the person can, in the one action, provide a retrospective evaluation of a past decision making experience in a specific provider context and enhance their competency in future decision making in any setting. We see this as an exercise in context-sensitive educational health informatics.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Kaltoft, Mette Kjer","Nielsen, Jesper Bo","Salkeld, Glenn","Dowie, Jack"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-619539"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Empowerment","Health literacy","Informed choice","Patient reported outcome measure","Person centred care"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"enhancing healthcare provider feedback and personal health literacy dual use of a decision quality measure","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84951966532","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-619539","identifier":[{"id":"84951966532","type":"scopus"},{"id":"26262530","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["sdu-a1ebf6f2-09ba-4e47-999b-b3627967202b"],"keyword":["Empowerment","Health literacy","Informed choice","Patient experience surveys","Pa