{"abstract":"I kapitlet behandler vi, hvordan idrætseleverne selekteres og optages i idrætsklasser. Vi undersøger, hvad der lægges vægt på i udvælgelsen af idrætselever, og hvilke repræsentationer af den gode idrætselev, idrætseleverne og deres familier søges forpligtiget på i relation til optagelsen til idrætsklasserne. I kapitlet forstås samarbejdet mellem skoler, klubber og idrætsudøvere som en hybridisering, hvor forskellige domæners værdier og praksisformer mødes i en ny organisering. Vi anvender Andersen og Knudsens begreber om kontraktliggørelse og ansvarliggørelse til at argumentere for, at idrætseleverne og deres familier indgår en form for uformel kontrakt med idrætsklassens aktører, der forpligtiger dem på bestemt adfærd og udviklingsmål.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Nielsen, Jens Christian","Olesen, Jesper Stilling","Skrubbeltrang, Lotte Stausgaard"],"cuid":["S02-098.53-006499"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Folkeskole","Grundskole","Talent"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum","med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"at blive optaget som idrætselev udvælgelse og korrektion","src":["aau","au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU"],"type":"dra","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"http://pure.au.dk/portal/files/85958138/Idr_tstalenter_i_den_danske_folkeskole_forpligtiget_p_udvikling_JCN_JEO_og_LSS_2015.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-098.53-006499","ids":["aau-8674d262-7ba8-424a-96d9-4b46467ed83d","au-de12ba80-dc9f-4a4f-812a-fc8a4b9f7e29"],"keyword":["Folkeskole","Grundskole","Talent"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities","Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-2-6835C5657A7D3BBF33C1203A7B4AA16E"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.uvm.dk/~/media/UVM/Filer/Udd/Folke/PDF15/Apr/150408%20Idraetstalenter%20i%20den%20danske%20folkeskole.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"http://pure.au.dk/portal/files/85958138/Idr_tstalenter_i_den_danske_folkeskole_forpligtiget_p_udvikling_JCN_JEO_og_LSS_2015.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, Danish School of Education, Danish School of Education - Research Programme for Diversity, Culture and Change"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities, Department of Learning and Philosophy, Centre for Education Policy Research (Learning)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Health Science and Technology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Health Science and Technology, Center for Sensory-Motor Interaction","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Health Science and Technology, Centre for Health Science Education and Problem-based Learning","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Health Science and Technology, Physical Activity and Human Performance","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Health Science and Technology, Sport Sciences (SSI)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jens Christian","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"f8fee80e-c33e-467c-9afd-8462e0bf571e","name":"Nielsen, Jens Christian","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper","key":"stillingolesenpau","last":"Stilling Olesen","locid":"bb840c08-e692-4000-8a96-d541f03bb9f4","name":"Stilling Olesen, Jesper","orcid":"0000-0001-7536-4544","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesper Stilling","key":"olesenpau","last":"Olesen","name":"Olesen, Jesper Stilling","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Lotte Stausgaard","key":"skrubbeltrangpau","last":"Skrubbeltrang","locid":"aa7165f7-cae8-472d-a248-99070c7f941a","name":"Skrubbeltrang, Lotte Stausgaard","orcid":"0000-0001-7419-1856","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"eisbn":["9788776847838"],"isbn":["9788776847838"],"pages":"17-34","place":"København","publisher":"Institut for Uddannelse og Pædagogik (DPU), Aarhus Universitet","status":"p","subtitle":"forpligtiget på udvikling","title":"Idrætstalenter i den danske folkeskole"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-8674d262-7ba8-424a-96d9-4b46467ed83d","au-de12ba80-dc9f-4a4f-812a-fc8a4b9f7e29"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","AU Aarhus University"],"title":"At blive optaget som idrætselev : udvælgelse og korrektion","type":"Report Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-098.53-006499","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"The proinflammatory cytokine tumor necrosis factor (TNF) plays a central role in low-grade adipose tissue inflammation and development of insulin resistance during obesity. In this context, nuclear factor κ-light-chain-enhancer of activated B cells (NFκB) is directly involved and required for the acute activation of the inflammatory gene program. Here, we show that the major transactivating subunit of NFκB, v-rel avian reticuloendotheliosis viral oncogene homolog A (RELA), is also required for acute TNF-induced suppression of adipocyte genes. Notably, this repression does not involve RELA binding to the associated enhancers but rather loss of cofactors and enhancer RNA (eRNA) selectively from high-occupancy sites within super-enhancers. Based on these data, we have developed models that, with high accuracy, predict which enhancers and genes are repressed by TNF in adipocytes. We show that these models are applicable to other cell types where TNF represses genes associated with super-enhancers in a highly cell-type-specific manner. Our results propose a novel paradigm for NFκB-mediated repression, whereby NFκB selectively redistributes cofactors from high-occupancy enhancers, thereby specifically repressing super-enhancer-associated cell identity genes.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Schmidt, Søren Fisker","Larsen, Bjørk Ditlev","Loft, Anne","Nielsen, Ronni","Madsen, Jesper Grud Skat","Mandrup, Susanne"],"cuid":["S02-098.91-043155"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"sci","mra":["sci","soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"acute tnf induced repression of cell identity genes is mediated by nfκb directed redistribution of cofactors from super enhancers","src":["ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1101/gr.188300.114","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-098.91-043155","identifier":[{"id":"26113076","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84941000331","type":"scopus"},{"id":"PMC4561488","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["ku-698c602f-c3e7-45f5-bf35-5b92c12f51ce","sdu-478da7c1-ff44-4f3f-a48c-f0ff4278810a"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology","Social Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-0563EEF3CCD2DD76144297BE1C61EC11"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1101/gr.188300.114","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, Faculty of Science, Department of Biochemistry and Molecular Biology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Novo Nordisk Foundation Center for Basic Metabolic Research, Translational Metabolic Physiology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Fisker","key":"schmidtpau","last":"Schmidt","locid":"325504d1-b29d-47c1-b594-5aa509340858","name":"Schmidt, Søren Fisker","orcid":"0000-0003-4449-288X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Bjørk Ditlev","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"b5604438-a5c4-48e6-bfe1-323596b91e52","name":"Larsen, Bjørk Ditlev","orcid":"0000-0003-1754-770X","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anne","key":"loftpau","last":"Loft","locid":"a616f90c-d579-46d4-9db7-8e0c3d19aa46","name":"Loft, Anne","orcid":"0000-0002-5647-8295","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Ronni","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"3fd12718-04a0-4664-882c-8213d3b5291b","name":"Nielsen, Ronni","orcid":"0000-0001-6331-7660","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 1","first":"Jesper Grud Skat","key":"madsenpau","last":"Madsen","locid":"100c7f8f-c444-486b-ab2e-a28e663d067b","name":"Madsen, Jesper Grud Skat","orcid":"0000-0002-0518-0800","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Susanne","key":"mandruppau","last":"Mandrup","locid":"6e8c29d6-da8a-4ef0-ab1a-03efe2e3d9e5","name":"Mandrup, Susanne","orcid":"0000-0002-0961-5787","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["26113076"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1101/gr.188300.114","issn":["10889051","15495469"],"issn_org":["10889051"],"issue":"9","journal":"Genome Research","pages":"1281-1294","publisher":"Cold Spring Harbor Laboratory Press","status":"p","title":"Genome Research","volume":"25"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84941000331"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-698c602f-c3e7-45f5-bf35-5b92c12f51ce","sdu-478da7c1-ff44-4f3f-a48c-f0ff4278810a"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Acute TNF-induced repression of cell identity genes is mediated by NFκB-directed redistribution of cofactors from super-enhancers","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-098.91-043155","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
