=LOI:S01-000.00-050256","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"A new over-the-air (OTA) testing method is required for evaluating multiple-antenna systems in realistic multipath propagation environments. Antenna design and propagation channels are the two key parameters that ultimately determine the multiple-input, multiple-output (MIMO) device performance. As antennas are inherently included in OTA testing, it is important to also consider realistic channel models for MIMO device-performance evaluation. This article shows that the multiprobe anechoic chamber (MPAC) setup is capable of emulating realistic and accurate multipath environments, making it a suitable method for testing terminals equipped with multiple antennas. In comparison to the mode-stirred reverberation chamber (RC) setup that represents an isotropic multipath environment, the MPAC method is capable of generating arbitrary spatial channel models with polarization characteristics.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Fan, Wei","Carreño, Xavier","Kyösti, Pekka","Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","Pedersen, Gert Frølund"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-053610"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Finland","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Anite Telecoms Oy","Intel"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"over the air testing of mimo capable terminals evaluation of multiple antenna systems in realistic multipath propagation environments using an ota method","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/213027331/magzine_paper.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-053610","identifier":[{"id":"84930631955","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-0c36e346-039d-4f64-9460-0af34f652426"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-B83EEA420B8CD3236133CE04DA7E4B7A"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/MVT.2015.2410314","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/213027331/magzine_paper.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Antennas, propagation and radio networking"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"us","key":"intel","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Intel","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"fi","key":"anite telecoms oy","loc":["Finland","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Anite Telecoms Oy","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Wei","key":"fanpau","last":"Fan","locid":"196e035b-e3db-4c94-b288-03dcd3119fda","name":"Fan, Wei","orcid":"0000-0002-9835-4485","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Xavier","key":"carreñopau","last":"Carreño","name":"Carreño, Xavier","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Pekka","key":"kyöstipau","last":"Kyösti","name":"Kyösti, Pekka","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Ødum","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"12489268-4402-4c17-8487-76a4323ee983","name