{"abstract":"Spherical wave channel modeling has attracted huge research attention for massive multiple-input multiple-output (MIMO) and short-distance MIMO systems. Current research work in multi-probe anechoic chamber systems is limited to reproduce radio channels assuming planar wavefronts. There is a need to emulate spherical wave channel models in multi-probe anechoic chamber setups. In this paper, a technique based on the field synthesis principle is proposed to approximate spherical waves emitted from arbitrarily located point sources with arbitrary polarizations. Simulation results show that static spherical waves can be reproduced with a limited number of probes, and the field synthesis accuracy of spherical wave depends on the location of the source point.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Fan, Wei","Carreño, Xavier","Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","Pedersen, Gert Frølund"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-100257"],"event":{"acronym":"EuCAP","end":"2015-05-17","place":"Lisbon, pt","start":"2015-05-13","title":"9th European Conference on Antennas and Propagation, EuCAP 2015","year":"2015"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"country":["United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Intel"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"emulating spherical wave channel models in multi probe anechoic chamber setups","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://ieeexplore.ieee.org/xpl/articleDetails.jsp?arnumber=7228232","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-100257","identifier":[{"id":"84949659982","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-acea3cea-c2f6-48d3-8c3a-26069a14f95a"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Scienc