rillation : Results from the Copenhagen ECG Study","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-091.51-006494","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"We present a novel solid-phase based 45Ti radiolabeling methodology and the implementation of 45Ti-PET in titanium-based antineoplastics using the showcase compound [45Ti](salan)Ti(dipic). This development is intended to allow elucidation of the biodistribution and pharmacokinetics of promising new Ti-based therapeutics.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Severin, Gregory","Nielsen, Carsten H.","Jensen, Andreas Tue Ingemann","Fonslet, Jesper","Kjær, Andreas","Zhuravlev, Fedor"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-033381"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"sci","mra":["med","sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"bringing radiotracing to titanium based antineoplastics solid phase radiosynthesis pet and ex vivo evaluation of antitumor agent sup 000000000045 sup ti salan ti dipic","src":["dtu","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/115437499/Bringing_radiotracing_postprint.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-033381","identifier":[{"id":"26312993","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84942333174","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-23afccd7-1975-48a2-9c3c-6572ce67f76b","ku-bf7af1fa-34bd-4ecd-907f-103deddcd10e"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science","Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-9DA78150FC93BD82B51A382848E17845"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/115437499/Bringing_radiotracing_postprint.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Center for Nuclear Technologies","Technical University of Denmark, Center for Nuclear Technologies, The Hevesy Laboratory"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Biomedical Sciences","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Biomedical Sciences, Endocrinology and Metabolism"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Gregory","key":"severinpau","last":"Severin","locid":"0e92340c-c204-4cd4-a297-06bb096315e3","name":"Severin, Gregory","orcid":"0000-0003-1189-7311","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Carsten H.","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"aefb223a-8c5c-41c6-9e69-fade0a04bf90","name":"Nielsen, Carsten Haagen","name_org":"Nielsen, Carsten H.","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Andreas Tue Ingemann","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"e28ab99e-fe7d-42cc-82d6-4478477211e7","name":"Jensen, Andreas Tue Ingemann","orcid":"0000-0002-9085-8603","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper","key":"fonsletpau","last":"Fonslet","locid":"4e7c8b5c-0ca8-486a-90a2-0a43669dc729","name":"Fonslet, Jesper","orcid":"0000-0003-1563-0251","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Andreas","key":"kjærpau","last":"Kjær","locid":"23e31554-6330-4153-9443-43d6e2951b3d","name":"Kjaer, Andreas","name_org":"Kjær, Andreas","orcid":"0000-0002-2706-5547","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Fedor","key":"zhuravlevpau","last":"Zhuravlev","locid":"36931255-67cf-464d-9e3e-7ab0b2af30f4","name":"Zhuravlev, Fedor","orcid":"0000-0001-8457-5191","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["26312993"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1021/acs.jmedchem.5b01167","issn":["00222623","15204804"],"issn_org":["00222623"],"issue":"18","journal":"Journal of Medicinal Chemistry","pages":"7591-7595","publisher":"American Chemical Society","status":"p","title":"Journal of Medicinal Chemistry","volume":"58"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84942333174"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-23afccd7-1975-48a2-9c3c-6572ce67f76b","ku-bf7af1fa-34bd-4ecd-907f-103deddcd10e"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Bringing Radiotracing to Titanium-Based Antineoplastics: Solid Phase Radiosynthesis, PET and ex Vivo Evaluation of Antitumor Agent [<sup>45</sup>Ti](salan)Ti(dipic)","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-033381","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"BACKGROUND: We tested the hypothesis that pressure sensitivity of the sternum (PPS) is associated with autonomic nervous system (ANS) function as assessed by tilt table test (TTT). in patients with stable ischemic heart disease. OBJECTIVES: (1) To evaluate an association between PPS and systolic blood pressure (SBP) and heart rate (HR) responses to TTT; and (2) to test the hypothesis that a reduction of resting PPS raises the PPS, SBP and HR responses to TTT response and lowers risk factors for ANS dysfunction (ANSD). METHODS: Cross-sectional study: In 361 patients with stable ischemic heart disease we measured PPS, SBP, and HR during TTT. Intervention study: We reassessed subjects with persistent stress who concluded a stress intervention trial by a second TTT. RESULTS: Cross-sectional study: Resting PPS and the PPS response to TTT were correlated (r = - 0.37). The PPS response to TTT was correlated with that of SBP (r = 0.44) and HR (r = 0.49), and with the number of risk factors for ANSD (r = - 0.21) (all p < 0.0001). Intervention study: A reduction in resting PPS was associated with an increment in PPS response to TTT (r = - 0.52, p < 0.0001). The greater this increment, the greater was the reduction in ANSD risk factors (r = - 0.23; p = 0.003). CONCLUSION: The results are consistent with the hypothesis that PPS at rest and in response to TTT reflects ANS function.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Ballegaard, Søren","Bergmann, Natasha","Karpatschof, Benny","Christiansen, Jesper","Gyntelberg, Finn","Arendt-Nielsen, Lars","Bech, Per","Hjalmarson, Åke","Faber, Jens"],"cuid":["S03-097.20-766994"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"keyword":["Autonomic nervous system","Cross Sectional Studies","Demography","Female","Humans","Male","Middle Aged","Pain","Pressure","Regression Analysis","Risk Factors","Tilt Table Test"],"level":"sci","mra":["med","soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-U"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-WORK"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-UND"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-WORK","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-UND"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"association between pressure pain sensitivity and autonomic function as assessed by a tilt table test","src":["aau","ku","nfa"],"src-code":["DI-GV-WORK","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84933504458","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S03-097.20-766994","identifier":[{"id":"WOS:000360177600001","type":"wos"},{"id":"25833816","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84933504458","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-c053fef0-c3c7-49d4-be2a-daa18b615726","ku-fcfe50a8-5599-4333-8930-090857d71a5f","nfa-dc4aa606-aae9-417f-87ff-a677428fc90b"],"keyword":["Autonomic Nervous System","Cross-Sectional Studies","Demography","Female","Humans","Male","Middle Aged","Pain","Pressure","Regression Analysis","Risk Factors","Tilt-Table Test"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science","Social Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-6-36B397ADADF9A5570C4B3F0B35E29280"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"unclear universities","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-UND","l3nl":"Undetermined","l3nn":"Unclear Universities","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Unclear Universities","namevar":["Institut for Psykologi"],"nora_code":"DI-U-UND","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Health Science and Technology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Health Science and Technology, Center for Sensory-Motor Interaction"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":4,"key":"nfa national research centre for the working environment","l2":"DI-GV","l2n":"Governmental Institutions","l3":"DI-GV-WORK","l3nl":"NFA National Research Centre for the Working Environment","l3nn":"NFA National Research Centre for the Working Environment","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"NFA National Research Centre for the Working Environment","namevar":["NFA National Research Centre for the Working Environment"],"nora_code":"DI-GV-WORK"}],"person":[{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren","key":"ballegaardpau","last":"Ballegaard","name":"Ballegaard, Søren","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Natasha","key":"bergmannpau","last":"Bergmann","name":"Bergmann, Natasha","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Benny","key":"karpatschofpau","last":"Karpatschof","name":"Karpatschof, Benny","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesper","key":"christiansenpau","last":"Christiansen","name":"Christiansen, Jesper","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Jesper","key":"kristiansenpau","last":"Kristiansen","name":"Kristiansen, Jesper","orcid":"0000-0002-1637-8900","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Finn","key":"gyntelbergpau","last":"Gyntelberg","name":"Gyntelberg, Finn","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresp