{"abstract":"Aalborg Forsyning, Kloak A/S overvejer i øjeblikket i samråd med Aalborg Universitet, hvordan samspil mellem forsyningens 9 regnmålere og et kommende regn radarsystem udformes optimalt. Behovet for dette samspil blev tydeliggjort ved en regnhændelse den 11. maj 2014.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Laden, Bo","Sørensen, Morten Steen","Nielsen, Jesper Ellerbæk"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-109870"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Nedbørsmåling","Regn","Regnmåler"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"tema når 000000000009 regnmålere i et forsyningsområde ikke er nok","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dra","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.dmi.dk/fileadmin/user_upload/Rapporter/TR/2015/TR_15-03_.pdf","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-109870","ids":["aau-ce0bafc9-660d-4264-83b5-9daf8a48f5ff"],"keyword":["Nedbørsmåling","Radarsystem","Regn","Regnmåler"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-D879B71C4ED20C380AF2AD3D88E7A1A9"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"other companies","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-OTH","l3nl":"Other Companies","l3nn":"Other Companies","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Companies","namevar":["Aalborg Forsyning A/S"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-OTH","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Civil Engineering","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Civil Engineering, Division of Water and Environment (CIVIL)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of the Built Environment, Division of Civil and Environmental Engineering","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of the Built Environment, Urban Water Research Group"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Bo","key":"ladenpau","last":"Laden","name":"Laden, Bo","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Morten Steen","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","name":"Sørensen, Morten Steen","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Ellerbæk","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"f850e281-27d9-4783-84c8-3048e7819444","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Ellerbæk","orcid":"0000-0003-4596-0948","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Rikke Sjølin","key":"thomsenpedh","last":"Thomsen","name":"Thomsen, Rikke Sjølin","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"issue":"03","pages":"37-40","place":"København","publisher":"DMI","series":"DMI Report","status":"p","subtitle":"Årsnotat 2014","title":"Drift af Spildevandskomitéens Regnmålersystem"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Private Research","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Other Companies","Private Research","Universities","aalborg forsyning a/s"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-ce0bafc9-660d-4264-83b5-9daf8a48f5ff"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Tema: Når 9 regnmålere i et forsyningsområde ikke er nok...","type":"Report Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-109870","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"In this paper we use ultra-wideband (UWB) signals for the localization of blade tips on wind turbines. Our approach is to acquire two separate distances to each tip via time-delay estimation, and each tip is then localized by triangulation. We derive an approximate maximum a posteriori (MAP) delay estimator exploiting i) contextual prior information and ii) a direct-path approximation. The resulting deflection estimation algorithm is computationally feasible for online usage. Simulation studies are conducted to assess the overall triangulation uncertainty and it is observed that negative correlation between the two distance estimates is detrimental for the tip localization accuracy. Measurement data acquired in an anechoic chamber is used to confirm that the UWB-hardware complies with the desired/relevant ranging accuracy. Finally, measurement data obtained from a static test bench is used to demonstrate that the approximate MAP-based localization algorithm is able to outperform standard methods.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Jensen, Tobias Lindstrøm","Jakobsen, Morten Lomholt","Østergaard, Jan","Nielsen, Jesper Kjær","Byskov, Claus","Bæk, Peter","Jensen, Søren Holdt"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-119535"],"event":{"end":"2015-09-04","place":"Nice, fr","start":"2015-08-31","title":"European Signal Processing Conference (EUSIPCO)","year":"2015"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-BOO","DI-PR-LM"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-BOO","DI-PR-LM","DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"online estimation of wind turbine blade deflection with uwb signals","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.eurasip.org/Proceedings/Eusipco/Eusipco2015/papers/1570102585.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-119535","identifier":[{"id":"84963972017","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-ef001fa4-f289-4978-99f7-6665e4f749b7"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-2178F2E11BE9676230D81ABDE52DCC3A"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.eurasip.org/Proceedings/Eusipco/Eusipco2015/papers/1570102585.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Signal and Information Processing"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"bang olufsen","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-BOO","l3nl":"Bang & Olufsen","l3nn":"Bang & Olufsen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Bang & Olufsen","namevar":["Bang & Olufsen A/S"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-BOO","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"lm wind power","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-LM","l3nn":"LM Wind Power","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"LM Wind Power","namevar":["LM Wind Power"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-LM","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Tobias Lindstrøm","key":"jensentobiaslindstrømpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"a2e382fc-c4c6-4ff2-b7d2-8b012eb5160e","name":"Jensen, Tobias Lindstrøm","orcid":"0000-0003-4262-0577","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","correspondi