{"abstract":"We present the first deuterium ion temperature and rotation measurements by collective Thomson scattering at ASDEX Upgrade. The results are in general agreement with boron-based charge exchange recombination spectroscopy measurements and consistent with neoclassical simulations for the plasma scenario studied here. This demonstration opens the prospect for direct non-perturbative measurements of the properties of the main ion species in the plasma core with applications in plasma transport and confinement studies.","author_count":12,"contributors":["Stejner Pedersen, Morten","Nielsen, Stefan Kragh","Jacobsen, Asger Schou","Korsholm, Søren Bang","Leipold, Frank","McDermott, R. M.","Michelsen, Poul","Rasmussen, Jesper","Salewski, Mirko","Schubert, Martin","Stober, J.","Wagner, D. H."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-375291"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Germany"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Max Planck Institute for Plasma Physics"],"keyword":["Collective Thomson scattering","Tokamak"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"plasma rotation and ion temperature measurements by collective thomson scattering at asdex upgrade","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1088/0741-3335/57/6/062001","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-375291","identifier":[{"id":"84929340296","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-ec675815-fd14-421d-a33b-ebd98347c725"],"keyword":["Collective Thomson scattering","Main ion rotation and temperature","Tokamak"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-5A9C709FF2F8A14B1F38FCCAEFEA9C34"],"oa_link":[{"ac