TU Technical University of Denmark","RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Electrodialytic separation of phosphorus and heavy metals from sewage sludge ash","type":"Conference Poster","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-096.70-032871","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"Low-temperature gasification allows the production of energy from biomass with high contents of low melting point compounds, like sewage sludge, and the recycling of the nutrients as P from the resulting ashes as renewable fertiliser. Major drawbacks are, however, the presence of heavy metals and the low plant-availability of Al- and Fe- phosphate compounds in the gasification ashes. In the present research, the feasibility of a 2-compartment electrodialytic (ED) setup for P separation from Al, Fe and heavy metals in two different low-temperature gasification ashes was investigated. One ash was from gasification of sewage sludge where P was precipitated with Fe and Al salts, from which it was possible to extract up to 26% of the P. The other ash was from co-gasification of a mixture of biologically precipitated sewage sludge and wheat straw pellets. More promising results were obtained with this ash, as up to 90% of the P was extracted from the ashes. For both ashes, P was extracted by ED in acidic aqueous solutions with ratios of Fe, Al and each heavy metal to P considerably below the values found in the initial ashes. Therefore, the 2-compartment ED cell technology was proved as possible method to separate Al, Fe and heavy metals from P for low-temperature gasification ashes.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Parés Viader, Raimon","Jensen, Pernille Erland","Ottosen, Lisbeth M.","Ahrenfeldt, Jesper","Hauggaard-Nielsen, Henrik"],"cuid":["S02-098.06-036946"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Electrodialysis","Elektrolyse","Fosfor","Heavy metals","Low temperature gasification","Phosphorus","Sewage sludge ash","Spildevandsslam","Tungmetaller"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci","soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"electrodialytic extraction of phosphorus from ash of low temperature gasification of sewage sludge","src":["dtu","ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/130113981/Electrodialytic_extraction_of_phosphorus_from_ash_of_low_temperature_gasification_of_sewage_sludge.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S02-098.06-036946","identifier":[{"id":"84945480301","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-c0230a52-1bcd-48a7-88a6-995b6fba63a5","ruc-df1ca653-8002-4dd2-bfb6-a0b147244b25"],"keyword":["Electrodialysis","Elektrolyse","Fosfor","Heavy metals","Lav-temperatur forgasning","Low-temperature gasification","Phosphorus","Sewage sludge ash","Spildevandsslam","Tungmetaller"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology","Social Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-C6E168DFFFF08E31C12A9519A83A6843"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/56705641/EREM14_29_Manuscript_reviewed.docx","version":"Authors Final Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.electacta.2015.05.025","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/130113981/Electrodialytic_extraction_of_phosphorus_from_ash_of_low_temperature_gasification_of_sewage_sludge.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Civil Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},