{"abstract":"Denne rapport omfatter en rapportering af de indsamlede data fra 2011-13 for de 18 lysåbne naturtyper, der blev overvåget i første programperiode. Desuden er der en beskrivelse af overvågningsprogrammets indikatorer. Disse indikatorer er forskellige for de forskellige naturtyper. Der er foretaget en sammenligning af en række indikatorer inden for og uden for habitatområderne. Overordnet set er der for de fleste undersøgte indikatorers vedkommende en bedre status inden for end uden for habitatområderne","author_count":5,"contributors":["Nielsen, Knud Erik","Nygaard, Bettina","Bladt, Jesper","Damgaard, Christian","Ejrnæs, Rasmus"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-165252"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"com","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"indikatorer for terrestriske naturtyper inden og udenfor habitatområderne 000000002013 novana","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-165252","ids":["au-3f1906d9-b03b-414a-baa4-f20a676c4d7c"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Commissioned","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-843B4B84C0BC3288D02A979C3AE61921"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Ecoscience, Department of Ecoscience - Terrestrial Ecology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Knud Erik","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"b349ca79-38d0-4c9b-84d2-7eb4defb1240","name":"Nielsen, Knud Erik","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Bettina","key":"nygaardpau","last":"Nygaard","locid":"68c147bf-e9bf-4693-8da5-69f0faac544c","name":"Nygaard, Bettina","orcid":"0000-0003-3335-9397","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper","key":"bladtpau","last":"Bladt","locid":"321c5b54-0e53-40d2-b196-b8df7ddcf68f","name":"Bladt, Jesper","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Christian Frølund","key":"damgaardpau","last":"Damgaard","locid":"719d46aa-2846-41c9-9b1e-fd5278eaa711","name":"Damgaard, Christian","name_org":"Damgaard, Christian Frølund","orcid":"0000-0003-3932-4312","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Rasmus","key":"ejrnæspau","last":"Ejrnæs","locid":"de0d0e9b-b9f3-46a7-9a70-ed6e45dba8d8","name":"Ejrnæs, Rasmus","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"46","publisher":"Aarhus University, DCE - Danish Centre for Environment and Energy","repno":"Scientific Report from DCE - Danish Centre for Environment and Energy","series":"Scientific Report from DCE - Danish Centre for Environment and Energy","status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-3f1906d9-b03b-414a-baa4-f20a676c4d7c"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Indikatorer for terrestriske naturtyper inden- og udenfor habitatområderne, 2013 : NOVANA","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-165252","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"Live streaming from bird nests has become increasingly popular for educational purposes, but may also hold a research potential by enabling direct observations of food provisioning and social interactions. We used video recordings from an Eagle Owl nest to investigate diet composition and prey delivery patterns as a function of date, time of day and weather. A total of 72 deliveries were observed with 41 prey items (57%) being identified to species and 18 (25%) to a higher taxonomic group. Birds accounted for 22 individuals (37%) and mammals for 37 individuals (63%). We found a significant positive correlation between biomass delivered per time unit and chick age, whereas the number of prey deliveries per time unit decreased with chick age, but increased with wind strength. We conclude that livestreams can provide much information on the feeding biology of owls and serve as an alternative to pellet analysis in studies of diet composition.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Nielsen, Jesper Stern","Larsen, Joachim Westergaard","Larsen, Trine Bork","Overgård, Helene","Sørensen, Iben Hove","Dichmann, Klaus","Sunde, Peter"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-201849"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"video som metode til undersøgelser af fødebiologi hos stor hornugle","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/98163174/Nielsen_et_al_2015_DOFT_Artikel_Hornugle.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-201849","ids":["au-7ec030fb-a42f-4ca9-8f60-edaf76d55bb6"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-D75BA8858CBB9D4BEF00DB231356233C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/98163174/Nielsen_et_al_2015_DOFT_Artikel_Hornugle.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Unspecified organisation"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Ecoscience, Department of Ecoscience - Wildlife Ecology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesper Stern","key":"nielsenjespersternpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Stern","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Joachim Westergaard","key":"larsenjoachimwestergaardpau","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, Joachim Westergaard","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Trine Bork","key":"larsentrineborkpau","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, Trine Bork","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Helene","key":"overgårdhelenepau","last":"Overgård","name":"Overgård, Helene","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Iben Hove","key":"sørensenibenhovepau","last":"Sørensen","name":"Sørensen, Iben Hove","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Klaus","key":"dichmannklauspau","last":"Dichmann","name":"Dichmann, Klaus","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Peter","key":"sundepeterpau","last":"Sunde","locid":"3a9b01f6-a55e-40f0-9f76-9f8bb4d5d466","name":"Sunde, Peter","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["00116394"],"journal":"Dansk Ornitologisk Forenings Tidsskrift","pages":"161-166","publisher":"Dansk Ornitologisk Forening","status":"p","title":"Dansk Ornitologisk Forenings Tidsskrift","volume":"109"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-7ec030fb-a42f-4ca9-8f60-edaf76d55bb6"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Video som metode til undersøgelser af fødebiologi hos Stor Hornugle","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-201849","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"During the last decade, there has been increasing focus on identifying and developing talented students within the Danish educational system, and, increasingly, talent development is regarded as a prerequisite in order to remain competitive on an international level. One of the results of this is that schools now have the option of providing themed programmes for students who display a particular interest in or talent for a particular activity. Because these classes appeal to many students and they have a limited intake, students strive to gain access to them. This creates a situation where students and schools can enter into a special agreement about what they can expect from each other. In this paper, we examine how Danish primary and lower secondary schools (in Danish, folkeskoler) handle this opportunity to enter into a new social learning contract, and what the schools and selected students, respectively, get out of entering into such an agreement. Specifically, we look at sports classes, which are the most widely used example of themed classes in Denmark, and we analyse what these contracts involve, how they are entered into and how they are enforced.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Nielsen, Jens Christian","Stilling Olesen, Jesper","Skrubbeltrang, Lotte S."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-207523"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Grundskole","Talent"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"what do schools get out of cooperation with elite sports sports talents learning agreement with danish primary and secondary schools","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dw","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.ethnography.webspace.virginmedia.com/Ethnography_Conference/Ethnography_Conference_Home_page.html","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-207523","ids":["au-890fb9b5-7ad9-4d7e-a848-bfb276e7b7b2"],"keyword":["Grundskole","Talent"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-04C8A2C816F31AB12390773E8EED5858"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, Danish School of Education, Danish School of Education - Research Programme for Diversity, Culture and Change"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University (AAU)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jens Christian","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"f8fee80e-c33e-467c-9afd-8462e0bf571e","name":"Nielsen, Jens Christian","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Stilling","key":"olesenpau","last":"Olesen","locid":"bb840c08-e692-4000-8a96-d541f03bb9f4","name":"Stilling Olesen, Jesper","name_org":"Olesen, Jesper Stilling","orcid":"0000-0001-7536-4544","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Lotte S.","key":"skrubbeltrangpau","last":"Skrubbeltrang","name":"Skrubbeltrang, Lotte S.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"11","place":"Oxford","publisher":"New College, Oxford University","status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-890fb9b5-7ad9-4d7e-a848-bfb276e7b7b2"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"What do schools get out of cooperation with elite sports? : sports talents' learning agreement with Danish primary and secondary schools","type":"Working Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-207523","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
