{"abstract":"En guide til de arkæologiske rester af oldtidens Neapolis/Neoklaudiopolis, grundlagt ca. 65 f.Kr. af den romerske feltherre Pompeius. Første del af bogen beskriver oldtidsbyens historie og dagligliv; i anden del tages læseren med på en vandring gennem den moderne by med stop ved monumentrester og indskrifter undervejs. I et appendix bringes en oversættelse af kejsereden fra Vezirköprü, som nu befinder sig på det arkæologiske museum i Istanbul. Bogen er rigt illustreret med fotos, kort og planer.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Bekker-Nielsen, Tønnes","Czichon, Rainer","Høgel, Christian","Kıvrak, Bünyamin","Madsen, Jesper Majbom","Sauer, Vera","Sørensen, Søren Lund","Winther-Jacobsen, Kristina"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-599050"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, Middle East","OECD"],"country":["Turkey"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Usak University"],"keyword":["Arkæologi","Historie","Neoklaudiopolis","Tyrkiet","Vezirköprü"],"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"neoklaudiopolis antik kenti vezirköprü samsun tarihsel ve arkeolojik rehber","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"db","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-599050","ids":["sdu-5a23d1dd-9ab9-4798-9edd-ff6b81859c37"],"keyword":["Neoklaudiopolis","Tyrkiet","Vezirköprü","arkæologi","historie"],"lang":"Turkish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-F9A8DDE7CB1340F947F10F1AD31BBB4E"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, Faculty of Humanities, Department of History"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"tr","key":"usak university","loc":["Turkey","Asia, Middle East","OECD"],"name":"Usak University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Tønnes","key":"bekkernielsenpau","last":"Bekker-Nielsen","locid":"0b1d0a8f-6ba2-466c-8302-ff66ddefb4c9","name":"Bekker-Nielsen, Tønnes","orcid":"0000-0003-4628-5411","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Rainer","key":"czichonpau","last":"Czichon","name":"Czichon, Rainer","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Christian","key":"høgelpau","last":"Høgel","locid":"337cd941-81a2-4faa-96fc-99a9d6255289","name":"Høgel, Christian","orcid":"0000-0003-3192-0961","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Bünyamin","key":"kıvrakpau","last":"Kıvrak","name":"Kıvrak, Bünyamin","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Majbom","key":"madsenpau","last":"Madsen","locid":"e32f502a-9dd2-4f29-8a66-7c4f54049f11","name":"Madsen, Jesper Majbom","orcid":"0000-0003-0997-2730","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Vera","key":"sauerpau","last":"Sauer","locid":"e62a41c8-a685-43a1-b719-a2fc2bd33e61","name":"Sauer, Vera","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Lund","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","locid":"3c0cb1a6-129c-40f6-bd95-315c7f00bcd7","name":"Sørensen, Søren Lund","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Kristina","key":"wintherjacobsenpau","last":"Winther-Jacobsen","name":"Winther-Jacobsen, Kristina","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9786053963400"],"pages":"96","place":"Istanbul","publisher":"Arkeoloji ve Sanat Yayınları","status":"p"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-5a23d1dd-9ab9-4798-9edd-ff6b81859c37"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Neoklaudiopolis Antik Kenti (Vezirköprü - Samsun) : Tarihsel ve Arkeolojik Rehber","type":"Book","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-599050","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"The use of subgroups based on biological-clinical and socio-demographic variables to deal with population heterogeneity is well-established in public policy. The use of subgroups based on preferences is rare, except when religion based, and controversial. If it were decided to treat subgroup preferences as valid determinants of public policy, a transparent analytical procedure is needed. In this proof of method study we show how public preferences could be incorporated into policy decisions in a way that respects both the multi-criterial nature of those decisions, and the heterogeneity of the population in relation to the importance assigned to relevant criteria. It involves combining Cluster Analysis (CA), to generate the subgroup sets of preferences, with Multi-Criteria Decision Analysis (MCDA), to provide the policy framework into which the clustered preferences are entered. We employ three techniques of CA to demonstrate that not only do different techniques produce different clusters, but that choosing among techniques (as well as developing the MCDA structure) is an important task to be undertaken in implementing the approach outlined in any specific policy context. Data for the illustrative, not substantive, application are from a Randomized Controlled Trial of online decision aids for Australian men aged 40-69 years considering Prostate-specific Antigen testing for prostate cancer. We show that such analyses can provide policy-makers with insights into the criterion-specific needs of different subgroups. Implementing CA and MCDA in combination to assist in the development of policies on important health and community issues such as drug coverage, reimbursement, and screening programs, poses major challenges - conceptual, methodological, ethical-political, and practical - but most are exposed by the techniques, not created by them.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Kaltoft, Mette Kjer","Turner, Robin","Cunich, Michelle","Salkeld, Glenn","Nielsen, Jesper Bo","Dowie, Jack"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-616392"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","OECD","Oceania"],"country":["Australia","United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","London School of Hygiene and Tropical Medicine","The University of Sydney","University of New South Wales"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"addressing preference heterogeneity in public health policy by combining cluster analysis and multi criteria decision analysis proof of method","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1186/s13561-015-0048-4","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-616392","identifier":[{"id":"84971324181","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["sdu-96c1c1ab-a6a0-4ad0-9319-b7311ffc2aa8"],"keyword":["Cluster Analysis; Multi-Criteria Decision Analysis; preference subgroups; heterogeneity"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-D81ABA1ADFAEE5D79575C7B7FF47E876"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1186/s13561-015-0048-4","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Public Health","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Public Health, Research Unit of General Pratice"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"au","key":"the university of sydney","loc":["Australia","Oceania","OECD"],"name":"The University of Sydney","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"au","key":"university of new south wales","loc":["Australia","Oceania","OECD"],"name":"University of New South Wales","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"gb","key":"london school of hygiene and tropical medicine","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"London School of Hygiene and Tropical Medicine","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Mette Kjer","key":"kaltoftpau","last":"Kaltoft","locid":"6f7d182a-c64a-413a-84e7-40365be224fe","name":"Kaltoft, Mette Kjer","orcid":"0000-0002-7056-8297","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Robin","key":"turnerpau","last":"Turner","name":"Turner, Robin","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Michelle","key":"cunichpau","last":"Cunich","name":"Cunich, Michelle","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Glenn","key":"salkeldpau","last":"Salkeld","name":"Salkeld, Glenn","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Bo","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"75938cc2-43d6-4c8d-a506-6b1c0472a382","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Bo","orcid":"0000-0002-5764-5462","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Jack","key":"dowiepau","last":"Dowie","name":"Dowie, Jack","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1186/s13561-015-0048-4","issn":["21911991"],"issue":"1","journal":"Health Economics Review","publisher":"BioMed Central","status":"p","title":"Health Economics Review","volume":"5"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84971324181"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-96c1c1ab-a6a0-4ad0-9319-b7311ffc2aa8"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Addressing preference heterogeneity in public health policy by combining Cluster Analysis and Multi-Criteria Decision Analysis : Proof of Method","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-616392","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"Background: The Franciscan Friary in Montella near Avellino in Southern Italy is of special interest because according to historical sources it was founded by St. Francis himself in AD 1221-1222. Human remains of several hundred individuals interred in the cloister walk have been unearthed during two excavation campaigns conducted in 2007-2008 and 2010. The environs of the friary have remained rural since the foundation preventing much modern contamination. The state of preservation of the skeletons is fair to good making a suite of analyses worthwhile. Results: The skeletons have been examined anthropologically and tissue samples have been subjected to radiocarbon dating, stable isotope measurements and trace element analyses by Inductively Coupled Plasma Mass Spectrometry and Cold Vapour Atomic Absorption Spectrometry. Conclusions: The radiocarbon dates are consistent with the historical sources and show that the cemetery in the cloister walk has been in uninterrupted use from the foundation of the friary in AD 1221-1222 and until the cemetery went out of use in AD 1524. The anthropological investigations show that the individuals interred at the friary would have been shorter than other Italians from the same time, and it seems that tuberculosis was more prevalent than leprosy. Isotopic measurements show a mixed agricultural and pastoral diet and none of the individuals were consuming marine protein. Based on the trace element analysis it seems that the people resided mainly at two distinct geographical areas, one of which was Montella. One individual stands out from the rest, because he was born and raised at some third geographical location distinct from Montella and because he sports the second oldest radiocarbon date of AD 1050-1249 (two sigma calibrated range). This date is consistent with the first generation of the founders of the friary-perhaps one of St. Francis' fellow travellers from Assisi.","author_count":11,"contributors":["Torino, Marielva","Boldsen, Jesper Lier","Tarp, Peter","Rasmussen, Kaare Lund","Skytte, Lilian","Nielsen, Lisbeth","Schiavone, Simone","Terrasi, Filippo","Passariello, Isabella","Ricci, Paola","Lubritto, Carmine"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-643363"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Italy"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Conventual Friars Minor, Pontifical Theological Faculty of St. Bonaventure, International College Seraphicum","INNOVA Scarl","Second University of Naples","University of Naples Federico II","Via Santa Caterina da Siena"],"keyword":["Montella","Osteology","Radiocarbon","Stable isotopes","Trace elements"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"convento di san francesco a folloni the function of a medieval franciscan friary seen through the burials","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/129631444/Convento_di_San_Francesco_a_Folloni.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-643363","identifier":[{"id":"84940747981","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["sdu-f51c64c7-306b-4c46-afec-4daca062fad3"],"keyword":["Franciscan friary","Montella","Osteology","Radiocarbon","Stable isotopes","Trace elements"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-E988C77D8ABF6444EB85D87BF488DE49"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1186/s40494-015-0056-z","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/129631444/Convento_di_San_Francesco_a_Folloni.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"it","key":"via santa caterina da siena","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Via Santa Caterina da Siena","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Forensic Medicine","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Forensic Medicine, ADBOU"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"it","key":"conventual friars minor pontifical theological faculty of st bonaventure international college seraphicum","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Conventual Friars Minor, Pontifical Theological Faculty of St. Bonaventure, International College Seraphicum","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"it","key":"second university of naples","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Second University of Naples","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"it","key":"innova scarl","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"INNOVA Scarl","used":1},{"affno":"6","country":"it","key":"university of naples federico ii","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Naples Federico II","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Marielva","key":"torinopau","last":"Torino","name":"Torino, Marielva","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesper L.","key":"boldsenpau","last":"Boldsen","locid":"fd6f6503-a886-4f97-becd-ce730d247ee0","name":"Boldsen, Jesper Lier","name_org":"Boldsen, Jesper L.","orcid":"0000-0002-2850-0934","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Peter","key":"tarppau","last":"Tarp","locid":"d4d680b3-00bb-4fac-963d-b3dfd985f2e1","name":"Tarp, Peter","orcid":"0000-0002-5664-3879","rank":3,"rol