, Kamelia Javanshir","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jan Jesper","key":"andreasenpau","last":"Andreasen","locid":"64f82f01-dc7b-4ed4-873a-940774d8921e","name":"Andreasen, Jan Jesper","orcid":"0000-0002-2382-3734","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Parisa","key":"gazeranipau","last":"Gazerani","locid":"64684d74-5bb0-4b78-94ff-7d18192e8aa9","name":"Gazerani, Parisa","orcid":"0000-0003-0109-3600","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Birthe Irene","key":"dinesenpau","last":"Dinesen","locid":"22de2dad-03e3-4bc9-8d55-94736e7d5941","name":"Dinesen, Birthe","name_org":"Dinesen, Birthe Irene","orcid":"0000-0001-5893-9676","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lars","key":"arendtnielsenpau","last":"Arendt-Nielsen","locid":"1794f9ec-22f1-47af-96c1-88c23c3b06a2","name":"Arendt-Nielsen, Lars","orcid":"0000-0003-0892-1579","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"publisher":"European Pain Federation EFIC","status":"p","title":"Abstract book of the 9th Congress of the European Pain Federation, EFIC, 2-5 September 2015, Vienna, Austria"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-26defa1d-c551-452e-bfaa-970f6c0944b9"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Post-thoracotomy pain syndrome : a Danish study","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-061330","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"This paper discusses over the air (OTA) testing for multiple input multiple output (MIMO) capable terminals with emphasis on modeling bidirectional spatial channel models in multiprobe anechoic chamber (MPAC) setups. In the literature, work on this topic has been mainly focused on how to emulate downlink channel models, whereas uplink channel is often modeled as free space line-of-sight channel without fading. Modeling realistic bidirectional (i.e., both uplink and downlink) propagation environments is essential to evaluate any bidirectional communication systems. There have been works stressing the importance of emulating full bidirectional channel and proposing possible directions to implement uplink channels in the literature. Nevertheless, there is no currently published work reporting an experimental validation of such concepts. In this paper, a general framework to emulate bidirectional channels for time division duplexing (TDD) and frequency division duplexing (FDD) communication systems is proposed. The proposed technique works for MPAC setups with arbitrary uplink and downlink probe configurations, that is, possibly different probe configurations (e.g., number of probes or their configurations) in the uplink and downlink. The simulation results are further supported by measurements in a practical MPAC setup. The proposed algorithm is shown to be a valid method to emulate bidirectional spatial channel models.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Fan, Wei","Kyösti, Pekka","Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","Hentilä, Lassi","Pedersen, Gert Frølund"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-091585"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Finland"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Anite Telecoms Oy"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"emulating realistic bidirectional spatial channels for mimo ota testing","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1155/2015/289843","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-091585","identifier":[{"id":"WOS:000366849400001","type":"wos"},{"id":"84953242452","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-8eea06ba-aacb-4380-8d32-4d5f6bb2ff44"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-0F6583C8DEC23527215969F917DFEE42"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/221750344/Final_manuscript.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1155/2015/289843","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Antennas, propagation and radio networking"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"fi","key":"anite telecoms oy","loc":["Finland","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Anite Telecoms Oy","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Wei","key":"fanpau","last":"Fan","locid":"196e035b-e3db-4c94-b288-03dcd3119fda","name":"Fan, Wei","orcid":"0000-0002-9835-4485","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Pekka","key":"kyöstipau","last":"Kyösti","name":"Kyösti, Pekka","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Ødum","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"12489268-4402-4c17-8487-76a4323ee983","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","orcid":"0000-0002-8505-853X","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Lassi","key":"hentiläpau","last":"Hentilä","name":"Hentilä, Lassi","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Gert F.","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"a49c73ee-aed0-448c-8a92-792c9ee12a9e","name":"Pedersen, Gert Frølund","name_org":"Pedersen, Gert F.","orcid":"0000-0002-6570-7387","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1155/2015/289843","issn":["16875869","16875877"],"issn_org":["16875869"],"journal":"International Journal of Antennas and Propagation","paperid":"289843","publisher":"Wiley","status":"p","title":"International Journal of Antennas and Propagation","volume":"2015"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84953242452"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-8eea06ba-aacb-4380-8d32-4d5f6bb2ff44"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Emulating Realistic Bidirectional Spatial Channels for MIMO OTA Testing","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-091585","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"The Generalized Likelihood Uncertainty Estimation methodology (GLUE) is investigated for radar rainfall calibration and uncertainty assessment. The method is used to calibrate radar data collected by a Local Area Weather Radar (LAWR). In contrast to other LAWR data calibrations, the method combines calibration with uncertainty estimation. Instead of searching for a single set of calibration parameters, the method uses the observations to construct distributions of the calibration parameters. These parameter sets provide valuable knowledge of parameter sensitivity and the uncertainty. Two approaches are analyzed; the static calibration approach, where the LAWR is calibrated once for a long period and the dynamic approach, where the estimate is continuously adjusted based on ground observations. The analysis illustrates that the static calibration performs insufficiently, whereas the dynamic adjustment improves the performance significantly. It is found that even if the dynamic adjustment method is used the uncertainty of rainfall estimates can still be significant.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Nielsen, Jesper Ellerbæk","Beven, Keith","Thorndahl, Søren Liedtke","Rasmussen, Michael R."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-109316"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"country":["United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Lancaster University"],"keyword":["GLUE","LAWR","Radar QPE","Uncertainty Estimation","Weather radar data calibration","X Band"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"glue based marine x band weather radar data calibration and uncertainty estimation","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-109316","identifier":[{"id":"WOS:000351885800003","type":"wos"},{"id":"84926262517","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-cc49d7c0-0ec4-4df2-b43f-f8f9f3409813"],"keyword":["GLUE","LAWR","Radar QPE","Uncertainty Estimation","Weather radar data calibration","X-Band"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-CD424BA7E1833BD5EBA490CBAAEB354E"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Civil Engineering","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Civil Engineering, Division of Water and Soil","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Civil Engineering, Urban Water and Environment Research Group","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Civil Engineering, Water and Environment Research Group","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of the Built Environment, Division of Civil and Environmental Engineering","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of the Built Environment, Division of Water and Environment","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of the Built Environment, Urban Water Research Group"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"gb","key":"lancaster university","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"Lancaster University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Ellerbæk","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"f850e281-27d9-4