{"abstract":"De novo design and chemical synthesis of proteins and of other artificial structures, which mimic them, is a central strategy for understanding protein folding and for accessing proteins with novel functions. We have previously described carbohydrates as templates for the assembly of artificial proteins, so called carboproteins. The hypothesis is that the template pre-organizes the secondary structure elements and directs the formation of a tertiary structure, thus achieving structural economy in the combination of peptide, linker, and template. We speculate that the structural information from the template could facilitate protein folding. Here we report the design and synthesis of 3-helix bundle carboproteins on deoxy-hexopyranosides. The carboproteins were analyzed by CD, AUC, SAXS, and NMR, which revealed the formation of the first compact, and folded monomeric carboprotein distinctly different to a molten globule.","author_count":11,"contributors":["Malik, Leila","Nygård, Jesper","Christensen, Niels Johan","Madsen, Charlotte Stahl","Rösner, Heike Ilona","Kragelund, Birthe B.","Hoiberg-Nielsen, Rasmus","Streicher, Werner","Arleth, Lise","Thulstrup, Peter Waaben","Jensen, Knud Jørgen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-420750"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-NOSI"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-NOSI","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a de novo designed monomeric compact three helix bundle protein on a carbohydrate template","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-420750","identifier":[{"id":"84940448275","type":"scopus"},{"id":"26147795","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-2dc6b5df-ad9a-4116-b067-55a13f25a34e"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-CB9C4087D80B465BC720F8C2B124D7F2"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Chemistry, Department of Chemistry"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"novonesis","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-NOSI","l3nn":"Novonesis","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Novonesis","namevar":["Novozymes"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-NOSI","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Leila","key":"malikpau","last":"Malik","locid":"78903637-5bb9-4ba6-b3be-5f4f950fcc99","name":"Malik, Leila","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Jesper","key":"nygårdpau","last":"Nygård","locid":"a9f6df21-02fe-407f-8472-6e4a496f8ec0","name":"Nygård, Jesper","orcid":"0000-0002-4639-5314","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Niels Johan","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"63f030f2-4bfe-42d9-99c2-e30d0f38a3bd","name":"Christensen, Niels Johan","orcid":"0000-0001-9588-2656","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Charlotte Stahl","key":"madsenpau","last":"Madsen","locid":"37d4e055-9261-4d68-b5e6-41effd0827c0","name":"Madsen, Charlotte Stahl","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Heike Ilona","key":"rösnerpau","last":"Rösner","locid":"c067b028-a52f-4c94-bcf2-927d1ea297e0","name":"Rösner, Heike Ilona","orcid":"0000-0002-6201-3195","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Birthe Brandt","key":"kragelundpau","last":"Kragelund","locid":"c3a5d42e-5e73-4af3-94f9-22550bb7c499","name":"Kragelund, Birthe B.","name_org":"Kragelund, Birthe Brandt","orcid":"0000-0002-7454-1761"