{"abstract":"The letter discusses over-the-air (OTA) testing for multiple-input–multiple-output (MIMO) capable terminals with emphasis on estimating discrete power angular spectrum modeled at the receiver (Rx) side in the test zone. Two techniques based on a uniform circular array (UCA) are proposed to obtain accurate direction-of-arrival estimates as well as power estimates of the impinging signals in the test zone. Simulation results match well with the target, as expected. Measurement results based on a virtual UCA in a practical 3-D multiprobe setup further support the simulation results. Possible reasons for the deviations between simulations and measurements are also investigated.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Fan, Wei","Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","Pedersen, Gert Frølund"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-064613"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"estimating discrete power angular spectra in multiprobe ota setups","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/186256348/final_manuscript.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-064613","identifier":[{"id":"WOS:000342828600001","type":"wos"},{"id":"84898404931","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-3249c96d-e4fd-47fe-8ed5-10f58fdfea30"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-D2DAFBF271CA92111A9B7D22E51C4689"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/186256348/final_manuscript.pdf","version":"Pre-print"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Antennas, propagation and radio networking"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Wei","key":"fanpau","last":"Fan","locid":"196e035b-e3db-4c94-b288-03dcd3119fda","name":"Fan, Wei","orcid":"0000-0002-9835-4485","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Ødum","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"12489268-4402-4c17-8487-76a4323ee983","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","orcid":"0000-0002-8505-853X","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Gert Frølund","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"a49c73ee-aed0-448c-8a92-792c9ee12a9e","name":"Pedersen, Gert Frølund","orcid":"0000-0002-6570-7387","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/lawp.2014.2306205","issn":["15361225"],"journal":"IEEE Antennas and Wireless Propagation Letters","pages":"349-352","publisher":"IEEE (Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers)","status":"p","title":"IEEE Antennas and Wireless Propagation Letters","title_org":"I E E E Antennas and Wireless Propagation Letters","volume":"13"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84898404931"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-3249c96d-e4fd-47fe-8ed5-10f58fdfea30"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Estimating Discrete Power Angular Spectra in Multiprobe OTA Setups","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-064613","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"The EU Directive on the Energy Performance of Buildings requires that energy certification of buildings should be implemented in Denmark so that houses that are sold or let should have an energy performance certificate. The result is that only a small part of existing houses has an energy performance certificate. The Danish Building Research Institute has described a method that can be applied for estimating the energy demand of dwellings. This is based on the information in the Danish Building and Dwelling Register and requirements in the Danish Building Regulations from the year of construction of the house. The result is an estimate of the energy demand of each building with a variation. This makes it possible to make an automatic classification of all buildings. The paper discusses the uncertainties and makes a sensitivity analysis to find the important parameters. The variations are compared with measured energy demand. The method can be applied in other countries with modifications for local building requirements, climate and building registers.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Nielsen, Anker","Wittchen, Kim Bjarne","Bertelsen, Niels Haldor"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-068528"],"event":{"acronym":"NSB","end":"2014-06-19","place":"Lund , se","start":"2014-06-15","title":"10th Nordic Symposium on Building Physics","year":"2014"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Energibesparelse","Renovering","beregningsmetode"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"sensitivity analysis of the energy demand of existing buildings based on the danish building and dwelling register","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/205506551/Sensitivity_analysis_of_the_energy_demand_of_existing_buildings.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-068528","ids":["aau-3fd8de47-22be-464e-a277-96bab6c09fe6"],"keyword":["Energibesparelse","beregningsmetode","renovering"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-F1AC1AD91D30C4B612A493C1AB22607E"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.nsb2014.se/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2014/07/Complete_fullpapers.pdf","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/205506551/Sensitivity_analysis_of_the_energy_demand_of_existing_buildings.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Danish Building Research Institute","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Danish Building Research Institute, Construction and health (CH)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anker","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"218dfaef-8c2b-4ec5-a965-af8a4382b15d","name":"Nielsen, Anker","orcid":"0000-0002-7130-6432","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Kim Bjarne","key":"wittchenpau","last":"Wittchen","locid":"4cf412e5-ace3-40f6-8f0c-dfef37eac83d","name":"Wittchen, Kim Bjarne","orcid":"0000-0002-3305-5409","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Niels Haldor","key":"bertelsenpau","last":"Bertelsen","locid":"e39ec4b4-5ae5-4793-99e4-3be87a28aafd","name":"Bertelsen, Niels Haldor","orcid":"0000-0001-6247-4218","rank"