{"abstract":"Individuals infected with human immunodeficiency virus (HIV) have excess risk of developing human papillomavirus (HPV)-related disease. A substantial fraction of HPV-associated cancers is caused by HPV serotypes not included in the currently available vaccines. Among healthy women, both Cervarix(®) (HPV-16/18, GlaxoSmithKline Biologicals, GSK) and Gardasil(®) (HPV-6/11/16/18, Merck) have demonstrated partial cross-protection against certain oncogenic non-vaccine HPV-types. Currently, there are no available data on vaccine-induced cross-protection in men and little is known about cross-reactive immunity after HPV-vaccination of HIV-infected individuals. In an investigator-initiated trial, we randomized 91 HIV-positive men and women to receive vaccination with Cervarix(®) or Gardasil(®). The HPV-DNA status of the participants was determined with pcr before and after immunization. Cross-reactive antibody responses against HPV-31, HPV-33, and HPV-45 were evaluated for up to 12 months using a pseudovirion-based neutralization assay (PBNA). Geometric mean antibody titers (GMTs) were compared among vaccine groups and genders at 7 and 12 months.: Both vaccines induced anti-HPV-31, -33, and -45 neutralizing antibodies in participants who were seronegative and HPV-DNA negative for those types at study entry. Geometric mean antibody titers were comparable between vaccine groups. Interestingly, anti-HPV-31 and -33 antibody titers were higher among women compared with men at 7 and 12 months.: In conclusion, both licensed HPV-vaccines induced cross-neutralizing antibodies against frequent oncogenic non-vaccine serotypes HPV-31, HPV-33, and HPV-45 in HIV-infected adults, and women had greater serological responses against HPV-31 and -33 compared with men.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Nielsen, Lars Toft","Tolstrup, Martin","Müller, Martin","Sehr, Peter","Bonde, Jesper","Storgaard, Merete","Østergaard, Lars Jørgen","Søgaard, Ole Schmeltz"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-166988"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Bonde, Jesper","Nielsen, Lars Toft"],"country":["Germany"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","European Molecular Biology Laboratory (EMBL)","German Cancer Research Center (DKFZ)"],"keyword":["Cervarix","Cross neutralization","Gardasil™","Neutralizing antibodies","Serology"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"comparison of the immunogenicity of cervarix and gardasil human papillomavirus vaccines for oncogenic non vaccine serotypes hpv 000000000031 hpv 000000000033 and hpv 000000000045 in hiv infected adults","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84901411221","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-166988","identifier":[{"id":"24553190","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC4896591","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"84901411221","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-4223d66b-2d74-4775-8814-dc10d26c5a34"],"keyword":["Cervarix","Cross neutralization","Gardasil","HPV vaccines","Neutralizing antibodies","Serology"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-5E37912608E5EAFA0173EEE2E3ADC575"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Department of Infectious Diseases"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"de","key":"german cancer research center","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"German Cancer Research Center (DKFZ)","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"de","key":"european molecular biology laboratory","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"European Molecular Biology Laboratory (EMBL)","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"dk","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lars","key":"toftpau","last":"Toft","locid":"57593d7e-a6df-4659-a4c9-08c8c7e155aa","name":"Nielsen, Lars Toft","name_org":"Toft, Lars","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Martin","key":"tolstruppau","last":"Tolstrup","locid":"36e9f1d5-608c-46b7-8d41-2505c02086fc","name":"Tolstrup, Martin","orcid":"0000-0001-7020-5173","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Martin","key":"müllerpau","last":"Müller","name":"Müller, Martin","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Peter","key":"sehrpau","last":"Sehr","name":"Sehr, Peter","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesper","key":"bondepau","last":"Bonde","name":"Bonde, Jesper","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Merete","key":"storgaardpau","last":"Storgaard","locid":"2c2b23fe-581a-47b7-9194-ab66b60773d3","name":"Storgaard, Merete","orcid":"0000-0001-6110-5963","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lars","key":"østergaardpau","last":"Østergaard","locid":"fb8358a6-187a-4d5f-8187-06051ed74173","name":"Østergaard, Lars Jørgen","name_org":"Østergaard, Lars","orcid":"0000-0003-2459-0511","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Ole S.","key":"søgaardpau","last":"Søgaard","locid":"1939f653-c3a3-482e-a947-b1a7501b3986","name":"Søgaard, Ole Schmeltz","name_org":"Søgaard, Ole S.","orcid":"0000-0001-9107-2023","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["24553190"],"pub":{"doi":"10.4161/hv.27925","issn":["15548619","21645515"],"issn_org":["21645515"],"issue":"5","journal":"Human Vaccines & Immunotherapeutics","pages":"1147-1154","publisher":"Taylor and Francis Ltd.","status":"p","title":"Human Vaccines & Immunotherapeutics","volume":"10"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84901411221"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-4223d66b-2d74-4775-8814-dc10d26c5a34"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Comparison of the immunogenicity of Cervarix® and Gardasil® human papillomavirus vaccines for oncogenic non-vaccine serotypes HPV-31, HPV-33, and HPV-45 in HIV-infected adults","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-166988","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"Forskningskortlægningens formål er at samle og kortlægge den relevante forskning, der undersøger virkningerne på eleverne af forskellig undervisning, praktik og vejledning på erhvervsskolerne og i virksomhedspraktikken både lokalt og internationalt. Virkninger af alle former for undervisning, praktik og vejledning, der er beskrevet i forskningen, vil blive undersøgt. Begreberne undervisning, praktik og vejledning med virkninger vil blive beskrevet nærmere. Kortlægningen vil således afdække, hvilke virkninger aspekter af den didaktiske proces har på eleverne, herunder på frafald, gennemførelse og resultater. Der kan dermed gennem kortlægningen primært peges på forhold, som lærere på erhvervsuddannelserne/oplæringsansvarlige i praktikken direkte kan påvirke i deres praksis. Sekundært peges der på forhold, der er påvirkelige gennem uddannelser i erhvervspædagogik og andre pædagogiske uddannelser.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Dyssegaard, Camilla Brørup","de Hemmer Egeberg, Jesper","Nielsen, Trine Kløveager","Steenberg, Kasper Tue","Vestergaard, Stinna"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-179050"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Erhvervsuddannelse","Undervisning"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"virkningsfuld undervisning praktik og vejledning på erhvervsuddannelserne en forskningskortlægning","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-179050","ids":["au-573111cd-553a-44a2-88c5-497d3f2f5623"],"keyword":["Erhvervsuddannelse","Undervisning"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-B333361778982304F794C128E2632A39"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, Danish School of Education, Danish School of Education - Danish Clearinghouse for Educational Research"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Camilla Brørup","key":"dyssegaardpau","last":"Dyssegaard","locid":"983bdd51-d0b6-41e2-9208-7177490ee4fe","name":"Dyssegaard, Camilla Brørup","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesper","key":"dehemmeregebergpau","last":"de Hemmer Egeberg","locid":"b53dd7e7-1894-48c3-95a0-6df426008e0b","name":"de Hemmer Egeberg, Jesper","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Trine Kløveager","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"33b7bb56-2672-4000-a25c-18e1b1c4ed8e","name":"Nielsen, Trine Kløveager","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Kasper Tue","key":"steenbergpau","last":"Steenberg","locid":"04b7e627-2eb5-4b88-8751-a2acc4af460e","name":"Steenberg, Kasper Tue","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Stinna","key":"vestergaardpau","last":"Vestergaard","locid":"12cf580b-53a6-41ac-ba25-52738f02a922","name":"Vestergaard, Stinna","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["19045255"],"issue":"20","pages":"129","place":"København","publisher":"Dansk Clearinghouse for uddannelsesforskning, IUP, Aarhus Universitet","repno":"Clearinghouse-forskningsserien, No. 20","series":"Clearinghouse-forskningsserien","status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-573111cd-553a-44a2-88c5-497d3f2f5623"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Virkningsfuld undervisning, praktik og vejledning på erhvervsuddannelserne. : En forskningskortlægning.","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-179050","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"Sorting n integers in the word-RAM model is a fundamental problem and a long-standing open problem is whether integer sorting is possible in linear time when the word size is ω(log n). In this paper we give an algorithm for sorting integers in expected linear time when the word size is Ω(log 2 n log log n). Previously expected linear time sorting was only possible for word size Ω(log2+ε n). Part of our construction is a new packed sorting algorithm that sorts n integers of w/b-bits packed in O(n/b) words, where b is the number of integers packed in a word of size w bits. The packed sorting algorithm runs in expected O(n/b(log n + log2 b)) time.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Belazzougui, Djamal","Brodal, Gerth Stølting","Nielsen, Jesper Asbjørn Sindahl"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-212545"],"event":{"acronym":"SWAT","end":"2014-07-04","place":"Copenhagen, dk","start":"2014-07-02","title":"Scandinavian Symposium and Workshops on Algorithm Theory","year":"2014"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Finland"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Helsinki"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"expected linear time sorting for word size ω log sup 000000000002 sup n log log n","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-319-08404-6_3","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-212545","identifier":[{"id":"84904192080","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-91f28af1-eb82-44f7-9c3d-3bb73e2a7519"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-292C083699ABDF1C0C6F335233CDB59D"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=84904192080&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-319-08404-6_3","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"fi","key":"university of helsinki","loc":["Finland","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"University of Helsinki","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Department of Computer Science","Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Department of Computer Science, Department of Computer Science - Center for Massive Data Algoritmics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Djamal","key":"belazzouguipau","last":"Belazzougui","name":"Belazzougui, Djamal","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Gerth Stølting","key":"brodalpau","last":"Brodal","locid":"49025d08-41c9-48eb-aed4-80979f26e0b1","name":"Brodal, Gerth Stølting","orcid":"0000-0001-9054-915X","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesper Asbjørn Sindahl","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"b70668c1-8833-4c48-be91-7e3552de7773","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Asbjørn Sindahl","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"R.","key":"ravipedh","last":"Ravi","name":"Ravi, R.","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Inge Li","key":"gørtzpedh","last":"Gørtz","name":"Gørtz, Inge Li","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/978-3-319-08404-6_3","isbn":["9783319084039"],"issn":["03029743"],"pages":"26-37","publisher":"Springer VS","series":"Lecture Notes in Computer Science","status":"p","subtitle":"14th Scandinavian Symposium and Workshops, Copenhagen, Denmark, July 2-4, 2014. Proceedings","title":"Algorithm Theory – SWAT 2014"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84904192080"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-91f28af1-eb82-44f7-9c3d-3bb73e2a7519"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Expected linear time sorting for word size Ω(log<sup>2</sup> n log log n)","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-212545","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"INTRODUCTION: Acquired brain injury (ABI) cause neural deficits. In addition to motor and cognitive deficits, the autonomic nervous system may be affected. This has been shown for neurorehabilitation patients with traumatic brain injury (TBI) by means of reduced heart rate variability (HRV). It was hypothesized that patient groups with other ABI aetiology (mainly stroke, subarachnoid haemorrhage and anoxia) would also present reduced HRV. METHODS: Patients consecutively admitted and severely ABI injured were considered for HRV measurements. HRV was extracted as a mean of four 5-minute ECG recordings at 6 pm, 10 pm, 2 am and 6 am the following day (scheduled resting periods). One 5-minute HRV recording from a sex- and age-matched group of healthy volunteers constituted control data. Standard deviation of normal-to-normal intervals (SDNN) and low frequency (LF) were primary HRV variables. RESULTS: Of 71 admitted patients, HRV was extracted from 49 patients. Patient SDNN and LF were reduced compared to controls (SDNN: 13 ms (CI = [10.8; 15.3]) vs 40.3 ms (CI = [36.6; 44.2]), p < 0.0001; LF: 29.4 ms² (CI = [19.8; 43.7]) vs 518 ms² (CI = [419; 639]), p < 0.0001). HRV appeared identical across ABI aetiology. CONCLUSION: It was found that HRV was considerably reduced in an heterogenic ABI patient group admitted for neurorehabilitation.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Vistisen, Simon Tilma","Hansen, Troels Krarup","Jensen, Jim","Nielsen, Jørgen Feldbæk","Fleischer, Jesper"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-239574"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Adolescent","Adult","Aged","Autonomic nervous system","Brain Injuries","Electrocardiography","Female","Heart Rate","Humans","Male","Middle Aged","Prognosis","Risk Assessment","Severity of Illness Index"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"heart rate variability in neurorehabilitation patients with severe acquired brain injury","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3109/02699052.2013.860477","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-239574","identifier":[{"id":"84893092212","type":"scopus"},{"id":"24295072","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-c1355351-15be-4134-a106-2a813e6f098e"],"keyword":["Adolescent","Adult","Aged","Autonomic Nervous System","Brain Injuries","Electrocardiography","Female","Heart Rate","Humans","Male","Middle Aged","Prognosis","Risk Assessment","Severity of Illness Index"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-6BA29E09DBA924EECCBD165422B898AD"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3109/02699052.2013.860477","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University (AU)","Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine","Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Regionshospital Hammel Neurocenter","Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Research Center for Emergency Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Simon Tilma","key":"vistisenpau","last":"Vistisen","locid":"fbb332fc-fc77-4471-854f-304fe9bb6eaa","name":"Vistisen, Simon Tilma","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Troels Krarup","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"4af39f3a-9bb3-4f30-8fee-29a550538de8","name":"Hansen, Troels Krarup","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jim","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"cc3d0e7d-b138-48ac-808f-01b64060da14","name":"Jensen, Jim","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jørgen Feldbæk","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"3fb25b9f-381b-44a6-a8dd-26eacf839d37","name":"Nielsen, Jørgen Feldbæk","orcid":"0000-0001-5339-171X","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper","key":"fleischerpau","last":"Fleischer","locid":"d05675bb-341e-4913-90d7-0277ad912141","name":"Fleischer, Jesper","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["24295072"],"pub":{"doi":"10.3109/02699052.2013.860477","issn":["02699052","1362301X"],"issn_org":["02699052"],"issue":"2","journal":"Brain Injury","pages":"196-202","publisher":"Informa Healthcare","status":"p","title":"Brain Injury","volume":"28"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84893092212"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-c1355351-15be-4134-a106-2a813e6f098e"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Heart rate variability in neurorehabilitation patients with severe acquired brain injury","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-239574","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"We present the first measurement of a local fast-ion 2D velocity distribution function f(v‖, v⊥). To this end, we heated a plasma in ASDEX Upgrade by neutral beam injection and measured spectra of fast-ion Dα (FIDA) light from the plasma centre in three views simultaneously. The measured spectra agree very well with synthetic spectra calculated from a TRANSP/NUBEAM simulation. Based on the measured FIDA spectra alone, we infer f(v‖, v⊥) by tomographic inversion. Salient features of our measurement of f(v‖, v⊥) agree reasonably well with the simulation: the measured as well as the simulated f(v‖, v⊥) are lopsided towards negative velocities parallel to the magnetic field, and they have similar shapes. Further, the peaks in the simulation of f(v‖, v⊥) at full and half injection energies of the neutral beam also appear in the measurement at similar velocity-space locations. We expect that we can measure spectra in up to seven views simultaneously in the next ASDEX Upgrade campaign which would further improve measurements of f(v‖, v⊥) by tomographic inversion.","author_count":14,"contributors":["Salewski, Mirko","Geiger, B.","Jacobsen, Asger Schou","García-Muñoz, M.","Heidbrink, W.W.","Korsholm, Søren Bang","Leipold, Frank","Madsen, Jens","Moseev, Dmitry","Nielsen, Stefan Kragh","Rasmussen, Jesper","Stejner Pedersen, Morten","Tardini, G.","Weiland, M."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-305605"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Germany","Spain","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Max Planck Institute","University of California at San Diego","University of Seville"],"keyword":["Fast ion velocity distribution function","Fast ions in tokamaks","Inverse problems","Tomography"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"measurement of a 000000000002d fast ion velocity distribution function by tomographic inversion of fast ion d alpha spectra","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1088/0029-5515/54/2/023005","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-305605","identifier":[{"id":"84893473580","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-036d9de7-feb2-4b30-8fc3-edfcc3ca546f"],"keyword":["Fast ions in tokamaks","Fast-ion velocity distribution function","Inverse problems","Tomography"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-F7DDBBB104B435644E5FA77BEAFA4655"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1088/0029-5515/54/2/023005","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/87698487/salewski2014nf_postprint.pdf","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Physics","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Physics, Plasma Physics and Fusion Energy"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"de","key":"max planck institute","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Max Planck Institute","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"es","key":"university of seville","loc":["Spain","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Seville","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"us","key":"university of california at san diego","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"University of California at San Diego","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mirko","key":"salewskipau","last":"Salewski","locid":"38100e3a-6385-47d3-aa2d-6fc5608a8649","name":"Salewski, Mirko","orcid":"0000-0002-3699-679X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"B.","key":"geigerpau","last":"Geiger","name":"Geiger, B.","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Asger Schou","key":"jacobsenpau","last":"Jacobsen","locid":"2cf25f5f-7ac3-4206-b331-68303e95a7f8","name":"Jacobsen, Asger Schou","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"M.","key":"garcíamuñozpau","last":"García-Muñoz","name":"García-Muñoz, M.","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"W.W.","key":"heidbrinkpau","last":"Heidbrink","name":"Heidbrink, W.W.","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Søren Bang","key":"korsholmpau","last":"Korsholm","locid":"cc3d86b6-81c5-4e9b-99dd-3933c1d56f7d","name":"Korsholm, Søren Bang","orcid":"0000-0001-7160-8361","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Frank","key":"leipoldpau","last":"Leipold","locid":"fb1ca27f-36e0-43a2-8779-3d8135a2a8dc","name":"Leipold, Frank","orcid":"0000-0003-3107-6713","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jens","key":"madsenpau","last":"Madsen","locid":"ed287c2f-88ab-4d2f-8609-c89f2c2f7633","name":"Madsen, Jens","orcid":"0000-0002-6874-2970","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Dmitry","key":"moseevpau","last":"Moseev","name":"Moseev, Dmitry","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Stefan Kragh","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"185da313-7f9e-45e7-9ee7-83306c90e806","name":"Nielsen, Stefan Kragh","orcid":"0000-0003-4175-3829","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1",