{"abstract":"Estimating the risk of venous thromboembolism (VTE) associated with combined hormonal contraceptives following early terminated pregnancies or birth, a Danish nationwide retrospective cohort observing a one-year follow-up was defined using three unique registries. All Danish women with confirmed pregnancies aged 15-49 during the period of 1995-2009 were included. The main outcomes were relative and absolute risks of first time venous thromboembolism in users as well as non-users of combined hormonal contraceptives. In 985,569 person-years, 598 venous thromboembolisms were recorded. After early terminated pregnancies and births, respectively, 113 and 485 events occurred in 212,552 and 773,017 person-years. After early terminated pregnancies, the crude VTE incidence ratios were similar, and the numbers needed to harm were equal between groups that did or did not use combined hormonal contraceptives throughout the follow-up year. After childbirth, individuals that used combined hormonal contraceptives were more likely than non-users to experience VTE depicted by crude incidence ratios; however, the difference was only significant after 14 weeks. This implied that the numbers needed to harm were lower for those that used compared to those that did not use combined oral contraceptives in the initial 14 weeks postpartum. In conclusion, the use of combined hormonal contraceptives after early terminated pregnancies was not detrimental, but during the puerperal period, they should be used with caution.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Petersen, Jesper Friis","Bergholt, Thomas","Nielsen, A. K.","Paidas, M J","Løkkegaard, Ellen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-408273"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Abortion Induced","Adolescent","Adult","Cohort Studies","Contraceptives Oral Hormonal","Denmark","Female","Follow Up Studies","Humans","Incidence","Middle Aged","Postpartum Period","Registries","Retrospective Studies","Risk","Treatment Outcome","Venous thromboembolism","Young Adult"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"combined hormonal contraception and risk of venous thromboembolism within the first year following pregnancy danish nationwide historical cohort 000000001995 000000002009","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1160/TH13-09-0797","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-408273","identifier":[{"id":"24499991","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84903757115","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-18cff25f-e93d-4425-a534-f0a514aa9e5c"],"keyword":["Abortion, Induced","Adolescent","Adult","Cohort Studies","Contraceptives, Oral, Hormonal","Denmark","Female","Follow-Up Studies","Humans","Incidence","Middle Aged","Postpartum Period","Registries","Retrospective Studies","Risk","Treatment Outcome","Venous Thromboembolism","Young Adult"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-C1A061876B1981E2484EAB7D45D314C3"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1160/TH13-09-0797","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Jesper Friis","key":"petersenpau","last":"Petersen","name":"Petersen, Jesper Friis","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"T","key":"bergholtpau","last":"Bergholt","locid":"8df996fd-0854-4e48-82e1-a1f98ec2c3fe","name":"Bergholt, Thomas","name_org":"Bergholt, T","orcid":"0000-0002-7284-6094","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"A. K.","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, A. K.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"M J","key":"paidaspau","last":"Paidas","name":"Paidas, M J","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"E C L","key":"løkkegaardpau","last":"Løkkegaard","locid":"e07484e2-8c0a-4f40-ad5d-0359a1341ad4","name":"Løkkegaard, Ellen","name_org":"Løkkegaard, E C L","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["24499991"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1160/th13-09-0797","issn":["03406245","03447618"],"issn_org":["03406245"],"issue":"1","journal":"Thrombosis and Haemostasis","pages":"73-78","status":"p","title":"Thrombosis and Haemostasis","volume":"112"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84903757115"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-18cff25f-e93d-4425-a534-f0a514aa9e5c"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Combined hormonal contraception and risk of venous thromboembolism within the first year following pregnancy. : Danish nationwide historical cohort 1995-2009","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-408273","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"Atrial fibrillation (AF) is the most common cardiac arrhythmia. Currently, 14 genes important for ion channel function, intercellular signalling, and homeostatic control have been associated with AF.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Olesen, Morten S","Andreasen, Laura","Jabbari, Javad","Refsgaard, Lena","Haunsø, Stig","Olesen, Søren-Peter","Nielsen, Jonas B","Schmitt, Nicole","Svendsen, Jesper Hastrup"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-437852"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"very early onset lone atrial fibrillation patients have a high prevalence of rare variants in genes previously associated with atrial fibrillation","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.hrthm.2013.10.034","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-437852","identifier":[{"id":"84893069849","type":"scopus"},{"id":"24144883","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-4a5fab5f-a437-4a55-bde5-4ed4517361af"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-6F5C7DB9FB948FBD793E49952682FD72"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.hrthm.2013.10.034","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Biomedical Sciences, Molecular Cardiology and Membrane Proteins"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Morten S","key":"olesenmortenspau","last":"Olesen","locid":"60e76597-44c1-4838-bb63-9b8568adb06f","name":"Olesen, Morten S","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Laura","key":"andreasenlaurapau","last":"Andreasen","locid":"058fca60-48be-4703-beca-c144879aa2d0","name":"Andreasen, Laura","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Javad","key":"jabbarijavadpau","last":"Jabbari","locid":"3c7f307b-30cb-4fb2-b8b5-8368ccc83e7a","name":"Jabbari, Javad","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Lena","key":"refsgaardlenapau","last":"Refsgaard","name":"Refsgaard, Lena","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Stig","key":"haunsøstigpau","last":"Haunsø","locid":"2d7a08cf-874a-4f9e-8964-e9c473cecd38","name":"Haunsø, Stig","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Søren-Peter","key":"olesensørenpeterpau","last":"Olesen","locid":"51fc35e9-2511-4618-b57b-171d6bb83eee","name":"Olesen, Søren-Peter","orcid":"0000-0002-4381-5192","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Jonas B","key":"nielsenjonasbpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Jonas B","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Nicole","key":"schmittnicolepau","last":"Schmitt","locid":"942c887c-32b0-4e89-812f-a11edf2505a5","name":"Schmitt, Nicole","orcid":"0000-0001-9482-9749","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Jesper H","key":"svendsenjesperhastruppau","last":"Svendsen","locid":"d80910cf-2f9c-457c-9e85-34b4b258bb81","name":"Svendsen, Jesper Hastrup","name_org":"Svendsen, Jesper H","orcid":"0000-0001-8466-8515","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["24144883"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.hrthm.2013.10.034","issn":["15475271","15563871"],"issn_org":["15475271"],"issue":"2","journal":"Heart Rhythm","pages":"246-251","status":"p","title":"Heart Rhythm","volume":"11"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84893069849"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U"