{"abstract":"The presented work is based on a large dual- band, dual-base outdoor-to-indoor multiple-input multiple- output (MIMO) channel measurement campaign, involving ten different realistic MIMO handsets, held in data mode by eight test users. Various different use cases (UCs) are measured. Statistics on the channel capacity, mean effective gain (MEG), branch power ratio (BPR), and correlation coefficients between Rx, Tx, and cross-link channels are presented.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","Yanakiev, Boyan","Barrio, Samantha Caporal Del","Pedersen, Gert Frølund"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-055167"],"event":{"acronym":"EuCAP","end":"2014-04-11","place":"Haag, nl","start":"2014-04-06","title":"2014 8th European Conference on Antennas and Propagation","year":"2014"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"country":["United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Intel"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"channel statistics for mimo handsets in data mode","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/215303353/EuCAP2014_MIMOChStats.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-055167","identifier":[{"id":"84908637238","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-118d0d9c-6054-4db1-b09b-9277530c1960"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-228991791A4EDE68E5A5FDB9034CC587"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/215303353/EuCAP2014_MIMOChStats.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/EuCAP.2014.6902413","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Antennas, propagation and radio networking"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"us","key":"intel","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Intel","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Ødum","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"12489268-4402-4c17-8487-76a4323ee983","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","orcid":"0000-0002-8505-853X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Boyan","key":"yanakievpau","last":"Yanakiev","name":"Yanakiev, Boyan","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Samantha Caporal Del","key":"barriopau","last":"Barrio","locid":"cd9159b3-d654-407c-9dd9-dc628d8b3065","name":"Barrio, Samantha Caporal Del","orcid":"0000-0002-1096-0924","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Gert Frølund","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"a49c73ee-aed0-448c-8a92-792c9ee12a9e","name":"Pedersen, Gert Frølund","orcid":"0000-0002-6570-7387","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/eucap.2014.6902413","isbn":["9788890701849"],"pages":"2818-2822","publisher":"IEEE Press","status":"p","title":"Antennas and Propagation (EuCAP), 2014 8th European Conference on"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84908637238"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-118d0d9c-6054-4db1-b09b-9277530c1960"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Channel Statistics for MIMO Handsets in Data Mode","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-055167","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"The topic of this paper is temporal interpolation of precipitation observed by weather radars. Precipitation measurements with high spatial and temporal resolution are, in general, desired for urban drainage applications. An advection-based interpolation method is developed which uses methods for vector field estimation already known from short-term weather radar nowcasting. However, instead of forecasting the weather radar rainfall, the proposed interpolation method exploits the advection of the rainfall in the interpolation. The interpolated rainfall fields are validated by measurements at ground level from laser disdrometers. The proposed interpolation method performs better when compared to traditional interpolation of weather radar rainfall where the radar observation is considered constant in time between measurements. It is demonstrated that the advection-based interpolation method reconstructs a significant part of the temporal variations of the rainfall. Moreover, the interpolated precipitation fields estimate accumulated rain depths more accurately.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Nielsen, Jesper Ellerbæk","Thorndahl, Søren Liedtke","Rasmussen, Michael R."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-068609"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Laser Disdrometers","Quantitative Precipitation Estimates","Temporal interpolation of radar data","Weather radar"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a numerical method to generate high temporal resolution precipitation time series by combining weather radar measurements with a nowcast model","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-068609","identifier":[{"id":"WOS:000333504300001","type":"wos"},{"id":"84887641165","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-40200652-f433-4f08-90a1-f0699ff3c651"],"keyword":["Laser Disdrometers","Quantitative Precipitation Estimates","Temporal interpolation of radar data","Weather Radar"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-84DD7A3DBD9BBD5ECF4F433243B3F820"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Civil Engineering","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Civil Engineering, Division of Water and Soil","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Civil Engineering, Urban Water and Environment Research Group","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Civil Engineering, Water and Environment Research Group","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of the Built Environment, Division of Civil and Environmental Engineering","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of the Built Environment, Division of Water and Environment","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of the Built Environment, Urban Water Research Group"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Ellerbæk","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"f850e281-27d9-4783-84c8-3048e7819444","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Ellerbæk","orcid":"0000-0003-4596-0948","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Søren Liedtke","