{"abstract":"Massive MIMO is a new technique for wireless communications that claims to offer very high system throughput and energy efficiency in multi-user scenarios. The cost is to add a very large number of antennas at the base station. Theoretical research has probed these benefits, but very few measurements have showed the potential of Massive MIMO in practice. We investigate the properties of measured Massive MIMO channels in a large indoor venue. We describe a measurement campaign using 3 arrays having different shape and aperture, with 64 antennas and 8 users with 2 antennas each. We focus on the impact of the array aperture which is the main limiting factor in the degrees of freedom available in the multiple antenna channel. We find that performance is improved as the aperture increases, with an impact mostly visible in crowded scenarios where the users are closely spaced. We also test MIMO capability within a same user device with user proximity effect. We see a good channel resolvability with confirmation of the strong effect of the user hand grip. At last, we highlight that propagation conditions where line-of-sight is dominant can be favourable.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Martinez, Alex Oliveras","De Carvalho, Elisabeth","Nielsen, Jesper Ødum"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-112285"],"event":{"end":"2014-12-12","place":"Austin, us","start":"2014-12-08","title":"Globecom 2014","year":"2014"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"towards very large aperture massive mimo a measurement based study","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/208062297/edas.final_1570005973.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-112285","identifier":[{"id":"84946692522","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-d63db45b-2eac-418c-82d5-0348ee50fd9f"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-6DEBAEBCF9984744D7E0030BF7590694"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/208062297/edas.final_1570005973.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Antennas, propagation and radio networking (CNT)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Àlex","key":"oliverasmartínezpau","last":"Oliveras Martínez","locid":"12d64adc-fd5d-44ee-99c6-b8253e019d43","name":"Martinez, Alex Oliveras","name_org":"Oliveras Martínez, Àlex","orcid":"0000-0003-2002-570X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Elisabeth","key":"decarvalhopau","last":"De Carvalho","locid":"cd08d3bf-1c27-487e-90dc-9aafd1088da2","name":"De Carvalho, Elisabeth","orcid":"0000-0002-5478-5531","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Ødum","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"12489268-4402-4c17-8487-76a4323ee983","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","orcid":"0000-0002-8505-853X","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/glocomw.2014.7063445","issn":["08951195"],"pages":"281-286","publisher":"IEEE (Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers)","series":"GLOBECOM - conference record / IEEE Global Telecommunications Conference","status":"p","title":"IEEE GLOBECOM 2014 proceedings"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84946692522"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-d63db45b-2eac-418c-82d5-0348ee50fd9f"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Towards Very Large Aperture Massive MIMO : a measurement based study","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-112285","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"This paper discusses over the air (OTA) testing for multiple input multiple output (MIMO) capable terminals, with emphasis on modeling Rician channel models in the multi-probe anechoic chamber setups. A technique to model Rician channels is proposed. The line-of-sight (LOS) component, with an arbitrary polarization and an arbitrary impinging direction, and non-LOS (NLOS) component, with any impinging power angular spectrum (PAS), can be created. Simulation results show that the emulated Rician channels approximate the target models accurately in terms of field envelope distribution, K factor, Doppler spectrum and spatial correlation at the receiver (Rx) side.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Fan, Wei","Kyösti, Pekka","Hentilä, Lassi","Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","Pedersen, Gert Frølund"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-117412"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Finland"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Anite Telecoms Oy"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"rician channel modeling for multiprobe anechoic chamber setups","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/203808351/manuscript.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-117412","identifier":[{"id":"WOS:000348204600022","type":"wos"},{"id":"84921485691","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-e7b76137-bdd6-4e27-9649-f5c941aed61d"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-C1017453A44A92B82A177C1089578F18"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/203808351/manuscript.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"