{"abstract":"Denne rapport indeholder en beskrivelse af arbejdet udført i og resultaterne af forsknings- og udviklingsprojektet ”CopenHybrid – udvikling af CO2 neutralt byrumsarmatur – Fase 1.5” og udgør slutrapportering for dette projekt. Projektet ligger i forlængelse af PSO 343-021 og bygger videre på F&U arbejdet heri.","author_count":23,"contributors":["Poulsen, Peter Behrensdorff","Dam-Hansen, Carsten","Corell, Dennis Dan","Thorseth, Anders","Thorsteinsson, Sune","Hansen, Søren Stentoft","Wolff, Jesper","Bak, Christian","Skrzypinski, Witold Robert","Beller, Christina","Kock, Carsten Weber","Jensen, Bogi Bech","Sødahl, Jakob Wagner","Bühler, Fabian","Harboe, Réne Kirstein","Boesgaard, Per","Jensen, Tim","Nielsen, Allan","Andresen, Christian","Fahlén, Morten","Maare, Thomas","Poulsen, Jan","Zinn, Torben Christian"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-369837"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Gate 21"],"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH","DI-PR-ØR"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-PR-ØR","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"copenhybrid udvikling af co000000000002 neutralt byrumsarmatur fase 000000000001 000000000005 slutrapport","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-369837","ids":["dtu-da416587-c191-4180-84e7-c01d38075721"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-CE4F3D4E9E86CA2578557D5CCAE8C178"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmar