{"abstract":"The first Danish Society for Emergency Medicine (DASEM) recommendations for the use of clinical ultrasound in emergency departments has been made. The recommendations describes what DASEM believes as being current best practice for training, certification, maintenance of acquired competencies, quality assurance, collaboration and research in the field of clinical US used in an ED.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Laursen, Christian B","Nielsen, Klaus","Riishede, Minna","Tiwald, Gerhard","Møllekær, Anders","Aagaard, Rasmus","Posth, Stefan","Weile, Jesper"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-020612"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Certification methods","Denmark","Education Medical Continuing methods","Emergency Medicine education","Emergency Service Hospital","Humans","Societies Medical","Ultrasonography","Wounds and Injuries diagnostic imaging"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a framework for implementation education research and clinical use of ultrasound in emergency departments by the danish society for emergency medicine","src":["au","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1186/1757-7241-22-25","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-020612","identifier":[{"id":"84899624295","type":"scopus"},{"id":"24731411","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC3989792","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["au-6ca07efb-cf2a-47d6-b97f-5fc861e27e1d","sdu-aee67450-56fc-4184-bf57-0db3b642a979"],"keyword":["Certification/methods","Denmark","Education, Medical, Continuing/methods