{"abstract":"This paper presents a demonstration of how Local Area Weather Radar (LAWR) X-band measurements can be combined with meteorological C–band measurements into a single radar product. For this purpose, a blending method has been developed which combines the strengths of the two radar systems. Combining the two radar types achieves a radar product with both long range and high temporal resolution. It is validated that the blended radar product performs better than the individual radars based on ground observations from laser disdrometers. However, the data combination is challenged by lower performance of the LAWR. Although both radars benefits from the data combination, it is also found that advection based temporal interpolation is a more favourable method for increasing the temporal resolution of meteorological C–band measurements.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Nielsen, Jesper Ellerbæk","Thorndahl, Søren Liedtke","Rasmussen, Michael R."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-064442"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["C Band","LAWR","Radar QPE","Weather Readar","X Band"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"improving weather radar precipitation estimates by combining two types of radars","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-064442","identifier":[{"id":"WOS:000333503600004","type":"wos"},{"id":"84892979439","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-31ba7666-e6a2-4191-a39d-0c549a2423cb"],"keyword":["C-Band","LAWR","Radar QPE","Weather Readar","X-Band"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-8365D0D586B7302D025290B19281563A"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Civil Engineering","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Civil Engineering, Division of Water and Soil","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Civil Engineering, Urban Water and Environment Research Group","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Civil Engineering, Water and Environment Research Group","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of the Built Environment, Division of Civil and Environmental Engineering","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of the Built Environment, Division of Water and Environment","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of the Built Environment, Urban Water Research Group"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Ellerbæk","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"f850e281-27d9-4783-84c8-3048e7819444","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Ellerbæk","orcid":"0000-0003-4596-0948","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Søren Liedtke","key":"thorndahlpau","last":"Thorndahl","locid":"5faa528b-e2f0-41fd-8128-9d76ed5993f0","name":"Thorndahl, Søren Liedtke","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Michael R.","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"97f39e8d-f121-4ce8-9157-10ce8955b1d8","name":"Rasmussen, Michael R.","orcid":"0000-0001-5791-3976","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.atmosres.2013.12.013","issn":["01698095","18732895"],"issn_org":["01698095"],"issue":"March","journal":"Atmospheric Research","pages":"36-45","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"Atmospheric Research","volume":"139"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84892979439"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-31ba7666-e6a2-4191-a39d-0c549a2423cb"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Improving Weather Radar Precipitation Estimates by Combining two Types of Radars","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-064442","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"InnoBYG projektet ”Udvikling af webløsning til smartphone om efterisolering af tagetager”, med Statens Byggeforskningsinstitut (SBi) som projektleder, har udviklet en prototype, der skaber opmærksomhed omkring energieffektive løsninger til efterisolering af tagetager, der anvendes til beboelse. Initiativet er opstået på baggrund af de vanskeligheder der er i forbindelse med at udføre renoveringer af eksisterende etageboliger, så der opnås holdbare og robuste løsninger, uden fare for konstruktioner med fugt og råd.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Kragh, Jesper","Nielsen, Niels Samsø","Aggerholm, Søren","Kirkeskov, Jesper"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-071495"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Dampsspærre","Efterisolering","Energibesparelse"],"level":"pop","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"anvisning om efterisolering af tagetage","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"doi","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.efterisolering.sbi.dk","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-071495","ids":["aau-49ed0a13-ea4b-4d4a-9478-9d8b06edb44b"],"keyword":["Dampsspærre","Efterisolering","Energibesparelse","Lufttætning","Skunkrum","Vindbræt"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-BF89B208C27C1B8411CCE2B67FBB6F75"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.efterisolering.sbi.dk","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","