, Jesper Kranker","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lene Faber","key":"ussingpau","last":"Ussing","locid":"e9a5f9e9-5681-46c6-bf86-f14a643b7e2e","name":"Ussing, Lene Faber","orcid":"0000-0001-6032-5120","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Thomas Ditlev","key":"brunøpau","last":"Brunø","locid":"b75a6b6d-0181-4141-b951-6f7f70bae83f","name":"Brunø, Thomas Ditlev","orcid":"0000-0002-9847-6562","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Kjeld","key":"nielsenpedh","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Kjeld","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Thomas Ditlev","key":"brunøpedh","last":"Brunø","name":"Brunø, Thomas Ditlev","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Stig B.","key":"tapspedh","last":"Taps","name":"Taps, Stig B.","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Kaj A.","key":"jørgensenpedh","last":"Jørgensen","name":"Jørgensen, Kaj A.","rank":7,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"isbn":["8791200709"],"pages":"49-50","publisher":"Department of Mechanical and Manufacturing Engineering, Aalborg University","status":"p","title":"ABSTRACTS MCPC2014"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-52929cd3-ad5f-4082-b508-3ae24cd8347e"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Danish Public Construction Counselling Selection and Assignment Criteria in European Tendering","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-074036","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"External thermal insulation composite systems (ETICS) can be used as extra insulation of existing buildings. The system can be made of cellular plastic materials or mineral wool. There is a European Technical guideline, ETAG 004, that describe the tests that shall be conducted on such systems. This paper gives a comparison of systems with mineral wool and cellular plastic, based on experience from practice and literature. It is important to look at the details in the system and at long time stability of the properties such as thermal insulation, moisture and fire. Investigation of fire properties must be done before utilisation of the system, including the risk of fire spread from one storey to the next for practical solutions. An elaboration of fire spread risks require thermo physic knowledge about ignition temperatures, critical radiation, upward flame spread velocities etc. of the actual insulation.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Sørensen, Lars Schiøtt","Nielsen, Anker"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-075875"],"event":{"acronym":"NSB","end":"2014-06-19","place":"Lund , se","start":"2014-06-15","title":"10th Nordic Symposium on Building Physics","year":"2014"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"external insulation with cellular plastic materials thermal properties long term stability and fire properties","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/205505882/External_insulation_with_cellular_plastic_materials_....pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-075875","ids":["aau-590fe122-893b-41c8-8d31-ee4e6c302086"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-FEA32A7C096CE0F10181E165B7EE878D"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.nsb2014.se/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2014/07/Complete_fullpapers.pdf","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/205505882/External_insulation_with_cellular_plastic_materials_....pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Danish Building Research Institute","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Danish Building Research Institute, Construction and health (CH)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lars Schiøtt","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","locid":"8702fcb9-1ddf-4f40-9308-f0de14dff7c8","name":"Sørensen, Lars Schiøtt","orcid":"0000-0002-9469-0895","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anker","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"218dfaef-8c2b-4ec5-a965-af8a4382b15d","name":"Nielsen, Anker","orcid":"0000-0002-7130-6432","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Jesper","key":"arfvidssonpedh","last":"Arfvidsson","name":"Arfvidsson, Jesper","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Lars-Erik","key":"harderuppedh","last":"Harderup","name":"Harderup, Lars-Erik","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Anders","key":"kumlinpedh","last":"Kumlin","name":"Kumlin, Anders","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Bitte","key":"rosencrantzpedh","last":"Rosencrantz","name":"Rosencrantz, Bitte","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9789188722539"],"pages":"175-182","place":"Lund","publisher":"Lunds Tekniska Högskola, LTH. Institutionen för Byggnadsteknik","status":"p","subtitle":"Full papers","title":"NSB 2014: 10th Nordic Symposium on Building Physics 15-19 June 2014 Lund, Sweden"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-590fe122-893b-41c8-8d31-ee4e6c302086"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"External insulation with cellular plastic materials : thermal properties, long term stability and fire properties","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-075875","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"Model comparison and selection is an important problem in many model-based signal processing applications. Often, very simple information criteria such as the Akaike information criterion or the Bayesian information criterion are used despite their shortcomings. Compared to these methods, Djuric’s asymptotic MAP rule was an improvement, and in this paper we extend the work by Djuric in several ways. Speciﬁcally, we consider the elicitation of proper prior distributions, treat the case of real- and complex-valued data simultaneously in a Bayesian framework similar to that considered by Djuric, and develop new model selection rules for a regression model containing both linear and non-linear parameters. Moreover, we use this framework to give a new interpretation of the popular information criteria and relate their performance to the signal-to-noise ratio of the data. By use of simulations, we also demonstrate that our proposed model comparison and selection rules outperform the traditional information criteria both in terms of detecting the true model and in terms of predicting unobserved data. The simulation code is available online.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Nielsen, Jesper Kjær","Christensen, Mads Græsbøll","Cemgil, Ali Taylan","Jensen, Søren Holdt"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-095150"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, Middle East","OECD"],"country":["Turkey"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Department of Computer Engineering, Bogaziçi University, 34342 Bebek, Istanbul, Turkey"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"bayesian model comparison with the g prior","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/160312613/master.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-095150","identifier":[{"id":"WOS:000330291000018","type":"wos"},{"id":"84890915731","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-9b7ccd66-0f96-463f-839d-c0c19cf6367d"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-48441F014BBF6DD081A833ADB3C4F89F"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://kom.aau.dk/~jkn/publications/publications.php","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/160312613/master.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology, Section for Media Technology - Campus Aalborg","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Signal and Information Processing"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"tr","key":"department of computer engineering bogaziçi university 34342 bebek istanbul turkey","loc":["Turkey","Asia, Middle East","OECD"],"name":"Department of Computer Engineering, Bogaziçi University, 34342 Bebek, Istanbul, Turkey","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Kjær","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"3d21c73c-3aa1-4590-870f-8be578634702","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Kjær","orcid":"0000-0002-2586-7925","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","