{"abstract":"This letter presents the results of analysis of data from a measurement campaign, carried out in Aalborg city, Denmark. The Virtual Signal to Interference plus Noise Ratio (VSINR) algorithm was employed in order to discover the achieved sum rate in cellular network systems. The results focus on the effect different handset (HS) grips have on the data rate achievement.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Rahimi, Maryam","Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","Pedersen, Troels","Pedersen, Gert Frølund"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-100405"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Rahimi, Maryam"],"keyword":["Measured data","Sum rate","VSINR"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"on the achieved sum rate for different handset grips","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=84923677378&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-100405","identifier":[{"id":"84923677378","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-ad8f2c6c-d7bb-4283-ba8e-73e1b22ff423"],"keyword":["Handset grips","Measured data","Sum-rate","VSINR"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-371FFEE3DA568804C543FED7BF5909C3"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Antennas, propagation and radio networking"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Maryam","key":"rahimimaryampau","last":"Rahimi","locid":"70809d27-ab7f-4e4f-bada-dc1f4ba0485a","name":"Rahimi, Maryam","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Ødum","key":"nielsenjesperødumpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"12489268-4402-4c17-8487-76a4323ee983","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","orcid":"0000-0002-8505-853X","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Troels","key":"pedersentroelspau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"44cbee09-5c21-40ae-9000-44758a081148","name":"Pedersen, Troels","orcid":"0000-0002-3003-4901","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Gert Frølund","key":"pedersengertfrølundpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"a49c73ee-aed0-448c-8a92-792c9ee12a9e","name":"Pedersen, Gert Frølund","orcid":"0000-0002-6570-7387","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.15866/irecap.v4i4.2246","issn":["20395086","20395094"],"issn_org":["20395086"],"issue":"4","journal":"International Journal on Communications Antenna and Propagation","publisher":"Praise Worthy Prize S.r.l","status":"p","title":"International Journal on Communications Antenna and Propagation","volume":"4"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84923677378"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-ad8f2c6c-d7bb-4283-ba8e-73e1b22ff423"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"On the Achieved Sum-Rate for Different Handset Grips","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-100405","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
