insights into the metabolic potential of electron-conducting filamentous <i>Desulfobulbaceae</i> from single filament genome sequencing","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-235835","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"To compare precut and surgeon-cut organ cultured donor corneas for DSAEK. A total of 119 consecutive eyes treated with DSAEK were retrospectically identified. 65 grafts were cut by the surgeon (Moria, ALTK System) prior to DSAEK and 54 grafts were precut by laboratory technicians from the Danish Eye Bank (Horizon single-use system). 1 year after surgery, tomographic images were obtained with the Pentacam HR. Endothelial cell density (ECD) and best-corrected visual acuity (BCVA) was determined. Graft thickness and graft asymmetry was evaluated in the centre and 1 mm from the edge of the graft in 6 semi-meridians. 1 year after surgery, the ECD loss was similar in the two groups, averaging 25.9 ± 14 % in surgeon-cut, and 22.9 ± 17 % in precut group (p = 0.33). Mean central graft thickness was 172 ± 6 μm in surgeon-cut grafts and 182 ± 6 μm in precut grafts (p = 0.30). BCVA was similar in surgeon-cut and precut corneas; being 0.25 ± 0.02 logMAR and 0.24 ± 0.02 logMAR, respectively (p = 0.59). The graft asymmetry index was 1.48 ± 0.02 for surgeon-cut and 1.44 ± 0.02 for precut grafts. There were no significant differences in complications rate in both groups. No correlations between BCVA and central graft thickness or graft asymmetry index in both groups were observed. Organ cultured precut donor corneas are comparable with surgeon-cut grafts with respect to ECD, graft thickness and asymmetry, and postoperative complication rate.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Ragunathan, Suganiah","Ivarsen, Anders","Nielsen, Kim","Hjortdal, Jesper"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-246400"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"comparison of organ cultured precut corneas versus surgeon cut corneas for descemet s stripping automated endothelial keratoplasty","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10561-014-9429-x","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-246400","identifier":[{"id":"24526412","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84911978192","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-ccd7f07f-b381-4ae8-bc15-1355b6b9240c"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-EC0036A23FF9205843D46CDFE7C427AC"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10561-014-9429-x","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Department of Ophthalmology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Suganiah","key":"ragunathanpau","last":"Ragunathan","name":"Ragunathan, Suganiah","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anders","key":"ivarsenpau","last":"Ivarsen","locid":"072c0ad1-1c62-4539-8b63-868ff8422866","name":"Ivarsen, Anders","orcid":"0000-0003-1466-4804","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Kim","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Kim","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper","key":"hjortdalpau","last":"Hjortdal","locid":"b69f284e-e209-49a7-9d0d-9eeff6a8feb3","name":"Hjortdal, Jesper","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["24526412"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/s10561-014-9429-x","issn":["13899333","15736814"],"issn_org":["13899333"],"issue":"4","journal":"Cell and Tissue Banking","pages":"573-8","publisher":"Springer","status":"p","title":"Cell and Tissue Banking","volume":"15"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84911978192"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-ccd7f07f-b381-4ae8-bc15-1355b6b9240c"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Comparison of organ cultured precut corneas versus surgeon-cut corneas for Descemet's stripping automated endothelial keratoplasty","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-246400","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"drætselevers erfaringer med idrætsklasser - et blik på Gentofte Kommune er et tillæg til og skal læses i sammenhæng med rapporten Idrætselevers erfaringer med idrætsklasser, der blev offentliggjort i begyndelsen af 2014. Rapporten og dens tillæg er del af et 3-årigt forskningsprojekt om idrætsklasser og talentudvikling i folkeskolernes 7. til 9. klassetrin i landets elitekommuner. Rapporten er baseret på data fra en survey blandt 1.170 idrætselever og tilkoblede registerdata fra Danmarks Statistik om elevernes socioøkonomiske baggrund. Nærværende rapporttillæg indeholder særkørsler af disse data med fokus på idrætseleverne i Gentofte Kommune. I tillægget er der fokus på fem områder: 1) Idrætsklassernes sammensætning – beskriver idræts-elevernes kønsfordeling, etnicitet og socioøkonomiske baggrund, 2) Fællesskabet og kulturen i idrætsklasserne – belyser fællesskabet og undervisningsmiljøet i idrætsklasserne, 3) Samspil mellem skole og idræt – belyser skolens tilpasning til elevernes idrætsudøvelse, 4) Idrætsklassen på skolen – belyser forholdet til de øvrige elever på skolen og 5) To spor – uddannelse og sport – belyser vægtning af sport og uddannelse og deres fremtidsplaner efter 9. klasse.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Nielsen, Jens Christian","Stilling Olesen, Jesper"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-246642"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Folkeskole","Talentudvikling","Udskoling","idræt og uddannelse"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"idrætselevers erfaringer med idrætsklasser et blik på gentofte kommune","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-246642","ids":["au-cd3fbc1f-624e-465d-bd56-bdbc57a4f1ea"],"keyword":["folkeskole","idræt og uddannelse","talentudvikling","udskoling"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-102A245CBA0E34E19FDA81E6E6B5DD06"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, Danish School of Education, Danish School of Education - Research Programme for Diversity, Culture and Change"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jens Christian","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"f8fee80e-c33e-467c-9afd-8462e0bf571e","name":"Nielsen, Jens Christian","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper","key":"stillingolesenpau","last":"Stilling Olesen","locid":"bb840c08-e692-4000-8a96-d541f03bb9f4","name":"Stilling Olesen, Jesper","orcid":"0000-0001-7536-4544","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"17","place":"København","publisher":"Institut for Uddannelse og Pædagogik (DPU), Aarhus Universitet","publisher_org":"Institut for Uddannelse og Pædagogik (DPU) Aarhus Universitet","status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-cd3fbc1f-624e-465d-bd56-bdbc57a4f1ea"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Idrætselevers erfaringer med idrætsklasser – et blik på Gentofte Kommune","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-246642","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"Acanthamoeba keratitis is a serious sight-threatening disease. The relatively low temperature of the cornea may explain why amoebic infections usually are localized in this tissue and rarely spread to other parts of the eye. In this study, the growth rate of the amoeba Acanthamoeba castellanii was examined at different temperatures. The aim was to establish the optimal growth temperature for A. castellanii and to examine the growth within the vicinity of the core body temperature. The growth rates of four clinical and two environmental strains of A. castellanii were estimated at different temperatures, and temperature limitations for the trophozoite stage was established. Movements influenced by temperature gradients were monitored for two clinical strains of A. castellanii. The highest growth rate for each of the six amoebic strains tested was found to be close to 32 °C. The growth of the trophozoites of all examined strains was greatly reduced or completely halted at temperatures above 36 °C and encysted at the elevated temperature. Thus, the optimal growth temperature for the four strains of A. castellanii is close to the surface temperature of the human cornea, while the higher body core-temperature induced encysting of the amoebae. This may explain why most amoebic eye infections are confined to the cornea.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Nielsen, Mattias Kiel","Nielsen, Kim","Hjortdal, Jesper","Sørensen, Uffe B Skov"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-248276"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"temperature limitation may explain the containment of the trophozoites in the cornea during acanthamoeba castellanii keratitis","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s00436-014-4109-0","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-248276","identifier":[{"id":"25204727","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84920494781","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-d0320b7f-6540-4788-8ca1-400935a81715"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-58C4978AFD4737728629A3500C0E12BE"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s00436-014-4109-0","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Department of Ophthalmology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Mattias Kiel","key":"nielsenmattiaskielpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Mattias Kiel","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Kim","key":"nielsenkimpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Kim","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper","key":"hjortdaljesperpau","last":"Hjortdal","locid":"b69f284e-e209-49a7-9d0d-9eeff6a8feb3","name":"Hjortdal, Jesper","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Uffe B Skov","key":"sørensenuffebskovpau","last":"Sørensen","locid":"6e354ce6-4d20-45ed-9336-2958dd4344c3","name":"Sørensen, Uffe B Skov","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["25204727"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/s00436-014-4109-0","issn":["09320113","14321955"],"issn_org":["09320113"],"issue":"12","journal":"Parasitology Research","pages":"4349-53","publisher":"Springer Science and Business Media Deutschland GmbH","status":"p","title":"Parasitology Research","volume":"113"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84920494781"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-d0320b7f-6540-4788-8ca1-400935a81715"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Temperature limitation may explain the containment of the trophozoites in the cornea during Acanthamoeba castellanii keratitis","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-248276","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
