{"abstract":"Idrætselevers erfaringer med idrætsklasser - et blik på Ballerup Kommune er et tillæg til og skal læses i sammenhæng med rapporten Idrætselevers erfaringer med idrætsklasser, der blev offentliggjort i begyndelsen af 2014. Rapporten og dens tillæg er del af et 3-årigt forskningsprojekt om idrætsklasser og talentudvikling i folkeskolernes 7. til 9. klassetrin i landets elitekommuner. Rapporten er baseret på data fra en survey blandt 1.170 idrætselever og tilkoblede registerdata fra Danmarks Statistik om elevernes socioøkonomiske baggrund. Nærværende rapporttillæg indeholder særkørsler af disse data med fokus på idrætseleverne i Ballerup Kommune. I tillægget er der fokus på fem områder: 1) Idrætsklassernes sammensætning – beskriver idræts-elevernes kønsfordeling, etnicitet og socioøkonomiske baggrund, 2) Fællesskabet og kulturen i idrætsklasserne – belyser fællesskabet og undervisningsmiljøet i idrætsklasserne, 3) Samspil mellem skole og idræt – belyser skolens tilpasning til elevernes idrætsudøvelse, 4) Idrætsklassen på skolen – belyser forholdet til de øvrige elever på skolen og 5) To spor – uddannelse og sport – belyser vægtning af sport og uddannelse og deres fremtidsplaner efter 9. klasse.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Nielsen, Jens Christian","Stilling Olesen, Jesper"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-217696"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Folkeskole","Idrætsklasser","Sport og uddannelse","Udskoling"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"idrætselevers erfaringer med idrætsklasser et blik på ballerup kommune","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-217696","ids":["au-9b13bf0c-6bc9-44a0-9c6a-5b17612e7342"],"keyword":["folkeskole","idrætsklasser","målrettethed og forsvarlighed","sport og uddannelse","udskoling"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-B9371E0B3022F2C409E3DA936E99028C"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, Danish School of Education, Danish School of Education - Research Programme for Diversity, Culture and Change"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jens Christian","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"f8fee80e-c33e-467c-9afd-8462e0bf571e","name":"Nielsen, Jens Christian","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper","key":"stillingolesenpau","last":"Stilling Olesen","locid":"bb840c08-e692-4000-8a96-d541f03bb9f4","name":"Stilling Olesen, Jesper","orcid":"0000-0001-7536-4544","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"17","place":"København","publisher":"Institut for Uddannelse og Pædagogik (DPU), Aarhus Universitet","publisher_org":"Institut for Uddannelse og Pædagogik (DPU) Aarhus Universitet","status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-9b13bf0c-6bc9-44a0-9c6a-5b17612e7342"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Idrætselevers erfaringer med idrætsklasser – et blik på Ballerup Kommune","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-217696","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"The velocity-space sensitivities of fast-ion diagnostics are often described by so-called weight functions. Recently, we formulated weight functions showing the velocity-space sensitivity of the often dominant beam-target part of neutron energy spectra. These weight functions for neutron emission spectrometry (NES) are independent of the particular NES diagnostic. Here we apply these NES weight functions to the time-of-flight spectrometer TOFOR at JET. By taking the instrumental response function of TOFOR into account, we calculate time-of-flight NES weight functions that enable us to directly determine the velocity-space sensitivity of a given part of a measured time-of-flight spectrum from TOFOR.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Jacobsen, Asger Schou","Salewski, Mirko","Eriksson, J.","Ericsson, G.","Hjalmarsson, A.","Korsholm, Søren Bang","Leipold, Frank","Nielsen, Stefan Kragh","Rasmussen, Jesper","Stejner Pedersen, Morten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-324629"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Sweden"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Uppsala University"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"velocity space sensitivity of the time of flight neutron spectrometer at jet","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1063/1.4885477","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-324629","identifier":[{"id":"25430282","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84904153160","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-436f1e4c-6fb8-4d22-abd8-b87e87517b1e"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-543A4814433B9EA49FE29BF652D55053"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1063/1.4885477","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/105417267/Postprint_version.pdf","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Physics","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Physics, Plasma Physics and Fusion Energy"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"se","key":"uppsala university","loc":["Sweden","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Uppsala University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Asger Schou","key":"jacobsenpau","last":"Jacobsen","locid":"2cf25f5f-7ac3-4206-b331-68303e95a7f8","name":"Jacobsen, Asger Schou","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mirko","key":"salewskipau","last":"Salewski","locid":"38100e3a-6385-47d3-aa2d-6fc5608a8649","name":"Salewski, Mirko","orcid":"0000-0002-3699-679X","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"J.","key":"erikssonpau","last":"Eriksson","name":"Eriksson, J.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"G.","key":"ericssonpau","last":"Ericsson","name":"Ericsson, G.","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"A.","key":"hjalmarssonpau","last":"Hjalmarsson","name":"Hjalmarsson, A.","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Søren Bang","key":"korsholmpau","last":"Korsholm","locid":"cc3d86b6-81c5-4e9b-99dd-3933c1d56f7d","name":"Korsholm, Søren Bang","orcid":