{"abstract":"Transapical chordae tendineae replacement is a promising new approach for mitral leaflet prolapse. However, animal studies have raised concerns that the tension of the transapically fixated artificial neochordae might be greater than the tension in the neochordae attached to papillary muscle tips, thereby reducing repair durability.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Jensen, Henrik","Jensen, Morten Ølgaard Jegstrup","Waziri, Farhad","Hønge, Jesper Langhoff","Sloth, Erik","Fenger-Grøn, Morten","Nielsen, Sten Lyager"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-222485"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"transapical neochord implantation is tension of artificial chordae tendineae dependent on the insertion site","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jtcvs.2013.07.068","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-222485","identifier":[{"id":"84902537128","type":"scopus"},{"id":"24041766","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-a385e820-607a-4ac2-a8e3-1a5264892558"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-93F22CC78308F0071D7FD6A753310E56"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jtcvs.2013.07.068","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medic