{"abstract":"The risk of stroke in patients with atrial fibrillation (AF) can be assessed by use of the CHADS2 and the CHA2DS2-VASc score system. We hypothesised that these risk scores and their individual components could also be applied to patients paced for sick sinus syndrome (SSS) to evaluate risk of stroke and death.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Svendsen, Jesper Hastrup","Nielsen, Jens Cosedis","Darkner, Stine","Jensen, Gunnar Vagn Hagemann","Mortensen, Leif Spange","Andersen, Henning Rud","Investigators, DANPACE"],"cuid":["S02-096.77-023808"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"corpau":["DANPACE Investigators"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"chads000000000002 and cha000000000002ds000000000002 vasc score to assess risk of stroke and death in patients paced for sick sinus syndrome","src":["au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1136/heartjnl-2013-303695","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-096.77-023808","identifier":[{"id":"PMC3664372","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"84878107693","type":"scopus"},{"id":"23539553","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-9918c7e7-da88-45b0-b03c-2470239eddaf","ku-06997f4a-9955-4ae8-8797-d56fc8b747ad"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-C06F62618706FE29D5ACCA4AEBECBBAD"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1136/heartjnl-2013-303695","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":