{"abstract":"A technique to emulate 3D geometry-based channel models in a multiprobe over the air test setup is presented. The proposed technique provides a general emulation framework for any spherical incoming power spectrum. The emulation method results in two optimization objectives, which are both convex. They give optimal emulation accuracy and allow relatively low computational complexity.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Fan, Wei","Sun, Fan","Kyösti, Pekka","Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","Carreño, Xavier","Knudsen, Mikael","Pedersen, Gert Frølund"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-081295"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"000000000003d channel emulation in a multi probe setup","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/75013798/3D_channel_emulation.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-081295","identifier":[{"id":"84879338596","type":"scopus"},{"id":"WOS:000321713800031","type":"wos"}],"ids":["aau-6b7c9fd0-85c0-45bb-9bfe-38da0e0cfd65"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-AE110575EFDDBFD1A0B336634276FBDA"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://ieeexplore.ieee.org/xpl/articleDetails.jsp?arnumber=6528130","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/75013798/3D_channel_emulation.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1049/el.2013.0709","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Antennas, propagation and radio networking"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Wei","key":"fanpau","last":"Fan","locid":"196e035b-e3db-4c94-b288-03dcd3119fda","name":"Fan, Wei","orcid":"0000-0002-9835-4485","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Fan","key":"sunpau","last":"Sun","locid":"0593f460-9081-4a41-8abb-c5bf8bdb4026","name":"Sun, Fan","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Pekka","key":"kyöstipau","last":"Kyösti","name":"Kyösti, Pekka","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Ødum","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"12489268-4402-4c17-8487-76a4323ee983","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","orcid":"0000-0002-8505-853X","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Xavier","key":"carreñopau","last":"Carreño","name":"Carreño, Xavier","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Mikael","key":"knudsenpau","last":"Knudsen","name":"Knudsen, Mikael","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Gert Frølund","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"a49c73ee-aed0-448c-8a92-792c9ee12a9e","name":"Pedersen, Gert Frølund","orcid":"0000-0002-6570-7387","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1049/el.2013.0709","issn":["00135194","1350911X"],"issn_org":["00135194"],"issue":"9","journal":"Electronics Letters","pages":"623-625","publisher":"John Wiley & Sons Inc.","status":"p","title":"Electronics Letters","volume":"49"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84879338596"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-6b7c9fd0-85c0-45bb-9bfe-38da0e0cfd65"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"3D channel emulation in a multi-probe setup","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-081295","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
{"abstract":"Background. Fiducials can be used as surrogate for target position during radiotherapy. However, fiducial motion could lead to potential position errors when using fiducials in four-dimensional computed tomography (4DCT) treatment planning and for gated image guided radiotherapy (IGRT). Material and methods. One gold marker (GM) and 5, 10 and 15 mm nickel-titanium (NiTi) stents were inserted in a moving phantom for the purpose of fiducial detection in 4DCT and gated IGRT. Fiducial position errors in 4DCT and BrainLAB's gated IGRT were defined as residuals between fiducial detection and the actual physical position at the instance of image acquisition. Results. Fiducials position errors correlate to speed, fiducial type and orientation during 4DCT acquisition. Lower detection accuracy was measured for the 5 mm NiTi-stent relative to the 10 and 15 mm NiTi stents and GM. Fiducials with orientation 45° relative to the scan direction showed a lower detection accuracy relative to parallel and perpendicular orientations. The standard deviation of position errors in 4DCT were up to 2.2 mm with a maximum deviation of 4.0 mm. Using BrainLAB's gated IGRT the fiducials were detected with a standard deviation of 0.6 mm and a maximum deviation of 1.9 mm. For gated IGRT no correlation to fiducial speed was found. Conclusions. Clinical use of fiducials in combination with treatment planning on mid-ventilation CT phase for moving target should include margins up to 5.5 mm due to potential systematic position errors.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Nielsen, Martin Skovmos","Nyström, M W","Hansen, Jesper Carl"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-089838"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"potential position errors using fiducial markers for gated image guided radiotherapy","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3109/0284186X.2013.814153","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-089838","identifier":[{"id":"23984813","type":"pmid"},{"id":"000324776100032","type":"wos"},{"id":"84884568113","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-88c97ccb-7fc3-474c-bf40-3f4339d0a05e"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-CFA5872B5D5D5169CF7848E3513C5A6C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3109/0284186X.2013.814153","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Department of Oncology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Klinik Kirurgi og Kræftbehandling"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Martin Skovmos","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"fbcf9e4e-63e5-4ae8-9b00-319148e15063","name":"Nielsen, Martin Skovmos","orcid":"0000-0002-3955-7266","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"M W","key":"nyströmpau","last":"Nyström","name":"Nyström, M W","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesper Carl","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"b2b04c0e-3516-4898-aff3-b83015cfd71d","name":"Hansen, Jesper Carl","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["23984813"],"pub":{"doi":"10.3109/0284186x.2013.814153","issn":["0284186X","11001704"],"issn_org":["0284186X"],"issue":"7","journal":"Acta Oncologica","pages":"1472-1476","publisher":"Medical Journals Sweden AB","status":"p","title":"Acta Oncologica","volume":"52"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84884568113"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-88c97ccb-7fc3-474c-bf40-3f4339d0a05e"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Potential position errors using fiducial markers for gated image guided radiotherapy","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-089838","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
