{"abstract":"Med Trængselskommissionens betænkning fremlægges en samlet strategi for modernisering af hovedstadsområdets transportsystem, der vil øge kapaciteten og styrke mobiliteten i hele hovedstadsområdet.","author_count":28,"contributors":["Larsen, Leo","Friis-Mikkelsen, Christel","Jespersen, Per Homann","Vedel, Aino","Gammelgaard, Britta","Pedersen, Lise Bjørg","Kristensen, Niels Buus","Møller Thomsen, Thomas","Nielsen, Otto Anker","Nøhr Pedersen, Dorthe","Lahrmann, Harry","Plougmann Olsen, Henrik","Skovbro, Anne","Lok, Jesper T.","Christiansen, Steen","Krawack, Susanne","Toft, Hans","Lund Pedersen, Ivan","Holmer, Henrik","Juncher Jørgensen, Trine","Stenild, Flemming","Vogt-Nielsen, Karl","Gaardhøj, Lars","Fischer, Charlotte","Østergaard, Erik","Jacobsen, Peter","Svane, Michael","Kabell, Morten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-287412"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"com","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-ZEA"],"OT":["Københavns City Center"],"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-ZEA","DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-CBS","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"mobilitet og fremkommelighed i hovedstaden hovedrapport fra trængselskommissionen","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.trm.dk/da/publikationer/2013/traengselskommissionens-betaenkning-og-sammenfatning","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-287412","ids":["cbs-7e0fdfe0-6899-44c5-a4dc-3fa79e1e511d"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Commissioned","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-2A61924C2650BAA1F029372C3E59F516"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"other companies","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Pri