{"abstract":"A new type of solid-state molecular junction is introduced, which employs reduced graphene oxide as a transparent top contact that permits a self-assembled molecular monolayer to be photoswitched in situ, while simultaneously enabling charge-transport measurements across the molecules. The electrical switching behavior of a less-studied molecular switch, dihydroazulene/vinylheptafulvene, is described, which is used as a test case.","author_count":22,"contributors":["Li, Tao","Jevric, Martyn","Hauptmann, Jonas Rahlf","Hviid, Rune","Wei, Zhongming","Wang, Rui","Reeler, Nini Elisabeth Abildgaard","Thyrhaug, Erling","Petersen, Søren Vermehren","Meyer, Jakob Abild Stengaard","Bovet, Nicolas Emile","Vosch, Tom","Nygård, Jesper","Qiu, Xiaohui","Hu, Wenping","Liu, Yunqi","Solomon, Gemma C.","Kjærgaard, Henrik Grum","Bjørnholm, Thomas","Nielsen, Mogens Brøndsted","Laursen, Bo Wegge","Nørgaard, Kasper"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-445212"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East"],"country":["China"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Chinese Academy of Sciences","National Center for Nanoscience and Technology"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"ultrathin reduced graphene oxide films as transparent top contacts for light switchable solid state molecular junctions","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adma.201300607","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-445212","identifier":[{"id":"23765569","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84882455355","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-56a5a537-65b9-4fe2-a300-2ebc3ea43a36"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-47A77FF0A892