y centres have improved survival compared to other hospitals in the Copenhagen area after out-of-hospital cardiac arrest","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-498452","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
{"abstract":"The discovery that the Ten-Eleven Translocation (TET) hydroxylases cause DNA demethylation has fundamentally changed the notion of how DNA methylation is regulated. Clonal analysis of the hematopoetic stem cell compartment suggests that TET2 mutations can be early events in hematologic cancers and recent investigations have shown TET2 mutations in diffuse large B-cell lymphoma. However, the detection rates and the types of TET2 mutations vary, and the relation to global methylation patterns has not been investigated. Here, we show TET2 mutations in 12 of 100 diffuse large B-cell lymphomas with 7% carrying loss-of-function and 5% carrying missense mutations. Genome-wide methylation profiling using 450K Illumina arrays identified 315 differentially methylated genes between TET2 mutated and TET2 wild-type cases. TET2 mutations are primarily associated with hypermethylation within CpG islands (70%; P","author_count":12,"contributors":["Asmar, Fazila","Punj, Vasu","Christensen, Jesper","Pedersen, Marianne Terndrup","Pedersen, Anja","Nielsen, Anders Busse","Hother, Christoffer","Ralfkiaer, Ulrik","Brown, Peter","Ralfkiaer, Elisabeth","Helin, Kristian","Grønbæk, Kirsten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-525000"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"genome wide profiling identifies a dna methylation signature that associates with tet000000000002 mutations in diffuse large b cell lymphoma","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3324/haematol.2013.088740","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-525000","identifier":[{"id":"PMC3856967","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"23831920","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84885196364","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-dc41b404-27bc-46dc-8524-9cdd2fd7fecf"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-129071E8F7CB8871DE35D8B4B6202623"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3324/haematol.2013.088740","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, The Danish Stem Cell Center"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Fazila","key":"asmarfazilapau","last":"Asmar","locid":"428f59ee-6524-4f45-b128-470e392f11d4","name":"Asmar, Fazila","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Vasu","key":"punjvasupau","last":"Punj","name":"Punj, Vasu","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Jesper Aagaard","key":"christensenjesperpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"d1168701-7281-4e81-96fc-0758e89c075e","name":"Christensen, Jesper","name_org":"Christensen, Jesper Aagaard","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Marianne T","key":"pedersenmarianneterndruppau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"adadc836-6264-4601-a544-31d54ea2ad13","name":"Pedersen, Marianne Terndrup","name_org":"Pedersen, Marianne T","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Anja","key":"pedersenanjapau","last":"Pedersen","name":"Pedersen, Anja","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Anders B","key":"nielsenandersbussepau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"a11ba24d-6380-431d-b85f-ce08b84e7bee","name":"Nielsen, Anders Busse","name_org":"Nielsen, Anders B","orcid":"0000-0001-9842-5303","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Christoffer","key":"hotherchristoff