{"abstract":"During the past decade, students at Aalborg University have had the possibility to participate in the cross disciplinary, and cross semester project of building and launching a cubesat. However, as such a project easily can last from three to five years, from the initial development to the launch of the satellite, it is important to consider how to keep the different student groups, who have participated in the project motivated in further developing of their respective subsystems, as well as engage actively in knowledge transfer to new student groups.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Larsen, Jesper Abildgaard","Nielsen, Jens Frederik Dalsgaard","Zhou, Chunfang"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-057027"],"event":{"end":"2013-06-14","place":"Istanbul, tr","start":"2013-06-12","title":"Recent Advances in Space Technology 2013","year":"2013"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"on student motivation in a problem and project based satellite development and learning environment","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/RAST.2013.6581346","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-057027","identifier":[{"id":"WOS:000332043900142","type":"wos"},{"id":"84883885317","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-17c28dd6-1d92-40ca-aa40-01d54c3214db"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-7D8C0A6AE67A7355C62AA55D582D955E"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://ieeexplore.ieee.org/xpl/articleDetails.jsp?arnumber=6581346","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/RAST.2013.6581346","version":"Other Ver