{"abstract":"Here, analysis of the antenna correlation at the design stage is done, with focus on measurement techniques. Various theoretical definitions of correlations are used with the corresponding measured data required. The problems related to the coaxial measurement cables, when calculating correlation through the radiation patterns, are analyzed and an optical solution proposed. It is shown that using optical cable replacement, repeatable and accurate measurements of the envelope correlation coefficient can be made.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Yanakiev, Boyan Radkov","Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","Christensen, Morten","Pedersen, Gert Frølund"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-073597"],"event":{"acronym":"EuCAP","end":"2012-03-30","place":"Prague, cz","start":"2012-03-26","title":"6th European Conference on Antennas and Propagation (EUCAP 2012)","year":"2012"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Antenna","Correlation","Electrically small antennas","Handset Antennas","MIMO systems","Measurements","Optical fiber","Optical fiber measurement applications"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Molex, Antenna Business Unit"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"correlation measurements on small mobile devices","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/60511458/Correlation_Measurements_on_Small_Mobile_Devices_2.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-073597","identifier":[{"id":"84862898518","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-511fa5a3-a23e-4c2d-b5ab-0d467c3d2bc9"],"keyword":["Handset Antennas","MIMO systems","Optical fiber measurement applications","antenna","correlation","electrically small antennas","measurements","optical fiber"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-9FB403FA95C0D5B5182497AD8FB254FA"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/60511458/Correlation_Measurements_on_Small_Mobile_Devices_2.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/EuCAP.2012.6206065","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Antennas, propagation and radio networking"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Molex, Antenna Business Unit"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Boyan Radkov","key":"yanakievpau","last":"Yanakiev","locid":"6de284ae-908b-4652-8ad8-e1eab05c5983","name":"Yanakiev, Boyan Radkov","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Ødum","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"12489268-4402-4c17-8487-76a4323ee983","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","orcid":"0000-0002-8505-853X","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Morten","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","name":"Christensen, Morten","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Gert Frølund","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"a4