{"abstract":"The perspective of controlling the local rain water storage tanks for a small catchment is investigated to evaluate if a predictive control reduces the CSO from the storm drainage system. A weather radar based nowcast system is used to predict the actual precipitation two hours ahead. In case of more than 1 mm rain - the control strategy is set to empty all rainwater storage tanks down to 50% capacity in order to capture a significant part of the approaching rain. This strategy is evaluated though simulation with the MOUSE model. Simulations of scenarios without local storage tanks and with passive local rainwater storage tanks are used as a reference. The results show that local rain water storage tanks reduce the CSO’s by 50% and lower the maximal water levels in the storm drainage system. The active control clearly outperforms the passive storage strategy.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Rasmussen, Michael R.","Thorndahl, Søren Liedtke","Bentzen, Thomas Ruby","Nielsen, Jesper Ellerbæk","Selc, Torben"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-107588"],"event":{"end":"2012-09-06","place":"Belgrade, rs","start":"2012-09-04","title":"Ninth International Conference on Urban Drainage Modelling","year":"2012"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Drainage","Modelling","Mouse","Nowcast","Rain Water Harvesting","SUDS","Urban","Weather radar"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["AquaPlanning"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"using weather radar to optimise operation of an urban drainage system with distributed rainwater storage","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-107588","ids":["aau-c63d9331-3178-4778-87e8-90dc062f99c8"],"keyword":["Drainage","MOUSE","Modelling","Nowcast","Rain Water Harvesting","SUDS","Urban","Weather Radar"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-BF2D6FA93C6966D61FE339E0BFD59E74"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Civil Engineering","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Civil Engineering, Division of Water and Soil","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Civil Engineering, Urban Water and Environment Research Group","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Civil Engineering, Water and Environment Research Group","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of the Built Environment, Division of Civil and Environmental Engineering","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of the Built Environment, Division of Water and Environment","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of the Built Environment, Urban Water Research Group"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["AquaPlanning"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Michael R.","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"97f39e8d-f121-4ce8-9157-10ce8955b1d8","name":"Rasmussen, Michael R.","orcid":"0000-0001-5791-3976","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","firs