{"abstract":"Compressed sensing (CS) has in recent years become a very popular way of sampling sparse signals. This sparsity is measured with respect to some known dictionary consisting of a finite number of atoms. Most models for real world signals, however, are parametrised by continuous parameters corresponding to a dictionary with an infinite number of atoms. Examples of such parameters are the temporal and spatial frequency. In this paper, we analyse how CS affects the estimation performance of any unbiased estimator when we assume such infinite dictionaries. We base our analysis on the Cramer-Rao lower bound (CRLB) which is frequently used for benchmarking the estimation accuracy of unbiased estimators. For the popular sensing matrices such as the Gaussian sensing matrix, our analysis shows that compressed sensing on average degrades the estimation accuracy by at least the down-sample factor.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Nielsen, Jesper Kjær","Christensen, Mads Græsbøll","Jensen, Søren Holdt"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-111911"],"event":{"acronym":"ICASSP","end":"2012-03-30","place":"Kyoto, jp","start":"2012-03-25","title":"2012 IEEE International Conference on Acoustics, Speech and Signal Processing","year":"2012"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"on compressed sensing and the estimation of continuous parameters from noisy observations","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/73496647/master.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-111911","identifier":[{"id":"WOS:000312381403170","type":"wos"},{"id":"84867612879","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-d50332cf-448f-4dd1-bcc9-d3dbb40eb7ed"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-5F89896AAE805580F8E3F5F4CC8B1BEB"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/ICASSP.2012.6288697","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/73496647/master.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology, Section for Media Technology - Campus Aalborg","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Multimedia Information and Signal Processing"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Kjær","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"3d21c73c-3aa1-4590-870f-8be578634702","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Kjær","orcid":"0000-0002-2586-7925","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Mads Græsbøll","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"cf9e922d-e5f8-4964-9b84-581667f97b0b","name":"Christensen, Mads Græsbøll","orcid":"0000-0003-3586-7969","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Søren Holdt","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"bfd2a53b-f2bd-4563-8968-9a911996215f","name":"Jensen, Søren Holdt","orcid":"0000-0002-1050-470X","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/icassp.2012.6288697","eisbn":["9781467300445"],"isbn":["9781467300452"],"issn":["15206149"],"pages":"3609-3612","publisher":"IEEE Press","series":"IEEE International Conference on Acoustics, Speech and Signal Processing. Proceedings","status":"p","title":"Proceedings IEEE International Conference on Acoustics, Speech and Signal Processing."},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84867612879"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-d50332cf-448f-4dd1-bcc9-d3dbb40eb7ed"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"On Compressed Sensing and the Estimation of Continuous Parameters From Noisy Observations","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-111911","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"The current paper concerns realistic evaluation of the capacity of the MIMO channel between a BS and handheld device, such as a PDA or smartphone, held in front of the user’s body (data mode). The work is based on measurements of the MIMO channel between two widely separated BSs in a micro-cellular setup, and six handsets located in an indoor environment. The measurements are done simultaneously in both the 773.5–778.5 MHz and 2250–2350 MHz bands, and from the two BSs. The handsets are realistic types and were measured both in free space and with twelve different users, using both one and two hands. The random capacities of the channels are evaluated in terms of outage capacity. For an SNR of 10 dB, median capacities in free space of about 4.4–4.7 bit/s/Hz for the low band and about 3.3–3.8 bit/s/Hz for the high band were found. The mean decrease in outage capacity due to the user was found to be up to about 2.2 bit/s/Hz, depending on the band and handset. More results are presented in the paper.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","Yanakiev, Boyan Radkov","Bonev, Ivan Bonev","Christensen, Morten","Pedersen, Gert Frølund"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-118550"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Channel capacity","MIMO channels","Propagation measurements","User interaction","dual band propagation","optical link"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Molex Interconnect - Antenna Business Unit"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"user influence on mimo channel capacity for handsets in data mode operation","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/61453674/IEEE_TAP_UserInfluenceMIMOCapacity.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-118550","identifier":[{"id":"84856997658","type":"scopus"},{"id":"WOS:000302655100021","type":"wos"}],"ids":["aau-ebb5f3c9-0ff7-4642-bc05-ae0b353d14da"],"keyword":["MIMO channels","channel capacity","dual-band propagation","optical link","propagation measurements","user-interaction"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-040433FF5C4C869329163887229004B4"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/TAP.2011.2173435","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/61453674/IEEE_TAP_UserInfluenceMIMOCapacity.pdf","version":"Pre-print"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Antennas, propagation and radio networking"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Molex Interconnect - Antenna Business Unit"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Ødum","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"12489268-4402-4c17-8487-76a4323ee983","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","orcid":"0000-0002-8505-853X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Boyan Radkov","key":"yanakievpau","last":"Yanakiev","locid":"6de284ae-908b-4652-8ad8-e1eab05c5983","name":"Yan