{"abstract":"Standardization work for MIMO OTA testing methods is currently ongoing, where a multi-probe anechoic chamber based solution is an important candidate. In this paper, the probes located on an OTA ring are used to synthesize a plane wave field in the center of the OTA ring. This paper investigates the extent to which we can approach the synthesized plane wave in practical measurement systems. Both single plane wave with certain AoA and multiple plane waves with different AoAs and power weightings are synthesized and measured. Deviations of the measured plane wave and the simulated plane wave field are presented in terms of phase and power. Possible reasons for the deviations are also investigated.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Fan, Wei","Carreño, Xavier","Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","Olesen, Kim","Knudsen, Mikael","Pedersen, Gert Frølund"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-120041"],"event":{"acronym":"VTC","end":"2012-09-06","place":"Québec City, ca","start":"2012-09-03","title":"IEEE Vehicular Technology Conference","year":"2012"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"country":["United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Intel"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"measurement verification of plane wave synthesis technique based on multi probe mimo ota setup","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/73426550/Measurement_Verification_of_Plane_Wave_Synthesis_Technique_Based_on_Multi_probes_MIMO_OTA_setup_submitted.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-120041","identifier":[{"id":"84878897514","type":"scopus"},{"id":"WOS:000317009100053","type":"wos"}],"ids":["aau-f0c567da-5167-46b7-b562-9a6bd8a8d754"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-B62C40A7633DC2B5737C2BC595EF952F"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/VTCFall.2012.6398925","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/73426550/Measurement_Verification_of_Plane_Wave_Synthesis_Technique_Based_on_Multi_probes_MIMO_OTA_setup_submitted.pdf","version":"Pre-print"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Antennas, propagation and radio networking"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"us","key":"intel","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Intel","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Wei","key":"fanpau","last":"Fan","locid":"196e035b-e3db-4c94-b288-03dcd3119fda","name":"Fan, Wei","orcid":"0000-0002-9835-4485","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Xavier","key":"carreñopau","last":"Carreño","name":"Carreño, Xavier","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Ødum","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"12489268-4402-4c17-8487-76a4323ee983","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","orcid":"0000-0002-8505-853X","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Kim","key":"olesenpau","last":"Olesen","locid":"aa6eeabd-33cb-4ca5-bab9-16cdf79fde26","name":"Olesen, Kim","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corres