{"abstract":"Abstract Vogt-Koyanagi-Harada syndrome (VKHS) is an inflammatory syndrome affecting melanocyte-containing organs. The clinical onset is often acute with neurological and ophthalmological symptoms and there is considerable risk of sequelae if the condition is not promptly diagnosed and treated. We present a case illustrating that VKHS is a rare but important differential diagnosis of viral meningitis.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Smit, Jesper","Berman, Dalia Cecilia","Nielsen, Henrik Ib"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-178389"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"vogt koyanagi harada syndrome a rare but important differential diagnosis of viral meningitis","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3109/00365548.2011.611171","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-178389","identifier":[{"id":"84856116240","type":"scopus"},{"id":"21905951","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-5601c24c-cecb-4246-baa5-b586146ee850"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-24B8E00DBACE95EDCD3B935032F4FAA6"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3109/00365548.2011.611171","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Infektionsmedicinsk Afdeling, Aalborg Sygehus"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","correspondi