{"abstract":"Forecast based flow prediction in drainage systems can be used to implement real time control of drainage systems. This study compares two different types of rainfall forecasts – a radar rainfall extrapolation based nowcast model and a numerical weather prediction model. The models are applied as input to an urban runoff model predicting the inlet flow to a waste water treatment plant. The modelled flows are auto-calibrated against real time flow observations in order to certify the best possible forecast. Results show that it is possible to forecast flows with a lead time of 24 hours. The best performance of the system is found using the radar nowcast for the short leadtimes and weather model for larger lead times.","author_count":12,"contributors":["Thorndahl, Søren Liedtke","Poulsen, Troels Sander","Bøvith, Thomas","Borup, Morten","Ahm, Malte","Nielsen, Jesper Ellerbæk","Grum, Morten","Rasmussen, Michael R.","Gill, Rasphall","Mikkelsen, Peter Steen"],"cuid":["S02-088.69-000406"],"event":{"end":"2012-09-06","place":"Belgrade, rs","start":"2012-09-04","title":"Ninth International Conference on Urban Drainage Modelling","year":"2012"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["DMI HIRLAM","Forecast","Numerical Weather Model","Radar","Runoff Model"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-DMI"],"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-KVWT","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-DMI","DI-PR-KVWT","DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"comparison of short term rainfall forecasts for model based flow prediction in urban drainage systems","src":["aau","dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S02-088.69-000406","ids":["aau-07e95780-f790-41b9-a41f-07423e37ca7c","dtu-4b1ad16a-1bde-4443-8b75-3eb696af3b8a"],"keyword":["DMI-HIRLAM","Forecast","Numerical Weather Model","Radar","Runoff Model"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-2-AA6F9A345856258C64BD31AAB9E4AF05"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Civil Engineering","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Civil Engineering, Division of Water and Soil","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Civil Engineering, Urban Water and Environment Research Group","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Civil Engineering, Water and Environment Research Group","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of the Built Environment, Division of Civil and Environmental Engineering","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of the Built Environment, Division of Water and Environment","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of the Built Environment, Urban Water Research Group"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"other companies","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-OTH","l3nl":"Other Companies","l3nn":"Other Companies","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Companies","namevar":["Krüger A/S"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-OTH","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"krüger veolia","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-KVWT","l3nl":"Krüger A/S Veolia Water Technologies, Denmark","l3nn":"Krüger - Veolia","loc":["Denmar