{"abstract":"Shared decision-making and patients' choice of interventions are areas of increasing importance, not least seen in the light of the fact that chronic conditions are increasing, interventions considered important for public health, and still non-acceptance of especially risk-reducing treatments of cardiovascular diseases (CVD) is prevalent. A better understanding of patients' medication-taking behavior is needed and may be reached by studying the reasons why people accept or decline medication recommendations. The aim of this paper was to identify factors that may influence people's decisions and reasoning for accepting or declining a cardiovascular preventive medication offer.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Harmsen, Charlotte Gry","Støvring, Henrik","Jarbøl, Dorte Ejg","Nexøe, Jørgen","Gyrd-Hansen, Dorte","Nielsen, Jesper Bo","Edwards, Adrian","Kristiansen, Ivar Sønbø"],"cuid":["S02-092.45-014208"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Norway","United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Cardiff University","University of Oslo"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"medication effectiveness may not be the major reason for accepting cardiovascular preventive medication a population based survey","src":["au","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1186/1472-6947-12-89","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-092.45-014208","identifier":[{"id":"PMC3465182","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"22873796","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84864646969","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-1659f953-8472-460c-b01e-c3ca161742e8","sdu-4e0f7078-54e3-46cf-957b-309c946ae9e4"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-29AAC4760F9F9DAAEDBEE3FE8675F8FA"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1186/1472-6947-12-89","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University (AU)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Public Health, Research Unit of General Pratice"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Unspecified organisation"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"gb","key":"cardiff university","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"Cardiff University","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"no","key":"university of oslo","loc":["Norway","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"University of Oslo","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Charlotte Gry","key":"harmsenpau","last":"Harmsen","name":"Harmsen, Charlotte Gry","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik","key":"støvringpau","last":"Støvring","locid":"c19fb430-dcd1-4a13-995f-4247f8ebc11d","name":"Støvring, Henrik","orcid":"0000-0002-5821-2351","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"af