ntal whole-body SAR Assessment Method in a Complex Indoor Environment","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-079920","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"The resolution of distributed rainfall input for drainage models is the topic of this paper. The study is based on data from high resolution X-band weather radar used together with an urban drainage model of a medium size Danish village. The flow, total run-off volume and CSO volume are evaluated. The results show that the model to some extent is dependent on the rainfall input resolution and recommendations for the resolution are given. However, none of the investigated resolutions can be characterized as ‘unusable’.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Nielsen, Jesper Ellerbæk","Rasmussen, Michael R.","Thorndahl, Søren Liedtke"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-084626"],"event":{"end":"2011-04-21","place":"Exeter, gb","start":"2011-04-18","title":"International Symposium on Weather Radar and Hydrology","year":"2011"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["LAWR","Mouse","Radar Data Resolution","Urban Drainage Modelling"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"what is a proper resolution of weather radar precipitation estimates for urban drainage modelling","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://iahs.info/redbooks/351.htm","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-084626","identifier":[{"id":"84871811067","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-771764aa-26ea-4d46-8eb8-cb8f9beba234"],"keyword":["LAWR","MOUSE","Radar Data Resolution","Urban Drainage Modelling","Weather Data Measurements","Weather Radar Measurements"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-57392E44EBC8172717D7FC493A426B58"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://iahs.info/redbooks/351.htm","version":"Other Versi