{"abstract":"I fremtidens VE-samfund er det nødvendigt, at elsektoren sammentænkes med varme-, gas- go transportsektorerne. Elbiler bliver en nøgleteknologi, og brint skal kombineres med kulstof fra biomasse eller atmosfæren, så der kan fremstilles brændstoffer til transportsektoren.","author_count":24,"contributors":["Mathiesen, Brian Vad","Lund, Henrik","Hvelplund, Frede","Connolly, David","Bentsen, Niclas Scott","Tonini, Davide","Morthorst, Poul Erik","Wenzel, Henrik","Astrup, Thomas","Meyer, Niels I","Münster, Marie","Østergaard, Poul Alberg","Bak-Jensen, Birgitte","Nielsen, Mads Pagh","Schaltz, Erik","Pillai, Jayakrishnan Radhakrishna","Hamelin, Lorie","Felby, Claus","Heussen, Kaj","Karnøe, Peter","Munksgaard, Jesper","Hansen, Lise-Lotte Pade","Andersen, Fritz"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-114293"],"event":{"end":"2012-12-05","place":"Fredericia, dk","start":"2012-12-05","title":"Robust og Bæredygtig Bioenergi","year":"2012"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Afd. for Skovdrift og Træprodukter"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-SDU","DI-U-UND"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-SDU","DI-U-UND"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"det intelligente energisystem","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/71336621/Det_intelligente_energisystem_Robust_og_baeredygtig_bioenergy.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-114293","ids":["aau-dce859b7-7ec6-4bcf-9eaf-9b0e370d1d1f"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-D204FC5F489C27FFA4F9CA97600994BA"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/71336621/Det_intelligente_energisystem_Robust_og_baeredygtig_bioenergy.p