 Notat fra DCE - Nationalt Center for Miljø og Energi Dato: 13. december 2012","type":"Memorandum/Exposition","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-219337","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"We propose a new approach to practical two-party computation secure against an active adversary. All prior practical protocols were based on Yao’s garbled circuits. We use an OT-based approach and get efficiency via OT extension in the random oracle model. To get a practical protocol we introduce a number of novel techniques for relating the outputs and inputs of OTs in a larger construction.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Nielsen, Jesper Buus","Nordholt, Peter Sebastian","Orlandi, Claudio","Burra, Sai Sheshank"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-226430"],"event":{"acronym":"CRYPTO","end":"2012-08-23","place":"Santa Barbara, us","start":"2012-08-19","title":"Annual International Cryptology Conference","year":"2012"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, Middle East","Asia, South","OECD"],"country":["India","Israel"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Bar-Ilan University","Indian Institute of Technology, Guwahati"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a new approach to practical active secure two party computation","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-642-32009-5_40","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-226430","identifier":[{"id":"84865506559","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-aa3d587a-2fab-4c70-a641-19a39c2c2e25"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-A98A5E92A05F14F90BB13ACDE1CA8F6A"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-642-32009-5_40","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarh