{"abstract":"LAWR-radaren har i flere sammenhænge demonstreret problemer med at måle nedbøren tilfredsstillende. Radaren har udvist problemer med at beskrive intensitetsforløbets dynamik således, at radaren generelt har tendens til enten at underestimere de høje intensiteter eller overestimere de lave intensiteter.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Nielsen, Jesper Ellerbæk","Thorndahl, Søren Liedtke","Rasmussen, Michael R."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-078544"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["LAWR","Nedbør","Vejrradar"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"evaluering af ny processeringsmetode til lawr","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/66641925/Nielsen_et_al_2012_Evaluering_af_ny_processeringsmetode_til_LAWR.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-078544","ids":["aau-62302e59-c249-42ba-b47f-a689bf481ddb"],"keyword":["LAWR","dataprocessering","nedbør","regnintensitet","vejrradar"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-33201280A7124860853E8DEF7C02277F"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/66641925/Nielsen_et_al_2012_Evaluering_af_ny_processeringsmetode_til_LAWR.pdf","version":"Pre-print"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Civil Engineering","Aalborg University, T