g University"],"title":"Evaluering af ny processeringsmetode til LAWR","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-078544","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"In this paper, details are given on a novel measurement device for radio propagation-channel measurements. To avoid measurement errors due to the conductive cables on small terminal antennas, as well as to improve the handling of the prototypes under investigation, an optical measurement device has been developed. It utilizes thin, light, and flexible glass fibers as opposed to heavy, stiff, and conductive coaxial cables. This paper looks at the various system parameters such as overall gain, noise figure, and dynamic range and compares the solution to other methods. An estimate of the device accuracy is also given. Selected parts of the circuitry are given in more detail. Typical measurement results are also shown.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Yanakiev, Boyan","Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","Christensen, Morten","Pedersen, Gert Frølund"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-092320"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Antenna","Electrically small antennas","Handset Antennas","MIMO systems","Optical fiber","Optical fiber measurement applications","Propagation measurements"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Molex Antenna Business Unit"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"long range channel measurements on small terminal antennas using optics","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/70782081/Rev_02_Optical_Measurements_On_Small_Terminal_Antennas.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-092320","identifier":[{"id":"84866510346","type":"scopus"},{"id":"WOS:000308964700017","type":"wos"}],"ids":["aau-9173eda3-f9b8-4139-8706-207c92d33cc4"],"keyword":["Electrically small antennas","MIMO systems","Optical fiber measurement applications","Propagation measurements","antenna","handset antennas","optical fiber"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-1FEC4474DDB49B18D531569CE47720EB"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/70782081/Rev_02_Optical_Measurements_On_Small_Terminal_Antennas.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/TIM.2012.2196391","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Molex Antenna Business Unit"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Antennas, propagation and radio networking"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Boyan","key":"yanakievpau","last":"Yanakiev","name":"Yanakiev, Boyan","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Ødum","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"12489268-4402-4c17-8487-76a4323ee983","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","orcid":"0000-0002-8505-853X","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Morten","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","name":"Christensen, Morten","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Gert Frølund","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"a49c73ee-aed0-448c-8a92-792c9ee12a9e","name":"Pedersen, Gert Frølund","orcid":"0000-0002-6570-7387","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/tim.2012.2196391","issn":["00189456"],"issue":"10","journal":"IEEE Transactions on Instrumentation and Measurement","pages":"2749-2758","publisher":"IEEE (Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers)","status":"p","title":"IEEE Transactions on Instrumentation and Measurement","title_org":"I E E E Transactions on Instrumentation and Measurement","volume":"61"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84866510346"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-9173eda3-f9b8-4139-8706-207c92d33cc4"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Long-Range Channel Measurements on Small Terminal Antennas Using Optics","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-092320","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"A system for performance evaluation of LTE devices has been presented, with evaluation in both a live network and with a channel sounder. The results serve as reference for OTA evaluations in the anechoic room based on multi-probe setups.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","Alrabadi, Osama","Fan, Wei","Yamamoto, Atsushi","Sakata, Tsutomu","Pedersen, Gert Frølund"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-113959"],"event":{"end":"2012-07-14","place":"Chicago, us","start":"2012-07-08","title":"2012 IEEE Antennas and Propagation Society International Symposium","year":"2012"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East","OECD"],"country":["Japan"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Panasonic Holdings Corporation"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"testing mimo devices over the air","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/71664767/OTAtesting_APS.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-113959","identifier":[{"id":"84870560770","type":"scopus"},{"id":"WOS:000312442301071","type":"wos"}],"ids":["aau-dbdb12f9-b60f-4cb7-8250-aa92ba31eb3f"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-09E13429F02ABCA0FCD1D38F714FF1F0"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/71664767/OTAtesting_APS.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/APS.2012.6348699","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://ieeexplore.ieee.org/xpl/articleDetails.jsp?tp=&arnumber=6348699&contentType=Conference+Publications&queryText%3DTesting+MIMO+Devices+Over+the+Air","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Antennas, propagation and radio networking"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"jp","key":"panasonic holdings corporation","loc":["Japan","Asia, East","OECD"],"name":"Panasonic Holdings Corporation","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Ødum","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"12489268-4402-4c17-8487-76a4323ee983","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","orcid":"0000-0002-8505-853X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Osama","key":"alrabadipau","last":"Alrabadi","locid":"d4f2b860-7e5b-45d5-ac87-28b3be50ad18","name":"Alrabadi, Osama","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Wei","key":"fanpau","last":"Fan","locid":"196e035b-e3db-4c94-b288-03dcd3119fda","name":"Fan, Wei","orcid":"0000-0002-9835-4485","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Atsushi","key":"yamamotopau","last":"Yamamoto","name":"Yamamoto, Atsushi","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Tsutomu","key":"sakatapau","last":"Sakata","name":"Sakata, Tsutomu","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Gert Frølund","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"a49c73ee-aed0-448c-8a92-792c9ee12a9e","name":"Pedersen, Gert Frølund","orcid":"0000-0002-6570-7387","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/aps.2012.6348699","isbn":["9781467304610"],"issn":["15223965"],"pages":"1-2","publisher":"IEEE (Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers)","series":"IEEE Antennas and Propagation Society. International Symposium","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of the 2012 IEEE International Symposium on Antennas and Propagation (APSURSI)"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84870560770"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-dbdb12f9-b60f-4cb7-8250-aa92ba31eb3f"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Testing MIMO Devices Over the Air","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-113959","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"In the auxiliary input model an adversary is allowed to see a computationally hard-to-invert function of the secret key. The auxiliary input model weakens the bounded leakage assumption commonly made in leakage resilient cryptography as the hard-to-invert function may information-theoretically reveal the entire secret key. In this work, we propose the first constructions of digital signature schemes that are secure in the auxiliary input model. Our main contribution is a digital signature scheme that is secure against chosen message attacks when given an exponentially hard-to-invert function of the secret key. As a second contribution, we construct a signature scheme that achieves security for random messages assuming that the adversary is given a polynomial-time hard to invert function. Here, polynomial-hardness is required even when given the entire public-key – so called weak auxiliary input security. We show that such signature schemes readily give us auxiliary input secure identification schemes","author_count":5,"contributors":["Faust, Sebastian","Hazay, Carmit","Nielsen, Jesper Buus","Nordholt, Peter Sebastian","Zottarel, Angela"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-145162"],"event":{"end":"2012-12-06","place":"Beijing, cn","start":"2012-12-02","title":"International Conference on the Theory and Application of Cryptology and Information Security","year":"2012"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, Middle East","OECD"],"country":["Israel"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Bar-Ilan University"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"signature schemes secure against hard to invert leakage","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-642-34961-4_8","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-145162","identifier":[{"id":"84871587528","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-1b9cd3f9-e147-4aa7-bd39-ef050389e868"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-192ECA5010F79F4C873C58A60E52F777"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-642-34961-4_8","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Department of Computer Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"il","key":"bar ilan university","loc":["Israel","Asia, Middle East","OECD"],"name":"Bar-Ilan University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Sebastian","key":"faustpau","last":"Faust","locid":"a159659b-6f11-4ff6-92dc-1d680e0caa9c","name":"Faust, Sebastian","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Carmit","key":"hazaypau","last":"Hazay","name":"Hazay, Carmit","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Buus","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"f428c4b3-80b3-403a-ada6-9ecb0fad97b2","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Buus","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Peter Sebastian","key":"nordholtpau","last":"Nordholt","locid":"45ed0f2e-3f58-4839-b089-4ba3cd802323","name":"Nordholt, Peter Sebastian","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Angela","key":"zottarelpau","last":"Zottarel","locid":"394061f9-826e-4304-9343-85b519672c62","name":"Zottarel, Angela","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/978-3-642-34961-4_8","issn":["03029743","16113349"],"issn_org":["03029743"],"journal":"Lecture Notes in Computer Science","pages":"98-115","publisher":"Springer Science and Business Media Deutschland GmbH","status":"p","title":"Lecture Notes in Computer Science","volume":"7658"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84871587528"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-1b9cd3f9-e147-4aa7-bd39-ef050389e868"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Signature Schemes Secure against Hard-to-Invert Leakage","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-145162","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"Årets rapport omfatter en præsentation af udbredelsesområde og areal for 34 lysåbne terrestriske naturtyper baseret på de seneste kortlægnings- og overvågningsdata. Rapporten retter særligt fokus på udviklingstendenser i udvalgte indikatorer for tilstanden på de intensivt overvågede stationer i de lysåbne naturtyper tørre overdrev på kalkholdig sand, kalkoverdrev, sure overdrev, tidvis våde enge, hængesæk, tørvelavninger, avneknippemoser samt kildevæld. Udviklingen bygger på overvågningsdata fra 2004 til 2009, da der kun er indsamlet ganske få data i 2010 og 2011","author_count":6,"contributors":["Nielsen, Knud Erik","Damgaard, Christian","Nygaard, Bettina","Bladt, Jesper","Ejrnæs, Rasmus","Bruus, Marianne"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-256079"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"com","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"terrestriske naturtyper 000000002011 udvikling og areal","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www2.dmu.dk/pub/sr35.pdf","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-256079","ids":["au-de07e684-4e35-4f9b-bde3-4adcf85c3f52"],"keyword":["Lysåbne naturtyper, udvikling 2004-2010, areal og udbredelse"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Commissioned","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-7671A8D06DBED2EE4769AF20FA4F6D95"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www2.dmu.dk/pub/sr35.pdf","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Ecoscience, Department of Ecoscience - Soil Fauna Ecology and Ecotoxicology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Knud Erik","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"b349ca79-38d0-4c9b-84d2-7eb4defb1240","name":"Nielsen, Knud Erik","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Christian","key":"damgaardpau","last":"Damgaard","locid":"719d46aa-2846-41c9-9b1e-fd5278eaa711","name":"Damgaard, Christian","orcid":"0000-0003-3932-4312","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Bettina","key":"nygaardpau","last":"Nygaard","locid":"68c147bf-e9bf-4693-8da5-69f0faac544c","name":"Nygaard, Bettina","orcid":"0000-0003-3335-9397","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Stentoft","key":"bladtpau","last":"Bladt","locid":"321c5b54-0e53-40d2-b196-b8df7ddcf68f","name":"Bladt, Jesper","name_org":"Bladt, Jesper Stentoft","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Rasmus","key":"ejrnæspau","last":"Ejrnæs","locid":"de0d0e9b-b9f3-46a7-9a70-ed6e45dba8d8","name":"Ejrnæs, Rasmus","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Marianne","key":"bruuspau","last":"Bruus","locid":"023f6013-a0e4-49ad-9744-4ac114bd9ee7","name":"Bruus, Marianne","orcid":"0000-0003-1812-9892","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9788792825643"],"issue":"35","pages":"118","publisher":"Aarhus University, DCE - Danish Centre for Environment and Energy","repno":"Videnskabelig rapport fra DCE - Nationalt Center for Miljø og Energi, No. 35","series":"Videnskabelig rapport fra DCE - Nationalt Center for Miljø og Energi","status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-de07e684-4e35-4f9b-bde3-4adcf85c3f52"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Terrestriske Naturtyper 2011 - udvikling og areal","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-256079","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"We demonstrate theoretically how photon-assisted dephasing by the electron-phonon interaction in a coupled cavity-quantum dot system can be significantly reduced for specific QD-cavity detunings. Our starting point is a recently published theory,1 which considers longitudinal acoustic phonons, described by a non-Markovian model, interacting with a coupled quantum dot-cavity system. The reduction of phonon-induced dephasing is obtained by placing the cavity-quantum dot system inside an infinite slab, assuming spherical electronic wavefunctions. Based on our calculations, we expect this to have important implications in single-photon sources, allowing the indistinguishability of the photons to be improved.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Nysteen, Anders","Nielsen, Per Kær","Mørk, Jesper"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-316096"],"event":{"end":"2012-01-26","place":"San Francisco, us","start":"2012-01-21","title":"SPIE Photonics West OPTO 2012","year":"2012"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Deformation potential","Electron phonon interaction","cavity QED"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"reducing dephasing in coupled quantum dot cavity systems by engineering the carrier wavefunctions","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1117/12.905594","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-316096","identifier":[{"id":"84859646123","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-26d00fec-52c6-45c9-9f35-6f3491c21028"],"keyword":["Acoustic phonon","Cavity QED","Deformation potential","Dephasing","Electron-phonon interaction"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-C2C760BC7087C63A412EB7003D8B2FD9"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1117/12.905594","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Photonics Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Photonics Engineering, Quantum and Laser Photonics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders","key":"nysteenpau","last":"Nysteen","locid":"feb12213-6336-4444-bc91-486323195b3a","name":"Nysteen, Anders","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Per Kær","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"8c0d2d70-b57e-4f6c-98aa-1574ce6c7d23","name":"Nielsen, Per Kær","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesper","key":"mørkpau","last":"Mørk","locid":"6621c7d8-77e3-4e53-a34d-b330e59262c6","name":"Mørk, Jesper","orcid":"0000-0001-8498-661X","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1117/12.905594","issn":["0277786X","1996756X"],"issn_org":["0277786X"],"journal":"Proceedings of SPIE - The International Society for Optical Engineering","publisher":"SPIE","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of SPIE - The International Society for Optical Engineering","volume":"8271"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84859646123"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-26d00fec-52c6-45c9-9f35-6f3491c21028"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Reducing dephasing in coupled quantum dot-cavity systems by engineering the carrier wavefunctions","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.fo