{"abstract":"For the last decade development and construction of student cubesat satellites has played an important part in the engineering Master Program within Electrical Engineering and Information Technology at Aalborg University, Denmark. As a result three cubesats AAU CUBESAT, AAUSAT-II and AAUSAT3 has been constructed and launched (AAUSAT3 will launch Q3 2011). This paper focuses on distributed system approach for internal as well as ground link structure.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Nielsen, Jens Frederik Dalsgaard","Larsen, Jesper Abildgaard"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-091682"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a decentralized design philosophy for satellites","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/RAST.2011.5966896","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-091682","identifier":[{"id":"80052114059","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-8f4a50cb-dc2a-4b0b-82b0-011b0a210caf"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-2A75AAF74FED862C1185DEABBE9056E8"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://ieeexplore.ieee.org/xpl/articleDetails.jsp?arnumber=5966896","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/RAST.2011.5966896","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Aalborg University Space Center","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Automation & Control"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jens Frederik Dalsgaard","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"1aa2e772-694f-4788-be3a-0b340af051fe","name":"Nielsen, Jens Frederik Dalsgaard","orcid":"0000-0002-1765-5551","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Abildgaard","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"c2132fab-0da3-4eac-a19c-ff7f57345bb6","name":"Larsen, Jesper Abildgaard","orcid":"0000-0003-4164-4913","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/rast.2011.5966896","isbn":["9781424496174"],"pages":"543-546","publisher":"IEEE Press","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of 5th International Conference on Recent Advances in Space Technologies (RAST), 2011"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-80052114059"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-8f4a50cb-dc2a-4b0b-82b0-011b0a210caf"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"A decentralized design philosophy for satellites","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-091682","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
