{"abstract":"We show that the resonance fluorescence spectrum of a quantum dot excited by a strong pulse contains multiple peaks. An analytical model shows how the peak positions depend on pulse width and amplitude.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Lund, Anders Mølbjerg","Nielsen, Per Kær","Lorke, Michael","Mørk, Jesper"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-312497"],"event":{"end":"2011-05-06","place":"Baltimore, MD, us","start":"2011-05-01","title":"Conference on Lasers and Electro-Optics 2011","year":"2011"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"resonance fluorescence from quantum dots beyond the mollow triplet","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.cleoconference.org/","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-312497","ids":["dtu-1a63f3a5-f115-46f3-bc3c-b4bd208a48d5"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-A3CC9B71B5D6247E804E4BA6A7F9B2D2"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.cleoconference.org/","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Photonics Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Photonics Engineering, Quantum and Laser Photonics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders Mølbjerg","key":"lundpau","last":"Lund","locid":"1bf57cde-4fad-4c3b-8fe1-c2be836414eb","name":"Lund, Anders Mølbjerg","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Per Kær","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"8c0d2d70-b57e-4f6c-98aa-1574ce6c7d23","name":"Nielsen, Per Kær","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Michael","key":"lorkepau","last":"Lorke","locid":"3c7a6163-8340-4232-844d-6ec362ef4116","name":"Lorke, Michael","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesper","key":"mørkpau","last":"Mørk","locid":"6621c7d8-77e3-4e53-a34d-b330e59262c6","name":"Mørk, Jesper","orcid":"0000-0001-8498-661X","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9781457712234"],"publisher":"Optical Society of America","status":"p","title":"2011 Conference on Lasers and Electro-Optics (CLEO)"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-1a63f3a5-f115-46f3-bc3c-b4bd208a48d5"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Resonance fluorescence from quantum dots: beyond the Mollow triplet","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-312497","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"We investigate the switch-on behavior of semiconductor QD-based nanocavity laser devices. From a microscopic treatment of the carrier-carrier and carrier-photon interaction, we find a fast switch-on, that is accompanied by heavily damped relaxation oscillations and caused by an ultrafast carrier dynamics.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Lorke, Michael","Nielsen, Torben Roland","Mørk, Jesper"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-318282"],"event":{"end":"2011-09-01","place":"Sydney, au","start":"2011-08-28","title":"2011 International Quantum Electronics Conference &amp; Conference on Lasers and Electro-Optics Pacific Rim<br/>","year":"2011"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"dynamical properties of qd based nanolaser devices","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/IQEC-CLEO.2011.6193690","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-318282","identifier":[{"id":"84862085599","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-2e1cd317-1e19-4ecc-a7d5-30a10721fc95"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-E08E49B9A24D712B4780833390C5AB9C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/IQEC-CLEO.2011.6193690","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Photonics Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, D