{"abstract":"I denne rapport belyses effekterne af byfornyelsesindsatsen i Svømmehalskvarteret på Frederiksberg. Rapporten belyser, hvordan en helhedsorienteret byfornyelsesindsats har betydet socioøkonomiske forandringer i kvarteret over tid. Der fokuseres bl.a. på, hvordan lokale beboere og forretningsdrivende oplever byfornyelsesindsatsen i form af gårdsaneringerne og ændrede vilkår på handelsstrøgene.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Nielsen, Rikke Skovgaard","Martino, Mark Esben","Jensen, Jesper Ole","Andersen, Hans Skifter","Hansen, Anders Rhiger","Andersen, Hans Thor","Engelund, Helle","Ferdinansen, Ib"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-121902"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Byfornyelse","Frederiksberg","Svømmehalskvarteret"],"level":"com","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-COWI"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-COWI","DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"effekterne af byfornyelsen i svømmehalskvarteret","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/619011681/SBi_2011-14.pdf","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-121902","ids":["aau-f73f7929-eaee-45e6-abde-6198e9dd62e6"],"keyword":["Byfornyelse","Frederiksberg","Gårdsanering","Svømmehalskvarteret"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Commissioned","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-DF10CC8CD7F1ECB34E1A15C094FB49B0"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/619011681/SBi_2011-14.pdf","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalbo