{"abstract":"This paper gives a practical solution for implementing an antenna radiation pattern measurement device using optical fibers. It is suitable for anechoic chambers as well as short range channel sounding. The device is optimized for small size and provides a cheap and easy way to make optical antenna measurements using off-the-shelf components. Verification measurements are made to confirm the benefits.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Yanakiev, Boyan Radkov","Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","Christensen, Morten","Pedersen, Gert Frølund"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-105743"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Antenna measurements","Antenna radiation patterns","Electrically small antennas","Optical fiber measurement applications","Propagation measurements"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Molex Interconnect, Antenna Business Unit"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"small device for short range antenna measurements using optics","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/58608004/Small_Device_For_Short_Range_Optical_Antenna_Measurements.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-105743","identifier":[{"id":"84857865089","type":"scopus"},{"id":"WOS:000300847600014","type":"wos"}],"ids":["aau-c0140a8e-87c6-405e-9b96-0ea06534b94b"],"keyword":["Antenna measurements","Antenna radiation patterns","Electrically small antennas","Optical fiber measurement applications","Propagation measurements"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-AA05EC6C182F2A2541CCE58A8A19C831"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/58608004/Small_Device_For_Short_Range_Optical_Antenna_Measurements.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/MAP.2011.6157732","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://ieeexplore.ieee.org/xpl/articleDetails.jsp?arnumber=6157732","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Antennas, propagation and radio networking"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Molex Interconnect, Antenna Business Unit"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Boyan Radkov","key":"yanakievpau","last":"Yanakiev","locid":"6de284ae-908b-4652-8ad8-e1eab05c5983","name":"Yanakiev, Boyan Radkov","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Ødum","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"12489268-4402-4c17-8487-76a4323ee983","name":"Nielsen, Jesper Ødum","orcid":"0000-0002-8505-853X","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Morten","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","name":"Christensen, Morten","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Gert Frølund","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"a49c73ee-aed0-448c-8a92-792c9ee12a9e","name":"Pedersen, Gert Frølund","orcid":"0000-0002-6570-7387","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/map.2011.6157732","issn":["10459243","15584143"],"issn_org":["10459243"],"issue":"6","journal":"IEEE Antennas and Propagation Magazine","pages":"148-152","publisher":"IEEE Computer Society Press","status":"p","title":"IEEE Antennas and Propagation Magazine","title_org":"I E E E Antennas and Propagation Magazine","volume":"53"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84857865089"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-c0140a8e-87c6-405e-9b96-0ea06534b94b"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Small Device For Short-Range Antenna Measurements Using Optics","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-105743","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"For a few years now, there has been a high interest in monitoring the global ship traffic from space. A few satellite, capable of listening for ship borne AIS transponders have already been launched, and soon the AAUSAT3, carrying two different types of AIS receivers will also be launched. One of the AIS receivers onboard AAUSAT3 is an SDR based AIS receiver. This paper serves to describe the background of the AIS system, and how the SDR based receiver has been integrated into the AAUSAT3 satellite. Amongst some of the benefits of using an SDR based receiver is, that due to its versatility, new detection algorithms are easily deployed, and it is easily adapted the new proposed AIS transmission channels.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Larsen, Jesper Abildgaard","Mortensen, Hans Peter","Nielsen, Jens Frederik Dalsgaard"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-109628"],"event":{"end":"2011-06-11","place":"Istanbul, tr","start":"2011-06-09","title":"5th International Conference on Recent Advances in Space Technologies (RAST 2011)","year":"2011"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"an sdr based ais receiver for satellites","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/RAST.2011.5966893","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-109628","identifier":[{"id":"80052113018","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-cd5073b0-706c-43c3-8f5d-f401b9e0c2f3"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-E636C4F6E731FF27F6FC43AF19D948E0"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/RAST.2011.5966893","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":